window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1601,"title":"Chapter 1601 Gu Zheng’s Enemy","paragraphs":["1601 Gu Zheng’s Enemy","A trace of playfulness flashed past Twilight’s eyes. “Miss Qiao, don’t you know Mu Jin?”","“Even the judges of the perfume competition haven’t seen Mu Jin before, so how could I have seen her? Fortunately, you stood up and said that you know Mu Jin. Otherwise, Kang Qingzhi would have continued to pretend to be Mu Jin!” Qiao Xi said slowly.","“Q-Qiao Xi!” As soon as she finished speaking, Gu Yao rushed over and subconsciously glanced at Twilight. “Gu Zheng is here to pick you up. If he sees you talking to another man, he’ll be jealous again.”","Qiao Xi instantly choked and was speechless.","Her gaze shifted between Twilight and Gu Yao with a trace of surprise.","Gu Zheng was here to pick her up?","Before Qiao Xi could come back to her senses, Gu Yao pulled her to the roadside. Twilight was still standing in the same spot with a cold smile on his lips. He said elegantly, “Goodbye, Miss Qiao.”","Qiao Xi: “”","Qiao Xi quickly left with Gu Yao. Gu Yao brought her around, and Qiao Xi frowned. “Where are you bringing me? Where’s Gu Zheng?”","Gu Yao: “” ‘It’s really too difficult!’","Qiao Xi stared at him with a burning gaze. “Are you sure Gu Zheng is here to pick me up?”","“Yes That’s right!” Gu Yao nodded.","“Where is he?”","“Gu Gu Zheng called me and said that he’s here to pick you up. I didn’t know that he wasn’t here yet! This bastard is playing with me! It’s fine that he’s playing with me, but he even made you wait with me! Don’t be angry! I’ll scold him for you!”","Qiao Xi crossed her arms and watched Gu Yao’s performance with interest. She saw him take out his phone while trembling and call Gu Zheng.","‘Gu Zheng! You have to work hard and quickly come over to pick up Qiao Xi!’","The other party did not pick up for a long time. Gu Yao felt that his heart was about to jump out of his chest. He was afraid that he would be exposed. His heart instantly turned cold as he stammered, “Qiao Qiao Xi! He didn’t pick up. Why don’t we go back first? We won’t wait for that bastard anymore. He’s really unreliable!”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly.","Gu Yao’s entire body tensed up. After a long silence, Qiao Xi said casually, “Alright.”","Gu Yao could finally relax. He hurriedly bent down and invited Qiao Xi into the car with a flattering expression. “Sister-in-law, please get in.”","Qiao Xi nodded arrogantly. She was just about to get into the car when she heard a gentle voice behind her. “Xi Xi.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were calm. He did an extremely good job at pretending that nothing was wrong. He strode forward and held Qiao Xi’s hand. “I’m here to pick you up. Let’s go home.”","Qiao Xi turned around and looked behind him. “You didn’t drive?”","He said calmly, “We got into a small accident. Song Shijing went to handle it.”","Gu Yao instantly understood and hurriedly said, “Then quickly get in the car. I’ll send you back!”","Damn! Gu Zheng was so quick-witted! He was late because of a car accident and the car was towed away by Song Shijing, which explained why he did not drive. This excuse was perfect!","Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi got into the backseat. The dignified Second Young Master Gu had become their chauffeur.","Qiao Xi leaned against Gu Zheng and suddenly realized that he had been holding his stomach. She reached out to touch it, and sticky blood dyed her fair fingertips red.","“Gu Yao! Go to the hospital!” Qiao Xi exclaimed, scaring Gu Yao so much that his heart trembled and the car swayed.","“What’s wrong?” Gu Yao asked.","Qiao Xi’s expression was gloomy. “Ah Zheng, are you injured?”","Gu Zheng was wearing a black coat today, so the blood was not obvious. He replied gently, “I’m fine. It’s just a small injury.”","Gu Yao’s eyes were filled with shock. In order to put on a convincing performance, he pretended to be in a car accident and even got himself injured?","However, Gu Yao quickly knew that he had misunderstood. Gu Zheng must have really gotten into a car accident because someone was following their car right now.","“Gu Yao, calm down. Get rid of them.” Gu Zheng’s voice was still calm, and his gentle voice made Gu Yao feel at ease.","Although Gu Yao was nervous, he felt that he had a heavy responsibility on his shoulders. He stepped on the accelerator and the car shot out like an arrow.","Qiao Xi took Gu Zheng’s pulse and lifted his clothes. When she realized that the wound was not big, she heaved a sigh of relief. “What exactly is going on?”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and replied calmly, “Someone’s seeking revenge.”","A few minutes later, Gu Yao still did not shake off the car that was following them. Qiao Xi frowned. This was not an ordinary enemy. Their enemies in Li City naturally did not dare to lay a finger on Gu Zheng, so this enemy was definitely not from Li City.","However, those who could come to Li City to chase after Gu Zheng were naturally not ordinary people. Qiao Xi quickly thought about it.","Could it be the Brook family?"]},{"number":1602,"title":"Chapter 1602 Not A Warning But A Notice","paragraphs":["1602 Not A Warning But A Notice","Qiao Xi had always felt that the Brook family was related to Gu Zheng in some way. Madam Tan was filled with hostility toward Gu Zheng, and the way Huo Yuzhou looked at Gu Zheng was also very strange.","Gu Zheng crippled Tan Yu’s arm in Y Nation and did not hide his actions. He was not worried about angering the Brook family at all. This did not seem like Gu Zheng’s style!","Unless Gu Zheng already had a grudge against the Brook family, so he did not care about adding more grudges.","However, Gu Zheng had grown up in Li City, and the Brook family had never stepped into Li City. Qiao Xi had never understood what grudges they had.","Gu Yao’s voice trembled. “Gu Gu Zheng! They’re still following us. What should we do?!”","Were they going to die here today?!","Gu Yao was extremely panicked, but he heard Gu Zheng say casually, “Concentrate on driving. In another ten minutes, they won’t be following us anymore.”","“Why?” Gu Yao looked puzzled. Qiao Xi also turned around to look at the car that had been keeping a distance from them. She was instantly enlightened. “This is just a warning!”","She should have sensed it a long time ago. When they drove fast, the other party drove fast too. When they drove slowly, the other party slowed down as well. Hence, they were not chasing after them. They were just following them.","“It’s not a warning but a notice,” Gu Zheng said slowly. “They’re telling me that they’re here in Li City.”","Qiao Xi’s breathing trembled.","Ten minutes later, the car disappeared from their sight.","“What grudge do you have against the Brook family?” Qiao Xi asked seriously.","Gu Zheng’s expression remained the same as the corners of his mouth curled into a smile. “Xi Xi, you’re so smart. You even guessed it.”","“The people who can attack you on your territory must be powerful. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have dared to attack rashly. Those people disregarded the consequences and warned you in Li City. The only family that can do that is probably the Brook family. But I don’t understand. What grudge do you have against the Brook family?”","“That’s right! We don’t seem to have much to do with each other on the surface.” Gu Zheng suddenly turned around and stared at her with a burning gaze. “Xi Xi, there are some things you shouldn’t ask.”","Qiao Xi frowned.","“I don’t want you to be involved in this mess. If you don’t know, you can stay out of it.” Gu Zheng’s voice was a little hoarse.","Qiao Xi looked at him with a determined gaze. “But I want to know.”","The car suddenly fell silent. After a moment of silence, Gu Zheng slowly said, “The Brook family is close to the Kang family. I don’t want to tell you because I’m afraid you’ll be involved in a new conspiracy.”","It was obvious that the Kang family wanted Xi Xi’s blood. It was also possible that many people were coveting it.","“Xi Xi, cut off all ties with the Kang family from now on.”","Qiao Xi said, “Of course.”","At this moment, the Kang family was in chaos.","Kang Jichuan and Kang Qingzhi were arrested. Previously, Kang Qingzhi lied when she said in public that Qiao Xi was her friend. If they only got to know each other in Y Nation, why did Qiao Xi stay in the Kang family’s villa for so long in the past?","The police had already obtained the relevant evidence and confirmed that this was a premeditated kidnapping. Kang Jichuan imprisoned Qiao Xi for a hundred days.","The Kang family was racking their brains to think of a way to escape punishment, but that was the truth. Kang Jichuan could not explain himself. Moreover, not only did Kang Qingzhi not win the championship, but she was also embroiled in a scandal. The investments in Kang Corporation’s perfumes were all withdrawn. Kang Corporation even had to face huge compensation.","The Kang family’s business was all supported by Kang Jichuan alone, but he was arrested. At this moment, Kang Corporation was in a mess and its employees were disorganized.","At this moment, Kang Jichuan was at the police station, dispirited. He could not say a word and could only quietly wait for the court hearing, hoping that things would turn around. Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were red from crying as she sobbed softly.","However, no one would pity her in the police station. After all, she had kidnapped and imprisoned Qiao Xi. Her tears could not offset the sins she had committed. She choked and said, “Brother, Dad! It’s all my fault. After I fell sick five years ago, those perfume recipes and perfumes appeared in my mind. When I saw that there were so many perfume recipes in my room, I thought that I was the one who created them. I didn’t expect Sister Xi Xi to deliberately set me up.”","Her eyes were red and swollen, and her tears had dried up. She could not help but sob. “I I really didn’t imprison Sister Xi Xi, much less force her to write perfume recipes for me!”"]},{"number":1603,"title":"Chapter 1603 Everything Was Going According To Her Plan","paragraphs":["1603 Everything Was Going According To Her Plan","Kang Jichuan closed his eyes and recalled the scene from five years ago. Qing Zhi tried to please Xi Xi, but Xi Xi always made things difficult for Qing Zhi. She felt that she had to get her blood drawn because of Qingzhi, so Xi Xi’s eyes were filled with resentment every time she saw Qingzhi.","Qingzhi had always been very afraid of Xi Xi and did not dare to see her alone. Why would she force Xi Xi to write the perfume recipes?","“Dad, you can’t blame Qingzhi for this. Actually, I hypnotized Qingzhi. Coincidentally, she fell sick again and lost her memory. It’s impossible for Qingzhi to snatch Xi Xi’s perfume recipes. It must be that Xi Xi has been scheming to frame Qingzhi.”","Kang Jichuan finally reacted. Xi Xi must have recovered her memory a long time ago. She had been scheming against the Kang family and using this method to destroy them.","Kang Qingzhi glanced at Kang Jichuan, then stood up and knelt in front of them.","“Qingzhi!”","Old Madam Kang shouted and hurriedly stood up to help her. Although this matter started because of her, Old Madam Kang still could not bear to blame her.","Kang Qingzhi’s eyes were filled with tears. “I’m sorry. I caused our family to lose so much money. I’ve let Grandma, Dad, and Brother down!”","Old Madam Kang’s heart ached. She pulled her into her arms. “Qingzhi, this isn’t your fault! It’s all that little b*tch’s fault for wanting to harm us!”","“Grandma, I’m useless. My memory was messed up, which caused all of this, but I didn’t expect Sister Xi Xi to say that we imprisoned her!” Kang Qingzhi’s body trembled as if she had suffered a great grievance.","She wiped her tears and looked at everyone seriously. She took a deep breath and said, “There’s only one way now. We’ll admit Sister Xi Xi’s identity first. As the daughter of the Kang family, it’s normal for her to stay with the Kang family. This will prove that we didn’t imprison her.”","The Kang family was stunned.","That was right! Xi Xi was a child of the Kang family, so it was only right for her to stay in the Kang family’s villa. Although they had never announced Xi Xi’s identity to the public, they were related to Xi Xi by blood.","“Qingzhi, if we acknowledge Xi Xi, then you” Kang Ru’s heart ached.","Kang Qingzhi sniffled and squeezed out a smile. “I’m fine. This matter started because of me. I can bear all the blame, but I can’t let Brother go to jail!”","“My good granddaughter!” Old Madam Kang shouted with heartache. Then, she gritted her teeth and said, “That damned little b*tch caused the Kang family to be in chaos the moment she appeared. She covets the Kang family’s assets, so she’s using this method to force us to admit her identity!","“For Jichuan’s sake, we can let her return to the Kang family, but I won’t let her have a good life. I’ll let her stay in a servant’s room. She’ll clean and serve us tea every day!”","Kang Ru did not retort and even nodded. “I’ll contact Xi Xi now.”","“Dad, wait.” Kang Qingzhi was a little worried. “I don’t think Sister Xi Xi will pick up your call now. Why don’t we hold a news conference to announce it?”","Kang Jichuan echoed, “That’s right. Xi Xi will definitely ignore us now. Why don’t we announce it through the media?”","Kang Ru nodded, feeling abnormally suffocated.","He really did not understand why his biological daughter had such a deep grudge against them.","Kang Qingzhi lowered her head as a trace of sinisterness flashed past her eyes. As long as the Kang family announced Qiao Xi’s identity, everything would become reasonable.","Qiao Xi was the daughter of the Kang family, so it was not a problem for her to stay with the Kang family. On the other hand, if she schemed against them, others would think that she was so heartless and vicious to her own family!","Kang Qingzhi clenched her fists. She could not contact that person she knew at the police station, which was why she was stuck in such a predicament now. However, she could leave this godforsaken place soon!","Longwan Residential.","Gu Zheng’s wound had already been treated. He lay flat on the wide sofa and closed his eyes to rest. “What’s going on in the Kang family?”","Song Shijing replied respectfully, “Kang Ru and Old Madam Kang went to the police station. When they entered, they looked anxious, but when they came out, they were smiling.","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “They probably think that Kang Qingzhi will be released soon. Xi Xi has probably guessed that this matter isn’t enough to crush the Kang family completely.”","Song Shijing found it strange. “Since we know that the Kang family has a way to deal with the problem at hand, why don’t we”","He suddenly paused and subconsciously looked at Gu Zheng.","Young Madam had guessed that the Kang family had a way, but she did not stop them. Why?","Perhaps it was because everything was going according to her plan. The arrest of Kang Qingzhi and Kang Jichuan was just the beginning. After they came out, it would be considered the start of Young Madam’s true revenge."]},{"number":1604,"title":"Chapter 1604 Kang Qingzhi Is Just Bait","paragraphs":["1604 Kang Qingzhi Is Just Bait","Nine in the evening.","Gu Zheng pushed open Qiao Xi’s door. There was only a table lamp switched on in the bedroom. Qiao Xi was sleeping on the table that had a few sheets of paper on it.","The man’s eyes instantly became gentle. He bent down slightly and wanted to pick her up, but he saw the contents of the paper. It was a complicated map of the wealthy families in the capital.","Some noble families had stood tall in the capital for hundreds of years and always had some grudges and conflicts with one another. The situation in the capital changed 20 years ago, and the powerful Situ family suddenly declined. When the old master of the Situ family appeared in Li City, it made him confirm that the Situ family was related to Xi Xi. Moreover, this connection was probably related to Xia Yunqiu.","A few years ago, the Yin family also lived in the capital, but for some reason, they left the capital and went to Shengdu. Why did they choose to leave the capital’s circle? Moreover, why were many noble families in the capital a little resistant to the name Xia Yunqiu?","Gu Zheng’s long fingers landed on the paper and lightly tapped on the word ‘Situ’.","“Gu Zheng?” Qiao Xi suddenly spoke. She opened her sleepy eyes and looked at the man in front of her in confusion.","He retracted his hand subtly and pretended not to see the paper. He picked her up from the chair and said softly, “Sleep on the bed.”","Qiao Xi’s voice was soft. “Mhm. What’s going on with the Kang family?”","“Kang Ru and Old Madam Kang went to the police station. It looks like Kang Jichuan and Kang Qingzhi will be released soon.”","Qiao Xi smiled. “That’s exactly what I wanted. If we keep them locked up, who’ll care about the 4.8 billion yuan the Kang family owes?","“That’s right. Has the person behind Kang Qingzhi appeared?” Qiao Xi fell into her memories. “When I was hypnotized five years ago, Kang Qingzhi was just a teenage girl. Even if she had the intention to set up a trap, she didn’t have that ability. Moreover, Kang Jichuan is a pampered young master of a noble family. How could he know how to hypnotize? Someone must be controlling him.”","Kang Jichuan thought that Kang Qingzhi did not know what he had done, but in reality, Kang Qingzhi was the one who facilitated the plan. Where did a teenage girl get those hypnotic drugs and learn how to use them?","Qiao Xi already had a guess in her heart. It was probably the Brook family or some other wealthy families in the capital. Next, she would use Kang Qingzhi as bait to lure out the big fish behind the scenes.","In the Yin family.","“The Kang family wants to announce to the public that Xi Xi is the daughter of Kang Ru and Yunqiu. How can Xi Xi be from the Kang family?” Yin Jingting handed a document to Old Madam Yin.","Old Madam Yin sneered. “How laughable! Is the Kang family worthy?”","Yin Jingting pointed at the person in the document. “Grandma, this person’s name is Kang Jichuan. He claims to be Aunt Yunqiu’s biological son and Xi Xi’s brother.”","Old Madam Yin’s eyes darkened. This person was indeed very similar to Yunqiu, but","“He’s not Yunqiu’s son,” Old Madam Yin said firmly.","Yin Jingting was puzzled. “But he’s very similar to Aunt.”","“Get your father to come over.” Old Madam Yin’s face was serious. “There are many similar people in this world. I’m sure Kang Jichuan isn’t Yunqiu’s son!”","A few minutes later, Yin Yunyi walked in steadily. “Mother.”","Old Madam Yin nodded, and her gaze landed on him for a long time. She sighed helplessly. “Yunyi, she is still unwilling to let your sister off.”","Yin Yunyi looked up abruptly. “Are you talking about that person from the Xia family?”","The Xia family in the capital!","“Yes.” A trace of resentment flashed past Old Madam Yin’s eyes. “She wanted to harm others 20 years ago. Even though Yunqiu is no longer alive, she’s still unwilling to let her off. She even manipulated the Kang family to deal with Xi Xi.”","Yin Yunyi frowned. “Mother, who else knows Yunqiu’s identity?”","“There’s probably only the Xia family in the capital left.” Old Madam Yin snorted. “That woman from the Xia family used Kang Qingzhi to scheme against Xi Xi. It’s impossible for her to tell her Yunqiu’s true identity.","“Everyone knows that Yunqiu is my and Xia Cheng’s biological daughter. No one knows about her relationship with the Xia family in the capital. It’s been so many years, so why”","“Mother.” Yin Yunyi frowned. “So Kang Jichuan is that woman’s child?”","That woman from the Xia family had been scheming all her life. Even though Yunqiu died, she hoped that Yunqiu would only be known as Kang Ru’s lover and be looked down on forever.","Old Madam Yin gritted her teeth. “Kang Jichuan can’t be Yunqiu’s child, but he’s so similar to Yunqiu. He must be that woman’s child!”"]},{"number":1605,"title":"Chapter 1605 Can’t Avoid What Was Destined To Happen","paragraphs":["1605 Can’t Avoid What Was Destined To Happen","Yin Yunyi was silent for a moment before sighing. “I really don’t understand why she hates Yunqiu so much. Even though Yunqiu is already dead, she still won’t stop. She even wants to harm Xi Xi now.","“Mother, Yunqiu is my younger sister. We can’t ignore this matter.” Yin Yunyi’s eyes were filled with determination. “Kang Qingzhi probably listened to that woman’s opinion before deciding to announce Xi Xi’s identity.","“Back then, the Kang family refused to admit Xi Xi’s identity for the sake of their family’s adopted daughter. Now, they want to use Xi Xi to escape. Xi Xi isn’t someone they can summon and dismiss at will!","“That woman gave birth to Kang Jichuan with Kang Ru, but she labeled Yunqiu as a mistress. How shameless!” Yin Yunyi’s eyes were filled with anger.","Old Madam Yin looked out of the window. She could not avoid what was destined to happen!","The next day.","A piece of news shocked the entire Li City. Miss Qiao, who was said to have been imprisoned by the Kang family for a hundred days, was actually Kang Ru’s biological daughter!","In order to prove his innocence, Kang Jichuan provided a recording to the police. It proved that Qiao Xi already knew that she was the daughter of the Kang family five years ago and voluntarily stayed in the Kang family’s villa.","Since that was the case, Miss Qiao was not imprisoned. She had simply returned to her home. However, she accused Kang Jichuan and Kang Qingzhi of imprisoning her!","It was true that Kang Qingzhi should not have stolen her perfume recipes, but it was wrong of her to accuse Kang Qingzhi of kidnapping and imprisonment!","After Kang Jichuan found out that this matter had caused a sensation online, he heaved a sigh of relief. He knew that nothing could be done regarding the matter of Qingzhi stealing the perfume recipes. No matter how they explained, it was useless. However, Xi Xi was not innocent either. She schemed against Qingzhi and the Kang family. Her reputation would plummet.","Since both parties were in the wrong, everyone would not just focus on the Kang family.","“Little Six, the internet is scolding you now. They’re saying that you and the Kang family are jackals of the same tribe. You’re all not good people! But it’s clearly the Kang family who schemed against you first. They don’t know what the Kang family has done to you at all!” Xue Yi said angrily.","Qiao Xi was extremely calm. “What does Kang Ru want to do next?”","Xue Yi calmed down for a while before saying, “Kang Ru is going to hold a press conference. He said that he wants to publicly apologize to you. I think it’s just an excuse. Actually, he wants everyone to know that you’re from the Kang family and then save Kang Jichuan and Kang Qingzhi! Isn’t this moral coercion?!”","Qiao Xi sneered. “So what even if he does that? I didn’t say I would acknowledge them as my family. As long as I have no morals, how will he coerce me?”","Xue Yi suddenly looked up. “Then what are your plans? How can you prove that you’re not related to them? Actually, I’ve seen Aunt Yunqiu’s photo. Kang Jichuan really looks a little like her.”","After the Kang family came to Li City, they had never done a paternity test with Qiao Xi because Kang Ru felt that Qiao Xi was very similar to Xia Yunqiu. Moreover, judging from her age, Qiao Xi must be his and Xia Yunqiu’s child.","Xue Yi thought so too, but looking at Qiao Xi’s appearance, she was a little suspicious. Qiao Xi and Kang Jichuan looked a little similar. Even if they were not biological siblings, they were probably relatives. As long as they were related by blood, the Kang family would definitely use that against Qiao Xi.","“I have the recording.” Qiao Xi said with a smile, “I’ve always kept the recording of Kang Qingzhi and Kang Jichuan threatening me. It’s just that after I lost my memory, I forgot about this matter. Now, I happen to remember it.”","Xue Yi was instantly stunned.","“At that time, I couldn’t leave the Kang family and was tortured by Kang Qingzhi and Kang Jichuan. Of course, I thought of leaving evidence behind, but I didn’t get any evidence of them taking my blood. Otherwise","“Otherwise, we could’ve sent Kang Qingzhi to jail in minutes!” Xue Yi was extremely angry at the thought of them imprisoning Xi Xi and taking her blood. “So what are your plans?”","“We wait.”","Xue Yi was confused.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Now that my relationship with the Kang family has spread online, Kang Ru will definitely take this opportunity to hold a press conference. He’ll pretend to be pitiful in front of everyone and guilt trip me. Moreover, the Kang family will definitely invite me over and accuse me of being unfilial in front of the reporters.”","Xue Yi was enlightened. Little Six was taking this opportunity to expose the Kang family’s true colors in public with the recording!","Time passed in a flash. It was half past one in the afternoon. There was still half an hour before the Kang family’s press conference officially began. Kang Ru did not invite many reporters, but they were all the most famous in Li City.","Gu Zheng parked the car and said in a gentle voice, “Can you go yourself?”","Qiao Xi smiled. “It’s no problem at all. You don’t have to do anything.”"]},{"number":1606,"title":"Chapter 1606 Bullying Others","paragraphs":["1606 Bullying Others","Gu Zheng curled his lips gently and leaned closer to unbuckle his seatbelt. He placed one hand behind her head and planted a kiss on her forehead with his slightly cold lips. His voice was hoarse. “Xi Xi, I’m your husband.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and looked at him with slight doubt.","“Your matter is my matter, but you never want to trouble me. I heard that being willing to rely on someone means that you trust that person very much, so I hope you can rely on me.” Gu Zheng stared at her with a burning gaze as he spoke word by word.","Qiao Xi also looked at him seriously. “Ah Zheng, who did you hear that from?","“Could it be Song Shiyu?” The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched. “Can you stop listening to Song Shiyu’s nonsense?”","Gu Zheng: “”","Qiao Xi’s fingertip landed on his lips and gently stroked them. She smiled and said, “It’s not that I don’t want to rely on you, but if you go, the Kang family will say that I’m bullying others!”","“But they’re still bullying a young lady like you just because they’re a noble family from Y Nation!” Gu Zheng grabbed her hand and kissed it. Then, he said gently, “You have a point. If I go, I’ll cause you trouble.”","Qiao Xi hurriedly nodded. Actually, there was another reason why she did not let Gu Zheng go. She could not ruin her weak image in Gu Zheng’s heart. Moreover, Gu Zheng was already busy with various matters. The Brooke family alone was already enough to trouble him. She could not add to his worries because of her.","After Qiao Xi left, Gu Zheng also got out of the car, his deep eyes filled with maliciousness.","Kang Ru and Old Madam Kang sat on the stage. The reporters asked, “Mr. Kang, is Miss Qiao Xi really your biological daughter?”","“I heard that you found Miss Qiao Xi five years ago. Why didn’t you announce her identity?”","“Miss Qiao knows about her relationship with the Kang family but schemed against you. Mr. Kang, will you still acknowledge her as your daughter now?”","Kang Ru had long thought of how to answer. He was unhurried and said gently, “Five years ago, my mother and I went overseas. Jichuan found Xi Xi, but in order to surprise me, he didn’t tell me. He made the arrangements for Xi Xi to come over. He even went to her university to pick her up every day. However, Xi Xi only went for a few days before throwing a tantrum and refusing to go to the university. Jichuan didn’t want his sister to neglect her studies, so he hired a tutor for her. However, Xi Xi hated the lessons and had a conflict with the tutor. Qingzhi went forward to stop her, but she was pushed down the stairs by Xi Xi. Although Qingzhi managed to survive, she fell into a coma.","“Qingzhi has been weak and sick since she was young, and Jichuan has always taken good care of her. When he found out that Xi Xi had hurt Qingzhi, he asked Xi Xi to apologize. However, not only did she not have the heart to repent, but she even forced Jichuan to chase Qingzhi away!","“Jichuan didn’t agree and reprimanded Xi Xi a few more times. Xi Xi left the Kang family in a fit of anger and cut ties with us. After my mother and I returned home, Jichuan was afraid that we would be sad, so he hid this matter.”","Kang Ru’s tone was sorrowful. “That’s what happened. I really didn’t expect my daughter to be such a naughty and mischievous child. It’s fine that she disrespected her tutor, but she even hurt Qingzhi. Now, she’s even spouting nonsense about Jichuan and Qingzhi imprisoning her!”","Old Madam Kang hid the resentment in her eyes and cried, “If she hadn’t almost killed Qingzhi back then, how could Jichuan not acknowledge her? It’s all because she’s naughty and willful. She did such a vicious thing. Now, she’s pushing all the blame on us!”","Then, the Kang family invited witnesses from back then. “Back then, Young Master Kang invited me to teach Miss Qiao. She made things difficult for me and even bullied Miss Kang”","“I was Qiao Xi’s classmate at that time. Her brother was really good to her. He was afraid that Qiao Xi would not like the food at the university, so he would come to deliver food every afternoon. No matter what the weather was like, Young Master Kang would pick her up from school at the door.”","“Miss Kang’s health wasn’t good, but no matter what overbearing requests Qiao Xi made, she would agree. She even fell sick a few times because of this, but she never had any complaints. Miss Kang tolerated her, yet she actually had the cheek to say that she was imprisoned by Miss Kang!”","In everyone’s testimony, Kang Jichuan was a good brother who doted on his younger sister. Kang Qingzhi was also a pitiful little girl who tolerated everything Qiao Xi did. On the other hand, Qiao Xi was a willful, naughty, vicious, and arrogant eldest daughter. Even though Kang Jichuan and Kang Qingzhi were good to her, she was still not satisfied and even wanted to chase Kang Qingzhi away.","Old Madam Kang cried bitterly. “Qiao Xi is my biological granddaughter. Of course, I want her to come home, but she almost caused Qingzhi’s death five years ago. How would I dare to let her come back?”"]},{"number":1607,"title":"Chapter 1607 You Ruined A Girl’s Life","paragraphs":["1607 You Ruined A Girl’s Life","A trace of viciousness flashed past Old Madam Kang’s eyes as she shouted, “Actually, there’s something else going on with the perfumes!”","Everyone looked up.","Old Madam Kang knew that Kang Ru was unwilling to deal with Qiao Xi, but she did not care. As long as she could salvage the Kang family’s losses and protect Qingzhi, she could kill Qiao Xi with her own hands!","Moreover, it was all Qiao Xi’s fault that the Kang family had come to this point. It was impossible for the Kang family to reconcile with Qiao Xi. It was better to completely fall out with her!","Old Madam Kang gritted her teeth and said, “Those perfume recipes are indeed Qiao Xi’s, but she was the one who gave them to Qingzhi. Others can accuse Qingzhi of using someone else’s perfume recipes to participate in the competition, but those were all personally given to her by Qiao Xi. How can that be considered stealing?","“Five years ago, she almost caused Qingzhi’s death. Fortunately, Qingzhi was lucky and managed to survive. However, Qiao Xi deliberately tampered with the perfume recipes and exposed Qingzhi for stealing and plagiarizing during the perfume competition. She simply wants to ruin Qingzhi!”","Old Madam Kang was so angry that she thumped her chest and stomped her feet. Not many tears fell, but her cries echoed throughout the hall.","Everyone could not help but be influenced by Old Madam Kang’s words. From what she said, it seemed that Qiao Xi had schemed against Kang Qingzhi, while Kang Qingzhi was just pure-hearted and fell for Qiao Xi’s trap.","At this moment, the reporters below the stage could not help but ask, “Old Madam Kang, do you have evidence to prove your words?”","Old Madam Kang said self-righteously, “Would I lie? I don’t have any evidence. Those who believe us will naturally believe us. We’re not like some people who scheme against our own family!”","Although there was no evidence, everyone believed her words when they saw her angry expression.","Old Madam Kang’s voice was sharp. “Qiao Xi maligned Jichuan and Qingzhi and ruined the reputation of my two grandchildren. She also caused a huge loss to the Kang family. Even though she’s my biological granddaughter, I’m unable to forgive her!”","The reporter quickly asked, “Does that mean the Kang family wants to cut ties with Miss Qiao? Does Mr. Kang Ru agree?”","Everyone looked at Kang Ru. Qiao Xi, who was hidden in the crowd, also looked at Kang Ru.","Kang Ru’s body trembled. He had never thought of this problem. After all, Xi Xi was his biological daughter. Could it be that he really would not let her come home?","Old Madam Kang stared at him with a burning gaze. “Ah Ru!”","This shout completely woke Kang Ru up. He seemed to have made an important decision and said with difficulty, “I I agree.”","“Does Miss Qiao’s mother agree too?”","Although Miss Qiao’s father, brother, and grandmother all wanted to cut ties with her, her mother might not agree. After all, she was pregnant with her for ten months.","The surroundings suddenly fell silent, and Kang Ru’s eyes suddenly turned red. “Xi Xi’s mother passed away many years ago.”","The moment that was said, the entire venue was in an uproar. Actually, everyone knew that Kang Ru had never been married, but he had two children. The secrets of the wealthy families were the focus of the reporters’ attention, and the event location instantly became noisy.","“If you want to know so much about me, why don’t you ask me directly?!”","The young lady’s dark and beautiful hair was tied into a loose bun. She wore a gemstone hairpin on her hair, and there was a pair of gemstone earrings of the same color on her fair and small earlobes. She was wearing a gentle purple fishtail dress as she walked elegantly and calmly toward the crowd. The creases of the dress rippled with her footsteps like a fairy stepping on waves.","The reporters were stunned for a moment. Did Qiao Xi mean that Old Madam Kang was lying?","“I’m telling the truth!” Old Madam Kang pointed at her nose and shouted, “Back then, you hurt Qingzhi and refused to apologize. You even took the initiative to leave the Kang family. Now, you’re biting back and pushing all the blame on Qingzhi and Jichuan. Why are you so vicious?!","As soon as she finished speaking, a middle-aged man took a few steps forward. “Miss Qiao, do you still recognize me?”","Qiao Xi glanced at him. “Yes, you were Kang Qingzhi’s attending physician five years ago.”","The doctor looked at her with disappointment. “Back then, after you left the Kang family, Miss Kang underwent surgery and had to lie on the hospital bed for half a year before she could walk on her own. She was a girl who liked to dance, but she never danced again. You ruined a girl’s life. Don’t you feel guilty at all?","“I don’t know anything else about the Kang family, but I’m extremely sure about this. You’re really too much!”","As soon as he finished speaking, hurried footsteps suddenly came from the door."]},{"number":1608,"title":"Chapter 1608 Who Would Like A Cold-Blooded And Heartless Person?","paragraphs":["1608 Who Would Like A Cold-Blooded And Heartless Person?","“Dad! Grandma!” Kang Qingzhi’s petite figure appeared at the press conference. “You What are you doing? Sister Xi Xi”","Qiao Xi’s eyes suddenly turned cold.","Kang Qingzhi actually came out so quickly?","“Qingzhi!” Kang Ru stood up abruptly.","Kang Jichuan helped Kang Qingzhi over. “Dad, Grandma, the police have already investigated. Qingzhi and I were released.”","He turned around slightly and looked at Qiao Xi with a complicated gaze. “Xi Xi, do you hate me so much? You actually told the police that we imprisoned you.","“Originally, the police wanted to arrest you for defamation, but you’re my younger sister, after all. I won’t pursue this matter anymore. Enough is enough.”","With that, Kang Jichuan sat on the chair beside him with a tired expression.","Everyone’s hearts ached. It was already very tiring for Kang Jichuan to manage the company alone, yet he still had to face such a sister who caused trouble and schemed against her own family.","Kang Qingzhi looked at Qiao Xi and smiled provocatively.","At this moment, Qiao Xi should be very angry! After Qiao Xi set up such a trap, she and her brother were still released without charge in the end. On the other hand, everyone thought Qiao Xi had spread false rumors.","“Sister Xi Xi, come home with us. The past is in the past”","“Congratulations on coming out so quickly.” Qiao Xi interrupted coldly, and her beautiful red lips curled into a smile.","What was she smiling about?","Kang Qingzhi’s heart skipped a beat. How could Qiao Xi still smile at a time like this?","“Miss Kang, are you sure I pushed you down the stairs five years ago?”","Before Kang Qingzhi could say anything, Kang Jichuan said angrily, “I saw it with my own eyes. How could I have wronged you? Qingzhi fell down the stairs, yet you still said that she fell down on purpose. When her life was in danger, you said that she was acting. Do you have any sympathy?”","When the reporters heard this, their eyelids twitched.","No wonder the Kang family did not like Qiao Xi. Who would like such a cold-blooded and heartless person?","“At least you dare to take responsibility. You”","Before he could finish, the big screen behind the Kang family suddenly flashed.","“Young Master Kang, look carefully.”","A video appeared on the big screen. Everyone looked up and saw that it was a staircase in a villa.","Kang Qingzhi’s face instantly turned pale, and her body tensed up. How did Qiao Xi have the Kang family’s surveillance footage?","A bright and beautiful young woman appeared in the video. It was the 15-year-old Qiao Xi. Right after she appeared, Kang Qingzhi fell down the stairs. From this angle, everyone could see it very clearly. Kang Qingzhi walked in front of Qiao Xi, and she fell before Qiao Xi could even touch her.","Qiao Xi stood on the spot with a surprised expression and subconsciously reached out to pull her. The next second, Kang Jichuan rushed over in a hurry. He looked at the unconscious Kang Qingzhi and looked at Qiao Xi angrily.","The video was short, but it was enough to explain everything.","“This This is clearly a case of framing! Kang Qingzhi fell down herself!”","“Since the Kang family has surveillance cameras, why didn’t Kang Jichuan check the surveillance cameras back then? Why did he blame his biological sister?”","“Kang Qingzhi is too scheming! In order to stay with the Kang family and chase Miss Qiao away, she played a trick!”","Kang Qingzhi’s mind buzzed, and the blood in her body seemed to have frozen.","Qiao Xi crossed her arms and looked at Kang Jichuan with ridicule. “You said that I’m vicious and can’t tolerate her, didn’t you? Do you see it clearly now, Young Master Kang?”","Kang Jichuan’s cheeks burned as he looked at Kang Qingzhi in shock.","Why?! Why did she lie?","His relationship with Qiao Xi had completely deteriorated because of this matter. At that time, Qingzhi’s life was in danger, yet Xi Xi was still criticizing Qing Zhi at the side. She was unwilling to apologize, so he began to hate Xi Xi.","Kang Qingzhi saw the doubt in Kang Jichuan’s eyes and her heart turned cold.","No! She could not lose Kang Jichuan’s trust!","She looked fiercely at Qiao Xi and wished for nothing more than to kill this b*tch. However, when she looked up again, her eyes were filled with surprise. “Didn’t Sister Xi Xi push me back then?”","Kang Jichuan stared at her with a burning gaze. She was a little panicked as tears silently fell. “I’m sorry, Sister Xi Xi. I misunderstood you. Maybe I suddenly felt dizzy and fell down the stairs, but before I fainted, I saw you standing at the stairs and thought that you I’m really sorry!","“Sister Xi Xi, why didn’t you take out the recording earlier? You made me misunderstand you for so long. Boo-hoo”","She sobbed uncontrollably and repeated her apology guiltily."]},{"number":1609,"title":"Chapter 1609 Just Because You’re Old And Shameless?","paragraphs":["1609 Just Because You’re Old And Shameless?","The moment Kang Qingzhi finished explaining, Kang Jichuan chose to believe her. Then, he said helplessly, “Xi Xi, you also know that Qingzhi always gets dizzy. That’s why she misunderstood you. Since the misunderstanding has been resolved, forgive her.”","“Misunderstood?” Qiao Xi sneered. “I’ve been bearing this crime for five years, yet you’re dismissing this by saying that it’s just a misunderstanding?”","Old Madam Kang’s voice was sharp. “What else do you want? Qingzhi was unconscious for so long after falling down and can’t dance anymore. Moreover, she has already apologized to you. Why are you still unwilling to let the matter go?”","Qiao Xi was not surprised in the slightest. She had suffered for five years, but now that the truth was out, they casually brushed it off without even comforting her.","She looked at the Kang family coldly. Before she could speak, an extremely oppressive voice sounded. “Old Madam Kang!”","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and saw a tall man walking over against the light. His aura was strong, and his light brown eyes were filled with a coldness that made one shudder.","“Who’s the one who’s unwilling to let the matter go?” Gu Zheng sneered and said firmly, “Back then, Kang Qingzhi thought that Xi Xi was the perpetrator, so the Kang family chased Xi Xi out of the house. Now that Young Master Kang brought this matter up again, it’s nothing more than to cover up the fact that Kang Qingzhi stole Xi Xi’s perfume recipes and imprisoned Xi Xi.","“After Xi Xi proved her innocence, you’re accusing her of being unforgiving? Your Kang family is so biased toward Kang Qingzhi. You don’t take Xi Xi seriously at all. You made her suffer for five years. Why should she forgive you?”","Gu Zheng said slowly, “Should she forgive you just because you’re old and shameless, Old Madam Kang?”","The moment that was said, the venue instantly fell silent. Everyone looked at Gu Zheng in shock.","This crazy person was President Gu?","It had to be said that every word Gu Zheng said made sense. The Kang family was really too biased. Kang Qingzhi caused Qiao Xi to suffer and bear the reputation of attempted murder. Now, Kang Qingzhi casually said that there was a misunderstanding and even accused the victim of not being tolerant enough. What kind of logic was this?","Old Madam Kang shouted in exasperation, “Qiao Xi! You actually found helpers to deal with the Kang family?”","Gu Zheng walked in front of Qiao Xi, his tall body protecting her behind him. The aura he exuded was cold, and his voice was low. “Old Madam Kang, Xi Xi is my wife. Why can’t I help her?”","“President Gu, you” Old Madam Kang was instantly speechless.","She was the madam of a noble family in Y Nation. She was naturally angry that she was being ridiculed by such a junior.","Kang Ru hurriedly said, “President Gu, since the misunderstanding has been resolved and Xi Xi is from the Kang family, she should come home with us”","“Mr. Kang.” The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth twitched, and his voice suddenly turned cold. “What right do you have to make her go back with you? When she was in the Kang family, she was bullied and wronged by your adopted daughter. When have you ever cared? You clearly know how Xi Xi has suffered, but you didn’t say anything!”","Every word he said hit Kang Ru hard. His face was ashen. “W-What are you talking about?!”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone present said angrily, “Mr. Gu is right! How does Kang Ru have the cheek to let Miss Qiao go back home with him? Do they even treat Miss Qiao as a family member?”","“Old Madam Kang is biased toward Kang Qingzhi. If Miss Qiao goes back, I don’t know how she’ll torture her! Look at how pitifully Kang Qingzhi is crying! She’s really aggrieved that she didn’t succeed in framing Miss Qiao!”","Hearing everyone’s mockery, Kang Qingzhi’s thin body swayed as tears fell uncontrollably.","“Is crying all you can do? You’ve wronged Miss Qiao for so many years, yet you still have the cheek to cry?”","“You stole Miss Qiao’s perfume recipes and won the championship. Then, you accused Miss Qiao of plagiarism. Isn’t that the truth?”","“The first time might be a misunderstanding, but you always target Qiao Xi and shed a few tears to gain sympathy. It’s as if you’re the one who was wronged. Qiao Xi isn’t willing to forgive you, so you’re using your family to guilt trip her. How can there be such a scheming person like you?!”","Kang Qingzhi had never been pointed at and scolded before. She instantly cried. “I I didn’t do that”","At this moment, Kang Jichuan said helplessly, “Xi Xi, I misunderstood you. I can understand that you hate me, but Qingzhi is innocent. You can’t vent the anger in your heart on her. She’s weak and sick. She accidentally fell down the stairs. This isn’t her fault!”","Kang Jichuan really did not understand why everyone was criticizing Qingzhi. She was clearly a victim too!"]},{"number":1610,"title":"Chapter 1610 You Owe Me This!","paragraphs":["1610 You Owe Me This!","“It’s not her fault?” Qiao Xi sneered. “Alright, I hope you can continue to insist on your own ideas.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi snapped her fingers. Kang Qingzhi’s heart skipped a beat as horror surged in her heart.","The next second, another surveillance footage appeared on the big screen. Kang Qingzhi was lying on the hospital bed with a pale face.","In the footage, Kang Jichuan roared, “Xi Xi! Apologize to Qingzhi!”","Qiao Xi said, “I didn’t push her. She fell down herself!”","Kang Qingzhi coughed a few times. “Brother, I’m fine. Don’t blame Sister. Cough, cough I forgive her.”","Kang Jichuan was even angrier now. He slapped Qiao Xi fiercely and roared furiously. “Qingzhi isn’t willing to bicker with you, but you actually said that she fell down on purpose. She’s weak and sickly to begin with, so how could she joke around with her life? Xi Xi, why are you so vicious?!”","Qiao Xi held her cheek as tears welled up in her eyes. “I told you, I didn’t push her!”","Smack!","Kang Jichuan stood up angrily and slapped Qiao Xi again. Then, he kicked her knee hard. “Kneel! Get up when you admit your mistake! If you’re unwilling to admit your mistake, then keep kneeling!”","Kang Jichuan left angrily, leaving behind two bodyguards to supervise Qiao Xi and make sure she remained kneeling.","Qiao Xi’s knees ached as she knelt on the floor. She stared at Kang Qingzhi with burning eyes. “You framed me?”","At this moment, Kang Qingzhi’s heart almost stopped beating.","No! The next scene could not be played!","Right on the heels of that, everyone saw Kang Qingzhi reveal a proud and vicious smile in the video.","Her face was still pale, but she no longer looked as weak as before. She chuckled and said, “Yes! I framed you. Look, Brother doesn’t believe you!”","At that moment, Kang Qingzhi’s legs went weak as she knelt on the floor.","After the video ended, everyone present was shocked. The truth was already in front of them. Even if there were people who had accepted the Kang family’s money, they did not dare to say anything now.","Old Madam Kang glared fiercely at Qiao Xi, while Kang Jichuan widened his eyes and looked at Kang Qingzhi in disbelief.","He never expected the truth to be like this!","Kang Qingzhi struggled to stand up. “No! No! This is fake!”","After a few seconds of silence, everyone came back to their senses. “F*ck! Kang Qingzhi is really a scheming b*tch! She looks gentle and weak, but she’s actually evil!”","“She was only 15 years old five years ago! To think that she would deliberately fall down the stairs to frame Qiao Xi. Looks like some people were born bad!”","“Is Kang Jichuan crazy? Did he blindly believe in Kang Qingzhi and beat up his own sister? He used all his strength in those two slaps. Qiao Xi’s face was swollen!”","“The Kang family aren’t good people. They treat Qiao Xi like this for an adopted daughter. No wonder Qiao Xi isn’t willing to return to the Kang family! Moreover, it seems that the kidnapping and imprisonment allegations are true!”","Kang Qingzhi’s tears trickled down. “No! Qiao Xi, you’ve wronged me!”","Previously, Qiao Xi did not have any evidence. No matter what she said, no one would believe her. However, now that Qiao Xi had taken out the surveillance footage, everyone knew that Kang Qingzhi had framed Qiao Xi and caused Qiao Xi to fall out with the Kang family!","Kang Ru’s eyes turned red. “Xi Xi Xi”","Kang Jichuan’s eyes turned red as well. Although he had approached Xi Xi back then to take her blood, he just wanted to treat his younger sister. It was because Xi Xi had hurt Qingzhi and was unwilling to apologize that he felt disgusted with her.","Kang Jichuan was unable to accept this fact. His most trusted sister had actually lied and used him to deal with Xi Xi?","Smack!","Suddenly, a crisp sound came. Kang Qingzhi held her red cheek while Qiao Xi casually took out a tissue and wiped her hands in disgust as if she had touched a virus.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up slightly. “Miss Kang, you owe me this!”","Kang Jichuan subconsciously rushed over and stood in front of Kang Qingzhi, looking at Qiao Xi vigilantly.","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with ridicule. “Young Master Kang, you’re still protecting her even now?”","Kang Jichuan was instantly speechless. Protecting Qingzhi seemed to have become his instinct. Even though he knew what Qingzhi had done, he could not bear to see her cry.","“Young Master Kang, I’m afraid you don’t know this. I didn’t bully Kang Qingzhi behind your back. She was the one abusing me. This slap is just the beginning, but you want to protect her even now?","“Kang Qingzhi wanted to kill me. Are you going to die for her sake?”"]},{"number":1611,"title":"Chapter 1611 Chase This Bad Woman Away","paragraphs":["1611 Chase This Bad Woman Away","As soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, everyone’s indignant voices sounded. “What spell did Kang Qingzhi cast on the Kang family? Normal people can tell that Kang Qingzhi’s heart is as vicious as a snake, but the Kang family thinks she’s a pure and weak little white flower?”","“Sure!” Qiao Xi said with a smile, “As long as you expel Kang Qingzhi from the family, I’ll forgive you.”","The two men were instantly stunned.","“Kang Qingzhi has made me suffer so much. I’m already traumatized. You can’t ask me to face someone who has hurt me every day, right?”","Everyone nodded. If they wanted to bring Miss Qiao back, of course, they had to chase this bad woman, Kang Qingzhi, away!","However, Kang Ru looked troubled. Kang Jichuan frowned with a sad expression. “Xi Xi”","“It’s fine if you’re unwilling. Ah Zheng, let’s go home.” Qiao Xi did not give them a chance to speak at all and pulled Gu Zheng out.","“Qiao Xi!” Old Madam Kang shouted. She raised her head arrogantly, and her tone was filled with charity. “I agree to let you return to the Kang family, but your grudge against Qingzhi ends here! Qingzhi grew up in the Kang family. Of course, she would feel threatened when you suddenly returned to the Kang family. She was young at that time, so it’s reasonable for her to be muddle-headed!”","“Old Madam Kang, if I remember correctly, Xi Xi and Kang Qingzhi are the same age. Kang Qingzhi is young, but was Xi Xi not young? A 15-year-old girl was wronged and beaten up. Why should she endure all of this for nothing?” Gu Zheng’s voice was cold, and a trace of cold killing intent flashed past his eyes.","Old Madam Kang retorted loudly, “President Gu, this is our Kang family’s matter. You’d better not interfere! Qingzhi did do something wrong, but Qiao Xi isn’t innocent either. She slandered Jichuan for imprisoning her. This score hasn’t been settled yet!”","Qiao Xi smiled. Before she could say anything, Old Madam Kang beat her to it. Since she mentioned this matter, she would tell her in detail.","“Actually, I’m not here today to force you to chase Kang Qingzhi away.” As soon as Qiao Xi said this, Kang Ru’s eyes instantly lit up. However, the next second, Qiao Xi chuckled and said, “I want to cut ties with you!”","Sever ties?","Old Madam Kang almost laughed out loud, and Kang Ru’s expression instantly changed. “Xi Xi!”","“Since Old Madam Kang mentioned the imprisonment, I’ll tell everyone the truth. Let’s talk about how I left the Kang family first!”","Kang Jichuan’s heart trembled as fear rushed to his head.","Qiao Xi glanced at him indifferently and said in a cold voice, “Five years ago, in order to escape Kang Jichuan and Kang Qingzhi’s clutches, I took the opportunity to escape from the Kang family.”","“Xi Xi!!!” Kang Jichuan stopped her.","Qiao Xi ignored him and continued, “Kang Jichuan chased after me with his bodyguards. I was forced to jump off the cliff and fall into the sea. At the same time, I lost my memories of the Kang family. It wasn’t until I recovered my memories not long ago that I found out about the grudge between me and Young Master Kang.”","Everyone gasped. Qiao Xi was Kang Jichuan’s biological sister!","As soon as she finished speaking, Old Madam Kang cursed, “Nonsense! Are you crazy, you little b*tch? Are you going to destroy Jichuan?”","Kang Jichuan’s ears buzzed. He did not expect Xi Xi to say that in public. He had almost caused Xi Xi’s death. For the past five years, he had been atoning for his sins and praying for her every month.","He was in the wrong, but he absolutely could not go to jail. The Kang family still needed him!","Kang Jichuan calmed his complicated emotions and straightened his neck. “Xi Xi left on her own. We didn’t chase after her! Xi Xi, I know you’ve been wronged and you hate me, but you can’t”","“Young Master Kang, stop pretending.” Suddenly, a dignified voice came from the door.","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and saw an old man with a gray beard slowly walking in. They immediately exclaimed, “Oh my! This is Old Master Zhou from the Medical Association!”","“Old Master Zhou? Why is he here?”","Gu Zheng looked up and was suddenly stunned when he saw Old Master Zhou.","It was him!","“Mr. Gu, long time no see.” Old Master Zhou greeted Gu Zheng. “How are you recovering?”","“Thank you for your concern, Doctor Zhou. I’ve already recovered.”","Old Master Zhou sized him and Qiao Xi up and said in surprise, “Mr. Gu, you and Miss Qiao are really fated! Five years ago, the two of you I didn’t expect you to be married now!”","Gu Zheng was a little stunned. Fated?","Before he could figure it out, Old Master Zhou walked in front of Kang Jichuan. “Young Master Kang, I saved Miss Qiao five years ago!”"]},{"number":1612,"title":"Chapter 1612 This Scene Is Familiar","paragraphs":["1612 This Scene Is Familiar","“Back then, when I saved Miss Qiao, I met the Kang family’s bodyguards at the beach. Then, I realized that Miss Qiao’s body was covered in whip marks and bruises. Moreover, she hadn’t eaten for three days. There were also several needle marks on her arm. All this is enough to prove that she was abused.”","Old Master Zhou looked at Kang Jichuan with a burning gaze. “I heard that you suddenly started praying for blessings five years ago. Is it because you felt guilty about Miss Qiao?”","Kang Jichuan’s scalp went numb. He really did not want to kill Xi Xi, but","“Someone must have been chasing after Qiao Xi. Jichuan only brought people to save her. Jichuan thought that she was dead, so he followed a vegetarian diet since then and kept praying for her!” Old Madam Kang roared with a ferocious expression. “Qiao Xi! Your brother did all that for your sake, yet you actually slandered him! You have no conscience!”","Old Madam Zhou ignored Old Madam Kang and questioned again, “Young Master Kang, can you explain why you often brought Miss Qiao to the hospital when she was in the Kang family? You don’t have to patronize me. I was a doctor in that hospital back then. I know very well what you did.","“Unfortunately, I was threatened and couldn’t save Miss Qiao. Otherwise, I would’ve called the police long ago!”","Kang Jichuan’s mind buzzed. Of course, he brought Xi Xi to the hospital to get her blood drawn!","At that time, he chose a private hospital and bribed the dean, so he was not worried about being exposed. Unexpectedly, Old Master Zhou used to work in that hospital!","“Young Master Kang, why did you bring me to the hospital?” The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth carried a trace of ridicule.","Kang Jichuan lowered his head and trembled uncontrollably.","No! He absolutely could not say it out loud, or he and Qingzhi would be doomed!","“It’s okay if you’re unwilling to tell me. I have evidence anyway.” As soon as Old Master Zhou finished speaking, a group of people appeared at the door. They were all the doctors and nurses from back then.","They were all here!","Kang Jichuan abruptly raised his eyes and met Qiao Xi’s cold eyes.","Xi Xi wanted to take revenge on him and make him go to jail!","This realization made Kang Jichuan stop breathing, and his mind was a mess.","“You old thing! You must have been hired by Qiao Xi! Show me whatever evidence you have! Don’t bluff here! Jichuan brought that little b*tch to the hospital to treat her. You”","“Grandma!” Kang Jichuan interrupted Old Madam Kang’s curses, his teeth chattering.","Purely imprisoning Qiao Xi was completely different from forcefully taking her blood. He would definitely go to jail!","Kang Jichuan was so scared that he did not dare to make a sound. He knew that Qiao Xi was forcing him to make a choice. Firstly, she wanted him to admit that he had imprisoned her. Secondly, she wanted Old Master Zhou to expose him in public for forcefully taking her blood and attempting to kill her.","He did not understand why Qiao Xi did not directly expose him but gave him a chance. He did not have the time to think and could only grit his teeth. “I I imprisoned Xi Xi!”","Boom!!!","These words hit everyone’s hearts hard. Why did Kang Jichuan, who was still denying it just now, suddenly admit it?","Everyone thought about it carefully and understood. He was afraid that Old Master Zhou would expose him, so he took the initiative to admit it.","“Jichuan! What nonsense are you talking about?! How can you admit to something you didn’t do?” Old Madam Kang had a slightly stunned expression. The next second, she rushed in front of Qiao Xi and grabbed her arm as she shouted, “Little b*tch! What exactly did you do to Jichuan? Did you threaten him?”","Her face was ferocious, and her muddy eyes were about to pop out. She raised her hand and attacked Qiao Xi’s cheek. “I’ll kill you, little b*tch”","However, the next second, Old Madam Kang’s hand was grabbed by a man’s strong palm. He seemingly gently moved her hand away. It seemed that he did not use much strength, but Old Madam Kang felt that her wrist was about to break.","“Old Madam Kang, you’re trying to beat Xi Xi up, and you even threatened to kill her. Do you think Kang Jichuan will be too lonely so you want to go to jail to accompany him?”","Song Shijing: “” The president’s mouth was still so vicious!","Kang Ru, who was at the side, also panicked. “Jichuan, why did you imprison Xi Xi?! You’re a kind child. You can’t spout such nonsense!","“Xi Xi, stop fooling around. Jichuan is your biological brother. He misunderstood you, but he definitely wouldn’t have imprisoned you! Xi Xi, you’re my daughter. I don’t agree with this. You have to”","“Mr. Kang,” Qiao Xi said casually, “Isn’t this scene familiar? Back then, when my mother said that Old Madam Kang wanted to kill her, you probably didn’t believe her either, right?!”"]},{"number":1613,"title":"Chapter 1613 Everyone Will Pay The Price","paragraphs":["1613 Everyone Will Pay The Price","Kang Ru felt as if he had been struck by lightning. There was a trace of confusion in his eyes.","Qiao Xi stopped looking at him and looked at Kang Jichuan with ridicule. “Young Master Kang, you admit to imprisoning me?”","Kang Jichuan looked up and nodded sadly.","“Alright.” The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up slightly as she walked to his side and said in a low voice, “You’re very smart. You know that imprisonment and intentional murder are different. Since you’ve admitted to imprisonment, you don’t have to bear the crime of murder.”","Kang Jichuan’s face instantly turned pale, and his lips trembled. “Xi Xi, I’ve already admitted it. What else do you want?”","Qiao Xi smiled sarcastically. “Young Master Kang, I gave you two choices because we’re siblings. However, I can’t easily forgive you, the murderer, either, so I asked you to admit that you imprisoned me. After this, you’ll take the initiative to turn yourself in and fight for clemency. You’ll be released after staying in prison for a few years.”","“Of course. I have to have a thorough plan when dealing with the Kang family. From the moment you came to Li City, I had already planned it out. It was also then that I recovered my memory.”","Kang Jichuan’s blood froze. He did not expect Xi Xi to start scheming against the Kang family so early on, but at that time, he and his father really wanted to bring her home!","“Right, there’s one more thing” Qiao Xi said with a smile, “Do you remember Kang Junjie? His status in high society is much higher than yours now. Moreover, you guys signed a bet agreement!”","Qiao Xi’s voice was light, but it was like a huge rock smashing heavily into Kang Jichuan’s heart.","“After you go to jail, who will manage the Kang family’s business? That idiot, Kang Ru, doesn’t know how to do business at all. Can he manage Kang Corporation, which is in danger? Or do you think Kang Qingzhi’s framing tricks can support the Kang family?","“Kang Jichuan, once you’re in jail, the Kang family will completely fall. All of you will pay the price!”","“Don’t hurt Qingzhi!” Kang Jichuan gritted his teeth.","“Since you’ve already admitted your crime, then go to the police station and turn yourself in,” Qiao Xi said coldly before turning around and returning to Gu Zheng’s side.","After a while, the police handcuffed Kang Jichuan and put him in the police car.","This scene caused everyone in the Kang family to fall into a huge panic. Their faces were paler than ever.","Qiao Xi smiled indifferently. The matter was not over yet!","She glanced at Kang Qingzhi indifferently. Back then, she was imprisoned in the basement by Kang Jichuan and became Kang Qingzhi’s blood bank. Imprisonment was just a part of Kang Jichuan’s crime. No one knew about the crime of him forcefully drawing her blood and attempting murder.","Kang Jichuan had already been arrested, so it was naturally Kang Qingzhi’s turn to confess. However, the person behind Kang Qingzhi had not appeared yet. Qiao Xi could not touch her yet, so she could only make a move on Kang Ru and Old Madam Kang first.","After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi said, “Mr. Kang Ru, my relationship with the Kang family is already destroyed. Why don’t we take this opportunity to sever ties?!”","“No!” Kang Ru refused without hesitation, his eyes filled with a trace of pleading. “Xi Xi, it wasn’t easy for me to find you. How could you”","“Mr. Kang, to tell you the truth, if I return to the Kang family, Kang Qingzhi won’t have a good life. She framed me time and again, but I haven’t had the chance to take revenge. At that time”","“Xi Xi, you wouldn’t. You’re so kind”","“Kind?” Qiao Xi sneered. “Mr. Kang, when did kindness become a derogatory word? You said that Kang Qingzhi and Kang Jichuan were kind, but look at what they’ve done. It’s impossible for me to be a family with them!","“Coincidentally, all my reporters are here. I officially announce that I want to cut ties with the Kang family! Mr. Kang Ru, this is a notice, not a request!”","Kang Ru said with a trembling voice, “Xi Xi, you”","At this moment, a reporter stood up. “I support Miss Qiao! The Kang family has hurt Miss Qiao so many times, yet they still have the cheek to ask her to acknowledge them? Don’t tell me they want to do something bad again?”","“Kang Ru, as a noble in Y Nation, you should know what etiquette is, right?! Miss Qiao has already shown mercy. You’d better agree quickly!”","Kang Ru’s eyes were bloodshot as he said sorrowfully, “Xi Xi, do you hate me so much?”","“I agree!” Before Kang Ru could finish speaking, Old Madam Kang gritted her teeth and said. Her old face was filled with malevolence as she roared fiercely, “You b*tch, you’re not worthy of entering our Kang family!”","Hearing Old Madam Kang’s curses, Qiao Xi was not angry in the slightest. Instead, she chuckled. “I’ve already prepared the document to sever ties with you. Mr. Kang Ru, please sign it later.”"]},{"number":1614,"title":"Chapter 1614 Your Love Is Too Cheap!","paragraphs":["1614 Your Love Is Too Cheap!","“The matter just now has been resolved. Let’s settle the rest.” As soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, her icy-cold gaze landed on Old Madam Kang.","“The outside world doesn’t know much about my mother. I only heard that you doted on my mother very much and had been looking for her all these years. But do you know why my mother left?” Qiao Xi asked casually.","Kang Ru was instantly stunned. He said stiffly, “Yunqiu and my mother didn’t get along, and she angered my mother. She felt ashamed and left the house”","“Are you sure?” Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with disappointment. Such a weak and irresponsible man was not worthy of being a father at all!","“Mr. Kang, listen carefully. My mother didn’t leave because of trivial matters in the family but because her life was threatened in the Kang family! The Kang family looks like a peaceful family on the surface, but they’re extremely dirty behind the scenes. Do you think that no one will find out once 20 years have passed?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were icy-cold, and her voice was sharp. “Old Madam Kang, do you need me to produce evidence?”","Kang Ru instantly panicked. “Xi Xi, stop fooling around. Yunqiu abandoned me and Jichuan. It’s her fault. How can you blame your grandma?”","“Your wife? According to what I know, the two of you were never married! You’re weak by nature and don’t dare to defy Old Madam Kang’s orders. You forcefully kept my mom by your side and made her a mistress without a status. You even created the image of an affectionate husband for yourself after she left. Don’t you think you’re very hypocritical?”","Everyone was dumbfounded, then looked at Kang Ru in disdain.","Kang Ru’s face turned red as he retorted loudly, “But I loved her!”","“Is your love so selfish? Did you have to force her to stay by your side just because you loved her? You loved her, so you let her suffer Old Madam Kang’s torture every day? Kang Ru, your love is too cheap!”","Qiao Xi said angrily, “Not only will I leave the Kang family today, but I’ll also bring my mother with me! Back then, you ruined my mother’s wedding with her lover in the name of love. After snatching her home, you didn’t cherish her properly. After she left, you told everyone that your love for her hadn’t changed and blamed her for abandoning her husband and son, but no one knew that she left just to survive!”","Kang Ru retorted in a panic, “Nonsense! I didn’t force Yunqiu. She willingly stayed by our side. We were very in love!”","As soon as he finished speaking, someone could not help but say, “Mr. Kang, you can’t be too selfish. If you had really liked Madam Xia Yunqiu, you would’ve let her go. You wouldn’t have ruined her life.”","“She should have gotten a happy marriage, but you forced her to be your lover. What right do you have to say that you loved her? Since you snatched her from another man, you should’ve married her and sincerely treated her well. You shouldn’t have let her suffer. You want to be respected as a man, but you didn’t allow her to pursue her own happiness. Aren’t you too despicable?!”","“Or do you think that it was Xia Yunqiu’s honor to be your lover because of your noble status? Pfft! How disgusting!”","A wave of ridicule entered Kang Ru’s ears. He froze on the spot like a statue.","Back in Y Nation, everyone had lamented that he was affectionate and loyal. Now, everyone was scolding him for being selfish!","“Shut up!” Old Madam Kang was so angry that her face was ferocious. She roared like a wild beast, “Ah Ru is a noble in Y Nation, while Xia Yunqiu was just a lowly commoner. It was her honor to be Ah Ru’s lover. Was she worthy of being the madam of the Kang family?”","Anger surged in Qiao Xi’s heart. They thought they were high up on the pedestal and looked down on commoners, but what right did Kang Ru have to force her mother to stay by his side? The Kang family felt that it was already a supreme honor to be able to become the lover of the earl of Y Nation, but no one had ever asked her mother if she was willing.","At this point, Old Madam Kang did not feel guilty at all. Instead, she felt that Xia Yunqiu’s escape was disloyal to Kang Ru. Hence, Xia Yunqiu deserved to die!","Qiao Xi sneered. “Old Madam Kang, are the lives of commoners not important in your eyes? My mother stayed in the Kang family for three years while you tortured her to your heart’s content. At first, I didn’t understand why you insisted on abusing her, but I understand now. It’s because in your eyes, she’s just a slave. You don’t have to bear the consequences even if you kill her.”","“Shut up!” Old Madam Kang stopped her angrily."]},{"number":1615,"title":"Chapter 1615 Dirty Beneath Her Shiny Appearance","paragraphs":["1615 Dirty Beneath Her Shiny Appearance","Kang Ru berated loudly, “Xi Xi, what nonsense are you talking about?! Why would my mother kill Yunqiu? Although my mother always reprimanded Yunqiu, it was because Yunqiu did something wrong. Yunqiu is just a junior, so why couldn’t she understand my mother? Even if it was for my sake”","“Kang Ru!” Qiao Xi roared angrily, her chest heaving violently as she gritted her teeth. “It’s been so many years, but you’re still unwilling to believe my mother! Fortunately, I obtained evidence. Otherwise, my mother would have to bear the bad reputation of abandoning her husband and son for the rest of her life!","“According to the Kang family, you were very good to her. On the contrary, she was wilful, disloyal, and heartless, right? Then open your eyes wide!”","At this moment, Qiao Xi had taken a few medical reports from Song Shijing. They were Xia Yunqiu’s medical reports. Her body was covered in injuries, her arm was broken, and there were whip marks on her back. There were also many needle marks on her body. In addition, she had suffered a heavy blow to her forehead.","!!","The peerless Xia Yunqiu back then actually suffered inhumane abuse. When everyone saw the reports, their hearts could not help but ache.","Kang Ru widened his eyes!","Qiao Xi clicked on another video. It was the testimony of the servants in the Kang family’s villa.","‘Old Madam didn’t like Madam Yunqiu. She said that she was a vixen who seduced Master, but we could all tell that Madam Yunqiu didn’t want to stay here. Master forced her to stay.’","‘When Master brought Madam Yunqiu back, he didn’t allow her to leave the bedroom. Whenever she was allowed to leave, someone had to follow her. Master told us that her health wasn’t good, so she couldn’t go out, but we all knew that he was putting her under house arrest.”","“That day, I saw Old Madam push Madam Yunqiu down the stairs with my own eyes, which caused Madam Yunqiu’s arm to break. Old Madam even threatened Madam Yunqiu not to tell Master. Madam Yunqiu was afraid that we would be in a difficult position and even comforted us that she was fine”","Next, there were testimonies of the neighbors and doctors. Everyone could prove that Kang Ru had imprisoned Xia Yunqiu, and Old Madam Kang had abused her.","“No This isn’t true! Xi Xi, I loved Yunqiu. I won’t marry for the rest of my life. Did you bribe them to testify?”","“I’m not as despicable as your Kang family.” Qiao Xi grunted coldly and looked at Kang Ru with a burning gaze. “Mr. Kang, when you brought my mother home, didn’t Old Madam Kang say that you could marry my mother as long as you gave up your title? But you didn’t.”","“I”","Qiao Xi said word by word, “It’s rare to have the best of both worlds in life. Why should you have everything? If you were unwilling to give up your title, then you should’ve let her leave!”","Kang Ru’s face was ashen. He lowered his head and retorted, “No”","“Mr. Kang, you said that I bribed the people in the video, huh? Those who can stay near the Kang family are all nobles and big shots in business. How can they be bribed by me? I don’t think I have the ability!”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, the surrounding people gasped.","“Those nobles all care about their reputation. They despise being bribed and threatened the most. It seems that Kang Ru really imprisoned Madam Xia back then. Old Madam Kang had also tortured her.”","“Xia Yunqiu was so pitiful! She was targeted by a man like Kang Ru and was forced to separate from her lover. She wasn’t allowed to leave and wasn’t given a status. She was even tortured by Old Madam Kang all day long!”","At this moment, everyone knew how hypocritical Kang Ru was under his affectionate mask. They also knew how dirty the Kang family’s glamorous appearance was.","Qiao Xi looked at Kang Ru whose eyes were bloodshot and felt extremely delighted!","She said coldly, “Mr. Kang, you keep saying that you loved her, but in reality, you don’t understand how to love someone at all. If you really loved her, you wouldn’t have forced her or let Old Madam Kang torture her. You were unwilling to offend your mother, so you could only let my mother endure it. How long did you want her to endure it? Did she have to endure it for the rest of her life or until the day she was killed by Old Madam Kang?”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly and did not want to listen to his retort. Now that the truth was out, no one would believe anything he said.","At this moment, Old Madam Kang stood up with a vicious expression. “Qiao Xi! You’re talking nonsense! When did I want to kill Xia Yunqiu? I only reprimanded her a few times, but she actually retorted. I punished her a few times, but I never said I wanted to kill her!","“Don’t try to drive a wedge between me and Ah Ru. Ah Ru won’t believe your nonsense!”","Qiao Xi sneered and snapped her fingers indifferently. Another video appeared on the big screen. The timestamp in the lower right corner showed that it took place more than 20 years ago, and the location was the Kang family’s villa in Y Nation."]},{"number":1616,"title":"Chapter 1616 A Rose Contaminated With Poison","paragraphs":["1616 A Rose Contaminated With Poison","In the video, Old Madam Kang grabbed Xia Yunqiu’s hair tightly and slammed her head against the railing of the stairs. Her forehead instantly bled.","Old Madam Kang shouted with a ferocious expression, “B*tch! Go die!”","Then, she kicked the unconscious Xia Yunqiu down the stairs. This scene was taken by a servant. After Old Madam Kang left, the servant hurriedly sent Xia Yunqiu to the hospital.","Right on the heels of that, the scene changed. Old Madam Kang instructed the nanny, who was in her 50s, to poison Xia Yunqiu’s food, causing her to vomit blood and fall unconscious. After that, Old Madam Kang locked her up and did not allow anyone to save her.","!!","This was deliberate murder!","After the video ended, the entire venue was in an uproar. Old Madam Kang’s expression instantly stiffened, and the veins on her forehead almost popped out.","Qiao Xi’s voice was cold as she said word by word, “Old Madam Kang, you’re really a good grandma who dotes on her grandson. You’re afraid that Kang Jichuan will be alone in prison and want to accompany him, so I’ll satisfy you!”","The video clearly listed Old Madam Kang’s evidence. Her attempted murder of Xia Yunqiu could be confirmed. The next second, Old Madam Kang was arrested.","When she was handcuffed, Old Madam Kang’s expression was still blank. She did not expect that her smooth sailing life would end up being destroyed in Qiao Xi’s hands.","Kang Qingzhi trembled in fear when he saw Old Madam Kang being captured. He shrunk his neck and widened his eyes in fear.","Qiao Xi seemed to have changed into a different person. Five years ago, she was clearly just a young lady who could be controlled by anyone, but five years later, she was like a rose that was contaminated with poison.","Now that his son and mother were in jail, what should the Kang family do? What should he do?","Kang Qingzhi knew very well in her heart that the matter of Qiao Xi’s blood being drawn back then was caused by her. Now that Qiao Xi had recovered her memory, she would definitely not let her off. Qiao Xi had already dealt with her brother and grandma. Would it be her turn next?","“Mother! Impossible!” Kang Ru’s roar interrupted Kang Qingzhi’s thoughts. His usually gentle face had already become ferocious, and his body was swaying.","“Yunqiu was my wife. My mother was just teaching her a lesson. That was just a family conflict. She didn’t try to kill anyone on purpose! Xi Xi, that’s your biological grandma. You can’t do this”","Kang Ru said crazily. His life had been too smooth sailing. He had nothing to worry about, and his daily routine only consisted of eating, drinking, and playing. Now that the Kang family was in such a predicament, he did not know how to deal with it at all.","Qiao Xi sneered. “You said that Old Madam Kang was just teaching my mother a lesson and didn’t want to kill anyone?”","“Yes! Yes, this is all a misunderstanding” Kang Ru said without hesitation.","Before he could finish speaking, the door of the venue slammed open. Old Madam Yin, who had a strong aura, quickly walked in and stood in front of Kang Ru. She looked coldly at this gentle-looking but weak and despicable man and said coldly, “Is a man like you worthy of coveting my daughter?”","Kang Ru did not even raise his head and only muttered to himself, “Yunqiu was my wife. It was only right for my mother to teach her a lesson. She”","“You didn’t marry Yunqiu. She had nothing to do with you. You and your mother had no right to teach her a lesson. Kang Ru, do you think I can’t do anything to you just because you’re a noble in Y Nation?”","Everyone was stunned.","This madam was Xia Yunqiu’s mother?","Someone instantly recognized Old Madam Yin and exclaimed, “Ah! Isn’t this the previous head of the Yin family, Old Madam Yin? She’s also the mother of the current head of the Yin family, Yin Yunyi. Xia Yunqiu is actually her daughter?”","“I remember that many years ago, Old Madam Yin and Xia Cheng were married. She gave birth to a son and two daughters. Xia Yunqiu is one of the two daughters.”","“In that case, Xia Yunqiu is from the Yin family, yet the Kang family actually thought that she wasn’t worthy of Kang Ru? How laughable!”","Old Madam Yin looked down at him from above and said in a cold voice, “Mr. Kang, according to what I know, Kang Jichuan was born in Y Nation. He’s 25 years old this year, but 25 years ago, my daughter was always at home in the capital. Everyone in the capital can testify. How could she have given birth to your child?","“23 years ago, she registered her marriage with her lover at that time but was forcefully taken away by you. She only escaped from the Kang family three years later. How could she have given birth to a daughter for you?","“Mr. Kang, you kidnapped my daughter and separated her from her lover for three years. Now, you’re actually slandering her in public. You said that she became your lover and even gave birth to your children. How dare you say such things?!”"]},{"number":1617,"title":"Chapter 1617 Kidnapped And Imprisoned","paragraphs":["1617 Kidnapped And Imprisoned","Old Madam Yin reprimanded angrily, “Now that the truth is out, you’re still unwilling to let her off. You even want to claim that your despicable son is hers and tarnish her reputation! Kang Ru, as a noble in Y Nation, you actually did such a shameful thing. Looks like I have to talk to the person in power in Y Nation!”","After Old Madam Yin finished speaking, everyone gasped.","What she meant was that Kang Jichuan was not Xia Yunqiu’s son, and Qiao Xi was not Kang Ru’s daughter. In other words, Qiao Xi had nothing to do with the Kang family!","Kang Ru was instantly stunned, and his body trembled uncontrollably. “You You’re lying to me. Yunqiu was my woman. She gave birth to my children!”","!!","Old Madam Yin sneered and said, “Mr. Kang, you’re delusional. It’s better to get you treated as soon as possible. Let me tell you clearly that my daughter has never had anything to do with you. If I hear you go around saying that my daughter was your lover or I hear that you’re using your identity as a father to blackmail Xi Xi, I’ll absolutely not let you off!","“Although my Yin family is no longer in the capital, we’re not afraid of the Kang family. Your son and Old Madam Kang are both in jail now. Your company’s matter is enough to make you overwrought. If you’re unconvinced, you can fight the Yin family!”","Only now did everyone understand the truth behind this. More than 20 years ago, Kang Ru kidnapped Xia Yunqiu and Old Madam Kang abused her. After that, Kang Jichuan kidnapped Qiao Xi and almost killed her. Did the Kang family have kidnapping and imprisoning in their genes?","Kang Qingzhi instantly panicked. That person had long instructed her to let Xia Yunqiu carry the title of ‘Kang Ru’s lover’ forever, but now that Old Madam Yin had clarified things in public, she could not salvage the situation. Could it be that the woman did not care about her anymore?","She did not understand that woman’s intentions, but all these years, she had been egging Old Madam Kang and Kang Ru on. They announced to the public that Xia Yunqiu was just a lover. Now that Kang Jichuan and Old Madam Qiao were both in jail and Kang Ru could not win against Old Madam Yin, what should she do?","Old Madam Yin glanced at Kang Ru in disgust and said hatefully, “If my daughter hadn’t met you back then, she would have lived happily with her lover and been by my side. She wouldn’t have died early. You destroyed her!”","She took a deep breath and suppressed her surging anger. Then, she looked at Qiao Xi and said in a gentle tone, “Xi Xi, it’s been hard on you. Now that you know that you’re not Kang Ru’s child, you have nothing to do with this weak and selfish man!”","With that, Old Madam Yin’s gaze landed on Kang Qingzhi as the corners of her mouth curled into a mocking smile. “You’re very similar to that woman!”","These words were confusing, and no one understood what they meant. Old Madam Yin quickly left. “Xi Xi, I’ll wait for you in the side hall.”","Qiao Xi nodded. She knew that Old Madam Yin had something to say. She glanced coldly at Kang Qingzhi and Kang Ru. “Mr. Kang, Miss Kang, let me remind you that the matter of Kang Corporation’s perfumes needs to be dealt with quickly. I’ll get going first.”","Only then did everyone realize that back then, Kang Qingzhi was confident that she could win the championship, so Kang Corporation invested four billion yuan. Now, not only was the four billion yuan wasted, but they also had to compensate Kang Junjie with a huge sum of money.","The higher-ups of Kang Corporation broke out in a cold sweat. From their vicious gazes, it looked like they wished they could pierce through Kang Qingzhi.","“That’s right! We’ve worked hard for Kang Corporation all these years, but this time, you’ve ruined all our years of hard work. You have to give us an explanation!”","Kang Qingzhi clenched her fists tightly. She wanted to leave, but there were people around her. She had nowhere to run.","Qiao Xi was really capable! After she caused a scene, everyone in the Kang family was affected. The news conference that was originally held to deal with Qiao Xi ended up burying everyone in the Kang family!","Not far away, Qiao Xi narrowed her eyes. “Sister Xue Yi, get someone to keep an eye on Kang Qingzhi.”","Xue Yi nodded. “Alright, but are you sure that person will contact Kang Qingzhi? Maybe the other party will think she’s useless and just give up.”","Qiao Xi shook her head. “No, that person has carefully nurtured her for so many years and set up such a big trap. It’s really not worth it to abandon Kang Qingzhi at this time.”","After the storm ended, everyone left. Kang Ru and Kang Qingzhi sat weakly on the chairs in a sorry state.","Kang Qingzhi looked at Qiao Xi’s back view and gritted her teeth in hatred.","This b*tch had ruined her future and reputation!","However, it did not matter. The Kang family had lost to Qiao Xi, but there were many people who wanted to kill her. When she arrived in the capital, she would face a death that was even more miserable than the incident five years ago!"]},{"number":1618,"title":"Chapter 1618 Secret From Decades Ago","paragraphs":["1618 Secret From Decades Ago","The surrounding people dispersed. Gu Zheng hurriedly caught up to Old Master Zhou. “Sir, wait.”","Old Master Zhou turned around. “Lil Gu, what’s wrong? Are you feeling unwell?”","Gu Zheng went straight to the point. “You said that Xi Xi and I are fated. What do you mean by that?”","Old Master Zhou widened his eyes in surprise. “Lil Gu, don’t you know? Five years ago, the two of you fell into the sea together. I was the one who saved you. Now that you’re married, of course, the two of you are very fated!”","!!","Gu Zheng’s pupils constricted!","“Back then, Lil Qiao was forced to jump into the sea. Your situation was similar, but you were shot. I smelled blood and saw someone floating on the sea, so I saved you. I found her right on the heels of that. Although her body was weak, she wasn’t injured. It wasn’t difficult to save her, but your injuries were very serious. There were a few times when you almost stopped breathing. Fortunately, God blessed you and you survived in the end.","“After that, Lil Qiao’s grandfather and brother picked her up. You were unconscious for more than ten days before you woke up. At that time, you hadn’t seen Lil Qiao. Now, you’re both married!”","Gu Zheng hid the emotions in his eyes and said softly, “You still remember what happened five years ago so clearly. Xi Xi and I both know about that matter. We just wanted to ask about the details.”","“Lil Qiao was only in her teens at that time, but I could tell that she was a beauty. You were handsome and tall. I saved two such good-looking people at the same time. How could I have forgotten? Lil Gu, I’ll get going first. Go look for Lil Qiao!”","Old Master Zhou left with a smile, but Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with maliciousness. He did not remember what had happened before he fainted, but after Old Master Zhou finished speaking, he learned that he had fallen into the sea in Y Nation.","Seeing Gu Zheng walk over with a heavy expression, Qiao Xi hurriedly asked, “What did you guys talk about?”","“Old Master Zhou said that he saved us at the same time.”","Qiao Xi was instantly stunned. It took her a long time to react. It turned out that the gunshots she heard in her dream and the smell of blood were not an illusion. She was not shot, but the man beside her was. That man was Gu Zheng!","Qiao Xi shuddered. She did not know what He Weinian had done to Gu Zheng, but she could confirm that He Weinian knew about her past with the Kang family. These things were like a tangled mess that could not be sorted out.","She originally thought that she was Kang Ru’s daughter and looked a little similar to Kang Jichuan, but her grandmother said","“Let’s go look for Old Madam Yin. She must know the inside story.” Gu Zheng held her hand, and the two of them walked toward the side hall.","At this moment, in the side hall.","Yin Yunyi said awkwardly, “Mom, should we really tell Xi Xi about those things? She’s too young. She shouldn’t have to endure all of this.”","Old Madam Yin could not bear it either. “If the Kang family hadn’t found her, of course, I wouldn’t have told her. But now that she has already fallen out with the Kang family, those people in the capital will find her sooner or later. Why don’t we tell her as soon as possible so that she can be on guard?”","“That woman hates Yunqiu, so she naturally won’t let Xi Xi off. Our Yin family can’t protect her at all times. Moreover, the capital is her home. She’ll have to go back sooner or later.”","Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng entered the side hall, and Yin Yunyi closed the door.","Old Madam Yin had a serious expression. “Xi Xi, what I’m about to say might be difficult for you to accept, but you have to know.”","Qiao Xi frowned and calmed down. “Tell me, I’m fine.”","Old Madam Yin nodded and pondered for a moment before slowly saying, “Actually, Yunqiu isn’t my biological daughter.”","Boom!!!","Qiao Xi felt her mind buzz. This was indeed something she had not expected.","A trace of surprise flashed past Gu Zheng’s eyes.","Qiao Xi calmed down for a long time and raised her eyes to look at Yin Yunyi and Old Madam Yin. These two people were clearly so similar to her mother, so how could they not be relatives?","“Xi Xi, I know what you’re thinking. Although Yunqiu isn’t my daughter, she’s still related to me.” Old Madam Yin’s voice darkened. “Yunqiu is the daughter of my twin sister, Yin Lianyi!”","Yin Lianxin took a deep breath. “I look the same as Lianyi, so her child is naturally similar to me.”","Qiao Xi widened her eyes. She had never heard that her grandmother had a twin sister. Since she was from a rich family in the Yin family, why didn’t she know this person?","“Lianyi has always been stubborn. She has to compete with me in everything. Back then, when I married Xia Cheng, she married the head of the Xia family in the capital. She was bound to suppress me.” Old Madam Yin smiled bitterly. “After I divorced Xia Cheng and took over the Yin family, she completely cut off all ties with the Yin family."]},{"number":1619,"title":"Chapter 1619 The Hot Socialite In The Capital","paragraphs":["1619 The Hot Socialite In The Capital","Qiao Xi hurriedly asked, “But why did Mom grow up by your side?”","Yin Lianxin lowered her eyes. “Lianyi married into the Xia family and gave birth to four children in a row. However, when she was pregnant with Yunqiu, her husband had another woman outside. In a fit of anger, she had difficulty giving birth and almost died on the operating table. Hence, when she saw Yunqiu, she was filled with resentment and wanted to abandon her.”","Qiao Xi was dumbstruck. She blamed her husband’s affair and her difficult birth on the child?","“She said that Yunqiu was a jinx and a demon sent by the heavens to punish her. Coupled with her depression after giving birth, she hated Yunqiu even more. I couldn’t bear to see Yunqiu suffer by her side, so I brought Yunqiu over and announced to the public that she was my daughter. I look exactly the same as Lianyi, and Yunqiu looked similar to me, so no one doubted Yunqiu’s identity.”","!!","Qiao Xi’s expression was serious as she asked in confusion, “But Mom is a child of the Xia family, after all. Didn’t my great-grandparents object after knowing that Yin Lianyi disliked my mother?”","Yin Lianxin shook her head. “Yunqiu was just a child. It was very simple for Yin Lianyi to let her die accidentally. In a noble family like the Xia family in the capital, no one cares about the life and death of a child. Even if my mother brought Yunqiu with her, it would’ve been difficult to protect her life. Later on, when I suggested taking Yunqiu away, Yin Lianxin didn’t object, but she had a condition. She wanted the Yin family to leave the capital forever so that Yunqiu could never appear in front of her!”","With that, Yin Lianxin snorted. “It’s very strange, right? Why is there such a heartless mother in the world? Yunqiu was clearly so obedient, but she was so hated by her biological mother!”","Yin Lianxin pondered for a moment. “When Yunqiu was about 20 years old, your great-grandparents were seriously ill. The two of them wanted to see Yunqiu, so Yin Lianyi brought her back. However, in Yin Lianyi’s eyes, Yunqiu was still a jinx. She hated Yunqiu. Meanwhile, the other daughter of the Xia family, Xia Zishan, thought that Yunqiu wanted to occupy her identity and made things difficult for her. Those days were extremely difficult for Yunqiu.","“Everyone in the capital’s high society knew that the Xia family didn’t treat Yunqiu well, but no one would stand up for her. They just criticized her behind her back.","“Xi Xi, your mother was the same as you. She wouldn’t suffer for no reason. Even when Xia Zishan played tricks, your mother could still resolve them. Yunqiu even participated in all kinds of competitions in the capital and became a popular socialite in the capital. She was chased after by everyone, so Xia Zishan hated her even more.","“After Yunqiu’s grandparents passed away, the Xia family planned to chase her out of the house. It was at this time that she met your biological father.”","“Who exactly is my biological father?” Qiao Xi asked.","Yin Lianxin looked at her helplessly. “Xi Xi, I can’t tell you your father’s identity for the time being. Because of the Kang family, the capital has already noticed your existence. Xia Zishan and Yin Lianyi won’t let you off.","“Your father is the man Xia Zishan has admired for many years. Back then, she wanted to marry your father, but your father didn’t like her at all and only liked your mother. After that, Xia Zishan was unwilling to give up. After all, she looked similar to Yunqiu. She even pretended to be Yunqiu to get close to your father, but your father saw through her.","“Xia Zishan is vicious and has done many evil things. She got someone to assassinate Yunqiu, but your father sent her to prison. After that, there was no news of her. Even Yin Lianyi didn’t discover Xia Zishan’s whereabouts.","“It was Xia Zishan’s jealousy that brought this upon herself. However, Yin Lianyi thinks that Yunqiu ruined Xia Zishan’s life. If Yunqiu hadn’t appeared, your father would have fallen in love with Xia Zishan, married her, and had children with her. Hence, Yin Lianyi hates Yunqiu even more.","“During that period of time, although Yunqiu’s situation in the capital was awkward, she was willing to endure it with your father protecting her. Moreover, everyone in your father’s family liked her very much. Your grandparents even held a grand wedding for them.”","At this point, Yin Lianxin’s tone was filled with happiness.","Qiao Xi felt that her parents should be living a happy life if things had come to that point. Xia Zishan was in jail, and her mother had the protection of a powerful family. Yin Lianyi was utterly unable to attack her mother, so why did her mother leave the capital in the end? Why did the name Xia Yunqiu become taboo in the capital?","“But 23 years ago, something big happened.” Yin Lianxin’s voice suddenly turned cold."]},{"number":1620,"title":"Chapter 1620 Taking Advantage","paragraphs":["1620 Taking Advantage","“23 years ago, the four major families in the capital, led by the Xia family, attacked the Situ family at the same time and slandered the Situ family for colluding with the enemy to commit treason!","“The Situ family had a clean family background, so how could they tolerate such slander? They tried their best to prove their innocence, but they fell into a trap. As the number one family in the capital, the Situ family sent people to negotiate with the four major families, but they all died unnatural deaths in the end.”","Qiao Xi hesitated for a moment. “You’re talking about the virus war 23 years ago?”","A cold glint flashed past Yin Lianxin’s eyes as she nodded and said, “Back then, when the virus affected the borders, everyone in the Situ family was focused on treating and saving people. Your grandfather was also unfortunately poisoned. Few people survived in the end. Some died, some were disabled, and some went missing.","“The Situ family were clearly the heroes of the country, but what awaited them when they returned to the capital was not praise or commendation. Instead, the various large families took advantage of the situation and attacked them. They divided their power and bought over the companies under their name. At that time, they lost their money and power in the capital and only had a good reputation. Naturally, they could not survive, so gradually, everyone forgot about them. They forgot that the Situ family were life-saving heroes. Even if someone still remembers them, they can only secretly pay their respects and not dare to let the people of the four large families know.","!!","“Your father’s family suffered a heavy blow and fell from the highest point in the capital to the bottom. On the other hand, those sinister, vicious, and selfish people became the top people in the capital.”","Yin Lianxin took a deep breath. “After they took over the capital, they didn’t want your father to revive the family, so they sent people to kill Yunqiu and your father. Yunqiu was afraid of implicating us, so she didn’t dare to contact the Yin family. She could only escape to Li City and marry Qiao Zhenguo. Your father’s whereabouts are still unknown. Now that they know of your existence, they’ll naturally make the first move in order to avoid your revenge.”","Yin Lianxin looked at her with a burning gaze. “Xi Xi, you were going to find out about these things sooner or later. Instead of letting you investigate it yourself, I decided to just tell you everything. However, I don’t want you to be involved in these disputes. The capital seems to be calm, but there are actually turbulent undercurrents. You must be more vigilant. I’ll do my best to protect you and not let anyone hurt you.”","Qiao Xi’s expression was solemn. She knew the history of 23 years ago. The virus at the border of C Nation was wreaking havoc, and countless people were poisoned to death. A mysterious hidden family took the initiative to go and save most of the people, but they suffered heavy casualties. She had read about this family in history books.","However, she did not expect that they would encounter such a thing after returning to the capital.","Qiao Xi’s voice was difficult. “The Situ family?”","Yin Lianxin suddenly looked up, her eyes filled with helplessness.","Qiao Xi said, “The history books have written about that family with the surname Si, but I think their surname should be Situ. I’ve seen Old Master Situ and a sickly man. That man was poisoned, right?”","Yin Lianxin sighed. “Old Master Situ wanted to see you too much, so he personally came to Li City. I didn’t expect this move to be noticed by the people in the capital. After that, Old Master Situ didn’t dare to do anything for fear that they would notice your presence.”","Qiao Xi sneered. “They’re afraid that I’ll take revenge and tell the truth, so they can’t wait to get rid of me? I haven’t even made a move yet, but just the title of Xia Yunqiu’s daughter has already made them uneasy.”","Yin Lianxin also smiled. “That’s right. They did something wrong, so of course, they’ll feel uneasy. Moreover, the Situ family had a few allies back then. They wouldn’t bother to be associated with those families.”","With that, Yin Lianxin looked up at Gu Zheng with a complicated expression. She casually waved her hand and said, “It’s getting late. Go back and rest. Leave the Kang family’s matters to me.”","Qiao Xi knew that the Kang family would not have a chance to make a comeback this time. After Kang Ru compensated Kang Junjie 4.8 billion, it would be impossible for them to make a comeback.","...","The two of them had just arrived at Longwan Residential when the butler rushed forward. “President, Young Madam, Old Madam is awake!”","Gu Zheng’s body suddenly tensed up as he held Qiao Xi’s hand tightly.","“When Old Madam Lu woke up, she even watched the live stream of the press conference. She was afraid of disturbing you, so she called home and asked you to look for her after you were done.”","“Alright! We’ll go now. I’ll go back to my room and pack my luggage. We’ll spend more time with Grandma in the old residence.” Qiao Xi looked at Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng nodded. “It’s time to go back. Something must have happened to the Gu family again.”"]},{"number":1621,"title":"Chapter 1621 Arrogant Servants","paragraphs":["1621 Arrogant Servants","Qiao Xi was slightly puzzled. With Old Madam Gu’s fierce character and status, who would dare to make things difficult for her in the Gu family’s old residence?","Could it be that Old Master Gu was causing trouble and Old Madam Gu wanted them to go back and deal with him?","Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng returned to the Gu family’s old residence with doubts. As soon as they entered, the butler smiled and came to welcome them. “Young Master, Old Master invites you over.”","Gu Zheng did not stop in his tracks at all. He walked past him and walked straight in. Of course, the butler did not dare to offend Gu Zheng. He could only bend down and say in a low voice, “Old Master said that he hasn’t seen Young Master in a long time, so he wants to see you. Moreover, a family friend of the Gu family has come to visit. As the head of the Gu family, you should make a trip there to show your respect.”","Who was the Gu family’s old friend? Qiao Xi had a puzzled expression.","The surroundings suddenly fell silent. After a long time, Gu Zheng stopped in his tracks. His eyes were filled with coldness as he said slowly, “The Gu family’s assets are all in Gu Yao’s hands now. If someone has to meet the guests, you should look for him.”","The butler’s expression froze: “”","“Young Master, that old friend is the head of the He family and your master. Of course, you have to go meet him!”","Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng stopped in their tracks at the same time, and their gazes suddenly turned sharp.","He Weinian?","“Chairman He, Miss He, and Young Master He are all here. How can you let Young Master Gu Yao meet them?”","Gu Zheng replied impatiently, “Why? Do I have to entertain Grandpa’s guests? Do you think Grandpa won’t be able to entertain them well?”","“No, no”","Before the butler could finish, Gu Zheng held Qiao Xi’s hand and entered Old Madam Gu’s courtyard. The butler did not dare to barge in rashly and could only stand at the door awkwardly.","Gu Zheng sent Qiao Xi to the door and said, “Go accompany Grandma first. I’m going to Maple Garden.”","Maple Garden?","Qiao Xi did not ask further and nodded. Then, Gu Zheng left through the back door.","At this moment, in Old Madam Gu’s courtyard, an old woman in her 60s was standing at the door and instructing the servants to move the things.","“Put these things at the door and sweep the courtyard clean!” Aunt Lin was in her 60s, but she had taken good care of herself. Coupled with her exquisite clothes, it was impossible to tell that she was a servant of the Gu family.","Aunt Lin said obsequiously, “Old Master knows that you’re awake, so he specially arranged for the servants to clean the place and change the furniture. He even instructed the kitchen to prepare your favorite dishes.”","Old Madam Gu snorted. “If he had the heart, he would’ve arranged everything when I was unconscious instead of putting on an act when I woke up.”","Aunt Lin’s complexion did not look too good. “How can you say that?”","Qiao Xi heard her words as soon as she entered and frowned unhappily. “Grandma doesn’t like you lot disturbing her. It’s dusty and noisy.”","When Old Madam Gu saw her enter, she hurriedly waved. “Xi Xi.”","The old madam’s personal servant, Aunt Fang, said with a smile, “Alright, all of you can leave. Don’t disturb the old madam anymore.”","“But” Aunt Lin still had something to say, but Qiao Xi’s cold gaze instantly shot over. Aunt Lin was so scared that her entire body trembled. She called out to the other servants unconvincedly, “Everyone, leave. You don’t have to deal with Old Madam Lin anymore!”","The servants filed out, leaving the four of them alone. Aunt Fang glanced at Aunt Lin. “Go make tea for Young Madam.”","Aunt Lin was a little unwilling, but she still left angrily.","Not long after Qiao Xi and the old madam started chatting, Aunt Lin walked over with a respectful smile. “Old Madam, try this new tea.","“Miss Qiao, you should try it too.”","Old Madam Gu’s expression darkened.","Aunt Fang reminded her, “Aunt Lin, this is Young Madam. You shouldn’t call her Miss Qiao.”","Of course, the Gu family’s servants had to call Qiao Xi ‘Young Madam’. This was an affirmation of her identity. Even if Gu Weiming and Huang Lilan did not acknowledge her in the past, the Gu family’s servants would still respectfully call her ‘Young Madam’.","Aunt Lin explained unhurriedly, “Although Miss Qiao and Young Master have gotten their marriage certificate, they didn’t have a wedding. It’s not appropriate to call her ‘Young Madam’ now.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Aunt Lin was sent by Old Master Gu to anger her!","Aunt Lin was Old Master Gu’s personal servant, and even Gu Weiming had to show her some respect. Now that she dared to offend her in front of the old madam, she was probably under Old Master Gu’s orders. Qiao Xi chuckled. “Aunt Lin is in her 60s, so it’s normal for her to be a little old-fashioned.”","Aunt Lin smiled in satisfaction. “It’s good that you understand me”","“But Aunt Lin, you’re a servant of the Gu family, after all. You should listen to your master’s instructions. I order you to call me ‘Young Madam’. Are you going to obey or not?” Qiao Xi interrupted her coldly."]},{"number":1622,"title":"Chapter 1622: What Other Reason Do I Need To Fire You?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1622: What Other Reason Do I Need To Fire You?","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","Aunt Lin was stunned for a moment before she quickly came back to her senses. She still had a smile on her face. “I’m old and it’s very difficult to change my habits. Please forgive me.”","Qiao Xi sneered. “You want me, the master, to accommodate you? Your salary is paid by the Gu family, so you should follow the Gu family’s rules. If you’re unwilling to call me ‘Young Madam’, then you’re disrespecting your master. In that case, there’s no need for you to stay in the Gu family anymore. Go look for the butler for your final salary now!”","Aunt Lin instantly panicked. She did not expect Qiao Xi to be so eloquent at such a young age!","!!","“Old Madam, Miss Qiao and Young Master aren’t married yet...”","“It’s enough for the law to acknowledge them as husband and wife. Everyone in the Gu family knows that she’s Gu Zheng’s wife, but you have to go against it. Just what do you want?” Old Madam Gu reprimanded sternly.","Aunt Lin was embarrassed. After serving Old Master Gu for so many years, the Gu family’s servants all looked at her differently. Even Gu Weiming had to show her some respect. Now, Old Madam Lin was berating her for Qiao Xi. It really made her unwilling.","Aunt Lin looked at Qiao Xi angrily. “I just called you by the wrong name, yet you want to chase me away. If news of this gets out, what will everyone say about you?”","Qiao Xi chuckled. “What reason do I need to fire you? Which noble family wouldn’t fire a few servants?”","Aunt Lin was so angry that her face turned red. A young madam in name actually dared to speak to her like this!","Before she could retort, footsteps came from outside the door. He Wenxian’s gentle voice sounded. “Grandma Gu, I’m here to see you!”","“Ah! Aunt Lin is here too!” He greeted Aunt Lin with a smile.","A few years ago, He Weinian was Gu Zheng’s master. He Wenxian also often came to the Gu family as a guest. At that time, Old Madam Gu thought that He Weinian really treated Gu Zheng well, so she welcomed He Wenxian every time she came.","It was just that Old Madam Gu did not expect He Weinian to not only scheme against Gu Zheng but also have so many secrets regarding the He family.","He Wenxian said gently, “Grandma Gu, I haven’t been here in a long time. Do you still remember me? Aunt Lin, quickly sit down. Let’s talk.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Aunt Lin said aggrievedly, “Miss He, I’d better not sit. I’m just a servant, after all. I don’t have the right.”","He Wenxian was a little puzzled. “What do you mean? Did someone bully you?” Aunt Lin subconsciously looked at Qiao Xi. She had been by the old master’s side for so many years and knew that the old master had chosen three candidates to be his granddaughter-in-law-Meng Wan, Yao Mengqing, and He Wenxian. Hence, every time these three people came to the Gu family, she would try her best to curry favor with them, hoping that they would give her some benefits when they came to power in the future. However, she never expected that Qiao Xi would suddenly appear and snatch away the position of the young madam.","Young Master clearly had a fiancee, yet Qiao Xi still seduced him and got married to him. She was a mistress who ruined his marriage!","Seeing that Aunt Lin did not answer for a long time, He Wenxian was a little puzzled. “Aunt Lin, you’ve been conscientious in the Gu family for so many years. Who can make things difficult for you? Who’s so bold?”","Old Madam Gu was smart and naturally could tell that He Wenxian and Aunt Lin were making things difficult for Qiao Xi. She directly berated, “I was the one who made things difficult for her. Miss He, do you have an opinion on this? Aunt Lin is a servant of the Gu family. What’s wrong with me reprimanding her? If you really feel aggrieved, Aunt Lin, go to the butler to get your final salary and leave the Gu family. Don’t act in front of me. Do you really think I’m a fool?”","The atmosphere instantly became awkward. He Wenxian’s expression was ugly, and her voice trembled slightly. “Grandma Gu, you’ve misunderstood... I was just worried...”","“Miss He, please call me ‘Old Madam Gu’. Only Ah Zheng and Ah Yao’s wives have the right to call me ‘Grandma’.” Old Madam Gu already hated He Wenxian, so she was even angrier when she saw her acting in front of her.","Aunt Lin did not expect Old Madam Gu to be so disrespectful to Miss He. She widened her eyes in shock.","He Wenxian’s face was pale as she panicked. “Old Madam Gu, I just think that because Aunt Lin has been working hard for the Gu family for decades, even if she did something wrong, she shouldn’t be reprimanded...”","Before Old Madam Gu could speak, Qiao Xi said slowly, “If she’s taking the Gu family’s salary, she should know that she’s just a servant and shouldn’t interfere in the marriage of the head of the Gu family. If Gu Zheng wants to marry me, does he have to get Aunt Lin’s permission? If she doesn’t agree, will I never be able to become the young madam of the Gu family?","“Miss He, your heart aches for Aunt Lin so much. Could it be that this is what the He family’s rules are like? Would Young Master He have to ask Chairman He’s servants if he wants to marry in the future? If the servants don’t agree, he can’t marry them?”","He Wenxian instantly choked.."]},{"number":1623,"title":"Chapter 1623 Important Things To Announce","paragraphs":["1623 Important Things To Announce","“Since you like Aunt Lin so much, then let her work in the He family.” Qiao Xi asked with a smile, “Aunt Fang, can you let Aunt Lin work in the He family?”","Aunt Fang replied respectfully, “Young Madam, you’re the madam of the Gu family. You can make decisions both inside and outside the Gu family. Not to mention firing a servant, even if you want to cut off all contact with the Gu family, no one will object. Old Master definitely won’t blame you for an old servant.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Aunt Lin’s and He Wenxian’s expressions turned ugly.","Qiao Xi said with a smile, “Aunt Lin, go look for the butler to get your final salary. When Miss He leaves, follow Miss He back to the He family. If Miss He is unwilling to accept you, then I’ll suspect that Miss He was just trying to drive a wedge between us just now.”","He Wenxian hurriedly retorted, “Xi Xi, you can’t say that. How can you make things difficult for an old servant? You...”","“Xi Xi is my wife. Does she not have the right to fire a servant?” At this moment, a cold and gloomy voice came from outside the door. The man exuded a strong sense of oppression, scaring Aunt Lin so much that she hurriedly lowered her head.","He Wenxian’s face was ashen. She pretended to be gentle and said, “Ah Zheng, you’ve misunderstood. If Xi Xi really doesn’t like Aunt Lin, then I’ll let her return to the He family with me.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. These words made it seem like she was very petty and He Wenxian was very magnanimous. However, the next second, Gu Zheng said impatiently, “Then quickly leave.”","He Wenxian’s gentle expression paused. “I’m here to accompany Old Madam Gu...”","“Aunt Fang, pay Aunt Lin’s final salary and get her to leave with Miss He,” Gu Zheng instructed coldly.","He Wenxian gritted her teeth and was silent for a few seconds. She smiled helplessly. “Ah Zheng, my father is your master, after all. We’re also friends. Why are you targeting me?","“I did have some grudges against Xi Xi, but I’ve already apologized. This small matter shouldn’t affect our relationship.”","Qiao Xi was speechless. He Wenxian meant that she and Gu Zheng had deep affection, but their relationship was affected by her. She meant that Qiao Xi was too jealous and did not allow her husband to interact with his friends.","Gu Zheng frowned unhappily. “Since you know that my wife hates you, why did you still come to the Gu family? Miss He, please leave!”","With that, the man took off his jacket and thoughtfully draped it over Qiao Xi. His voice was extremely gentle. “It’s so cold outside. Why are you only wearing this much?”","When He Wenxian saw this scene, she felt that it was extremely dazzling. Girls all liked to look beautiful, so she and Qiao Xi were both wearing thin long dresses. When the autumn wind swept past, it was indeed a little cold, but Gu Zheng could not be bothered to pay attention to her at all. He only cared about Qiao Xi and even helped her put on a jacket.","She had known Gu Zheng for more than ten years. When he was at his lowest point, the He family had lent a helping hand. They were childhood sweethearts who studied and played together, but Gu Zheng had never cared about her so much. Moreover, in Gu Zheng’s eyes, had her childhood playmate long become a stranger?","He Wenxian suppressed the surging emotions in her heart and smiled. “Ah Zheng, Grandpa Gu has already asked me to stay in the Gu family.”","Qiao Xi glanced coldly at He Wenxian and instantly saw through her thoughts.","It was fine if she wanted to stay in the Gu family!","He Wenxian clenched her fists tightly. This b*tch only knew how to drive a wedge between her and Ah Zheng!","As soon as she finished speaking, the old master’s butler walked in. “Old Madam, Young Master! Old Master wants everyone to eat in the front hall tonight.”","Old Madam Gu’s face immediately darkened. She did not object to He Wenxian staying because Xi Xi had spoken, but it did not mean that she was willing to eat with He Wenxian.","“We’re not going.”","The butler looked troubled. “Old Madam, Old Master said that he has something important to announce.”","“Where’s Chairman He?” Old Madam He asked.","“He went back a long time ago.”","Old Madam Gu had a mocking expression. He Weinian had left, leaving He Wenxian behind. The old master even said that he had something important to announce. She instantly understood Old Master Gu’s intentions.","“Alright, I’ll go, but it’s hard to say if we’ll be able to eat this meal today.”","The butler took a deep breath and said while trembling, “Old Master said that Aunt Lin is just a servant, so you don’t have to get angry over her and ruin your health. If you’re unhappy, just chase her away.”","Old Madam Gu did not even look at him. If she wanted to deal with a servant, did she need to ask that damned old man?","The butler broke out in a cold sweat and hurriedly left."]},{"number":1624,"title":"Chapter 1624 Startling Words","paragraphs":["1624 Startling Words","An hour later, Gu Yao arrived at the Gu family’s residence and asked Gu Zheng in a low voice, “Why did Grandpa suddenly call us back for dinner?”","He had already sensed that the atmosphere was not good. Looking at Grandma’s expression, it seemed that she would flip the table tonight.","When Gu Yao entered the front hall, he finally understood what was going on. Why was He Wenxian here?","Gu Weiming and Old Master Gu were already seated. Seeing Gu Yao enter, Gu Weiming gritted his teeth. In the past, when Gu Yao was obedient, he could dote on his son. However, this bastard actually joined forces with Gu Zheng to snatch his shares. Now that the Gu family’s company was in the hands of an outsider like Gu Yao, how could he be willing?!","He had already forgotten that He Wenxian was sitting beside him. He said unhappily, “Today is a family banquet. Why did you call an outsider over?!”","Old Madam Gu frowned.","Gu Yao’s expression was indifferent. In the past, he and Gu Weiming had feelings for each other, but those feelings had disappeared now. He was raised by Gu Zheng. Gu Zheng had taught him how to be a good person and even taught him his skills. Gu Weiming could not be considered a father, so he did not care what Gu Weiming said.","“Get lost!” Gu Weiming was not polite at all.","Although he did not name Gu Yao, everyone knew that he wanted Gu Yao to get lost.","Gu Zheng’s eyes suddenly turned cold, but Old Madam Gu spoke first, “You’re right. How could an outsider join our family for a meal? Hurry up and get lost!”","The surroundings suddenly fell silent, and the air seemed to have frozen. Gu Weiming immediately said to Gu Yao, “The old madam has already spoken. Did you hear her?”","Old Madam Gu smiled. “Weiming has already agreed. He Wenxian, don’t force us to chase you out.”","Gu Weiming was about to get the servants to chase Gu Yao away, but before he could say anything, his expression froze. “Wenxian? Mom, you...”","“Is there a problem? Isn’t he the only outsider present?” Old Madam Gu glanced at him coldly. “Gu Weiming, has your brain been kicked by a donkey?”","Qiao Xi almost laughed out loud. Grandma Gu was still so valiant!","Gu Weiming’s face was ashen. “Mom, the outsider I’m talking about is Gu Yao. He’s not my son.”","“You don’t acknowledge him as your son, but I treat him as my grandson.” With that, Old Madam Gu looked at He Wenxian and snorted in disdain. “I didn’t expect He Wenxian to be your illegitimate daughter! Does Chairman He know about this? Are you having an affair with Madam He?”","Everyone gasped. This old madam was really shocking!","Gu Weiming’s face instantly turned red. “Mom! Wenxian isn’t my illegitimate daughter! She’s the child of He Weinian and Madam He!”","“Oh!” Old Madam Gu said slowly, “Is He Weinian the old man’s illegitimate child, then?”","Old Madam Gu sneered. “Since the He family has nothing to do with us, why is He Wenxian in the Gu family’s residence? Who does she think she is? What right does she have to eat in the Gu family?”","Old Master Gu and Gu Weiming’s faces alternated between white and green.","“Ah Yao, you’re the head of the Gu family’s company, but you’re not even a member of the Gu family. He Wenxian isn’t related to the Gu family by blood, yet she still came to attend the family banquet. I can’t eat this meal anymore. Let’s go back to the courtyard to eat.”","Old Madam Gu said casually, then she thought of something. “By the way, quickly call the doctor over to take a look at your father and grandfather. Are they crazy? Why are they always spouting nonsense? How pitiful!”","With that, Old Madam Gu walked out of the door. Old Master Gu’s face was so gloomy.","“Grandma Gu,” He Wenxian called out gently. “Don’t be angry. Grandpa Gu and Uncle haven’t seen Ah Yao in a long time and got a little agitated. They didn’t say that he’s an outsider.”","As soon as she finished speaking, she walked in front of Gu Yao and smiled gently. “Ah Yao, I remember that when I was studying with Ah Zheng, you were still very young and naughty. You grew up in the blink of an eye.”","Old Madam Gu turned around and walked to the master seat to sit down. He Wenxian hurriedly said obsequiously, “Grandma Gu, I’m really sorry...”","“If you’re really sorry, you should leave quickly.” Old Madam Gu really hated such pretentious people. Although He Wenxian said that she was sorry, she refused to leave.","He Wenxian’s expression instantly became aggrieved as tears welled up in her eyes.","“That’s enough!” Old Master Gu shouted unhappily. “I called you over to announce something important. From today onward, Wenxian is a member of the Gu family!”","Old Madam Gu’s expression darkened. What she had expected had still happened.","If He Wenxian wanted to become a member of the Gu family, she had to marry a man from the Gu family. Naturally, it could not be Gu Weiming. Old Master Gu was unwilling to acknowledge Gu Yao, so of course, it could not be Gu Yao. That left Gu Zheng."]},{"number":1625,"title":"Chapter 1625 You Should Call Me Sister-In-Law","paragraphs":["1625 You Should Call Me Sister-In-Law","Old Madam Gu’s expression was terrifyingly gloomy. This damned old man really knew how to play! He was finding a mistress for his grandson?","Xi Xi was still here, yet he still had the cheek to say such things. Did he think that no one would object to his words? She wanted to see who had the final say in this family!","Old Madam Gu snorted and did not flare up. After everyone sat down and the dishes were served, Old Master Gu said, “I announce that Wenxian”","Old Madam Gu exploded. “Gu Chen! I don’t agree!”","“Are you done fooling around?!” Old Master Gu was also furious.","Seeing this, He Wenxian pretended to be anxious and said, “Grandma Gu, did you misunderstand”","Old Madam Gu had never liked He Wenxian. She always felt that this young lady was too scheming. She pretended to be obedient in front of her elders and played tricks behind their backs. However, that idiot of her husband still thought that He Wenxian was kind-hearted, gentle, and polite. He even wanted to marry her to Gu Zheng. He was really daydreaming!","He Wenxian’s eyes were filled with tears. “Uncle Gu, please explain things. We can’t let Grandma Gu and Grandpa Gu quarrel because of me. I I’d better go!”","“Wenxian, you’re not allowed to leave!” Old Master Gu stood up, his face ashen. “Ya’er, how did you become like this? Why are you making things difficult for Wenxian? Did someone badmouth her in front of you?”","As soon as he finished speaking, his sharp gaze landed on Qiao Xi as he said angrily, “Some people should understand their identities. They shouldn’t always gossip in front of the old madam!”","“Bullsh*t! It has nothing to do with anyone else. I just don’t like He Wenxian. In the past, she kept saying that she’s Ah Zheng’s childhood sweetheart. Now that Ah Zheng is already married, she’s still”","“You’ve misunderstood. I said that Wenxian is now a member of the Gu family. I want to acknowledge her as my god-granddaughter!” Old Master Gu interrupted Old Madam Gu unhappily.","Gu Zheng held Qiao Xi’s hand and rubbed it gently. He could not help but sneer.","“God-granddaughter?” Old Madam Gu’s eyes were filled with disdain.","He Wenxian immediately explained, “Grandma Gu, it’s my fault. I didn’t make myself clear. Grandpa Gu wants to acknowledge me as his god-granddaughter, so he invited everyone over for dinner today. I didn’t expect”","Her eyes were slightly red as she glanced at Qiao Xi helplessly, then she bit her lip and looked away.","“Ah Zheng and I are childhood playmates. I did say that I wanted to marry Ah Zheng, but that was just a joke I made as a child. It’s been so many years. Ah Zheng is already married. Why would I ruin his marriage? Grandma Gu, you’ve really misunderstood.”","“Heh, is that so?” Old Madam Gu snorted. He Wenxian specially glanced at Xi Xi. Did she think that she did not understand? She was just telling the others that the reason the old madam misunderstood was that Xi Xi was sowing discord between them.","He Wenxian lowered her eyes and revealed a proud expression.","Qiao Xi pinched Gu Zheng under the table and said with a smile, “Grandpa wants to acknowledge Miss He as his god-granddaughter. That’s a good thing. I misunderstood. I’m sorry!”","Everyone was surprised. They did not expect Qiao Xi to apologize so readily. Old Master Gu’s words of scolding were instantly stuck in his throat.","“At least you’re sensible! Wenxian will be a member of the Gu family in the future. I can’t let her suffer!”","Old Madam Gu frowned unhappily, while Qiao Xi smiled in embarrassment. “Miss He, I’m really sorry. I misunderstood you because I care too much about Ah Zheng. After all, you’re so outstanding and grew up with Gu Zheng. I’ll definitely overthink things!”","Gu Zheng touched the spot where he was pinched just now, his eyes filled with a doting smile. He chuckled and said, “There’s no need to misunderstand. I only love you. It’s impossible for me to like another woman.”","Qiao Xi instantly became shy and lightly punched Gu Zheng’s shoulder with her small fist. “Oh! You’re so annoying! I’m so shy!”","Gu Yao: “”","He almost spat out a mouthful of tea, then continued to watch Qiao Xi’s performance.","The corners of He Wenxian’s mouth twitched. Qiao Xi continued, “Miss He, you’re magnanimous and won’t bicker with me, right? From today onward, you’re Ah Zheng’s younger sister. I definitely won’t think too much about it. After all, you’re siblings. Even if you really want to be together, Grandpa Gu won’t allow it, right?”","Old Master Gu choked.","He Wenxian’s eyes instantly turned vicious, but she pretended to be gentle. “Yes, Xi Xi, don’t misunderstand. I I’m just Ah Zheng’s younger sister.”","“Miss He, you should call me ‘Sister-in-law’, right?” Qiao Xi looked at her with a smile.","Old Madam Gu and Gu Yao almost laughed out loud."]},{"number":1626,"title":"Chapter 1626 Gu Zheng’s Favorite","paragraphs":["1626 Gu Zheng’s Favorite","Anger surged in He Wenxian’s heart. She gritted her teeth and did not say anything.","“What? Miss He, you don’t acknowledge me as your sister-in-law?” Qiao Xi asked with an innocent expression. “Since you’re already Ah Zheng’s younger sister, it’s only right for you to call me your sister-in-law, right?”","He Wenxian was so angry that her face turned red. When she was young, she had dreamed of marrying Gu Zheng. If it were not for what had happened five years ago, she would have long become Mrs. Gu. How could Qiao Xi dare to show off in front of her?","However, she could not offend Qiao Xi yet. She had to take her time and separate Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng bit by bit. She could only swallow her anger first.","He Wenxian was silent for a long time before she said helplessly, “Xi Xi, it’s not that I don’t acknowledge you, but I’m older than you. It’s not appropriate for me to call you my sister-in-law, right?”","Qiao Xi’s tone was gentle. “It is appropriate! Call me that.”","Everyone’s gazes landed on He Wenxian. Old Madam Gu and Gu Yao’s gazes were especially burning. If she refused to call out, they might immediately chase her out of the house.","He Wenxian felt her cheeks burning. In the end, she gritted her teeth. “Sister-in-law.”","It was just one word, but it seemed to have exhausted all her strength. The hatred in her eyes grew stronger.","Qiao Xi smiled in satisfaction, then pulled Gu Zheng’s sleeve and said sweetly, “Ah Zheng, I want to eat fish.”","Gu Zheng was not impatient at all. He picked up a piece of fish with the chopsticks and placed it in the bowl. He even thoughtfully picked off the bones and said in an extremely gentle voice, “Gluttonous cat.”","He Wenxian clenched her fists, her sharp fingers digging into her palms. Even in the few years when she was on the best terms with Gu Zheng, he had never treated her so gently.","Other than his relatives by his side, Gu Zheng rarely interacted with women. He Wenxian thought that she was a special case as she could accompany Gu Zheng, but Gu Zheng still did not allow her to go to his bedroom or touch his personal belongings, much less put food in her bowl.","Why was Qiao Xi able to obtain his favoritism? Just because they were married? If she married Gu Zheng, would she also be able to enjoy Gu Zheng’s favoritism?","At this moment, Qiao Xi started acting cute again. “Ah Zheng, I want to drink soup. Feed me.”","A trace of a smile flashed past Gu Zheng’s eyes. He picked up the spoon he had used and gently fed her the soup. “Mrs. Gu, drink it.”","Qiao Xi saw the smile in his eyes and blushed in embarrassment. He knew that she was acting for He Wenxian, but he doted on her and accommodated her.","The spoon was about to reach her mouth when Qiao Xi obediently opened her mouth. Gu Zheng gently fed her a few mouthfuls.","This scene made Old Madam Gu feel happy. In the past, she was still worried about Ah Zheng’s marriage and was afraid that he would die alone. Fortunately, he had Xi Xi.","“Don’t the two of you have any manners?!” Old Master Gu slammed the table angrily. “Ah Zheng, this is a family banquet. Are you going to let this woman fool around?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were still doting. He even picked up a tissue to wipe the corners of her lips. He Wenxian, who was at the side, gritted her teeth in jealousy.","Ever since everyone sat down, Gu Zheng’s gaze had been on Qiao Xi. His gaze was so gentle and doting as if he had changed into a different person.","He watched Qiao Xi fool around with a smile on the corners of his mouth. It seemed that as long as he was around, even if Qiao Xi flipped the table, he would protect her unconditionally.","Why did such a gentle and powerful Gu Zheng only belong to Qiao Xi?","Old Master Gu was angered to the point his face flushed red. He said while trembling, “You... Qiao Xi, you’re really shameless!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were red as she pounced into Gu Zheng’s arms. “Ah Zheng, Grandpa is scolding me.”","Gu Zheng patted her back gently and said casually, “I don’t want to hear anyone insult my wife again. Otherwise, I don’t mind destroying the Gu family.”","Old Master Gu almost fainted. This woman was a vixen who wanted to drive a wedge between Gu Zheng and the Gu family. However, Gu Zheng was actually threatening him because of this woman!","It was because he could not stand Qiao Xi that he acknowledged He Wenxian as his god-granddaughter and gave her a chance to get close to Gu Zheng. On account of their past relationship, perhaps Gu Zheng would like He Wenxian.","With the Gu family’s current power, they did not need to consolidate their status through marriage, but Gu Zheng should not have chosen that wild girl, Qiao Xi!","He Weinian was Gu Zheng’s master. When He Wenxian was young, she often came to the Gu family. At that time, Gu Zheng and He Wenxian were very close. He had filtered so many women for so many years and thought that He Wenxian was the most qualified to be the madam of the Gu family, but Gu Zheng only had eyes for that shameless woman!"]},{"number":1627,"title":"Chapter 1627 You Wouldn’t Have Been My Wife","paragraphs":["1627 You Wouldn’t Have Been My Wife","“Xi Xi.” Suddenly, He Wenxian said in a gentle voice, “Today is a family banquet, after all. The elders are all here, so we have to be careful.","“Grandpa Gu, Xi Xi is young, so she’s acting cute with Ah Zheng at the family banquet. Don’t mind her.”","Old Master Gu nodded, but he still glared at Qiao Xi unhappily.","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. It was fine as long as she did not suffer any losses.","The banquet hall was silent. Only Old Master Gu and He Wenxian spoke from time to time.","After a while, the butler served the last dish of a yam dessert. As soon as the desserts were served, He Wenxian frowned and looked at the servants. “Ah Zheng is allergic to yams. How could you make a yam dish?”","The servants looked shocked. Allergic to yams?","He Wenxian said nervously, “Ah Zheng is very allergic to yams and even went to the hospital because of this. You don’t even know about this? Hurry up and take them away!”","The servants were about to take the desserts away when Qiao Xi took a bite and asked softly, “Ah Zheng, are you allergic to yams?”","Gu Zheng sneered. “The He family is really well-informed. My family doesn’t even know that I’m allergic to yams, but you know everything, Miss He.”","He Wenxian’s face instantly turned pale. She said in a panic, “Ah Zheng, you were allergic to yams back then. The servants saw it and told my father. I only found out then.”","Gu Zheng glanced at her indifferently, and she felt every inch of her skin tense up.","“But my allergy to yams started four years ago. I remember that everyone in the He family had already gone overseas by then.”","Since they had already gone overseas, why would the servants specially call He Weinian to tell him that Gu Zheng was allergic to yams? Wasn’t this just surveillance?","The surroundings suddenly fell silent. He Wenxian broke out in a cold sweat.","Gu Yao put down his chopsticks and said in shock, “F*ck! Could it be that the He family has been monitoring Gu Zheng all these years overseas? You’re perverts!”","Old Madam Gu’s expression was also gloomy. “Ah Zheng is in a high position. In order to avoid trouble, he never exposes his weakness. Only those close to him know what he’s allergic to. Who did you hear it from, Miss He?”","Everyone’s gazes landed on He Wenxian.","Old Master Gu wanted to stop them. Why was there a need to be so hostile over such a small matter? However, when he saw everyone’s cold gazes, he swallowed his words.","He Wenxian’s expression was extremely ugly. Did she not understand that everyone was targeting her? She and Ah Zheng were childhood sweethearts, yet he actually questioned her in public? Had he forgotten their past friendship?","Of course, she could not admit that the He family was monitoring Gu Zheng. She could only look aggrieved. “Back then, when I went overseas, I missed Ah Zheng very much, so I sent someone to investigate him. I happened to know that he was allergic to yams through the investigator.”","Old Madam Gu questioned coldly, “So, you admit to spying on Ah Zheng, Miss He?”","Old Madam Gu snorted. The panic in He Wenxian’s eyes was obvious.","He Wenxian’s eyes turned red from grievance. “I know that many things have changed after five years, but if I hadn’t gone overseas back then, Ah Zheng and I...”","“Even if you hadn’t gone overseas, my wife wouldn’t have been you,” Gu Zheng interrupted coldly.","He Wenxian’s eyes instantly glazed over. Everyone said that if she had not gone overseas back then, she would definitely have married Gu Zheng. However, he had personally shattered He Wenxian’s last wish.","Gu Zheng said casually, “As for the matter of you spying on me, I’ll look for Chairman He to ask for an explanation.”","“Ah Zheng, I wasn’t spying on you...” He Wenxian’s eyes were filled with sorrow as she shook her head helplessly. “Forget it, it’s all my wishful thinking.”","Old Madam Gu gritted her teeth in hatred. She kept saying that she had no improper thoughts about Ah Zheng, but she got someone to monitor him. She clearly knew that Ah Zheng was already married, yet she still wanted to come forward and dream of sitting in Mrs. Gu’s seat. Her behavior was really nauseating!","“Hubby, how could you do this to Miss He?!” Just as the atmosphere was awkward, Qiao Xi’s delicate voice sounded. “Miss He is just concerned about you. She didn’t do anything wrong, did she? Moreover, I’m very grateful to Miss He.”","Gu Yao: “...”","Grateful to He Wenxian? What was this woman trying to do?","Qiao Xi held Gu Zheng’s arm and looked at He Wenxian with a smile. “Miss He, thank you for accompanying Ah Zheng for so many years. You also let me know how much Ah Zheng loves me. After all, you’re so outstanding and beautiful. And you care so much about him. You even helped him when he was at his weakest. However, he didn’t choose you and married me instead."]},{"number":1628,"title":"Chapter 1628 The Food He Likes","paragraphs":["1628 The Food He Likes","“You let me know how much Ah Zheng loves me. No matter how good other women are to him, he won’t waver in the slightest and will still choose me.”","As soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, He Wenxian instantly lost control of her expression, and it gradually became ferocious.","This b*tch! She clearly knew that she loved Gu Zheng, yet she was still showing off in front of her!","He Wenxian bit her lip so hard that the flesh was about to break, but Qiao Xi did not intend to let her off. “In the past, Ah Zheng always said sweet words to me and I didn’t believe him. It was you who made me understand that Ah Zheng’s love for me is real and the sweet words he says come from the bottom of his heart. I’m really grateful to you!”","Gu Yao coughed.","Qiao Xi was slightly puzzled. “Gu Yao, why are you coughing?! I’m telling the truth!”","Gu Yao: “...” ‘You have such a vicious mouth!’","He covered his face and hid the smile on his face. “I’m sorry! I choked on water. My sister-in-law is really magnanimous! You know that there have been rumors outside that say that Miss He and my brother are engaged. Not only did you not get angry, but you’re also thanking Miss He. You’re awesome!”","Qiao Xi replied with a smile, “You’re right. I’m a magnanimous and tolerant person. Ah Zheng is so handsome and rich. It’s normal for him to have many admirers, but Ah Zheng only likes me. I don’t have to be jealous.”","Old Madam Gu smiled dotingly. “Xi Xi, stop talking. Miss He will be unhappy later.”","He Wenxian’s palm was pierced by her nails, and her face alternated between green and white.","Qiao Xi pretended to be surprised. “Huh? Miss He will be unhappy? Grandma, Miss He isn’t that petty. Moreover, she’s Ah Zheng’s younger sister. If she still likes Ah Zheng, it’ll be incest! How could Miss He be so muddle-headed?”","With that, she looked at He Wenxian. “Miss He, what do you think?”","“Yes... Yes,” He Wenxian replied through gritted teeth.","“I knew Miss He wouldn’t be so petty!”","He Wenxian was so angry that her eyes darkened. She wanted to kill this b*tch!","Seeing that she was so angry that she did not say anything, Qiao Xi was satisfied. She beamed and picked up some food for Gu Zheng. “Hubby, fortunately, Miss He said that you’re allergic to yams. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have known!”","Gu Zheng smiled at her, then asked He Wenxian coldly, “Who told you that I’m allergic?","He Wenxian was stunned for a moment before realizing that Gu Zheng was talking to her. Her scalp instantly went numb as she said while trembling, “A subordinate of the He family.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent, but his tone carried a trace of mockery. “Actually, I’m not too sensitive to yams. The He family’s subordinates are really not much. They even passed on fake news to you.”","He Wenxian was furious. The information she spent so much effort to find was still fake, but Qiao Xi could easily find out.","He Wenxian had only eaten a few bites during this meal and was already full from anger.","After dinner, Old Madam Gu brought Gu Zheng and his wife back to the courtyard. After the few of them entered the house, she lowered her voice and said, “Ah Zheng, come in with me. I’ll give you something good.”","Gu Zheng gestured to Qiao Xi and followed Old Madam Gu into the room.","Aunt Fang and Qiao Xi sat in the living room and chatted. “Young Master has really changed. He didn’t eat chicken in the past.”","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. “Why?”","“It’s all because of Huang Lilan. At that time, she used all kinds of methods to abuse Young Master. After that, Young Master was traumatized and stopped eating chicken.”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes, and her heart trembled. “He never told me.”","She liked to eat chicken very much and never got tired of it. After she married Gu Zheng, he would always eat it with her. He did not show a trace of disgust and never said that he did not eat chicken.","“Then what does Ah Zheng like?” Qiao Xi asked.","Aunt Fang smiled. “You might not believe me, but he likes glutinous rice balls.”","Qiao Xi was indeed in disbelief. Gu Zheng never seemed to show any disgust or liking for certain foods. She only knew that Gu Zheng did not like sweets, so why did he like glutinous rice balls?","“Actually, I don’t think Young Master really likes glutinous rice balls. It’s just that Eldest Miss Lu liked them. She said that glutinous rice balls represented reunion, so Young Master always remembered it. At that time, he should have guessed that Eldest Miss Lu was his biological mother. After that, Eldest Miss Lu was seriously ill, but she forced herself to cook glutinous rice balls for Young Master. Eldest Miss Lu ate two, while Young Master finished everything else in the pot.","“However, someone like Young Master never reveals his preferences to outsiders. Only Old Madam and I know about it. He’s not good at expressing himself, but we all know that he misses Eldest Miss Lu very much. Ever since Eldest Miss Lu passed away, he hasn’t eaten glutinous rice balls.”"]},{"number":1629,"title":"Chapter 1629 Do You Have A Problem In That Aspect?","paragraphs":["1629 Do You Have A Problem In That Aspect?","Qiao Xi’s heart ached, and her eyes instantly burned.","“Let’s not talk about the past.” Aunt Fang smiled affectionately. “Actually, the first time I saw you, I knew that Young Master really loved you. Although he didn’t say anything, his eyes were filled with love.","“Rumor has it that Young Master is irritable and vicious. Actually, it’s not wrong. But he’s always been gentle and elegant in front of you. If it’s someone he doesn’t like, he won’t even bother to pretend.”","Qiao Xi could not help but fall into deep thought. She remembered that when she first met Mo Yuan ten years ago, his eyes were filled with alienation and coldness. She followed behind him every day, but he did not chase her away. Although he looked cold, his temper was not bad.","After marrying him and spending so much time with him, she had always thought that Gu Zheng had a good temper. She even thought that the rumors outside were all fake. It turned out that he only showed the gentle side of himself to her.","!!","At this moment, Gu Zheng walked out of the room. Aunt Fang hurriedly stood up. “Young Master, Young Madam, it’s getting late. You should quickly return to Maple Garden to rest.”","Gu Zheng nodded and held Qiao Xi’s hand as they left.","On the way, Qiao Xi was curious. “What did Grandma give you?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was a little strange, and his ears were slightly red. “It’s nothing. Let’s go back.”","Ten minutes ago, Old Madam Gu pulled him into the room and asked meaningfully, “Ah Zheng, at my age, my only wish is for you to get married and have children. You’re married, but you don’t have children yet...”","Before Gu Zheng could say anything, Old Madam Gu lowered her voice and asked, “Tell me, do you have a problem in that aspect?”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth twitched.","Old Madam Gu comforted him. “As a man, you should be brave. If there’s really a problem, go to the hospital to take a look. There’s nothing to be embarrassed about. You’re so rich, so you’ll definitely be able to get your condition treated.”","Gu Zheng looked helpless. “Grandma, I’m fine.”","“Really?” Old Madam Gu muttered, “There can’t be anything wrong with Xi Xi, and you’re fine too. Then why don’t you have children? Don’t tell me you haven’t slept together yet?”","Faced with Old Madam Gu’s question, Gu Zheng was very speechless. He did not answer for a long time. After a long time, he massaged his temples and said in a low voice, “Xi Xi is still young. It’s better not to have a child first.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Old Madam Gu stuffed a small medicine bottle into Gu Zheng’s hand. “Ah Zheng, this medicine is for pregnancy. Find a time to take it. If you have any health problems, go to the hospital to take a look. Don’t hide it from Xi Xi.”","Gu Zheng: “...”","With that, Old Madam Gu pushed him out of the door. Gu Zheng could only put the small medicine bottle in his pocket.","At this moment, Gu Zheng looked at Qiao Xi who was beside him, and a warm current surged in his heart. He seemed to have already imagined his and Qiao Xi’s child...","Xiao Lan and the butler followed her to Maple Garden and prepared a hot breakfast.","Qiao Xi had just walked to the dining table when her expression froze. It was her favorite chicken sandwich and a glass of milk.","If it were in the past, she would have thought that breakfast like this was simple but perfect. However, she was not in the mood to eat now because Gu Zheng hated chicken.","At this moment, Gu Zheng had also taken a seat. He looked at Qiao Xi with slight doubt. “You don’t want to eat sandwiches?”","Qiao Xi wanted to speak, but she felt the urge to cry. She said in a muffled voice, “Yes, I don’t want to.”","Gu Zheng asked softly, “If you’re tired of eating sandwiches, what do you want to eat, Mrs. Gu?”","Qiao Xi suddenly felt her eyes burn, and she did not dare to raise her eyes. Since he did not like to eat chicken, why did he not tell her? Did he have to eat something he did not like with her just because he loved her?","He had always been meticulous and even had to accommodate her every meal.","Qiao Xi’s voice was slightly hoarse. “We eat at home every day. Let’s go out to eat today, alright?”","Aunt Fang said that Gu Zheng did not eat chicken because of Huang Lilan’s abuse. Qiao Xi did not want him to recall the past, so she wanted to bring him out of Maple Garden to eat.","With that, she stood up. “It’s still early. You can go straight to the company after breakfast.”","Gu Zheng did not understand what she meant, but he still respected her thoughts. “Alright, where are we going?”","Qiao Xi smiled mysteriously. “I won’t tell you yet. I’ll drive you somewhere today.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes flickered as he looked at her in a daze. Then, he smiled and nodded.","20 minutes later, Qiao Xi parked the car. The two of them entered a restaurant near Li City University. The shop was not big, but it was very clean.","After the two of them sat down, Qiao Xi said excitedly, “Ah Zheng, let’s eat glutinous rice balls today!”"]},{"number":1630,"title":"Chapter 1630 One Can’t Live In The Pain Of The Past","paragraphs":["1630 One Can’t Live In The Pain Of The Past","After Qiao Xi finished speaking, Gu Zheng’s expression remained calm, but Qiao Xi could clearly see the fluctuation in his eyes.","He did not answer, but Qiao Xi asked, “The glutinous rice balls here taste very good. What do you want to eat?”","“Everything’s fine.” Gu Zheng slowly looked up with a trace of nostalgia in his eyes. His voice was a little hoarse. “I’ll eat whatever you order.”","Qiao Xi ordered two signature fillings, and the two of them quietly waited. Gu Zheng suddenly asked, “Why do you suddenly want to eat glutinous rice balls?”","“I haven’t eaten near Li City University in a long time, so I asked you to come and try this place out with me.”","!!","While the two of them were talking, the glutinous rice balls were served. Qiao Xi picked one up and blew on it a few times before putting it in her mouth. It was so hot that she shouted, “Gu Zheng! Quickly try it. The filling is delicious!”","Gu Zheng picked up his chopsticks, his movements a little hesitant as he carefully savored the soft and sweet taste. He had not eaten glutinous rice balls for many years. It had nothing to do with his preferences; he just did not dare to.","When he tasted it, he would definitely recall the scene of his mother making glutinous rice balls for him. She dragged her seriously ill body to make them, and her face was pale. That was the most painful scar in his heart, so he did not dare to eat this dish.","At that time, Huang Lilan abused him and did not give him any food. A pot of glutinous rice balls was already precious food. After he took over the Gu family, every meal was delicious. No one would serve ordinary desserts like glutinous rice balls to his dining table.","“Xi Xi, I remember that you don’t like glutinous rice balls,” Gu Zheng asked softly.","A mouthful of glutinous rice balls was stuck in her throat. Qiao Xi swallowed it forcefully. “I like them!”","Gu Zheng’s eyes burned. “Before we got married, when you were chatting with me online, you said that you didn’t like glutinous rice balls. We’ve been married for so long and you never mentioned them. Why did you suddenly want to eat them today? Did Aunt Fang say something?”","Qiao Xi’s heart instantly jumped as she immediately retorted, “I did say that they taste bad, but that’s because the glutinous rice balls my grandfather made aren’t delicious. The skin of the glutinous rice balls wasn’t even cooked, and the filling was too sweet. What I meant to say was that I don’t like to eat the glutinous rice balls my grandfather made, but you think I don’t like glutinous rice balls at all. You weren’t listening to me at all!”","Gu Zheng curled his lips slightly. Mrs. Gu’s self-righteous appearance was really... cute!","He smiled helplessly. “It’s my fault. What can I do to make Mrs. Gu forgive me?”","Qiao Xi supported her chin and said with a smile, “It’s simple! You can accompany me here more often to eat glutinous rice balls! The beef noodles and dumplings here are very delicious. We can eat different things every day!”","Gu Zheng guessed her thoughts but did not point them out. “Alright.”","After the two of them finished eating, they left. Gu Zheng said indifferently, “Xi Xi, no matter what Aunt Fang says, don’t take it to heart. One can’t always live in the pain of the past. Now that I have you, I’ve long let go of the past.”","Seeing this, Qiao Xi stopped pretending. “Aunt Fang did tell me some things. I just want you to eat whatever you like. Don’t just accommodate me. I also want you to tell me everything.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with warmth. He reached out and pulled her into his arms. He whispered in her ear, “Alright, I’ll tell you.","“At that time, I was young and didn’t have the ability to resist. Whenever Huang Lilan was unhappy, she would torture me. She locked me in the basement of Maple Garden and tied me to a chair with a rope. I was left to starve for three days, but she placed a roasted chicken in front of me.","Qiao Xi’s heart ached as if she had been punched.","“But the next day, Huang Lilan untied the rope around me and took away the roasted chicken. She sent over a live chicken. When that chicken entered, it was still running around. I... I ate it in the end.”","Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled.","Gu Zheng said indifferently, “During that period of time, every time I had a nightmare, I would dream of that chicken that was stained with blood. I was traumatized, but after I took over the Gu family and met you, I no longer hated chicken. Moreover, when I eat chicken sandwiches with you, I feel very happy.","Qiao Xi’s eyes turned red as she choked. “Stop talking, Ah Zheng.”","Hatred welled up in her heart. She had let Huang Lilan die too easily back then. She had done many evil deeds, so she should have been tortured to death!","At this moment, her cell phone suddenly rang. Qiao Xi picked it up angrily. “Hello?!”","“Little Six, did you eat explosives?” Qin An exclaimed.","When Qiao Xi heard Qin An’s voice, she calmed down. “What is it?”","Qin An went straight to the point. “The He family has indeed participated in the research of the capital’s laboratory. Furthermore, they’ve been researching it for many years.”"]},{"number":1631,"title":"Chapter 1631 But Some People Are So Ruthless","paragraphs":["1631 But Some People Are So Ruthless","“Little Six, although Li City is far from the capital, we can’t let our guard down. You have to be vigilant of your surroundings at all times. I’ll continue to investigate the laboratory,” Qin An said seriously.","Qiao Xi agreed. “I understand, don’t worry.”","After hanging up, the two of them walked all the way to Li University’s entrance. Students came and went. When they saw Qiao Xi, they wanted to greet her, but when they saw the tall and cold man beside her, they did not dare to go forward.","“Do you have a class today?” Gu Zheng asked.","“The class I’m teaching is about to do an internship. I haven’t had any classes recently.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi’s phone rang again. Xiao Lan’s voice sounded. “Young Madam, um... Mr. He Tingchen is outside the villa. He wants to look for the president. I said that you weren’t around, but he said that he wants to wait for you in the villa. Uncle Sheng is blocking the door. Do you want him to come in?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng. “He Tingchen wants to see you.”","Gu Zheng got into the car and said indifferently, “No.”","After Qiao Xi finished speaking according to Gu Zheng’s instructions, Xiao Lan said with some difficulty, “But Young Master He isn’t willing to leave. Isn’t it inappropriate to keep him waiting outside?”","Qiao Xi frowned. What was He Tingchen trying to do?","Gu Zheng took the phone and said coldly, “Tell him that I’m in the Gu family’s old residence. If there’s anything, he should look for me there.”","“Alright, President.”","After Xiao Lan hung up, she immediately went to convey Gu Zheng’s message.","At eight in the evening, in the Gu family’s old residence.","Old Madam Gu was leaning against the sofa and watching TV. When she saw Qiao Xi arrive, she hurriedly said warmly, “Xi Xi, come over quickly and chat with me.”","After Qiao Xi sat down, Old Madam Gu went straight to the point. “He Tingchen came to the Gu family today to see Ah Zheng. How could he have the cheek to look for Ah Zheng?”","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “He Tingchen is simple-minded and doesn’t know about the dirty things in the He family. He has always thought that he and Ah Zheng are good friends.”","“He’s innocent, but he’s also stupid. Everything he’s enjoying now was left behind by He Weinian’s ex-wife. As the child of a mistress, even if He Tingchen doesn’t know anything, he’s not innocent!”","“A mistress? Didn’t Madam He only marry Chairman He two years after his ex-wife passed away?” Qiao Xi asked.","Old Madam Gu snorted in disdain. “I’ve lived for so long and basically know everything about the noble families in Li City. The He family’s scandals naturally can’t escape my eyes.","“Qiao Zhenguo and my good-for-nothing son, Gu Weiming, are the same type of men. He Weinian relied on his wife and father-in-law to have his current achievements, but in the end, his parents-in-law died an unnatural death. His wife and child also died in a car accident. Yet no one actually suspects He Weinian?","“Everyone thinks that even if He Weinian killed his wife and in-laws, he wouldn’t have killed his child, but...” Old Madam Gu paused, her smile cold. “But some people are just so vicious!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes trembled. Even though she had already guessed it, she still felt shocked when she heard it with her own ears.","Old Madam Gu said indifferently, “Actually, I’ve long known that He Weinian isn’t an easy person to deal with! I remember that when his ex-wife was still alive, I saw He Weinian being very close to a woman. Two years after his ex-wife died, that woman married him.","“He Weinian clearly had an affair with that woman a long time ago, but two years after his ex-wife passed away, he pretended that the two of them had just met and got married. A year later, he gave birth to a child who was sent overseas to recuperate because of his illness. He Tingchen was already 15 when he returned to the country.”","15 years old?","Qiao Xi’s gaze was slightly cold.","If a 15-year-old boy developed well, it would not be strange for him to look 18 or 19 years old. He Weinian could even make an 18 or 19-year-old look 15 through his clothes and hairstyle. Moreover, no one would suspect anything.","In that case, before He Weinian’s ex-wife passed away, the mistress had secretly given birth to He Tingchen. In that case, the deaths of He Weinian’s ex-wife and in-laws were definitely not an accident.","Qiao Xi was deep in thought when Gu Zheng pushed the door open and walked in. Old Madam Gu smiled and said, “Ah Zheng is here.”","Gu Zheng said softly, “Grandma, it’s getting late. You should rest early. I’ll bring Xi Xi back.”","“Alright! Go ahead.” Old Madam Gu chuckled as she watched the two of them leave."]},{"number":1632,"title":"Chapter 1632 Parted On Bad Terms","paragraphs":["1632 Parted On Bad Terms","When they arrived at Maple Garden, Qiao Xi was about to go upstairs to take a shower when Gu Zheng hugged her and led her to the backyard of Maple Garden. There were two lounge chairs in the small pavilion, and there was hot tea and exquisite pastries on the table.","“The moon is really round tonight. Let’s admire the moon.” Gu Zheng sighed.","A gust of autumn wind blew past, and Qiao Xi shivered. They were admiring the moon outside so late at night?","As if he could tell that she was cold, Gu Zheng unbuttoned his coat and wrapped her petite body in his arms. His smiling voice sounded in her ears. “You’re wearing so little. Are you cold?”","“All girls love to look pretty!” Qiao Xi sniffed.","!!","Qiao Xi leaned into Gu Zheng’s embrace. Her entire body was warm, but she was inexplicably puzzled. Why did Gu Zheng suddenly bring her here to admire the moon? Could it be that today was a special day?","Before Qiao Xi could ask, Gu Zheng’s low voice sounded. “Do you know why He Tingchen is looking for me?”","Qiao Xi had a confused expression. “Why?”","A mocking smile appeared on Gu Zheng’s face. “He really just wants to catch up. I sent someone to follow He Tingchen and saw him go to the Gu family’s old residence alone. He didn’t bring anything with him and didn’t contact anyone else.","“He Tingchen hasn’t been staying in the He family’s villa recently, nor has he contacted He Wenxian. It’s probably because He Wenxian pretended to be you and wronged you. It’s a huge blow to him, so he can’t face He Wenxian for a while.”","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. “Does he really not know what the He family has done? Did he come to look for you just to catch up?”","Gu Zheng was silent for a moment before saying indifferently, “He’s indeed a little stupid, but he’s really different from the He family. He’s considered a kind person. He didn’t come to look for me with any ill intentions today.”","Qiao Xi shook her head. “Even if he’s very kind, he should know that He Weinian abandoned you and went overseas five years ago. Your relationship with the He family has long been ruined. Don’t you think it’s very strange that he came over to express his goodwill to you now?”","When Gu Zheng heard her say this, he abruptly looked up with a trace of coldness in his eyes. “Xi Xi, he’s my friend. I hope you believe him.”","Qiao Xi’s body stiffened. She pushed Gu Zheng away unnaturally. “But I’m just worried about you. I think he has ill intentions.”","“You don’t have to interfere in my matters,” Gu Zheng said indifferently. “He Tingchen is my friend. I have the right to decide whether to interact with him or not. Xi Xi, you shouldn’t interfere.”","Qiao Xi’s heart instantly fell to the bottom of the valley, and she had a strong urge to cry. She abruptly stood up, and her face was slightly pale. This was the first time Gu Zheng had spoken to her like this.","Gu Zheng sensed the low pressure exuding from her body, and his heart trembled.","Qiao Xi distanced herself and said coldly, “Alright, since you’ve said so, I won’t interfere in your matters in the future.”","Gu Zheng’s words kept echoing in her ears. Her heart was heavy as she turned around and said, “I’m tired.”","Gu Zheng watched her leave and pursed his lips. An hour later, he returned to the bedroom. Qiao Xi had already fallen asleep. Her petite body was curled up tightly against the side of the bed.","Gu Zheng wanted to reach out and move her toward the middle of the bed, but just as he was about to touch her, he realized that she was frowning tightly. His body stiffened for a moment before she stood up and left.","The next day.","When Qiao Xi woke up, the man beside her had already left. She was even more depressed.","When she washed up and went downstairs, she heard a voice coming from downstairs. “Ah Zheng, you’re finally willing to see me!”","He Tingchen’s voice carried a trace of guilt. “Previously, I trusted Wenxian too much and offended your wife. Is she still angry with me?”","“Perhaps.” Gu Zheng’s voice was indifferent.","“Then I’ll apologize to her!”","Qiao Xi originally wanted to have a good talk with Gu Zheng, but at this moment, her mood had fallen to rock bottom again. Gu Zheng did not care about her feelings at all. They parted on bad terms yesterday because of He Tingchen, but today, he invited He Tingchen to the house as a guest. He clearly did not take her seriously!","She hated the He family and He Tingchen. Moreover, she had a feeling that He Tingchen must have ulterior motives for looking for Gu Zheng, but Gu Zheng was still unwilling to listen to her.","Qiao Xi’s expression was gloomy. She was not in the mood to eat breakfast and directly returned to the bedroom. She changed her clothes, put on makeup, and carried her bag downstairs.","“Young Madam, breakfast is ready,” Xiao Lan hurriedly said.","Qiao Xi replied coldly, “I don’t feel like eating.”","“But...” Xiao Lan looked at Gu Zheng. He lowered his eyes and said casually, “It’s fine if Young Madam doesn’t want to eat. She’ll go out and eat.”","“Alright.” Xiao Lan frowned and walked out. She felt that the atmosphere today was a little strange."]},{"number":1633,"title":"Chapter 1633 Fight Alone","paragraphs":["1633 Fight Alone","From the moment Qiao Xi went downstairs until she left, Gu Zheng did not even look at her. Instead, he raised his eyes to look at He Tingchen. “I still have something on in my company. Let’s eat together another day.”","He Tingchen smiled and nodded. “Alright! I’m going to my company too, so I’ll leave first. I’ll contact you when I have time!”","Gu Zheng nodded, and he was instantly the only one left in the living room. He stood up and walked to the dining hall to take a seat. He elegantly finished his breakfast and looked at Qiao Xi’s breakfast with a cold gaze.","...","On the other hand, Qiao Xi was even angrier when she arrived at the company.","Suddenly, her cell phone vibrated. It was a message from Gu Yao. It was a piece of news from Li City: [The necklace that’s worth hundreds of millions, Scorching Heart, disappeared at the He Corporation’s donation ceremony!","[Qiao Xi, look at this piece of news. Even a fly can’t get past the He family’s security system. How did that necklace disappear? That sly old fox, He Weinian, must have hidden it!]","Looking at Gu Yao’s message, Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed.","Gu Zheng had installed a GPS inside Scorching Heart. They had been too busy recently and did not have time to look at it, so He Weinian took the initiative to attack.","At this moment, everyone was discussing this matter online. The current market price of Scorching Heart was above 300 million. Moreover, Scorching Heart was a donation. The money from the auction had to be donated. 300 million could completely change a small mountain village, but it had disappeared now.","After losing Scorching Heart, He Weinian posted an apology online and called the police to look for the necklace.","Qiao Xi’s heart suddenly thumped as she smelled something unusual.","Could it be that... He Weinian wanted to frame Gu Zheng? Then did He Tingchen come to the Gu family to...","Qiao Xi immediately called Gu Yao. “Gu Yao, go look for Gu Zheng immediately and ask him if he knows about the He family’s scheme!”","After a while, Gu Yao called back. “Gu Zheng said that he doesn’t want me to interfere in the He family’s matters. Qiao Xi, are you suspecting that He Weinian wants to push the blame on Gu Zheng?”","“I’m not suspecting anything.” Qiao Xi was extremely sure. “I’m sure!”","“F*ck!” Gu Yao exploded. “Then what should we do? Could it be that Gu Zheng has already been schemed against?!”","Only then did Qiao Xi understand why Gu Zheng invited He Tingchen to their house but was unwilling to tell her the reason. He was tempting He Weinian to take the bait. This move was indeed very dangerous. If he was not careful, his reputation would be ruined. Hence, Gu Zheng was unwilling to tell her about it because he was afraid that she would be implicated.","Once this crime was pinned on Gu Zheng, not only would he have to compensate, but he would also have to bear the infamy of stealing. He might even go to jail. Gu Corporation would even be divided up by others. The consequences would be unimaginable.","Qiao Xi’s expression was gloomy. After a long silence, she said, “Since Gu Zheng has already decided, let’s not participate in it for now. We’ll listen to him.”","“There’s a GPS on Scorching Heart. The necklace is still in the He family’s residence,” Qiao Xi said in a low voice. “We can’t cause trouble for Gu Zheng. He must have his own plans.”","As long as He Weinian was not eliminated, Gu Zheng would always be in danger. Instead of being on guard all day, it was better to take the initiative to attack and solve this hidden danger.","Qiao Xi took a deep breath. She could understand Gu Zheng’s thoughts, but they were husband and wife. They should face everything together. It was better than Gu Zheng fighting alone, right?","What should she do if he failed?","At this moment, the netizens angrily posted their comments: [The money from auctioning Scorching Heart was supposed to be donated to a poor mountain village. The climate there is cold, and the roads are muddy. There’s even no internet. Children have to cross a huge mountain to go to school. They have to leave their homes at four in the morning to reach the school on time.]","[The village in the deep mountains is isolated from the world. It’s too difficult to walk out of the mountains. Not only can the 300 million yuan from auctioning Scorching Heart repair roads, but it can also build schools and surrounding houses so that every child can go to school.]","[I went to that mountain village a few years ago to teach. The classrooms were leaking, and the children’s bags and textbooks were all wet. They need six hours to go to and from the school every day. If they take a shortcut, they can only cross a bridge that’s connected by a rope. Every year, someone will get into an accident on the bridge. This 300 million can help them build a stable bridge, but the necklace was stolen. There’s not enough money at all!]","[Who’s so heartless as to steal the donated necklace? Those who can attend the auction are either rich or noble. To them, 300 million is just the price of a villa and a year’s pocket money. However, to the people in the mountains, it’s their lifelong hope!]","[The person who stole the necklace will die a horrible death!]","Someone posted a few photos of the poor mountain village in the comments section. It angered everyone even more. They all berated the thief who stole the necklace.","The residents of the small mountain village were waiting for the 300 million yuan to escape their predicament, but that thief had ruined everyone’s hopes. Who knew how long it would take for the next donation?"]},{"number":1634,"title":"Chapter 1634 Aren’t You Going To Look In The Mirror Before You Leave?","paragraphs":["1634 Aren’t You Going To Look In The Mirror Before You Leave?","At night, Qiao Xi returned to Maple Garden. She had just walked to the door when she heard He Wenxian’s voice. “Ah Zheng, those people in the capital won’t let her off. If you can’t protect her, why don’t you be with me? We’ve been together for so many years. Why did you have to marry her?”","Gu Zheng’s voice was cold. “Miss He, don’t you look in the mirror before you leave?”","He Wenxian was instantly angry. “She’ll die sooner or later. Why don’t you—urgh!”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with killing intent. He grabbed He Wenxian’s throat tightly and tightened his grip bit by bit. “Miss He, if you dare to say another word, I’ll break your neck.”","He Wenxian’s body trembled. She could clearly feel the killing intent on Gu Zheng’s body. He would really kill her!","“Back then, He Weinian stepped on the bones of other people to climb up the social ladder. Now, you still have the cheek to curse Xi Xi?” Gu Zheng shook him off in disgust and said, “Get lost!”","He Wenxian got up from the floor and shouted in exasperation, “Gu Zheng, you’ll regret it! You can’t protect her!”","With that, she ran out in a panic and did not see Qiao Xi hiding at the door.","Qiao Xi walked out of the shadows and looked at Gu Zheng’s tall figure. He was clearly such a powerful person, yet he seemed a little tired at this moment.","She slowly walked in, and Gu Zheng suddenly looked up. “Move out of the Gu family tomorrow. I’ve arranged a place for you.”","“I’m not going.” Qiao Xi refused without the slightest hesitation and approached him step by step. “You were deliberately fierce to me yesterday. What exactly is your plan?”","Gu Zheng’s lips tightened.","Qiao Xi raised her head and looked at him seriously. “Gu Zheng, you’re distancing yourself from me because you’re afraid of implicating me, right?”","Gu Zheng’s voice was hoarse. “Be good.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes turned red. “You reprimanded me for He Tingchen yesterday, and you’re chasing me away today. Back then, when we got married, you said that you would treat me well. Have you changed so quickly?”","Gu Zheng: “...”","He could not bear to see Qiao Xi sad. He massaged his temples and advised gently, “You’ll be implicated by my side.”","“He Weinian isn’t a kind person. Even if I leave, he won’t let me off. Once something happens to you, they’ll attack me next!” Qiao Xi choked.","Gu Zheng held her hand, his eyes filled with reluctance but determination. “I can’t be by your side during this period of time. This matter is very dangerous. It might...”","It might involve those dirty families in the capital, and he would officially declare war on them. He was not afraid of failure, but he could not let harm go Xi Xi’s way.","He had to leave Xi Xi a way out. If she did not participate in this matter, at least she would not have to suffer the fierce revenge of those people. After the incident, he would send Xi Xi to the Yin family in Shengdu, far away from the capital","“I’m not afraid. I can protect myself.” Qiao Xi looked at him with a burning gaze.","Gu Zheng knew that his delicate wife was capable, but he was still unwilling to let her be in any danger.","After a long silence, Gu Zheng suddenly changed the topic. “Xi Xi, I’m hungry. I want to eat glutinous rice balls.”","Qiao Xi glared at him. “Nonsense! We’re still having a cold war!”","Gu Zheng chuckled. His voice was hoarse and sexy with a trace of coquettishness. “I was wrong. Mrs. Gu, please forgive me.”","Qiao Xi’s heart skipped a beat. Was Gu Zheng acting cute to her?","She walked to the kitchen helplessly. After struggling for a long time, she finally made the glutinous rice balls.","After the two of them finished eating, Qiao Xi went upstairs to take a shower. Gu Zheng watched her leave in fascination. Even when her figure disappeared, he was still standing in the same spot, his face filled with gentleness and reluctance.","After a long time, Gu Zheng’s expression suddenly turned cold. His voice was extremely cold. “Let’s start.”","“If Qiao Xi finds out that you and I planned this behind her back, she definitely won’t let me off.” A man walked out of the darkness. Cheng Juan leisurely walked to the sofa and sat down with his arms crossed.","“Have you delivered the things?” Gu Zheng asked.","“Of course. The real Scorching Heart is still in the He family. The one in Longwan Residential is a fake. If the matter is exposed, you’ll have to suffer for a few more days.”","Gu Zheng smirked. “It doesn’t matter.”","The next day.","Qiao Xi woke up from her sleep and abruptly sat up. She was not in the Gu family or Longwan Residential. She was in an unfamiliar room.","Before she could think further, someone pushed the door open and entered. An unfamiliar servant said respectfully, “Young Madam, Assistant Song is waiting for you downstairs.”","Song Shiyu?","In that case, Gu Zheng was the one who sent her here!","Qiao Xi quickly put on her clothes and rushed downstairs. She saw Song Shiyu in the middle of the living room. When he saw her coming downstairs, he went up to her with a flattering expression. “Young Madam, breakfast is ready.”","Qiao Xi looked at him coldly. “What exactly does Gu Zheng want to do?”"]},{"number":1635,"title":"Chapter 1635 The Plan Has Already Begun","paragraphs":["1635 The Plan Has Already Begun","“The president has been too busy recently. He’s afraid that he won’t be able to take care of you, so he sent you here to stay for a few days. The matter will definitely be settled in a week at the latest.”","Qiao Xi’s heart was heavy. No wonder Gu Zheng looked at her with a reluctant expression when he wanted to eat glutinous rice balls last night!","“Don’t worry, it’s just a small matter. The president was just afraid that you would be upset, so he hid it from you.” Song Shiyu smiled obsequiously. “Just treat it as a holiday. The president will come and pick you up in a week.”","Qiao Xi looked out of the window. There was an artificial lake outside, and there were many flowers, plants, and trees planted around it. The scenery was pleasant. The interior of the villa was luxuriously decorated, and it was enough to show how diligent the builder was. This seemed to be a princess’ castle.","“Then tell me, what does he want to do?” Qiao Xi suppressed the uneasiness in her heart.","Song Shiyu looked helpless. “Even if you know, you can’t do anything. The plan has already begun.”","Qiao Xi was puzzled. “The plan started in just one night?”","She knew Gu Zheng’s ability, but she was still worried and wanted to do something for him.","“Young Madam, you’ve been asleep for three days.”","Qiao Xi widened her eyes in shock.","She slept for three days?","Qiao Xi took out her phone and instantly saw the notification.","[The latest developments on the missing Scorching Heart. Gu Corporation’s President, Gu Zheng, has been taken away by the police for investigation!]","The moment this news was released, the internet instantly exploded. The police found Scorching Heart in Longwan Residential, and Gu Zheng was immediately taken away by the police. In the eyes of the netizens, the thief had already been caught.","Scorching Heart was not just a necklace. It was the hope of the people in the mountains. However, Gu Zheng, the richest man in Li City, actually stole it. He clearly did not lack the 300 million, but he stole Scorching Heart. He was treating the donation as a joke!","The netizens’ curses were almost overflowing. Qiao Xi’s heart ached. No wonder he said that she could not stay in Longwan Residential. That place should have been sealed off by now.","Qiao Xi hurriedly opened Qin An’s chat box. Qin An had already told her the news from the outside world. Gu Corporation’s stock market had plummeted, and the president had been arrested. Everyone was dispirited. Every day, people would come to the company’s entrance to splash paint and hold banners.","“I’m the creator of Scorching Heart. I can prove his innocence.” Qiao Xi’s voice was slightly choked.","“Young Madam, you’re indeed the creator of Scorching Heart, but even if you stand up and testify, who will believe you? Since the president has come this far, he has a way to escape. Believe him, alright?”","Qiao Xi closed her eyes and did not dare to look at the netizens’ curses. When had Gu Zheng ever been scolded like this? He Weinian’s move was putting Gu Zheng in the eye of the storm.","“There should be other reasons for him to send me out of Li City, right?” Qiao Xi suddenly asked.","Song Shiyu looked a little flustered.","“Now that Gu Zheng has been captured, if I stay in Li City, He Weinian will definitely look for me to discuss a deal. As long as I agree to his request, he can let Gu Zheng off. Or rather, He Weinian’s target from the beginning was me. Scheming against Gu Zheng was just part of the plan. Gu Zheng was afraid that I would fall for his trap, so he sent me away, right?” Qiao Xi stared at him with a burning gaze.","Song Shiyu’s expression changed.","Qiao Xi was extremely sure. “Not saying anything is equivalent to admitting it. I’ve been unconscious for three days, and the plan has already reached the end. I can’t interfere anymore. If the plan goes smoothly, he can escape in a few days. At that time, it’ll be meaningless for He Weinian to look for me.”","Song Shiyu: “...” Damn! Young Madam’s guess was too accurate! He did not say a word, yet she had guessed everything herself!","Qiao Xi did not say anything else. She looked at the location of Scorching Heart and was relieved.","...","At the police station.","Gu Zheng was wearing a suit and sitting leisurely on a chair. He was clearly a suspect, but he did not look disheveled at all. Instead, he exuded a noble aura that made others not dare to offend him.","On the first day of the plan, He Weinian reported him for stealing Scorching Heart and brought the police to search for the necklace in Longwan Residential. He was taken away by the police, and Longwan Residential was also sealed off.","Right on the heels of that, a few higher-ups of Gu Corporation sold their shares. The company’s shares plummeted, and everyone in the company was in a panic.","In the Gu family’s old residence, not only was He Wenxian not blamed, but she was also valued by Old Master Gu and Gu Weiming. It seemed that they had long known about He Weinian’s plan.","It was the third day now. The results of the jewelry appraisal were about to be released. At the same time, He Weinian was probably looking for Xi Xi.","In the He family’s villa.","“Have you found her?”","“Sir, Miss Qiao was secretly sent away by Gu Zheng. We’ve searched the entirety of Li City, but we can’t find her.”","“Trash! Hurry up and investigate!”"]},{"number":1636,"title":"Chapter 1636 I Can Relax If I Personally Protect Her","paragraphs":["1636 I Can Relax If I Personally Protect Her","The He family’s subordinate said while trembling, “Miss Qiao seems to have vanished into thin air. We even went to Li City University to investigate, but there were still no clues.”","He Weinian’s expression was gloomy. Those two idiots from the Gu family wanted to get rid of Gu Zheng, but his target was Qiao Xi. If Qiao Xi did not appear, then it would be meaningless to wait for Gu Zheng to escape.","He originally thought that it would be much easier to get close to Qiao Xi after Gu Zheng was captured, but Qiao Xi actually disappeared?","“Gu Zheng, Gu Zheng! You’re really capable! Even if you’re captured, you can still arrange everything.” He Weinian sneered.","On the other hand, Qiao Xi calculated the time. Today was the third day. The results of the jewelry appraisal should have been out a long time ago. Why was Gu Zheng not released yet?","Suddenly, Qiao Xi received a message on her phone. It was from an unknown number: [Miss Qiao, can you talk to me in person about Gu Zheng? You’re his wife. You can’t just watch him bear the crime of stealing a donated necklace, right?!]","Indeed, He Weinian had really contacted her!","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly. Before Gu Zheng left, he must have done something so that He Weinian could not locate her phone, but she could still contact the outside world. He Weinian could not find her anywhere, so he could only take the initiative to contact her and see her reaction.","After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi directly called that number.","At this moment, He Weinian and He Wenxian were discussing their next countermeasures when He Weinian’s phone suddenly rang. His eyes instantly flashed. “Qiao Xi!”","He hurriedly picked up the call and said in a gentle voice, “Miss Qiao, I’ve finally contacted you. You must have seen the news online. I want to make a deal with you...”","“I’m not interested,” Qiao Xi interrupted impatiently.","He Weinian asked patiently, “Miss Qiao, can we talk in person?”","Qiao Xi knew that He Weinian wanted to see her for the sake of obtaining her blood. If she really went to see him, he would definitely do his best to make her stay. At that time, everything Gu Zheng had done would be in vain.","“There’s no need. Chairman He, let’s talk over the phone,” Qiao Xi said coldly.","“It’s hard to explain over the phone.” He Weinian’s attitude was still gentle. “Miss Qiao, you’ll definitely record the conversation over the phone. I have to be careful. Please forgive me.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. He was indeed a sly old fox!","Song Shiyu stood outside the room and stomped his feet anxiously, afraid that Young Madam would agree to He Weinian’s request","Suddenly, footsteps came from behind.","Song Shiyu thought that it was a servant and could not help but frown. When he turned around, a cold face appeared in front of him.","Gu Zheng nodded, looking a little tired. His voice was hoarse. “I think it’s better to protect her personally.”","Even though everything had been arranged and the villa was surrounded by shadow guards, he still felt uneasy.","Song Shiyu asked quickly, “The internet is already filled with criticisms. Although Gu Corporation is still operating normally, business has been hindered. When are you going to reel in the net?”","“Three days at most.” With that, Gu Zheng looked at the figure in the living room. She was on the phone.","“President, He Weinian contacted Young Madam and said that he wants to meet her.” Song Shiyu lowered his voice and said, “Although Young Madam didn’t have much of a reaction when she woke up, I think she was very unhappy.","“I know you’re worried about Young Madam and are afraid that she’ll be in danger, but seeing you in jail is the most torturous thing for her. When she saw those people scolding you online, her eyes turned red. She was in a daze when she was eating. After eating a few mouthfuls, she said that she lost her appetite. Actually, she really wants to help you, but she’s afraid that she’ll ruin your plan.”","At this moment, Gu Zheng’s heart felt as if it had been cut by a knife. The pain spread from his heart to his entire body. He knew that Xi Xi would be worried about him, but he did not know that Xi Xi was suffering so much.","Gu Zheng quickly entered the room. Qiao Xi replied with an impatient expression, “I’ve made myself very clear. I...”","Before she could finish, her voice suddenly stopped. She looked at the man in front of her in shock. His suit was not wrinkled at all, and his hair was not messy. However, he looked a little tired.","Qiao Xi covered her cell phone, afraid that He Weinian would notice.","On the other end of the phone, He Weinian was still tempting her. “Miss Qiao, for Ah Zheng’s sake, we have to meet. I think you’ll agree to my request.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Qiao Xi fell silent and only looked at Gu Zheng in a daze.","Song Shiyu made a phone gesture behind him before Qiao Xi came back to her senses and hung up."]},{"number":1637,"title":"Chapter 1637 There Are Gains And Losses","paragraphs":["1637 There Are Gains And Losses","“Gu Zheng!”","Qiao Xi casually tossed the phone aside and rushed into the man’s arms.","Gu Zheng pulled her into his arms and gently planted a kiss on her forehead. His voice was hoarse and gentle. “Xi Xi, I’m sorry.”","Was it enough to just say that he was sorry? He hid such a big matter from her and had made his own decision. Did he treat her as his wife?","“Didn’t you say you’d be back in a week?”","“I was afraid that you would be worried, so I came back early.” Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with gentleness. His light brown eyes were as bright as stars as he hugged the woman in his arms tightly.","“I’ve already gotten out. As for the rest, we’ll just wait and see.”","“Wait and see?” Qiao Xi was a little depressed. “Gu Corporation’s shares have plummeted, and the internet is filled with curses. Aren’t you worried?”","Gu Zheng did not tell the higher-ups of the company about his plan. Of course, it would bring huge losses to Gu Corporation. If he did not show his face for a long time, someone would definitely have crooked thoughts.","“No rush, let’s continue waiting,” Gu Zheng said indifferently.","There were gains and losses. Since he wanted to scheme against He Weinian, he could not be too hasty. He had to wait for him to take the bait.","The next day.","Just as Qiao Xi had guessed, He Weinian and the Gu family had started taking action.","Old Master Gu directly announced that he would expel Gu Zheng from the Gu family. Gu Weiming also announced that he would cut off all ties with Gu Zheng. The two of them still remembered the video of them angrily criticizing Gu Zheng at the reception being spread online. At this moment, in everyone’s eyes, Gu Zheng was the thief of Scorching Heart.","Those who originally believed in Gu Zheng could not help but waver. After all, the two heads of the Gu family had both stood up to cut ties with him. That meant that the police already had enough evidence. Moreover, it had been so many days but Gu Zheng had not appeared. The two assistants beside him had not released a statement either.","Qiao Xi looked at the video online and asked softly, “You don’t want me to prove your innocence, so what’s your plan?”","Gu Zheng chuckled and said, “Mrs. Gu, you should know that the necklace found in Longwan Residential is a fake. The police will prove to me that I didn’t steal the real Scorching Heart. As for why that fake appeared in Longwan Residential, someone must have deliberately framed me!”","Qiao Xi instantly understood. “No wonder you asked He Tingchen”","He Tingchen went to Longwan Residential, and such a thing happened right on the heels of that. Of course, he could not escape responsibility!","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng. The corners of his mouth curled into a satisfied smile as if he felt that his plan was perfect. In terms of power and strategy, He Weinian was not his match.","In the afternoon, He Weinian also held a press conference.","He Weinian apologized sincerely at the press conference. “I’m very sorry, everyone. I didn’t expect Ah Zheng to do this either. He has been learning from me since he was ten years old. He was once my proudest student. He’s indeed very outstanding. He founded Gu Corporation and has his current achievements, so I trusted him very much. I told him the place where Scorching Heart was stored and asked him to help me take care of it. I originally wanted to find a suitable buyer and donate it to the mountains after getting 300 million, but he actually","“It’s my negligence that he became like this today. Ah Zheng has already paid the price. I hope everyone can give him a chance to change.”","Everyone’s hearts ached when they heard He Weinian’s words.","All these years, He Weinian had been devoting himself to charity. Every year, he would donate a large sum of money and even spend a lot of effort to hold a charity banquet. He had already done enough. Now that Gu Zheng had made a mistake, he still had to take the initiative to take responsibility.","“Chairman He, you can’t be blamed for this! Some people are born to be bad. No matter how you teach them, it’s useless!”","“That’s right! We can’t blame the teachers for all the students’ mistakes. Moreover, we all know how many good deeds you’ve done all these years!”","He Weinian listened to everyone’s words, and a trace of pride flashed past his eyes. However, his face was still filled with sorrow and helplessness. “In the end, it was my negligence that caused Scorching Heart to be stolen, so I’ve decided to donate 300 million to the mountain area in my own name, even if the necklace”","Before he could finish speaking, a commotion came from the door. Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and could not help but exclaim, “Qiao Xi!”","Although not everyone in Li City knew that Qiao Xi was Gu Zheng’s wife, as reporters, they were well-informed and naturally knew her identity.","Gu Zheng’s wife actually came over at this time. Was she here to cause trouble or to clarify things for Gu Zheng?","In an instant, the reporters swarmed over and surrounded Qiao Xi, wanting to obtain first-hand news."]},{"number":1638,"title":"Chapter 1638 Luring Out The Real Thief","paragraphs":["1638 Luring Out The Real Thief","He Weinian’s expression darkened. He did not expect Qiao Xi to come to the press conference. The matter of Gu Zheng stealing the necklace was already a sure bet. It would not change anything even if she came.","Qiao Xi was wearing a long beige coat and had casually tied her hair into a bun. She walked in elegantly and arrogantly. The reporters’ microphones were already in front of her, but she still maintained her smile.","“Mrs. Gu, as President Gu’s wife, don’t you think it’s a little too much for you to suddenly appear at the press conference?” someone said with a mocking expression.","Qiao Xi smiled gently. “Everyone, I’m sorry I’m late. Since the press conference President He is holding is related to my husband, I think I have the right to stay here.”","The person accused angrily, “Gu Zheng stole the donated necklace. Shouldn’t you apologize on his behalf? People like you only care about benefits and don’t care about the lives of the people in the mountains at all!”","Qiao Xi was not angry and said with an innocent expression, “Since you’ve said so, let’s make things clear today. I’m the creator of Scorching Heart and also the donor. If I didn’t want to donate it, no one could force me. Why should Gu Zheng steal it? Our family doesn’t lack this necklace!”","The person was instantly speechless. He subconsciously glanced at He Weinian, then retorted, “You and Gu Zheng just want good reputations, but you can’t bear to part with the 300 million!”","Qiao Xi sneered. “It’s fine for a reporter to think this way, so I’m here today to clarify things for Gu Zheng.”","He Weinian stood on the stage and looked sharply at the calm woman.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up slightly as she casually stroked the hair on her forehead and revealed a sweet smile. “Everyone doesn’t know yet, right? The necklace found in Longwan Residential has been appraised and confirmed to be a fake. It’s only worth a few thousand yuan, so Gu Zheng was released last night.”","The surroundings were silent, and He Weinian’s face instantly cracked.","Madam He lost control of her expression and subconsciously roared, “Impossible!”","“Why not? He went to rest after returning home last night, so he didn’t have time to tell Chairman He and the Gu family. Who would have thought that you would actually hold a press conference? Old Master Gu announced that he would expel Gu Zheng from the house, and Chairman He accused him of stealing.” Qiao Xi sighed lightly. “You’re his relatives and master. Why don’t you believe in his character?”","The next second, everyone’s phones rang one after another. They received a message almost at the same time. The jewelry appraiser hired by the police confirmed that the necklace found in Longwan Residential was a fake. The real thief must have framed Gu Zheng.","Actually, when Gu Zheng was taken away by the police, the police had already confirmed that the necklace was a fake. However, Gu Zheng wanted to lure out the real thief, so he cooperated with the police to put on an act. Now that there were clues, Gu Zheng was released on the fifth day after the police detained him.","There was also a jewelry appraisal report under the statement released by the police that confirmed that the necklace was a fake.","At this moment, the entire venue was in an uproar. They did not expect the truth to be like this. Not only was Gu Zheng innocent, but he was also cooperating with the police to catch the real thief!","In the past five days, Gu Zheng had been infamous. Gu Corporation’s shares had plummeted, and he was under immense pressure. However, he was still cooperating with the police to solve the case. He was too selfless!","Everyone’s gazes on Qiao Xi became respectful. She casually found a seat and sat down. She said somewhat sadly, “My husband was deemed guilty when he was just helping the police solve the case. It’s fine if the netizens scold him, but even Chairman He and Old Master Gu refused to believe him. They even held a press conference to criticize him. How disappointing!","“Ah Zheng, don’t you think so?”","Everyone followed her gaze and instantly gasped. The man was tall and slowly walked toward everyone, exuding a strong sense of oppression.","On the stage, He Weinian’s expression froze as he clenched his fists tightly.","The entire venue was silent for more than ten seconds before everyone came back to their senses. “It’s President Gu! He’s really released!”","“Mrs. Gu is right. He Weinian is President Gu’s teacher, and Old Master Gu and Gu Weiming are his relatives. However, they both held a press conference to criticize him. Moreover, that necklace worth 300 million was donated by President Gu. It’s fine that no one thanked him, but they even accused him of stealing. Isn’t this too much?!”","He Weinian’s expression changed abruptly. He met Qiao Xi’s proud eyes and realized that he had been schemed against by Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng!","He forced himself to calm down and squeezed out an ugly smile. “Ah Zheng, so it was all a misunderstanding. I’m very happy that you’re safe and sound.”"]},{"number":1639,"title":"Chapter 1639 He’s Not The Only One Who Knows How To Act","paragraphs":["1639 He’s Not The Only One Who Knows How To Act","He Weinian did not expect that after he had carefully schemed for so long, Gu Zheng would easily escape. The necklace that was placed in Longwan Residential was clearly the real one, so why did the police appraise it as a fake?","He really did not understand and did not know what method Gu Zheng had used. He only knew that he had lost this time!","“Ah Zheng, so you haven’t appeared for so many days because you were busy helping the police with the case. We misunderstood you. I’m really sorry.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were calm, but there was a trace of killing intent around him. His thin lips parted slightly. “Chairman He, I didn’t come here today to listen to your nonsense.”","The moment that was said, everyone gasped. Why was President Gu so rude to Chairman He?!","He Weinian’s attitude was still gentle. “Ah Zheng, I know you resent me, but I’m your master, after all. I’ve already apologized to you. Don’t cause trouble in front of your reporters. We”","He Weinian’s expression instantly darkened. The man from before immediately stood up to defend the injustice. “Mrs. Gu, how can you speak like this to your elder? Mr. He misunderstood President Gu, but the evidence at that time pointed to President Gu. It’s normal to suspect him, right? Moreover, Mr. He just announced that he’s willing to donate 300 million yuan in his own name to help President Gu make up the funds!”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. It was probably because He Weinian had been wearing a mask for too long, so everyone thought that he was a kind person, but she did not believe that He Weinian would donate 300 million yuan.","He Weinian was not the only one who knew how to act. She knew how to act too!","Qiao Xi’s eyes instantly turned red as she sobbed softly. “Chairman He, I didn’t expect you to care so much about Ah Zheng, but why did you report him for stealing the necklace?”","Everyone instantly reacted.","That was right! He Weinian was the one who reported Gu Zheng and brought the police to search for the necklace in Longwan Residential!","Qiao Xi said delicately, “If you really cared about Ah Zheng, you could have asked him in private, but you didn’t give him a chance at all and directly brought the police to search his house”","The corners of He Weinian’s mouth twitched, then he was a little helpless. “Scorching Heart was stolen. I was anxious, so I didn’t inform Ah Zheng in advance. It’s my fault for not thinking things through, but the reason I was in such a rush was that I hoped to donate this sum of money to the mountains as soon as possible.”","As soon as he finished speaking, He Weinian frowned and sighed. “I thought Ah Zheng would understand me, but I didn’t expect him to still resent me.”","The male reporter from before said again, “President Gu, Chairman He misunderstood you, but he did all that for the sake of the people in the mountains. Why are you so unforgiving?”","Qiao Xi chuckled. “Chairman He, you said that you only reported Ah Zheng in a moment of anxiety. Then was it your idea for your son, He Tingchen, to hide the fake necklace in Longwan Residential?”","Boom!!!","Her voice was light, but it hit everyone’s hearts hard.","Mrs. Gu said that He Tingchen was the one who put the fake necklace in Longwan Residential. If that was the case, He Weinian was blatantly framing Gu Zheng when he reported Gu Zheng!","He Weinian’s expression was as gloomy as ink, but he hid it in a few seconds. He pretended to be surprised. “Xi Xi, what are you talking about?!”","Qiao Xi did not even bother to look at him as she said slowly, “A week ago, He Tingchen went to Longwan Residential many times to catch up with Gu Zheng, but everyone knows very well that Gu Zheng’s relationship with the He family had long collapsed, so we didn’t see him. After that, he went to the Gu family’s residence to look for Gu Zheng. He did this to hide the fake necklace in Gu Zheng’s residence, whether it’s Longwan Residential or the Gu family’s residence. He can’t escape responsibility.”","He Weinian’s eyes were vicious. “Tingchen did look for Ah Zheng, but he was chased away before he could enter Longwan Residential. How could he have hidden the necklace?”","“Yes, he didn’t go in, but he could have entrusted someone else to help him!” Qiao Xi said with a smile, “Young Master He specially avoided the surveillance cameras, but unfortunately, we have pinhole cameras too. After watching the recording, the police have already found the servant who helped He Tingchen commit the crime.”","He Weinian almost could not control his ferocious expression. He was the one who instructed Tingchen to hide the necklace in Longwan Residential, but this kid actually got a servant to hide it and it was even captured by the surveillance cameras.","What a good-for-nothing! He could not even do such a small thing!","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with ridicule. “Before this, He Tingchen transferred a sum of money to the servant’s account. There’s also surveillance footage as evidence. It’s confirmed that He Tingchen gave the necklace to the servant and got that servant to hide it in Gu Zheng’s study.","“Now that the evidence is conclusive, should we call the police and ask if they’ve already arrested He Tingchen?”"]},{"number":1640,"title":"Chapter 1640 He’s My Helper","paragraphs":["1640 He’s My Helper","He Weinian was a little flustered and hurriedly retorted, “Tingchen was the one who did that. What does it have to do with me?”","“Yes, that’s what Young Master He said too.” Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “He admitted that he planned this matter himself and it has nothing to do with anyone else. He framed Gu Zheng because he was jealous of him.”","He Weinian’s heart skipped a beat as he felt inexplicably flustered.","That was not right! The necklace he gave Tingchen was clearly real, so why was the necklace found in Longwan Residential fake?","“It’s getting late, so we won’t disturb Chairman He anymore. The police will definitely come to investigate later.” Qiao Xi turned around and faced the reporters. “I’ll have to trouble everyone to tell the truth about what happened here today.”","The reporters hesitated for a few seconds before understanding Qiao Xi’s intentions. He Weinian held a press conference to ruin Gu Zheng’s reputation. Now that it had been proven that Gu Zheng was innocent and the real culprit was He Weinian’s son, not only would Gu Zheng be able to clear his name if news of this got out, but he would also cause the He family to suffer a considerable blow. It could be considered as taking revenge on the He family.","Indeed, this reversal caused a new wave on the internet.","[F*ck! We misunderstood Gu Zheng! He was arrested to cooperate with the police’s investigation and was scolded by everyone for five days. I heard that Gu Corporation’s shares have plummeted. My heart aches for my idol!]","[I didn’t expect He Tingchen to hide the necklace in Longwan Residential to frame Gu Zheng. But isn’t He Tingchen a fool? Does he have the IQ to scheme against Gu Zheng? Moreover, he and Gu Zheng are good friends. Isn’t it a little far-fetched to ruin Gu Zheng just because of jealousy?]","[He Tingchen hid the necklace in Longwan Residential. Right on the heels of that, He Weinian reported Gu Zheng. The villa is so big, so he found it in the study. Is there a possibility that He Weinian ordered He Tingchen to frame Gu Zheng? But isn’t he Gu Zheng’s master?]","[He Weinian betrayed Gu Zheng five years ago and even cut ties with Gu Zheng before leaving the country. It’s just that He Weinian held a charity banquet as soon as he returned to the country, so everyone stopped mentioning that matter.]","After reading the news online, Qiao Xi put down her phone and looked at the man beside her. “I have a question. Since He Tingchen was ordered by He Weinian to hide the necklace, that sly old fox would definitely have given He Tingchen the real necklace in order to ensure that the plan went smoothly. However, what was found in Longwan Residential is fake. Moreover, not only did He Tingchen get a servant to hide the necklace, but he was also captured by the surveillance cameras. He made many stupid mistakes, which makes me find it strange.”","Gu Zheng smirked and chuckled. “That’s right, he did it on purpose. He Tingchen is my helper.”","Qiao Xi gasped. She had thought of many possibilities, but she had never thought of this.","“He Tingchen helped you scheme against He Weinian?”","“He’s not just trying to help me. He just hopes that he can pull his father back from the precipice,” Gu Zheng said slowly. “Actually, He Tingchen looked for me half a month ago. He probably knew the secret behind He Weinian’s charity and knew that He Weinian wanted to frame me. He felt uneasy, so he told me about this. He hoped to take this opportunity to teach He Weinian a lesson and turn over a new leaf.”","Qiao Xi shook her head. “He Weinian is even willing to kill his own children. It’s impossible for him to turn back.”","“He Weinian didn’t even tell He Tingchen about the dirty things he did. He protects his son very well. He knows that He Tingchen is pure-hearted. If he finds out that he has dozens of lives on his hands, he might even go crazy!” Gu Zheng said softly.","“I know you don’t like He Tingchen. He’s weak and stupid, but he’s the only pure, kind, and moral person in the entire He family besides He Wenyin.”","Qiao Xi could not help but nod. Although He Tingchen was annoying, he was indeed a good person. He was willing to work with Gu Zheng!","Gu Zheng said indifferently, “This isn’t something I should worry about. He Weinian will naturally think of a way to save him.”","...","A few days later, He Weinian finally arrived at the police station. After confirming that there were no surveillance cameras or recording equipment around, he suddenly stood up and rushed in front of He Tingchen. He grabbed his collar and gritted his teeth as he questioned, “Tingchen, the necklace I gave you was clearly real. How did it suddenly become fake?","“I instructed you to handle such a small matter, but you couldn’t even do it well and were even arrested. Now, the rumors outside are about to drown the He family!”","He Tingchen’s eyes were lifeless as if he did not hear him."]},{"number":1641,"title":"Chapter 1641 They Will Never Be Family","paragraphs":["1641 They Will Never Be Family","“Tell me!” He Weinian shouted angrily.","He Tingchen’s eyes finally focused. He looked at his father in front of him in a daze. He felt that his father, who used to be full of love, had suddenly become ferocious.","“Dad, all these years, you’ve been accumulating wealth in the name of doing charity. Have you never felt guilty or uneasy?”","He Weinian’s expression froze for a moment, then he frowned. “You know about this?”","“Everyone says that you’re a kind person who has dedicated your life to charity. I’ve always treated you as my role model, but now, I know that your so-called charity is all fake. You organize donations from others, but you’ve never donated. You even take away most of the funds every time!","“You announce to the public that He Corporation donates a billion yuan every year, but this is all a lie!”","He Weinian sneered. “You’re right, but so what? He Tingchen, if not for my plan, would you be able to live such a luxurious life?”","He Tingchen moved his lips and said with heartache, “Don’t you think you’re in the wrong? If Gu Zheng hadn’t told me the truth, I would’ve still been kept in the dark by you!”","“You believe everything Gu Zheng says?! I asked you to hide the necklace in Longwan Residential. What did you do?”","“Dad! Why do you want to frame Ah Zheng? He’s your student!” He Tingchen’s voice trembled slightly.","He Weinian bent down and patted his face. He said in a low voice, “He Tingchen, everything I’ve done is for the He family. How dare you question me?”","He Tingchen’s body trembled as he silently lowered his eyes. “Leave. I don’t want to see you.”","“I’ll bail you out. Come home with me!”","“I’m not leaving! You framed Gu Zheng, so someone has to bear this responsibility!” He Tingchen broke down and roared. He clenched his fists tightly, and the veins on his forehead were bulging. He could not accept that the He family, which looked glorious on the surface, was so filthy behind the scenes.","“Alright! If you want to stay in the police station, then stay here! When you’ve thought it through, beg me to bring you back!” He Weinian snorted and left angrily.","Half an hour later, someone pushed the door open and walked in. He lowered his head and said dejectedly, “I’m not leaving. You don’t have to persuade me.”","“Why was the dignified young master of the He family arrested and sent to the police station?” A teasing female voice sounded. He Wenyin stood at the door and looked at him coldly.","He Tingchen looked up. His younger sister seemed to be different from before. In his impression, his parents doted on his younger sister very much and let her fool around all day. She was ignorant, incompetent, eccentric, and mischievous. However, her eyes were cold now as if she had changed into a different person.","“Yin Yin...”","He Wenyin waved her hand and interrupted him. “Don’t call me that. I’m not He Weinian’s daughter.”","She sat on the chair opposite He Tingchen and said casually, “I guessed that Gu Zheng wouldn’t tell you everything. After all, you’re so weak. You definitely won’t be able to accept it.”","He Tingchen widened his eyes.","She was supposed to be an arrogant and wilful little girl, but at this moment, He Wenyin’s eyes were cold, and she exuded an unapproachable aura.","He Tingchen asked in confusion, “What nonsense are you talking about? How can you not be Dad’s daughter?”","“Young Master He, you should know that He Weinian has sponsored many orphans, right?” He Wenyin smiled strangely. “Actually, you should have guessed it too. If he can do fake charity, he won’t really sponsor orphans. It’s better if you don’t know about my background.”","He Wenyin leaned closer and stared into his eyes. “Why are you helping Gu Zheng?”","He Tingchen was a little surprised and said in a trembling voice, “I... I’m not sure either. I just don’t think I can frame Gu Zheng. Moreover, the necklace I gave him is real.”","Really?","He Wenyin was stunned for a few seconds before she abruptly stood up and walked out of the door.","“Yin Yin!” He Tingchen’s voice was hoarse. “I was wrong, and so was the He family. You...”","He Wenyin turned around and looked at him with a burning gaze. He Tingchen was indeed kind-hearted and really treated her as his younger sister. However, they would never become family.","“Young Master He, the grudge between me and the He family is very deep. From now on, you’re no longer my elder brother. Let’s try not to contact each other anymore.”","He Tingchen watched He Wenyin leave, and his heart ached. He could guess that Yin Yin was an orphan sponsored by his father. His father must have made a mistake that was worse than a fake donation, which was why Yin Yin was so resentful."]},{"number":1642,"title":"Chapter 1642 A Hero’s Appreciation","paragraphs":["1642 A Hero’s Appreciation","In the study of Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi was curious. “He Weinian wouldn’t want He Tingchen to take the blame, right?”","“That’s impossible,” Gu Zheng replied without hesitation. “He Tingchen is the heir in his heart. Even if he’s weak by nature, He Weinian’s assets will still be left to He Tingchen. How could he bear to let his only son go to jail?”","“It’s been so many days, but He Tingchen hasn’t come out of the police station yet. Looks like the problem this time is a little troublesome!” Qiao Xi said with a smile.","“He Tingchen is the one who’s unwilling to leave,” Gu Zheng said indifferently.","As soon as he finished speaking, Song Shijing pushed the door open and entered. “President, the He family has sent an invitation over.”","Qiao Xi had a look of disdain. “The He family is still in the mood to hold a banquet at a time like this?”","She looked at the contents of the invitation and felt a chill run down her spine.","An apology banquet?","“Could it be that someone confessed?” Qiao Xi suddenly reacted. The next second, she received the news that the He family’s butler had confessed.","The butler had worked in the He family for many years. He took the initiative to go to the police station to admit that he was the one who asked He Tingchen to send the necklace to Longwan Residential. His original words were, ‘No one is buying this necklace for the time being, so it’ll be handed to Gu Zheng for safekeeping first. If Gu Zheng isn’t around, it’ll be placed in his study.’","Then, the butler took out a series of evidence, including chat records and recordings. He proved that he was the culprit who framed Gu Zheng and it had nothing to do with the He family and He Tingchen.","In the end, He Tingchen was acquitted. He Weinian’s name was not even tarnished one bit. However, the question was, where did the real Scorching Heart go?","The He family’s butler said that he had already sold the necklace overseas and could not get it back. This farce should end here. He Weinian sent an invitation to the people of Li City’s high society to explain this matter in public.","Qiao Xi sneered. “He Weinian is really audacious. He even invited everyone to the He family’s residence. Isn’t he afraid that we’ll find the necklace?”","Gu Zheng was silent for a moment before the corners of his lips curled up. “You’ll have to ask He Wenyin and Cheng Juan. Without their help, He Weinian wouldn’t be holding this banquet.”","Qiao Xi pondered for a moment. These two people had joined forces to scheme against He Weinian, making them a powerful force to be reckoned with","“Xi Xi, you’ve known Cheng Juan for many years, right? You should know that he has always been working with Liuli. Do you know what kind of work he’s in charge of in Liuli?” Gu Zheng suddenly asked with a chuckle.","Qiao Xi was puzzled. “What?”","Gu Zheng said, “He destroys the fakes on the market. The jewelry that Liuli Corporation sells to the public every year is limited. Of course, it can’t satisfy the needs of the socialites and noblewomen of high society. Hence, others started researching how to make fakes. One of Liuli Corporation’s departments deals with fakes on the market. Most of them are related to your work.","Qiao Xi’s eyes instantly widened. “In that case, Cheng Juan forged a fake and gave it to He Weinian? But I’m the real creator. Why not just let me make another one?”","“He Weinian has been paying attention to your movements. Moreover, making Scorching Heart requires expensive gems and professional equipment. It’ll easily arouse He Weinian’s suspicion, so Cheng Juan made it himself,” Gu Zheng explained.","Qiao Xi was extremely excited. The four of them seemed to have a natural tacit understanding. Even if they did not communicate in detail, they knew how to start the next step of the plan.","She was really looking forward to the banquet tomorrow. If Scorching Heart was exposed in the He family, how exciting would it be?!","The next day, in the He family’s residence.","Everyone knew that Gu Zheng’s relationship with the He family had already collapsed. Everyone also knew the purpose of He Weinian holding this apology banquet.","“President Gu is really here!”","“Didn’t they say that President Gu cut off all ties with He Weinian? Why is he still attending the banquet?”","Gu Zheng held Qiao Xi’s hand and appeared at the entrance of the He family’s residence, immediately attracting the gazes of countless people.","The man was elegant and noble, with a trace of coldness and arrogance. He was like a noble god. The woman beside him had a delicate figure, fair skin, and red lips. The two of them seemed to have walked out of a painting.","Everyone looked at them uncontrollably. The moment He Weinian saw the two of them, the viciousness in his eyes flashed.","Madam He cursed softly, “If I had known that he was such an ungrateful person, I wouldn’t have cared about him back then! Now that he has made a comeback, he’s turning against us!”"]},{"number":1643,"title":"Chapter 1643 Those Who Do Great Things Have To Be flexible","paragraphs":["1643 Those Who Do Great Things Have To Be flexible","“Trouble comes from the mouth. Don’t say such things again. We invited Ah Zheng over to apologize,” He Weinian berated in a low voice.","He Weinian knew very well that the reason he was like a fish in water in Li City was that he was Gu Zheng’s master. Otherwise, who would show him any respect when he held a charity banquet?","Everyone felt that it was not a good thing for the He family if their relationship with Gu Zheng broke down, so he specially held this banquet.","He Weinian lowered his voice and said, “Those who achieve great things have to be flexible. Being humiliated now means nothing. Everything will be ours sooner or later.”","On the other hand, Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng slowly walked into the banquet hall. Qiao Xi chuckled and said, “Ah Zheng, what do you think He Weinian has been scheming for his entire life?”","Gu Zheng said casually, “It’s probably to live forever!”","Immortality? This must be the reason why He Weinian built the research lab!","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and glanced around. Cheng Juan was standing in the crowd, his gaze cold and empty. A bloodthirsty smile spread on the corners of his mouth.","Gu Zheng was the richest man in Li City. Wherever he and Qiao Xi went, they would be flattered and ingratiated. Madam He’s eyes were bloodshot. Her son was still locked up in the police station, and the butler who was loyal to the He family had also been locked up. However, Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi could still appear in the He family’s residence!","He Wenxian’s eyes were filled with viciousness as she gritted her teeth. Gu Zheng was the love of her life, but he was snatched away by that b*tch, Qiao Xi.","What right did Qiao Xi have to easily obtain Gu Zheng’s love? Even when he entered the police station, he did not forget to protect Qiao Xi so that they would not be able to find her. Now, her father even asked her to humble herself in front of Qiao Xi. He said that when Qiao Xi completely fell into his hands, she could torture her however she wanted, but she did not want to wait anymore!","She wanted to kill Qiao Xi!","He Wenxian rolled her eyes and suddenly thought of an idea. “Is the Lu family here?”","“Lu Zhi and his sister are here,” the man beside her replied.","The corners of He Wenxian’s mouth curled up. She was just worrying about how to deal with Qiao Xi when someone delivered themselves to her door.","Half an hour later, Qiao Xi was walking in the backyard. Gu Zheng and Ye Qingyuan were chatting not far away. The He family’s servant walked forward. “Mrs. Gu, Eldest Miss Lu invites you over. She asked me to pass this to you.”","Qiao Xi lowered her head and saw that it was Lu Zhi’s jade pendant. The only person who could get Lu Zhi’s things and call her Eldest Miss Lu was Lu Jinshu, but her relationship with Lu Jinshu was not good.","Qiao Xi hesitated for a moment before turning to Gu Zheng. “Lu Zhi is looking for me. I’ll go over.”","Gu Zheng looked up and glanced at the servant before nodding.","Qiao Xi followed the servant to the small pavilion in the backyard. Lu Jinshu was indeed standing there.","“You’re so shameless! The He family doesn’t welcome you, yet you still have the cheek to attend the banquet!”","Qiao Xi: “???” Was this person crazy?","Lu Jinshu was furious. “Stop pretending to be innocent! You stole Miss He’s childhood sweetheart and seduced Young Master He. Why are you so cheap?!”","Qiao Xi instantly understood that Lu Jinshu had probably been used as a tool. However, she could use this to counter-attack.","She chuckled and said, “Miss Lu, do you dare to talk in a crowded place? I’m afraid you’ll hurt me in the middle of nowhere! I’m so weak, so I’m definitely not your match!”","Lu Jinshu instantly exploded. “Alright! Let’s go somewhere crowded and let everyone see your lewd appearance!”","The two of them arrived at the front hall. There were many female guests gathered here. Seeing the two of them ready to fight, everyone came over.","“Qiao Xi!” Lu Jinshu called out to her and roared angrily. “If you’re sensible, get out of the He family immediately. Don’t embarrass yourself here!”","Everyone was dumbfounded. Eldest Miss Lu actually chased Mrs. Gu away in public?","Everyone knew that He Weinian was holding this banquet to apologize to Gu Zheng. If Mrs. Gu was chased out, would Gu Zheng let the matter go?","Everyone looked embarrassed and pretended not to see anything. They did not say anything.","There was only Lu Jinshu’s angry roar in the huge banquet hall. After a long silence, Qiao Xi said slowly, “Eldest Miss Lu, explain clearly. How am I embarrassing myself?”","Seeing this, Lu Jinshu shouted in exasperation, “You clearly know that Miss He and Gu Zheng are childhood sweethearts, yet you still seduced Gu Zheng and got him to marry you!”","Everyone gasped. Eldest Miss Lu’s words were too serious!"]},{"number":1644,"title":"Chapter 1644 You’re A Scourge","paragraphs":["1644 You’re A Scourge","Half an hour ago, Lu Jinshu was walking in the garden when she bumped into Madam He and He Wenxian. The two of them were crying very sadly. After asking the two of them, she found out that Miss He was originally Gu Zheng’s fiancee. After Miss He went overseas, Qiao Xi snatched Gu Zheng away.","Lu Jinshu was instantly angry when she heard this. Qiao Xi, this woman, was seducing men everywhere. She was too shameless!","In the past, when Qiao Xi was working with Liuli, her brother had taken good care of her and even treated Qiao Xi better than his own younger sister. Now that Lu Jinshu heard that Qiao Xi had snatched someone else’s fiance and seduced He Tingchen, the anger in her heart could no longer be suppressed.","“Don’t you feel guilty at all?” Lu Jinshu’s voice became sharper. “Miss He said that she and Gu Zheng share a senior-junior relationship. The two of them grew up together and were about to get engaged when you suddenly interfered. Do you like snatching someone else’s man so much?”","Everyone: “???”","Qiao Xi was not angry in the slightest. “Did Miss He say all this?”","Lu Jinshu snorted. “I happened to see Miss He crying. I asked her what was wrong, so she told me. She’s not like you, who announces to the world that she has been wronged!”","Qiao Xi chuckled. “Why would Miss He tell you? Are you very familiar with each other?”","Lu Jinshu choked. “What do you mean? Stop trying to drive a wedge between us! You’ve done dirty things yourself, yet you’re not letting others say anything? Miss He said that they were together for many years, and she reached out to help Gu Zheng when he was at his weakest. Five years ago, she went overseas, but she has always loved Gu Zheng. She hoped to renew their relationship after returning to the country, but you beat her to it.”","The banquet hall was even quieter now. Everyone’s breathing became weaker.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched as she swept her gaze across everyone before her gaze finally landed on Lu Jinshu. “The entire Li City knows that Gu Zheng has already clarified that he has never been engaged to anyone from the He family. Eldest Miss Lu, you’ve always been living overseas and probably don’t know what happened five years ago. However, many of the guests present should know about it, right? Have you heard of the rumors of Gu Zheng and Miss He’s engagement?”","Everyone shook their heads, and there was a trace of mockery in their eyes. They discussed in low voices, “Not only that, but He Wenxian even held a press conference. She said that she and Mr. Gu were just friends and she wouldn’t interfere in Mrs. Gu and Mr. Gu’s marriage. She only treated Mr. Gu as a friend. How did things change in just a few months?”","“I heard that Lu Jinshu and Mrs. Gu don’t have a good relationship. He Wenxian deliberately told Lu Jinshu about this because she wants to use Lu Jinshu to bully Mrs. Gu!”","Lu Jinshu heard everyone’s discussion and was instantly stunned.","“He Wenxian is really a scheming b*tch. She instigated Eldest Miss Lu to scold Mrs. Gu. Does she really think that we’ve forgotten what she once said?”","“She’s clearly the one who wants to ruin someone else’s marriage, yet she’s saying that Mrs. Gu is a mistress.”","“She even pretended to be Mrs. Gu and participated in the ancient painting restoration event. When she was exposed in public, she lost all her dignity. Now, she still has the cheek to look for trouble with Mrs. Gu?”","Lu Jinshu was dumbfounded.","“Eldest Miss Lu, everyone here can testify for me,” Qiao Xi said indifferently.","Lu Jinshu was unwilling to give up. “But Madam He said that you seduced Young Master He, which was why he put the necklace in Longwan Residential to frame Gu Zheng. You seduced two men at the same time and made them go against each other for you. You’re a scourge!”","As soon as she finished speaking, everyone could not help but say, “Eldest Miss Lu, this is clearly nonsense! Young Master He grew up overseas. He and Mrs. Gu only met for the first time a few months ago, yet they fell in love at first sight? Mrs. Gu has been busy participating in competitions and drawing designs every day. How could she have the time to seduce Young Master He? If Young Master He really likes Mrs. Gu, it’s because he’s immoral and likes married women!”","“To be honest, with a handsome, rich, and doting husband like Gu Zheng, who would like He Tingchen?!”","Lu Jinshu’s expression gradually stiffened.","Qiao Xi stared at her and asked casually, “Eldest Miss Lu, did Madam He and Miss He really say these things? Or are you deliberately slandering me?”","Everyone’s gazes instantly turned sharp. Lu Jinshu hurriedly explained, “I didn’t make it up! They said it!”","“I heard that you don’t have a good relationship with Mrs. Gu. Who knows if you’re taking the opportunity to malign her?!”","“If you can’t produce evidence, we won’t believe you!”","Lu Jinshu had never been questioned like this before. Her eyes instantly turned red as she said loudly, “I have evidence!"]},{"number":1645,"title":"Chapter 1645 She Hated Being Used","paragraphs":["1645 She Hated Being Used","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up into a crafty smile.","Lu Jinshu looked aggrieved. “I didn’t malign anyone. I just wanted to seek justice for Madam He and Miss He! You have to believe me! I’ll take out the evidence now!”","With that, Lu Jinshu took out her phone from her bag. “I just happened to take a video of my brother when Miss He talked to me, so I must have recorded it!”","The socialite who spoke just now came over to listen and exclaimed, “It’s really the voices of Miss He and Madam He!”","“As expected, they were the ones who instigated Eldest Miss Lu to bully Mrs. Gu. If it weren’t for the recording, Eldest Miss Lu would have taken the blame!”","!!","The moment that was said, Lu Jinshu’s anger surged.","She hated Qiao Xi, but she hated being used by others even more! She thought that she was speaking up for justice, but she never expected that she would actually be played by that mother and daughter!","“Miss Lu, you should apologize to Mrs. Gu!”","Lu Jinshu glared at the person who spoke and walked angrily toward the backyard. Madam He and He Wenxian were drinking tea and chatting with a few good friends when Lu Jinshu suddenly rushed out.","Before anyone could react, she slapped He Wenxian hard.","He Wenxian was caught off guard and was beaten until she knelt on the floor. She looked up at the woman in front of her. “Miss Lu, you hit me?”","The socialites and noblewomen present all exclaimed, “Ah! Eldest Miss Lu, why did you hit someone?!”","Lu Jinshu was burning with anger. “He Wenxian, you actually dare to play me and use me? I, Lu Jinshu, am not a pushover! Madam He, on the account that you’re an elder, I can choose not to hit you, but He Wenxian has to accept this beating!”","Smack!","A slap landed on He Wenxian’s other cheek, making her scream.","“You mother and daughter sure have good methods! You pretended to be pitiful in front of me and asked me to deal with Qiao Xi for you. In the end, I was the one who lost my dignity!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi slowly walked over. He Wenxian’s face instantly turned pale.","Before He Wenxian could come back to her senses, Qiao Xi said slowly, “Miss He, Madam He, since you don’t welcome me, why did you invite me to the banquet?”","She waved her hand gently. “Song Shiyu, tell Ah Zheng that the He family’s mother and daughter chased me away, so I’ll go back first.”","The socialites and noblewomen present looked at each other. They could not help but distance themselves from the He family’s mother and daughter. It was really not worth offending Mrs. Gu for Madam He.","He Wenxian’s tears welled up in pain. “Xi Xi, when did I want to chase you away?”","Qiao Xi sneered, and Lu Jinshu cursed, “He Wenxian, stop pretending to be innocent. Have you forgotten what you just said to me? You want to get away with it now? It’s too late!”","He Wenxian gritted her teeth. “Eldest Miss Lu, I don’t understand what you mean. What does offending Xi Xi have to do with me? Don’t slander a good person.”","The female guests who rushed over with Qiao Xi and Lu Jinshu revealed disdainful expressions.","Lu Jinshu’s face was filled with mockery. “I was really blind to believe a scheming b*tch like you. Fortunately, I recorded the conversation and used it to prove my innocence.”","“That’s right! We all heard the conversation and know that you and Madam He were slandering Mrs. Gu behind her back!” Everyone echoed.","He Wenxian’s heart skipped a beat. The blood in her body flowed backward, and her mind buzzed.","Lu Jinshu actually recorded it?","Qiao Xi said with a smile, “If Eldest Miss Lu hadn’t told me, I wouldn’t have known that you were slandering me behind my back, Miss He. Looks like what you said at the press conference back then was all fake.”","Someone echoed, “That’s right. The daughter of the He family actually wants to be a mistress and ruin someone else’s marriage. Does she have the cheek to say that she’s a socialite from Li City?”","“You pretend to be pure and harmless in front of everyone, but you spread rumors behind Mrs. Gu’s back that she stole your fiance. The truth is that President Gu was never engaged to you at all!”","He Wenxian’s body stiffened as she sat on the floor in a daze.","“Madam He, you also said that I seduced He Tingchen?” Qiao Xi suddenly looked over, and Madam He’s face instantly turned pale.","“Everyone happens to be here. Please be witnesses. I’m not familiar with Young Master He and have almost never spoken to him. We’ve never met alone either. With an outstanding husband like Gu Zheng, why should I seduce other men? Don’t you think so?” Qiao Xi said casually.","Madam He clenched her fists tightly and looked at Qiao Xi with resentment. This b*tch meant that she looked down on Tingchen!","However, He Weinian had said that he would let Qiao Xi marry Tingchen no matter what. Now that Qiao Xi had caused a scene in public, she wanted to cut off their path!"]},{"number":1646,"title":"Chapter 1646 With Someone You Care About, You’ll Have A Weakness","paragraphs":["1646 With Someone You Care About, You’ll Have A Weakness","At the same time, He Weinian was discussing a collaboration with a few business big bosses. When he saw Gu Zheng sitting not far away, he brought everyone over. His tone was gentle. “Ah Zheng, are you still angry with me? Those are all misunderstandings. Actually, I was very worried about you when you entered the police station!”","Gu Zheng did not even raise his eyes and just chuckled.","He Weinian continued to explain, “Although we haven’t contacted each other much all these years, you’re still my student. I believe in your character. At that time, I had already sent someone to investigate this matter. I didn’t expect that the person who harmed you was my butler.”","His eyes were filled with helplessness, but Gu Zheng was still expressionless. No one dared to make a sound as they secretly thought about their relationship.","No matter what, He Weinian was Gu Zheng’s master. Although the two of them did not seem to have a good relationship on the surface, who knew what Gu Zheng was thinking? Hence, they had to be more respectful to He Weinian.","Everyone hurriedly echoed, “That’s right! Chairman He has been busy dealing with President Gu’s matter recently, but I didn’t expect the butler to be the perpetrator!”","“Chairman He, you’re just too kind. Leaving such a hidden danger by your side has affected your relationship with President Gu.”","He Weinian sat opposite Gu Zheng and said awkwardly, “Ah Zheng, Tingchen...”","“Tingchen can’t be blamed for this,” Gu Zheng said without hesitation.","Hearing that, everyone thought that he had forgiven the He family. They heard that President Gu had a bad temper, but now, it seemed that he was quite tolerant!","When He Tingchen came out of prison, Gu Zheng and He Weinian’s relationship would recover to normal sooner or later. The He family was still a top family in high society.","He Weinian smiled in satisfaction. He was sure that Gu Zheng would not refuse. After all, he had already matured and was not as arrogant as before.","In the past year, all the rumors about Gu Zheng’s bad temper and viciousness had disappeared. Gu Zheng, who appeared in front of everyone again, was an elegant, noble, gentle, and polite rich man.","Gu Zheng had never cared about what others thought of him. The huge change now was only because of Qiao Xi. When someone had someone they cared about, they would have a weakness.","Hence, He Weinian was sure that Gu Zheng would not fall out with him in public and be scolded for being disrespectful to his master. Gu Zheng was also unwilling to let Qiao Xi be implicated. After all, once the He family cut ties with Gu Zheng, Qiao Xi would definitely bear most of the blame.","“Ah Zheng, let me give you a toast.” He Weinian raised his glass. Just as Gu Zheng was about to raise his glass...","“President!” Song Shiyu rushed in.","Everyone looked puzzled. Song Shiyu had been following Mrs. Gu. Why did he come to the banquet hall where the male guests were?","Song Shiyu walked to Gu Zheng’s side and whispered in his ear.","Bang!","Gu Zheng slammed the wine glass on the table, shattering the glass. Bright red wine flowed down the table.","Song Shiyu quickly took out a handkerchief to wipe Gu Zheng’s hands. At this moment, Gu Zheng’s eyes were cold and he exuded strong killing intent. He looked like a demon who had walked out of hell.","“Chairman He, I came to the banquet today because of your kindness in imparting your knowledge to me back then, but it doesn’t mean that I’ll blindly tolerate the He family bullying my wife!”","Gu Zheng glanced coldly at He Weinian before leaving angrily.","Just then, Song Shiyu said slowly, “Chairman He, please keep an eye on your wife and daughter. The president won’t pursue He Tingchen’s mistake on account of your past relationship, but that doesn’t mean you can offend him again and again.”","Everyone was dumbfounded and looked at He Weinian.","He Weinian’s expression was gloomy as he gritted his teeth tightly. Those two idiots must have attacked Qiao Xi again!","Everyone hurriedly arrived at the backyard. Gu Zheng’s expression was cold as he strode toward Qiao Xi. After confirming that there were no injuries on her body, he was relieved and asked softly, “Have you been wronged?”","Qiao Xi nodded delicately. “Miss He and Madam He said that I seduced Young Master He. I’m not familiar with Young Master He at all. How can they slander me like this?”","The corners of Madam He’s mouth twitched, and she could not help but shiver.","“Where did your confidence come from, Madam He?” Gu Zheng sneered, not hiding the mockery in his eyes.","Song Shiyu immediately mocked, “Yes! Madam He, you’re too confident! Our young madam has only met Young Master He a few times, yet you just had to say that our young madam seduced Young Master He. Where did you get that from?","“All the socialites present, you have to be careful. In the future, you’d better take a detour when you see Young Master He. Otherwise, it’ll be very easy for Madam He to think that you seduced Young Master He. You’re all innocent young ladies from noble families. No one wants to be cursed like this, right?!”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Song Shiyu had a vicious tongue!"]},{"number":1647,"title":"Chapter 1647 Entering The Game With An Ancient Painting","paragraphs":["1647 Entering The Game With An Ancient Painting","“Our young madam is already married. She has only seen Young Master He twice in public, but Madam He has already gone around saying that Young Madam seduced Young Master He and wants to divorce the president. If Madam He talks about you single daughters, won’t you all be pregnant with Young Master He’s child? How are you going to get married if such rumors spread?!”","Everyone’s expressions changed drastically as they looked at Madam He with disgust.","Gu Zheng hugged Qiao Xi’s waist, and Qiao Xi leaned weakly in the man’s arms. The two of them turned around intimately and prepared to leave.","Madam He was about to break down. She was the wife of Gu Zheng’s master, yet he did not even greet her? She could not stand such disregard and mockery. She instantly lost her mind and shouted sharply, “Qiao Xi, if it weren’t for you, why would Tingchen frame—”","Smack!","Before she could finish, a slap landed on Madam He’s face.","He Weinian’s eyes were bloodshot. He was so angry that his entire body was trembling. He roared, “Shut up!”","Madam He fell to the floor. Her hair was messy, her cheeks were red and swollen, and her eyes were a little dazed.","“Mom!” He Wenxian cried as she helped Madam He up. The cheeks of the mother and daughter were red, and they looked very miserable.","“Chairman He, your wife and daughter don’t welcome my young madam, so there’s no need for us to stay here.” Song Shijing’s tone was respectful, but his eyes were filled with disdain. “Not only did Madam He and Miss He slander Young Madam, but they also instigated Eldest Miss Lu to bully her. We won’t just turn a blind eye to this!”","Lu Jinshu also stood up. “That’s right! My brother won’t let you off for using me to bully Qiao Xi!”","He Weinian’s expression was as gloomy as ink. After a long silence, he suppressed the anger in his heart and squeezed out a smile. “Ah Zheng, they were muddle-headed for a moment. I didn’t discipline them well. I’ll get them to apologize to Xi Xi.”","Gu Zheng looked at Qiao Xi, who nodded with an aggrieved expression. “Alright, Ah Zheng. Don’t have any grudges against Chairman He because of me. Otherwise, someone will say that I’m a scourge!”","Everyone’s hearts ached. Mrs. Gu had suffered such grievances and was afraid that President Gu would be stuck in the middle. It was really a blessing to have such an obedient, sensible, beautiful, and outstanding wife!","Gu Zheng replied gently, then said coldly, “Apologize, then.”","No matter how much hatred He Weinian had in his heart, he had no choice but to show some sincerity. He could only chuckle and say, “Of course, we can’t let Xi Xi suffer for nothing. Coincidentally, Wenxian bought a few paintings. I heard that Xi Xi also likes ancient paintings. Why don’t Xi Xi choose one of them as an apology?!”","Everyone had heard that He Wenxian had accepted a few expensive paintings. Using this as an apology gift was already very sincere. It seemed that this farce should end now.","Qiao Xi said with some fear, “Ah Zheng, accompany me.”","Song Shijing asked immediately, “Chairman He, can you allow the president to accompany Young Madam in?”","Of course, He Weinian would not refuse. He could only smile and nod.","“I heard that you also have Former Garden here,” Gu Zheng suddenly said.","Qiao Xi had a surprised expression. “Chairman He, can I have that painting?”","He Wenxian almost fainted from anger. This painting was the most precious!","He Weinian smiled. “Of course.”","Everyone had also heard of Former Garden. It was a famous painting, so everyone was instantly tempted. A socialite from an ancient family of painters asked excitedly, “Mrs. Gu, can you let us see that painting?”","At this moment, the event location became lively. Everyone wanted to see that painting.","Qiao Xi was slightly hesitant. “This kind of ancient painting has high requirements for the humidity and temperature of the air. It’s not convenient to bring it to the banquet hall for everyone to admire. I originally wanted to pack it up and send it back to Longwan Residential. In that case, why don’t everyone come with me to look at the paintings in the He residence’s collection room? Chairman He, is that okay?”","He Weinian nodded immediately. “We’ll do anything you say, Xi Xi.”","All the paintings in the He family’s collection were placed in the He family’s collection room. These ancient paintings were all very fragile and needed to be strictly controlled in temperature and humidity. If one was not careful, they would be destroyed.","Everyone followed carefully behind. They could not help but be shocked when they entered the spacious room.","“Wow! This is too spectacular!”","“Miss He, you must have spent a lot of effort to find these ancient paintings. Now that you’ve offended Mrs. Gu, you can only part with them.”","After everyone entered, they could not help but size up their surroundings. In the end, they arrived in front of Former Garden.","“Ah Zheng, I want this painting. I just don’t know if Miss He is willing to give it to me,” Qiao Xi said with a smile."]},{"number":1648,"title":"Chapter 1648 A Careful Scheme","paragraphs":["1648 A Careful Scheme","He Wenxian suppressed her anger, but she still had to smile. “Of course, I’m willing. I offended Xi Xi, so I should apologize. Take whatever you want.”","Qiao Xi made the final decision. “Alright! I want this painting. Ah Zheng, send someone to send the painting back to Longwan Residential now!”","After a while, Song Shijing walked in with white gloves and carefully took the painting...","Bang!","In the silence, the sound of something falling was exceptionally clear.","“What dropped?”","“It seems to have fallen out of the painting! Could it be that there’s a secret behind this ancient painting?”","At this moment, Song Shijing had already put away the painting and was about to walk out with Qiao Xi when a socialite exclaimed, “Ah! What’s this?!”","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and their eyes landed on the floor. They were instantly dumbfounded.","“Wait!” The person’s voice trembled. “Mrs. Gu, come over and take a look!”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled into a smile as she turned around. Shockingly, there was a dazzling ruby necklace lying on the floor. It was the legendary Scorching Heart.","The necklace had slipped out from under the painting. Everyone looked at He Wenxian.","Qiao Xi quickly stepped forward with a gloomy expression. “Chairman He, Miss He, aren’t you going to explain?”","Even if He Wenxian did not say anything, everyone had a guess in their hearts. They all said, “This must be Scorching Heart! Mrs. Gu is the designer of Scorching Heart. She’ll definitely be able to recognize the real Scorching Heart.”","“He Weinian reported President Gu for stealing Scorching Heart. Later on, it turned out that He Tingchen hid the necklace in Longwan Residential. Right on the heels of that, the He family pushed their butler out to take the blame. They said that the necklace had long been sold overseas, but now, the necklace is here...”","“Isn’t that obvious? It’s all the He family’s scheme! He Wenxian stole it while He Tingchen framed President Gu. The siblings joined forces to push the butler out to take the blame. Even if the matter was exposed, the He family wouldn’t lose anything. After all, the necklace is still in their hands. He Tingchen would definitely be able to come out safely.”","He Weinian’s expression gradually turned cold.","At this moment, he finally reacted. Qiao Xi had deliberately used the excuse of being wronged to bring everyone to this room with the goal of making Scorching Heart appear in public!","He Weinian hurriedly explained, “This is a fake! Wenxian likes Scorching Heart very much, so she custom-made one for herself.”","“Chairman He, I’m the creator of Scorching Heart. There’s no need for me to lie in front of me.” Qiao Xi’s expression was serious, and her eyes were filled with disappointment. “Because you’re Ah Zheng’s master, we’ve repeatedly forgiven the He family. We hoped that you could turn over a new leaf and even stop bickering about He Tingchen framing Gu Zheng with you. We even came to attend the banquet, but what did you do?","“Miss Qiao!” He Weinian stopped her coldly.","“What? Am I wrong?” Qiao Xi’s tone was angry. “Then why did the necklace appear in the He family’s residence? Why didn’t the He family take out the necklace to prove Ah Zheng’s innocence when he was wronged?","“Heh! I almost forgot that you were the one who reported Ah Zheng! Everyone in your He family was part of the plan. Did you want to destroy Gu Zheng?”","Everyone could not help but be angry.","He Weinian never expected Scorching Heart to appear here. He could not explain himself and only pretended to be calm. “Miss Qiao, I said that the necklace is fake. If you don’t believe me, we’ll send it for appraisal now!”","Qiao Xi nodded. “Alright! We’ll do as you say, Chairman He!”","“Song Shijing, send the necklace to be appraised personally and invite a famous jewelry appraiser in the country to appraise it. Let everyone see with their own eyes if this is really Scorching Heart!”","“Yes!”","He Weinian’s face was ashen.","Qiao Xi was so confident. Could it be that this necklace was real?","The real necklace had clearly been sold overseas, so how did it appear here? How did Qiao Xi know?","He suddenly looked at He Wenxian. Her face was pale, and her eyes were filled with shock and panic.","Wenxian did not know that the necklace was here either, so there must be a spy in the He family who colluded with Qiao Xi to hide the necklace here!","He had really underestimated Qiao Xi. Because of Wenxian’s few words, Qiao Xi blew the matter up and suggested that everyone look at the paintings. Every step seemed reasonable as if she had foreseen it!","He Weinian had seen too many schemes in his life. In the end, he was schemed against by a young lady. For now, he could only insist that the necklace was fake."]},{"number":1649,"title":"Chapter 1649 Investigating The He Family’s Charity","paragraphs":["1649 Investigating The He Family’s Charity","Qiao Xi looked at the crowd. “Madam Ye, the Ye family is also a jewelry family. Can we invite the Ye family’s appraiser to participate?”","Madam Ye smiled and nodded. “Sure. Actually, in my experience, there’s a high chance that this necklace is real. After all, the rubies used in Scorching Heat are extremely rare. They’re dazzling and colorful. They’re irreplaceable.”","“Chairman He, you insist that this is a fake. When the results are out and it’s proven the necklace is real, I hope you won’t say that the necklace was left in the He family by someone else. No one will believe you then.”","“That’s right! Just now, you said that Miss He likes Scorching Heart and specially custom-made a fake. If it’s the real thing, who are you going to push the blame on?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled into a cold smile as she looked at the man beside her. “Ah Zheng, I’m tired. Let’s go.”","Gu Zheng nodded and held Qiao Xi’s hand as they left. The guests also left one after another. Not long after, only the He family was left in the room.","He Weinian looked at Gu Zheng’s back view as anger surged in his heart. The good student he had raised was pushing him into a fire pit!","He had been scheming for many years, basically his entire life. He could not be ruined by Gu Zheng just like that!","Smack!","He Weinian was too angry, so he slapped He Wenxian hard.","“Why are you hitting Wenxian? She doesn’t know anything!”","As soon as Madam He finished speaking, He Wenxian was slapped hard again.","He Weinian gritted his teeth and shouted, “I told you long ago not to provoke Qiao Xi. Why didn’t you listen?”","If it were not for these two idiots looking for trouble with Qiao Xi, how could her plan have gone so smoothly?","Actually, there was no need to appraise the necklace. He Weinian knew that the necklace must be real because Gu Zheng would not do anything he was not confident in.","When the test results were out, no matter how he explained it, no one would believe him. It would be difficult to protect Wenxian this time.","He took a deep breath tiredly. Why had he been scheming all these years? His son hated him, and his daughter’s reputation was ruined!","...","Two hours later, the results of the test were out. The necklace was indeed Scorching Heart. This matter caused another uproar online.","He Weinian’s report, He Tingchen’s framing, and the He family’s shocking revelation all told everyone that the theft of Scorching Heart was a conspiracy from the beginning.","After a long silence, he said helplessly, “Wenxian, go overseas and hide.”","He Wenxian shuddered, and her eyes instantly turned red. “Dad!”","Madam He was also stunned for a moment. “Hubby, you can’t chase Wenxian away. She was framed!”","He Weinian said coldly, “Who can prove that she was framed? As long as you can’t produce evidence, no one will believe you. The He family’s security system is so high that outsiders can’t enter our collection room at all. How will we explain why the necklace appeared there?”","“Then... Then let’s check the surveillance cameras and find the spy!”","“Since Gu Zheng can do this, he naturally won’t leave any evidence behind. You won’t be able to find anything!” He Weinian’s voice carried a strong warning. “Wenxian, if you’re unwilling to go overseas, you can only stay in the country and be scolded. Moreover, Gu Zheng won’t let you off.”","He Wenxian gritted her teeth, her heart filled with unwillingness.","Madam He also frowned. “Is there no other way? Gu Zheng is your student, after all. Would he harm Wenxian?”","He Weinian narrowed his eyes. He was sure that Gu Zheng would not kill Wenxian, but he would ruin the good reputation the He family had accumulated for many years!","At this moment, the He family’s reputation was damaged, and He Corporation was also affected. The two heirs of He Corporation were both in a predicament. Immediately after, someone online questioned the He family’s charity work all these years. Why was the amount of donations different from the original amount?","There were even people who claimed that the area the He family donated to had not seen any construction works because the funds were not enough. Problems came one after another, and He Weinian’s character was questioned.","The police and the charity department also received a report that they were investigating the He family’s charitable donations in recent years.","Qiao Xi sat in a restaurant and heard the people beside her discussing the He family.","“Could it be that the He family embezzled funds?”","“I heard that He Weinian never planned to sell Scorching Heart, so he stole it and slandered Gu Zheng. Unexpectedly, the matter was exposed, and the young master and young miss of the He family were implicated.”","“He Weinian has been doing charity since 28 years ago. I think he was sincere at first, but after he became famous and prestigious, he became more and more greedy. But why did he suddenly choose to do charity back then?”"]},{"number":1650,"title":"Chapter 1650 One Has To Be Grateful","paragraphs":["1650 One Has To Be Grateful","After the girl finished speaking, the atmosphere suddenly fell silent. Then, a young man said, “Because 28 years ago, Chairman He’s ex-wife and two children died in a car accident. Chairman He’s heart ached, so he donated his and his ex-wife’s assets to build a mountain road.”","Qiao Xi looked up, and Cheng Juan revealed a regretful expression. “Chairman He was really doing charity back then. I’m an orphan he sponsored.","“Back then, it was Chairman He who gave us a chance to learn, but I’m the only one who’s still in contact with Chairman He. There’s no news of those 15 people.”","The two women glanced at Cheng Juan and asked shyly, “Is Chairman He considered your benefactor?”","“That’s right! He was really good in the past. I didn’t expect...” Cheng Juan sighed. “I think he’s kind-hearted, but those two children have malicious intentions. The kids who received President He’s sponsorship are very grateful to him.”","There were a few reporters sitting beside them, and they captured this scene and uploaded it online. Because of Cheng Juan’s words, everyone’s impression of He Weinian changed.","Cheng Juan was a famous jewelry appraiser, after all. There were also documents that showed that he was indeed an orphan sponsored by He Weinian.","The anger in everyone’s hearts dissipated a little. It seemed that He Weinian was a true philanthropist a few years ago and had sponsored many orphans. However, someone raised a question right on the heels of that.","Back then, He Weinian had sponsored 16 orphans. Why was only Cheng Juan speaking up for He Weinian in the end? Where were the other 15?","Even if He Weinian’s reputation was ruined now, he had sponsored those orphans, after all. Couldn’t they stand up for their benefactor?","After scolding He Weinian, the netizens started scolding those orphans for being heartless.","Cheng Juan looked at the comments online with malicious eyes. They did not deserve to be scolded like this. Sooner or later, he would seek justice for his friends!","Qiao Xi knew Cheng Juan’s plan. He wanted to use public opinion to lead the way. Soon, someone would investigate the whereabouts of those 15 people. Then, they would realize that those 15 people had mysteriously disappeared. The reason they disappeared was because they were already dead!","Cheng Juan had 15 lives on his shoulders. He worked for He Weinian and endured humiliation. No one knew how he had survived all these years.","Qiao Xi slowly closed her eyes as her heart ached. He was planning all this alone and shouldering the heavy responsibility of taking revenge. How difficult was it for him?","“Why do you look like you have nothing to live for?” Cheng Juan smiled and sat opposite her. “Qiao Xi, don’t tell me you pity me?”","Qiao Xi slowly opened her eyes with a calm expression. “Mr. Cheng, shouldn’t you be in the He family’s residence now?”","“I’m showing my gratitude. I’m busy helping Chairman He clear his name!”","Cheng Juan’s eyes were malicious as he lowered his voice and said, “Chairman He should be very grateful to me now. He Tingchen and He Wenxian are both good-for-nothings. They can’t help at all when he’s in trouble. On the other hand, if I help him gain goodwill in front of outsiders, he’ll probably want me to be his son!”","Qiao Xi took a sip of coffee. “Cheng Juan, what’s your true age?”","Before Qiao Xi could answer, Cheng Juan immediately changed the topic. “By the way, Master and Master’s wife are here in Li City. They’re holding a banquet for Master’s wife’s birthday tomorrow. Do you know about it?”","Qiao Xi nodded. “Third Brother told me a long time ago that they would celebrate Godmother’s birthday tomorrow.”","...","The next day, an hour before the Qin family’s birthday party began.","Madam Qin looked at the guest list with a gloomy expression. “I didn’t invite Xia Chunyu either! Why is she on the list too?”","At this moment, Qin An walked in. “The butler said that Xia Chunyu was added at the last minute. After all, Xia Corporation is famous in the capital. When Xia Chunyu came, she said that she forgot to bring an invitation. The butler didn’t expect Xia Chunyu to pretend to be a guest, so he wrote her name on it.”","Madam Qin was even more speechless.","“Madam.” Qin Xian advised softly, “We can’t offend the Xia family yet. If Xia Chunyu wants to come, we can’t refuse.”","“I clearly didn’t invite her, yet she still shamelessly came. Do I have to raise my hands to welcome her? I’m already showing her enough respect by not chasing her out!","“Moreover, Xia Chunyu is just an adopted daughter. She used Xia Corporation’s reputation to commit crimes. Now, she even provoked our Qin family!” Madam Qin was indignant, but after a moment, she sighed helplessly. “Forget it. We really can’t offend the capital’s Xia Corporation. That family is terrible!”"]},{"number":1651,"title":"Chapter 1651 The Loving Couple From 20 Years Ago","paragraphs":["1651 The Loving Couple From 20 Years Ago","“We can’t take down a group of people in one go. Jing’an is quite good.” Qin Xian smiled.","Madam Qin’s expression softened a little. “Xia Jingan looks alright, but I don’t believe that Yin Lianyi’s grandson is a good person!”","“Be careful not to cause trouble with your mouth!” Qin Xian covered Madam Qin’s mouth and said in a low voice, “Don’t forget Xi Xi. Her identity is...”","Madam Qin had a look of disdain. “Don’t confuse our Xi Xi with those wolf cubs from the capital’s Xia family. They’re disgusting!”","Qin Xian shook his head helplessly. “Alright, alright! You’re right!”","“Qin An, why are you still standing there? Hurry up and pick Xi Xi up!” Madam Qin was in a better mood now.","Qin An’s expression froze for a moment. “I’ll go right away.”","Seeing Qin An leave, Madam Qin said in a low voice, “Have you told Shuwan?”","“Yes. Back then, the Shu and Situ families declined together, and those people weren’t kind people either. I had no choice but to adopt Shuwan and let her call us ‘Dad’ and ‘Mom’. But now that she’s an adult, we shouldn’t stop her from investigating the Shu family.”","“I’m just afraid that she’ll be rash and cause trouble!”","“Shuwan has always been sensible. She grew up by our side. You should believe her. She deliberately didn’t attend the banquet because she was afraid that the Xia family would recognize her when they came.”","“But even if she can hide for a while, she can’t hide for the rest of her life!” Madam Qin looked worried. “Those people are too detestable. If it weren’t for them seeking personal gain, those families wouldn’t have been ruined and ended up like this!”","The Qin family was famous in the capital. Although they were not a top family, they were still considered a century-old noble family. Now that they were in Li City, the entire city was celebrating. There were many guests, but everyone was curious why the eldest daughter of the Qin family, Qin Shuwan, did not appear, making those young masters a little disappointed.","Qiao Xi arrived at the event location half an hour in advance and went to the inner residence to give Madam Qin a gift.","As soon as she entered, she realized that Madam Qin had a serious expression and looked like she wanted to say something but hesitated. She hurriedly asked, “Godmom, it’s your birthday today. Why are you unhappy?”","“Xi Xi, did Old Madam Yin tell you about the capital?” Madam Qin looked at Qiao Xi in front of her and felt a little sad. She treated Xi Xi and Shuwan as her biological daughters. She did not want the two children to forget their ancestry and their family members who risked their lives to protect them, but she also did not want them to be sad about their past.","She wanted Xi Xi and Shuwan to live happily instead of living in hatred.","Qiao Xi said calmly, “You want to talk about the capital’s Xia Corporation and Yin Lianyi?”","Madam Qin’s heart instantly rose, but after hearing what Yin Lianxin said from Qiao Xi, she was relieved. Fortunately, Old Madam Yin did not tell her everything and only let her know a portion of it. She would not tell Qiao Xi about her most hated past for the time being.","“An uninvited guest came today. She’s the adopted daughter of the Xia family and Yin Lianyi’s precious granddaughter. Her name is Xia Chunyu. Your grandmother and Yin Lianyi are like fire and water. Yin Lianyi naturally hates you, so Xia Chunyu must have ill intentions. You have to be careful.”","She was not afraid of anyone. She was just afraid of ruining her godmother’s birthday party.","Madam Qin hurriedly said, “After the banquet begins, I’ll tell you which one is Xia Chunyu. You don’t have to deliberately hide. You just have to try your best to avoid contact with her.”","Qiao Xi nodded obediently. “I understand.”","The banquet officially began. Madam Qin pointed at Xia Chunyu and gave Qiao Xi a few reminders. Qiao Xi remembered everything.","Right on the heels of that, Qin Xian held Madam Qin’s arm and went on stage. The two of them had been in love for many years, so the guests were extremely envious. “It’s rare to see such a loving couple in a noble family! I’m really envious of Mr. Qin and Madam Qin!”","“That’s right! Just look at their son, Qin An. I can tell that the couple has a good relationship. I heard that Qin An’s medical skills are outstanding at such a young age. He doesn’t fool around and has a gentle temperament. Whoever marries him will be blessed!”","“Speaking of loving couples, I’m reminded of the rich couple from 20 years ago. That’s true love. I remember that the man’s surname is Si, and the woman’s surname is Xia. Unfortunately, the woman died early in the end, and the man’s whereabouts are unknown!”","When everyone heard this, they fell silent. A trace of viciousness flashed past Xia Chunyu’s eyes. She knew who the woman they were talking about was. It was that b*tch, Xia Yunqiu!","She had heard from her grandmother since she was young that her mother committed suicide because Xia Yunqiu stole her lover, so she jumped into the river to commit suicide in a fit of anger. Not only did Xia Yunqiu, the mistress, not feel guilty at all, but she even gave birth to a daughter!"]},{"number":1652,"title":"Chapter 1652 Self-Imposed Restrictions As A Married Man","paragraphs":["1652 Self-Imposed Restrictions As A Married Man","Xia Chunyu’s eyes were filled with maliciousness as she walked forward angrily. The bodyguard at the side hurriedly reminded her, “Miss, Young Master said not to let you fool around.”","She stopped in her tracks and shrunk her neck in fear. But she said indignantly, “If you don’t tell him, how will he know? I just want to teach that b*tch’s daughter a lesson!”","With that, Xia Chunyu ignored the bodyguards and rushed over. The bodyguards were helpless and could only call Xia Jingan after she left. “Young Master, I really can’t stop Miss. She said she wants to teach that b*tch’s daughter a lesson.”","Xia Jingan’s expression instantly darkened. He knew that Xia Chunyu must have gone to look for Xia Yunqiu’s daughter.","“You’ve already reminded her. If she wants to fool around, let her. As for the consequences, she has to bear them herself.”","Xia Jingan said coldly. He had long investigated Qiao Xi. This young lady was not that simple. She was filled with wisdom like Xia Yunqiu. Anyone who provoked her would not have a good ending.","Back then, Xia Yunqiu was smart, decisive, beautiful, and stunning among all the youths in the capital. However, her sister, Xia Zishan, was infamous, jealous, and extremely stupid. She went from a socialite in the capital to a murderer. It was all her fault.","Xia Chunyu and Xia Zishan’s personalities were almost the same. If they continued to fool around, they would end up in a miserable state sooner or later.","At the same time, Xia Chunyu had already arrived at the center of the banquet hall and was looking around. However, her gaze was attracted by a noble and elegant man.","Gu Zheng! She had seen his photo in financial newspapers!","A few years ago, when the Xia family’s business was in crisis, the Gu family of Li City proposed a marriage alliance. As long as she married Gu Zheng, they would provide funds to help the Xia family tide over the crisis. Originally, the two families were already about to get engaged, but when she heard that Gu Zheng was ugly, had a bad temper, and had hidden illnesses, she cried and refused to marry him. After that, this marriage was put on hold.","However, looking at Gu Zheng now, he was handsome and elegant. He even exuded the aura of a gentle gentleman. Those rumors were clearly fake!","If she had not believed those rumors, she would have married Gu Zheng a long time ago and become the high and mighty Mrs. Gu!","At the thought of this, Xia Chunyu could not suppress the feelings in her heart and walked forward. “Mr. Gu, can you dance with me?”","She raised her head arrogantly. She was the daughter of Xia Corporation. Gu Zheng would definitely not refuse her.","“No.”","Gu Zheng’s cold voice sounded. Xia Chunyu was stunned for a few seconds, her eyes filled with surprise.","This man actually rejected her? She was the eldest daughter of the Xia family and a woman many men admired. If he could marry her, he would be able to obtain the Xia family’s protection. She felt that Gu Zheng must be embarrassed, or perhaps he could not let himself go due to Mrs. Gu’s presence.","She was about to speak when Gu Yao hurriedly rushed over. “I’m sorry, Miss. My brother is already married, so it’s not appropriate for him to dance with you.”","Xia Chunyu frowned. So what if he was married? Could that woman be nobler than her?","Xia Chunyu looked at Gu Zheng and said with a smile, “Hello, Mr. Gu. I’m the eldest daughter of the Xia family in the capital, Xia Chunyu.”","As long as she revealed her identity, those men would surround her like flies. Although Gu Zheng would not be as shameless as those men, he would definitely be afraid of the Xia family and agree to dance with her.","Just as Xia Chunyu was feeling proud of herself, Gu Zheng slowly stood up and did not even look at her. Instead, he turned to Gu Yao and said, “Let’s go.”","“Alright!” Gu Yao immediately followed.","Xia Chunyu’s face turned pale. “Mr. Gu, why are you leaving?”","Xia Chunyu, who had never been rejected by a man, was instantly anxious. “This is the first time I’ve invited someone to dance. Could it be that you aren’t willing to give me face? If Mrs. Gu is really charming, she doesn’t have to be afraid of someone snatching you away. Why does she have to restrict you from interacting with other women?”","Gu Yao was speechless. Where did this woman get her confidence from?","Gu Zheng, who was beside her, suddenly stopped in his tracks and turned around slightly. “My wife has never restricted me from interacting with other women. This is a restriction I imposed on myself as a married man.”","Gu Yao immediately echoed, “Yes! My sister-in-law doesn’t restrict my brother. It’s just that my brother loves my sister-in-law too much, so he doesn’t care about interacting with other women.”","Xia Chunyu instantly felt her cheeks burn. It was not that Mrs. Gu was restraining Gu Zheng but that he did not like other women. This was blatant mockery!"]},{"number":1653,"title":"Chapter 1653 The Engagement Was Snatched","paragraphs":["1653 The Engagement Was Snatched","Xia Chunyu was burning with anger. Everyone around her had seen her invite Gu Zheng to dance. Now that she was rejected, countless people were laughing at her behind her back.","The dance was about to start when Xia Chunyu realized that a slim woman was walking over.","Qiao Xi had long seen Xia Chunyu pestering Gu Zheng. She did not want to have a conflict with Xia Chunyu, but she could not just watch that woman seduce her husband!","When Qiao Xi walked in front of everyone, Gu Yao hurriedly greeted, “Sister-in-law, you’re finally here!”","Xia Chunyu sized up Qiao Xi with a burning gaze and stood in front of her angrily. “You’re Mrs. Gu? You’re a little good-looking, but you’re nothing special. You just have good looks.","“As the daughter of the Xia family, I’ve learned etiquette, socializing, chess, calligraphy, and painting since I was young. Can you compare to me? I’m the most suitable person to dance with Mr. Gu!” Xia Chunyu said arrogantly.","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. Xia Corporation in the capital was not much either. Xia Chunyu was clearly a wilful and brainless idiot!","She smiled charmingly. “Being good-looking is also a skill. Are you envious, Miss Xia?”","Xia Chunyu was stunned for a moment. She suddenly felt that Mrs. Gu looked a little familiar when she smiled as if she had seen her somewhere before. She did not have time to think before anger surged. “You b*tch!”","Qiao Xi said with a smile, “Miss Xia, you want to dance with my husband, yet you’re scolding me instead? Aren’t you too unreasonable?”","The moment that was said, the surrounding people echoed, “That’s right! Li City has its own rules. Bringing your wife to the banquet and not dancing with other women is the most basic show of respect for your wife.”","“Do you think you can force others just because you’re the daughter of the Xia family? You clearly know that President Gu has a wife, yet you still specially came over to snatch her husband. Is this the character of a socialite in the capital?”","Xia Chunyu’s bodyguards’ heads were buzzing. Their young master had instructed Miss not to cause trouble, but she still did not care. Not only did she offend Mr. and Mrs. Gu, but she also ruined her reputation.","The surroundings were filled with discussion, and Xia Chunyu’s expression was extremely ugly. She bit her lip and left with a gloomy expression.","Qiao Xi sat on the sofa and raised her eyebrows at the man in front of her. “You sure know how to attract women.”","Gu Zheng was stunned for a moment. His eyes were filled with affection as he laughed heartily. “Since you know that I’m so popular, you should be by my side at all times.”","Qiao Xi glared at him. “If it weren’t for Godmom telling me to try my best not to have a conflict with Xia Chunyu, I would’ve come over to look for you a long time ago!”","Gu Zheng pursed his lips and understood Madam Qin’s intentions. Xia Chunyu was not a kind person. By avoiding conflict with her, Qiao Xi could avoid interacting with the Xia family.","“I heard from Grandma that the old madam of Xia Corporation in the capital is her biological sister, so Old Madam Xia should also be from the Yin family. However, Xia Corporation in the capital doesn’t have any contact with Old Madam Yin now. What exactly happened between them?”","Seeing Qiao Xi’s confusion, Gu Zheng slowly said, “Old Madam Yin didn’t tell you that she was the one who originally wanted to marry into the capital’s Xia Corporation. The Yin and Xia families were long-time friends, so they arranged an engagement after the sisters were born. Old Madam Yin was the elder sister, so she was supposed to marry the young master of the capital’s Xia Corporation. The two of them were engaged when they were seven years old. Later on, with the support of their parents, they went to the same university and were only waiting to get married after graduation.","“At that time, the entire high society knew that she stole my sister’s fiance and became a mistress, so they were unwilling to interact with her. The Yin family rarely contacted her either. After the Xia family’s head passed away, Yin Lianyi took over Xia Corporation. Her status is outstanding, so no one dares to talk about her past anymore.","“What’s even more shameless is that she wasn’t pregnant at all back then. She was just playing tricks to get to where she is today. Back then, this matter was a topic of discussion in the high society. No one expected that decades later, the mistress who was despised by everyone back then became the powerful old madam. The entire capital’s noble families have to be polite to her.”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “Yin Lianyi is unscrupulous in order to achieve her goal, and Xia Chunyu grew up by her side. Looks like their personalities are similar.”","“Xia Chunyu can’t compare to her mother’s madness and methods,” Gu Zheng said indifferently."]},{"number":1654,"title":"Chapter 1654 The Yin Family Will Always Be Her Backer","paragraphs":["1654 The Yin Family Will Always Be Her Backer","“The Xia family has announced to the public that Xia Chunyu is Xia Zishan’s adopted daughter, but only the Xia family knows if she’s an adopted daughter or an illegitimate daughter.","“Xia Chunyu came to the Xia family when she was three years old. Not long after, Xia Zishan committed suicide. However, everyone has been saying that she went missing, so Xia Chunyu probably doesn’t have any impression of her adoptive mother. However, their personalities are quite similar.","“Back then, Xia Zishan was the most powerful socialite in the capital. She was vicious and hired people to kill someone. In the end, the matter was exposed and she became a murderer...”","Qiao Xi felt a chill run down her spine when she heard this. “Xia Zishan and Mom are both Yin Lianyi’s daughters. Why is there such a big difference in personalities?”","Gu Zheng said slowly, “It’s because they grew up in different environments. Your mother grew up by Old Madam Yin’s side, while Xia Zishan grew up under Yin Lianyi’s guidance. They’re naturally incompatible.","“Xia Chunyu is clearly an adopted daughter, but she’s very similar to Xia Zishan. The current head of the Xia family, Xia Jingan, is Xia Zishan’s biological son, but he’s not similar to her at all. He’s not favored either.","“Originally, Yin Lianyi was prepared to give the position of heir of Xia Corporation to Xia Chunyu. Unfortunately, she’s stupid and useless. The shareholders and higher-ups of Xia Corporation jointly submitted a petition to abolish Xia Chunyu’s position. From then on, Xia Jingan controlled Xia Corporation. His reputation has always been good, and his status in the Xia family has been rising.”","“How do you know so much about the Xia family?” Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. She had long investigated the Xia family, but she only found out about what happened in the past few years. It was really strange that Gu Zheng knew about the Xia family’s dirty past.","Gu Zheng said slowly, “My intelligence network has been collecting all kinds of information for many years. As long as I want to investigate, I’ll definitely be able to find clues.”","At this moment, the birthday banquet was about to end. Qiao Xi was a little tired, so she went to the lounge first. After entering, she took out an exquisite velvet box from her bag. Inside was an emerald bracelet.","Grandma said that this was originally a wedding gift for her mother, but in the end, before she could give it away, her mother went missing, so she gave it to her instead.","A lifelike lotus flower was carved in the middle of this bracelet. It was the Yin family’s heirloom. Grandma gave the bracelet to her to tell her that the Yin family would always be her backer.","Qiao Xi was deep in thought when someone suddenly pushed the door open. A gust of wind blew past her ear as a slap landed heavily on her face.","“B*tch, how dare you steal my bracelet?!”","Qiao Xi staggered from the slap, and her cheek burned with pain. When she came back to her senses, she directly slapped the woman opposite her.","Xia Chunyu did not expect Qiao Xi to retaliate. She fell to the floor unguarded and roared angrily, “You hit me?”","Qiao Xi looked at her coldly. “Miss Xia, you hit me first. I was just returning the favor.”","“B*tch! I hit you because you stole my bracelet. Give it to me immediately, or I won’t let you off!”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes to look at the bracelet and sneered. “As the daughter of the Xia family, you barged into my lounge and hit me. The Xia family is really well-educated!”","“Shut up!” Xia Chunyu roared. “I’m the daughter of the Xia family. I can go wherever I want!”","Xia Chunyu pointed at her nose and cursed, “You vixen! You seduced Mr. Gu and even stole my bracelet. A person like you isn’t worthy to be Mrs. Gu!”","As soon as she finished speaking, she reached out with the intention of snatching Qiao Xi’s bracelet.","Qiao Xi nimbly dodged, and Xia Chunyu slipped and fell to the floor.","Ten minutes ago, when Xia Chunyu saw Qiao Xi leave, she secretly followed over with the intention of teaching her a lesson. Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi took out the lotus bracelet.","Xia Chunyu would wear the lotus bracelet every time she attended banquets. However, because today’s gown did not match the bracelet, she put it in her bag. Now, it was gone!","“Miss Xia, my bracelet was given to me by an elder. You just think your bracelet is very similar to mine. It might be two identical bracelets.”","Xia Chunyu flew into a rage. “Nonsense! There’s only one bracelet in the world that my grandmother gave me. It can’t be the same! You stole my bracelet and even lied to me. If you don’t return it to me, I won’t let the matter rest!”","With that, she got up from the floor and ran out angrily.","Qiao Xi suspected that there were two bracelets. Yin Lianxin and Yin Lianyi each had one. Her grandmother had given it to her, while Yin Lianyi had given her bracelet to Xia Chunyu."]},{"number":1655,"title":"Chapter 1655 The Xia Family’s Family Treasure","paragraphs":["1655 The Xia Family’s Family Treasure","Xia Chunyu entered the bathroom and used her foundation to cover the red marks on her face. After that, she came to the banquet hall again.","“Ah, I lost my bracelet!”","Just as everyone was about to leave, they suddenly heard Xia Chunyu’s scream.","Xia Chunyu was the daughter of the Xia family in the capital, after all. Although she was an adopted daughter, she was extremely favored. It was not that they were afraid of Xia Chunyu but that they had heard of Xia Zishan’s crazy past. They knew that the Xia family was not to be trifled with, so they tried their best not to offend her.","After all, it was the Qin family’s banquet. If someone lost something, the Qin family would naturally have to bear the responsibility. Hence, Madam Qin immediately went forward and asked, “Miss Xia, what’s going on?”","!!","“Madam Qin, I lost my bracelet. What do you think we should do about it?” Xia Chunyu’s posture was arrogant, and she looked bossy.","Madam Qin was disgusted. She suppressed the anger in her heart and asked patiently, “Miss Xia, are you sure you lost it at the banquet?”","Xia Chunyu snorted. “Of course! That bracelet was given to me by my grandmother. It’s the Xia family’s heirloom. I brought it with me to ensure its safety. Many people saw me wearing it. Someone must have gotten greedy and stolen my bracelet!”","Madam Qin also remembered that Xia Chunyu had indeed worn an emerald bracelet when she entered and showed it off in front of everyone. However, as it did not match her gown, she later put it in her bag. In that case, she had indeed lost it at the banquet.","Madam Qin looked troubled. “Miss Xia, think carefully about where you’ve been. I’ll send someone to look for it.”","“I was in the banquet hall just now, but...” Xia Chunyu paused. “I went to the wrong lounge and got into a conflict with the person inside. She even slapped me. I lost my bracelet after that.”","Everyone gasped. “Miss Xia, are you saying that someone hit you and stole your bracelet?”","“I’m not sure either. I think it’s best to search for it. After all, my bracelet is expensive. If I can’t find it, I can only call the police.”","Everyone looked helpless and wanted to leave as soon as possible, so they said anxiously, “Miss Xia, who hit you? Call them out to confront you!”","Madam Qin suddenly had a bad feeling. The next second, everyone saw Xia Chunyu pointing at someone not far away while shouting, “It’s her! I just went to the wrong lounge and she slapped me!”","Everyone looked in the direction she was pointing and was instantly stunned.","Mrs. Gu!","After Qiao Xi left the lounge, she was prepared to leave with Gu Zheng. She had just walked to the banquet hall when she heard Xia Chunyu’s roar.","Madam Qin frowned. She believed that it was impossible for Xi Xi to steal anything. Now that Xia Chunyu had publicly pointed her out, she wanted to frame Xi Xi. Before the banquet began, she had instructed Xi Xi not to provoke Xia Chunyu, but in the end, she still did not manage to avoid her.","“Miss Xia, it’s impossible for her to steal your bracelet. As President Gu’s wife, she can buy anything she wants. Why would she steal your bracelet?” Madam Qin said coldly.","Xia Chunyu’s expression instantly darkened. “She can’t buy this bracelet even if she wants to. It’s the Xia family’s heirloom, a unique treasure. That woman must have gotten greedy and stolen it. Search her body!!”","Madam Qin’s tone was serious. “Miss Xia, you have no right to search her body!”","Xia Chunyu looked at the Qin family’s attitude toward her and knew that they must not want to offend Gu Zheng, so they were unwilling to search that woman’s body.","She suppressed her anger and suddenly thought of something. “Maybe I remembered wrongly. I don’t think Mrs. Gu would steal a bracelet.”","Madam Qin was stunned. Why did Xia Chunyu, who was extremely arrogant just now, suddenly stop?","“I misunderstood. I apologize.” Xia Chunyu slowly walked into Qiao Xi and grabbed her bag before anyone could react.","Crash!","The things inside the bag scattered, and an exquisite box appeared in front of everyone. Xia Chunyu quickly snatched the box and opened it. Inside was a bracelet carved with lotus flowers.","“Look! This is my bracelet! She stole my bracelet!”","Qiao Xi snatched the box back. After confirming that there were no cracks on it, she said coldly, “Miss Xia, I told you that this bracelet is mine.”","Now that she had been caught red-handed, this woman was still unwilling to admit it?","“You’re so shameless! When did our Xia family’s heirloom belong to you?” Xia Chunyu shouted in exasperation.","Everyone looked at each other, unable to confirm if what the two of them said was true.","Xia Chunyu was furious. “So many people saw me wearing this bracelet today. How did it become yours? Hurry up and return the bracelet to me!”"]},{"number":1656,"title":"Chapter 1656 Is There Any Reason For Xia Yunqiu’s Daughter To Be Jealous Of You?","paragraphs":["1656 Is There Any Reason For Xia Yunqiu’s Daughter To Be Jealous Of You?","“Mrs. Gu, tell us what’s going on!”","“That’s right! Miss Xia is from the capital’s Xia Corporation. If you really picked up her bracelet, you should quickly return it!”","Everyone stood up to smooth things over, but Qiao Xi insisted, “The bracelet is mine. Miss Xia, if you’re unconvinced, call the police.”","“B*tch! You’re quite arrogant!”","Xia Chunyu cursed angrily. She looked at Qiao Xi’s vixen-like face and was infuriated. Wasn’t the reason Gu Zheng married her that she was a little beautiful? If her face was ruined, would Gu Zheng still like her?","“Just because you’re Mrs. Gu, you stole my bracelet and refuse to return it. You’ve offended the capital’s Xia Corporation. I definitely won’t let you have an easy time! I advise you to be sensible and immediately kneel down and kowtow to me to admit your mistake!”","Qiao Xi raised the bracelet and said with a smile, “Miss Xia, this isn’t the Xia family’s heirloom but the Yin family’s emerald bracelet.”","Xia Chunyu was stunned.","Yin family? Wasn’t that her grandmother’s surname? However, there was no family in the capital with the surname Yin. This woman must have checked her grandmother’s surname to deliberately fool her!","Just as Xia Chunyu was about to retort, a dignified voice came from outside the door. “Xi Xi is right. The bracelet belongs to the Yin family!”","Xia Chunyu’s face was filled with disdain. B*llshit! How could the Yin family compare to the noblest Xia family in the capital?","She looked in the direction of the voice but was stunned when she saw the person’s face. Her body trembled uncontrollably, and her face instantly turned pale. “G-Grandma?”","Why was Grandma in Li City?","No! No! This was not Grandma!","Xia Chunyu broke out in a cold sweat. Grandma would not look at her with such a cold gaze.","At this moment, Madam Qin broke the silence and came forward to greet her. “Old Madam Yin!”","Everyone recovered from their shock. This was the old madam of the Yin family! It seemed that she was here today to support Qiao Xi. After all, Qiao Xi was her granddaughter. Although Xia Chunyu was favored, she was just an adopted daughter.","Yin Lianxin’s cold gaze landed on Xia Chunyu, then she sneered. “Miss Xia, you said that this bracelet is the Xia family’s heirloom. How laughable! When did the Yin family’s heirloom become the Xia family’s?”","At this moment, Xia Chunyu did not care about the person in front of her anymore. She still looked at Qiao Xi with resentment. “But my bracelet is missing. She stole it!”","Yin Lianxin sneered. “Miss Xia, aren’t you curious about why I look exactly like your grandmother?”","She suddenly had a bad feeling. Before she could react, Yin Lianxin said, “Your grandmother probably didn’t tell you that she has a twin sister, right? Back then, my mother carved two bracelets and gave one to each of us. The word ‘intent’ was engraved on the inside of her bracelet, while the word ‘heart’ was engraved on my bracelet.","Xia Chunyu panicked. It turned out that this old madam was Grandma’s biological sister. That bracelet...","At this moment, Madam Qin walked to Qiao Xi’s side and carefully looked at the bracelet. “Yes, the word ‘heart’ is engraved on the inside of Xi Xi’s bracelet. In other words, this is Old Madam Yin’s bracelet.”","Xia Chunyu’s face was pale as tears streamed down her face. She roared unwillingly, “I didn’t know that there were two identical bracelets! I lost my bracelet. Maybe this b*tch is jealous of me and deliberately hid my bracelet!”","“Jealous of you?” Yin Lianxin sneered. “You can go home and ask your grandmother if there’s any reason for Xia Yunqiu’s daughter to be jealous of you.”","Xia Yunqiu’s daughter?","At this moment, Xia Chunyu finally reacted. It turned out that this b*tch was Xia Yunqiu’s daughter, Qiao Xi. Back then, Xia Yunqiu snatched her mother’s lover. This time, Qiao Xi had snatched Gu Zheng. The mother and daughter were vixens who specialized in snatching other people’s men!","The past grudges were intertwined, and Xia Chunyu’s face gradually became ferocious. She roared angrily, “So what if she’s Xia Yunqiu’s daughter? Xia Yunqiu’s father is Xia Cheng. He’s just a member of the declining branch family. Can he be compared to the Xia Corporation in the capital?","“Although I’m an adopted daughter, I’m the only daughter of the Xia family, while Qiao Xi is just an orphan. Even if she has the support of the Yin family, she’s far inferior to me!”","The surroundings were silent. These words were unpleasant, but they made sense. Qiao Xi’s parents were not alive, and the Yin family was indeed not as noble as the Xia family in the capital. Their identities were naturally incomparable."]},{"number":1657,"title":"Chapter 1657 If You Want To Die, I’ll Help You","paragraphs":["1657 If You Want To Die, I’ll Help You","Yin Lianxin looked at Xia Chunyu coldly, and the atmosphere instantly turned cold.","At this moment, Qin An received a call. His expression carried a trace of mockery. Then, he said coldly, “Miss Xia, the servants found your bracelet in the bathroom. Please investigate things clearly the next time you lose something. Don’t malign others.”","After a while, the servants brought the bracelet over.","Xia Chunyu’s expression was extremely ugly, and the surroundings were filled with discussion. “So, it was Miss Xia who left the bracelet in the bathroom, but she maligned Mrs. Gu!”","“How embarrassing! She said that she wanted to call the police and even tried to break Mrs. Gu’s bracelet!”","!!","Xia Chunyu gritted her teeth and roared angrily, “Shut up!”","“Miss Xia, you should apologize to Xi Xi!” Madam Qin looked at her with a gloomy expression. “Don’t think that just because you’re from the capital’s Xia Corporation that you can do whatever you want. Do you really think our Qin family is easy to bully?”","“I’m not apologizing!” There was no such word in Xia Chunyu’s dictionary. She glared at Qiao Xi angrily. “I’m the eldest daughter of the Xia Corporation in the capital. So what if I wronged that b*tch? What right does she have to make me apologize?”","Smack!","As soon as she finished speaking, Yin Lianxin slapped Xia Chunyu hard.","Xia Chunyu was instantly stunned. She shouted in exasperation, “What right do you have to hit me? You’re Grandma’s sister, yet you hit me for that b*tch? Are you crazy?”","Yin Lianxin said coldly, “Don’t let me hear the word ‘b*tch’ again. Xi Xi is my granddaughter. In terms of relatives, Yin Lianyi can be considered her grandmother. You’re just an adopted daughter of the Xia family. What right do you have to scold her?”","Xia Chunyu cried bitterly. “Boo-hoo... I’m going to tell Grandma that you bullied me. The Xia family won’t let you off!”","She had been pampered since she was young and had never been beaten up before this. However, she was actually slapped by Qiao Xi and Yin Lianxin on the same day. Of course, she could not accept it.","“Go back and tell Yin Lianyi. I want to see if she’ll cause trouble for me and Xi Xi for your sake.” Yin Lianxin had a disdainful expression.","Everyone looked at Xia Chunyu in disdain. Her face was covered in tears, and there was a trace of horror in her eyes. She gritted her teeth and said, “Just you wait!”","She picked up her dress and was about to escape when she was stopped by the Qin family’s servants. Madam Qin ordered, “Apologize! Miss Xia, don’t even think about leaving here if you don’t apologize.”","Xia Chunyu had never seen such a scene before. She was so scared that she took two steps back and said unwillingly, “You’re actually making things difficult for the daughter of the Xia family for that b*tch? I’m not apologizing. If you have the ability, kill me! If I’m injured in the slightest, Grandma will definitely not let you off!”","As soon as she finished speaking, a cold man suddenly came from outside the door. “If you want to die, I’ll fulfill your wish. Don’t implicate the Xia family.”","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and saw a young man in a gray suit walking in. His eyes were deep, and his face was cold. His body exuded a biting coldness.","The man walked in front of Yin Lianxin and bowed slightly to her. “Old Madam Yin.”","Old Madam Yin snorted. “Yin Lianyi sure raised a good granddaughter!”","Xia Chunyu’s expression changed drastically. The fearlessness from before instantly vanished, and her body trembled slightly. “Brother...”","Everyone immediately reacted. It turned out that this man was the head of the Xia family, Xia Jingan!","Xia Jingan subconsciously glanced at Qiao Xi, and a trace of abnormality surged in his heart. He said softly, “Miss Qiao, I’m very sorry that my younger sister has caused you trouble. I’ve already prepared an apology gift for you. I hope you can accept it.”","With that, he looked at Xia Chunyu and ordered coldly, “Apologize!”","Xia Chunyu could not stop her tears from flowing, but she did not dare to go against his wishes. She gritted her teeth and said, “S-Sorry.”","Then, Xia Jingan looked at Gu Zheng. “Mr. Gu, I didn’t discipline my sister well. I agree to your previous request.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he glanced coldly at Xia Chunyu. “Let’s go.”","Xia Chunyu followed carefully behind. After leaving, she muttered unwillingly, “Brother, they bullied me. How can you help outsiders?”","Xia Jingan’s eyes turned cold. “Do you know that because of your nonsense, Xia Corporation has to give up 3% profit to Gu Corporation in our collaboration? I told you long ago not to provoke Qiao Xi. Why didn’t you listen?”"]},{"number":1658,"title":"Chapter 1658 I’ll Avenge You","paragraphs":["1658 I’ll Avenge You","Xia Chunyu was instantly angry when she heard this. “Why are you all protecting that b*tch? Just because she has the face of a vixen? That b*tch! She’s a b*tch who seduces men! How is she worthy of Gu Zheng?!”","“Xia Chunyu, pay attention to your identity. Don’t be so vulgar with your words. They’re disgusting.” Xia Jingan looked at her without the slightest pity. Instead, he was filled with impatience. “If you dare to fool around and ruin my business again, I’ll let you have a taste of my methods.”","Xia Chunyu instantly shut up as cold sweat trickled down her face.","Xia Jingan ignored her and got into the car to leave. Xia Chunyu watched as the car sped away. She was so angry that her entire body was trembling. She hurriedly took out her phone and cried, “Grandma!”","“A b*tch bullied me, yet my brother is protecting an outsider. Help me kill her. Kill her to avenge me!”","When Yin Lianyi heard her granddaughter cry, her voice instantly softened. “Don’t cry! Tell me who bullied you.”","Xia Chunyu was the adopted daughter of the Xia family, but...","Even if she was just an adopted daughter, she was still the daughter of the Xia family. Yin Lianyi would not allow anyone to challenge the Xia family’s authority and bully her precious granddaughter.","Xia Chunyu immediately complained, “Grandma, that b*tch’s name is Qiao Xi. She’s Gu Zheng’s wife. I was originally engaged to Gu Zheng. What right does that woman have to marry him? She even slapped me!”","When Yin Lianyi heard Qiao Xi’s name, she instantly fell silent. It was as if a huge rock was stuck in her throat, and she could not say a word.","Xia Chunyu was still crying on the other end of the phone. “I hate her face. She’s a b*tch who seduces men. Grandma, get someone to ruin her face. Let’s see how she can seduce men then.”","“Grandma?” Xia Chunyu had spoken for a long time but realized that Yin Lianyi never responded, so she hurriedly called out.","Yin Lianyi held her cell phone tightly. Qiao Xi was Xia Yunqiu’s daughter and her biological granddaughter. She had long known of Qiao Xi’s existence, but she had never asked about it. As long as she did not pay attention, no one would know that she had abandoned a daughter and she would not be criticized. It was just that she did not expect that the person who bullied Chunyu was Qiao Xi.","“Chunyu, forget it.”","Xia Chunyu, who thought that she had found a backer, was instantly stunned. Her voice was hoarse. “Why?”","She was thinking about how to disfigure Qiao Xi and snatch away Mrs. Gu’s position, but her grandmother actually told her to let it slide?","Xia Chunyu suddenly recalled Yin Lianxin’s words. ‘Go back and tell Yin Lianyi. I want to see if she’ll cause trouble for me and Xi Xi for your sake.’","She thought that her grandmother would stand on her side unconditionally, but reality slapped her hard.","Xia Chunyu’s tears trickled down. “Grandma! I’m the eldest daughter of the Xia family. That b*tch bullied me. Why are you and Brother protecting her?”","“About this...” Yin Lianyi had a difficult expression. Back then, she abandoned Xia Yunqiu. If news of this got out, it would not be pleasant. If she went to look for trouble with Yin Lianxin and Qiao Xi now, they would definitely expose what had happened back then. At that time, she would be the one losing her dignity!","Xia Chunyu sniffled and choked. “Alright, Grandma, you must avenge me!”","After hanging up, Xia Chunyu’s eyes were filled with resentment.","Ten minutes later, Xia Jingan received a call from Yin Lianyi. Her vicious voice sounded. “Jingan! How dare you help outsiders bully Chunyu? Do you still have any respect for me? I can let this matter go, but if you let Chunyu suffer again, I definitely won’t let you off!”","Xia Jingan’s assistant frowned when he heard this.","Old Madam Qin was biased toward Xia Chunyu. Every time Xia Chunyu suffered a little, she would scold the young master. If the young master had not personally gone to the banquet to bring Xia Chunyu back, would Madam Qin and Mr. Gu have let her off?","Xia Jingan’s eyes were calm as he asked indifferently, “Xia Chunyu cried and complained to you?”","Yin Lianyi roared, “She was wronged! What’s wrong with her crying and complaining to me? Jingan, you’re her brother. How can you protect outsiders?”","“Is Qiao Xi considered an outsider?” Xia Jingan asked coldly.","Old Madam Xia instantly choked.","Did he know something? Did he know that Qiao Xi was Yin Lianxin’s granddaughter, or did he know Qiao Xi’s relationship with her?","Old Madam Xia took a deep breath and calmed down. “Jingan, she’s indeed not an outsider, but Chunyu is the younger sister who grew up with you. How could you just watch her suffer?”"]},{"number":1659,"title":"Chapter 1659 About Your Background","paragraphs":["1659 About Your Background","“Xia Chunyu probably didn’t tell you what exactly happened. She slandered Qiao Xi for stealing the lotus bracelet, but Qiao Xi’s bracelet was given to her by Madam Yin Lianxin. Xia Chunyu spouted nonsense at the Qin family’s birthday party and offended Madam Qin, Gu Zheng, and even Old Madam Yin. If I had protected her, it’d be very difficult for her to walk out of the Qin family today. Do you really want the matter to blow up?","“You should know what kind of person Gu Zheng is. Xia Chunyu offended him, and as a result of that, she might die for no reason one day. How long do you think the Xia family can protect Xia Chunyu?","“I asked her to apologize to Qiao Xi because I want to let the matter rest. She can’t go around causing trouble just because she’s the eldest daughter of the Xia family. There’s always someone in this world she can’t afford to offend. Does she even know the consequences of causing trouble in Gu Zheng’s territory?!”","Xia Jingan said calmly. The assistant beside him was stunned.","The young master actually refuted the old madam for the first time. Every word he said made sense. It seemed that the young master was finally going to resist!","!!","Yin Lianyi roared, “Xia Jingan!”","“Grandma, I’m very busy. I’ll hang up first.” Xia Jingan hung up mercilessly.","The assistant at the side was curious. “Young Master, why are you...”","Xia Jingan pinched the space between his eyebrows tiredly. “I think I’ve discovered some secrets.”","After the birthday party ended, Old Madam Yin and Qiao Xi walked to the door together. She held Qiao Xi’s hand and said earnestly, “Xi Xi, there are some things you can’t avoid. You have to face them.”","Qiao Xi knew what Old Madam Yin meant. The grudge between her and the Xia family had to be revealed one day. Instead of hiding, it was better to face it head-on.","“No matter what difficulties you encounter, you can look for me at any time.” With that, Old Madam Yin seemed to have thought of something and suddenly asked, “By the way, you and Gu Zheng have been married for so long. When are you planning to hold a wedding?”","The moment that was said, Gu Zheng was stunned.","Wedding?","Old Madam Yin was reminding him that he had not given Xi Xi a wedding yet. It was not that he did not want to hold it, but Xi Xi had been waiting for the divine physician to return. Now that he was about to go to the capital, it was time to prepare for the wedding.","Qiao Xi fell into deep thought and followed Gu Zheng into the car.","...","The next day.","Gu Zheng had just brought Qiao Xi back from university. As soon as he entered, Uncle Sheng rushed over. “Young Madam, a gentleman wants to see you. He stood outside the door for two hours. I really couldn’t stand it anymore, so I could only get someone to bring him to the living room to wait.”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment. Who was in such a rush to see her?","“Who is it?”","“He didn’t say his name. He just said that you know him, but I’ve never seen him before. He doesn’t look like a bad person.” Uncle Sheng had been in Longwan Residential for so many years and had seen most of the dignitaries in Li City, but he didn’t know this person, which meant that this person was very likely not from Li City.","The man in the living room had a cold expression and a straight back. He was elegant and leisurely. He did not look like he had been waiting for more than three hours.","Seeing Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng enter, Xia Jingan slowly stood up. “Mrs. Gu, Mr. Gu.”","“Sit.” After Qiao Xi finished speaking, she and Gu Zheng sat opposite Xia Jingan.","“Young Master Xia, why are you here today? If it’s because of Miss Xia, there’s no need to talk anymore.”","Xia Jingan’s tone was gentle. “No, it’s about you.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes turned cold.","“It’s about your background.”","As soon as these words were spoken, Qiao Xi’s pupils constricted.","Xia Jingan went straight to the point. “From your reaction, you must already know your background. Your mother, Xia Yunqiu, is my biological aunt.”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. “Oh... You’re Xia Zishan’s son.”","“Yes,” Xia Jingan said calmly. “I’m her only son, and Xia Chunyu is her adopted daughter. My father’s identity is unknown, so I took my mother’s surname.”","“What’s the point of telling me this?”","Xia Jingan said slowly, “You’re Xia Yunqiu’s daughter and the daughter of the Xia family. Your identity is nobler than Xia Chunyu’s. Are you willing to return to the Xia family?”","Qiao Xi curled her lips. “Is this Old Madam Xia’s idea?”","“It’s Grandma’s idea,” Xia Jingan replied truthfully.","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. Back then, Yin Lianyi abandoned her mother and naturally hated her. Why would she let her return to the Xia family as the daughter of the Xia family? Then what should Xia Chunyu do?","Didn’t Yin Lianyi dote on Xia Chunyu very much? Could she bear to let Xia Chunyu suffer?","“I’m unwilling,” Qiao Xi replied unhurriedly."]},{"number":1660,"title":"Chapter 1660 Do You Want A Wedding?","paragraphs":["1660 Do You Want A Wedding?","Xia Jingan looked into her eyes and knew that she already understood what he meant. This younger cousin of his was indeed very smart. She was much better than that idiot, Xia Chunyu. She could understand even without him saying it directly. “Alright, I’ll take my leave.”","Qiao Xi also felt that it was very easy to talk to him and nodded slightly at him. “Uncle Sheng, send Young Master Xia out.”","After Xia Jingan left, Gu Zheng said, “The Xia family is going to attack you.”","“On the surface, Young Master Xia is here to test me on the orders of his elders, but he’s actually reminding me to be careful of the Xia family. It seems that Yin Lianyi has heard that rumor and wants my blood!”","Logically speaking, Yin Lianyi hated her. Why would she persuade her to return to the Xia family in the capital? It must be because she could get some benefits out of it. The only thing Yin Lianyi cared about was probably her blood!","“Ah Zheng, I suddenly have a guess.” Qiao Xi had a serious expression. “Do you think it’s possible that Kang Jichuan is Xia Zishan’s son? According to the timeline, it’s absolutely impossible for Kang Jichuan to be my mother’s child, but his eyebrows are slightly similar to my mother’s. Moreover, I think with my mother’s taste, she wouldn’t have taken a liking to a man like Kang Ru!”","She still remembered her grandmother saying that when her mother and her lover got married, they were forcefully separated by Kang Ru. Could all of this have been set up by Xia Zishan?","Xia Zishan took advantage of Kang Ru’s noble status in Y Nation to forcefully keep Qiao Xi’s mother by his side. This way, Xia Zishan could be with her mother’s original lover!","This realization caused Qiao Xi’s scalp to go numb. She even got involved in such a scheme for a man?","Xia Zishan was really too crazy!","At night, Qiao Xi lay on the bed without the slightest trace of sleepiness.","There was a knock on the door, and Xiao Lan’s voice sounded. “Young Madam, the president wants you to go down.”","Qiao Xi got up and walked downstairs. The living room was a little dark, but the dining area was bright. The man stood at the door and looked at her with gentle eyes.","There were all kinds of food on the table, and the freshest lilies were in a vase. Qiao Xi’s favorite incense was lit beside it, making the atmosphere extremely romantic.","Gu Zheng gentlemanly pulled out a chair and invited her to take a seat. His voice was low and hoarse. “Xi Xi, do you want a wedding?”","Under the gentle lights, the man’s face was well-defined and sharp. His eyes were as bright as stars, and his thin lips were slightly pursed. His deep light brown eyes were staring straight at her, making her heart beat like a drum.","“Old Madam Yin is right. We’ve been married for so long but haven’t held a wedding. We should hold a wedding. What do you think?”","Ever since Old Madam Yin mentioned the wedding, Gu Zheng had been fantasizing about Qiao Xi wearing a wedding dress. She would definitely be stunningly beautiful.","He even wanted to order a few more sets of wedding gowns of different styles for Qiao Xi to wear. He said anxiously, “I’ll start preparing now. We’ll hold the wedding in a month, alright?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with excitement and anticipation. “Where do you want to hold the wedding? I’ll get Song Shijing to arrange it.","“I’ve already prepared the ring. What other requests do you have?”","Gu Zheng had always been a man of few words and rarely asked so many questions, but there were many things to prepare for a wedding. The dignified President Gu of Gu Corporation actually felt a little flustered right now.","Qiao Xi hurriedly held his hand. “Let’s eat first. We’ll slowly discuss it tomorrow.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with joy. “You agree?”","Qiao Xi nodded. She rarely saw Gu Zheng reveal a happy expression. His expression had always been indifferent, but at this moment, he was really happy like a child who had eaten candy.","“I have time tomorrow. I’ll bring you to try on the wedding dress, okay?”","“Alright, I’ll see if there’s anything I like.”","The next morning, Qiao Xi was pulled up from bed by Gu Zheng. The two of them arrived at Li City’s most upscale wedding dress shop. The sales assistants received a notice early in the morning that President Gu and Mrs. Gu were coming to choose a wedding dress. They specially cleared the venue to serve them.","“Mrs. Gu, what do you think of this wedding dress? It’s a new dress from this year. It was simply custom-made for you!” the designer introduced.","Gu Zheng pointed at the wedding dress. “Try this one.”","As soon as President Gu spoke, the entire wedding dress studio immediately became busy. Someone went to get the wedding dress, while someone prepared a veil and brought Qiao Xi into the dressing room. They quickly helped Qiao Xi style her hair.","Gu Zheng sat on the sofa and waited. His expression was calm, but his heart was beating faster and faster."]},{"number":1661,"title":"Chapter 1661 Rich And Wilful","paragraphs":["1661 Rich And Wilful","The white curtain was pulled open, and a young woman appeared in front of him in a pure white wedding dress. Her petite face was covered by light makeup, and a thin veil covered her dark hair. The layers in her skirt bloomed like white roses, and her slender and fair fingers were crossed over her stomach. Her eyes were like stars that flickered, making one indulge in them, only to find that it was impossible to extricate oneself.","At this moment, time seemed to have stopped. Gu Zheng looked at Qiao Xi in front of him in a daze. He could only hear his own heartbeat.","The staff members quietly left to give the two of them some privacy. Gu Zheng could not help but chuckle. His voice was hoarse. “You’re very beautiful.”","Qiao Xi smiled and said, “I think it’s not bad either. I’ll take this.”","Gu Zheng nodded. “Buy this set first. I’ve asked Song Shijing to contact world-renowned wedding designers. They’ll come up with the designs soon. You can choose a few more sets then.”","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. “Why should I buy so many wedding gowns? There’s nowhere to put them!”","“That’s true.” Gu Zheng was deep in thought. Then, he called Song Shijing. “Immediately tidy up a room to store Young Madam’s wedding dresses.”","Qiao Xi: “...” He was rich and wilful!","At the He family’s villa.","The He family announced to the public that they had already sent He Wenxian overseas, but He Wenxian refused to leave. She hid in the He family’s villa and read the curses online. She was utterly dispirited.","“Wenxian!” Madam He rushed in. “Pack your luggage and go overseas immediately!”","He Wenxian’s eyes revealed resentment. Sending her overseas meant that the family was abandoning her to protect themselves. She had done so much for this family, but she was abandoned just like that!","“Ah Zheng isn’t even pursuing the matter anymore, so why should I go overseas?” He Wenxian questioned unwillingly.","Madam He looked troubled. “Wenxian, you have to understand your father. The He family is in the middle of the storm now. Gu Zheng isn’t pursuing the matter now, but once the matter blows up, the He family will bear the huge consequences. For the sake of the overall situation, go overseas and lie low.”","“Then when can I come back?”","Madam He hurriedly said, “When everyone forgets about this matter, we’ll bring you back.”","Her eyes flashed as she felt a little guilty. If He Weinian wanted to take Qiao Xi’s blood, he could not let others have something on him. Hence, Wenxian would not be able to come back for a while.","He Wenxian’s voice was sharp. “You’re lying! You don’t plan on bringing me back at all. You want to chase me overseas. Do you think I’m useless now?”","“Keep your voice down!” Madam He looked out of the door. “Wenxian, calm down.”","He Wenxian suddenly laughed with a crazy expression. “I know why my father wants Qiao Xi’s blood. He’s done many evil deeds in his life and caused the deaths of so many orphans. Isn’t it all for the sake of studying that medicine?","“I’ve been helping Dad since I was young while my brother lives a carefree life. There’s no blood on his hands. He’s the most innocent because Dad can’t bear to let him know about those dirty things!” He Wenxian’s eyes were filled with heartache. “We’re both children of the same mother. Why should he sacrifice me?","“In Dad’s eyes, I’m just a chess piece. The He family’s business has to be left to He Tingchen, and I don’t have a share at all!”","He Wenxian’s eyes were bloodshot. “He Tingchen was locked up in the police station, but Dad tried his best to save him. I only made a small mistake, yet he wants to send me overseas. I’ve been planning for so long, but I ended up like this. The whole family has already decided to abandon me!”","Madam He’s expression gradually darkened. “Wenxian, what nonsense are you talking about?! You’re our daughter. How could we abandon you? You’re just going overseas to lie low. After your father’s plan succeeds, he’ll definitely bring you home!”","At this moment, Madam He had also lost her patience. She could not bear to part with her daughter, but she would not allow her daughter to stay and ruin that plan.","He Wenxian’s eyes were filled with resentment, and her voice suddenly calmed down. “Alright! I agree to go overseas. Anyway, even if I don’t leave, Dad will force me to leave!”","Madam He’s heart could not help but ache when she saw her sad expression. She wanted to reach out and touch her face, but He Wenxian coldly dodged her hand. “Leave. I’m going to pack my luggage.”","At this moment, He Wenxian’s phone rang.","“Miss He, Mr. Gu and Mrs. Gu are preparing to hold a wedding. Will you attend?”","He Wenxian’s face instantly turned pale.","Qiao Xi had caused her to leave the country dejectedly, yet she still wanted to hold a high-profile wedding with Gu Zheng?","What right did she have?","The resentment in He Wenxian’s eyes was about to overflow. She gritted her teeth."]},{"number":1662,"title":"Chapter 1662 Gu Zheng’s Scandal","paragraphs":["1662 Gu Zheng’s Scandal","After a long time, He Wenxian suddenly laughed. Her expression gradually became crazy like she was a prisoner on the verge of death.","She had worked hard for so many years for the He family, but in the end, she still could not compare to He Tingchen. That soft-hearted and incompetent fool was useless. Why did her parents insist that he inherit the family business? Just because he was a man?","Back then, her father was just a poor boy. It was because he had hooked up with the daughter of a rich family and married into the Fang family that he gradually came to have his current family business. However, after his career was successful, the first thing he did was repay kindness with ingratitude by killing his wife’s entire family. He could even kill his infant child, so of course, his daughter was not important!","He Weinian had been planning all these years just to get Qiao Xi’s blood. If she got rid of Qiao Xi and ruined this plan, how angry would He Weinian be?","...","A few days later.","Qiao Xi decided to personally design a wedding dress. It was not that she did not find a satisfactory wedding dress, but she just felt that she would only get married once in her life. As a fashion designer, she hoped to personally design a wedding dress that belonged to her. It could also be used for collection.","She had just picked up a pen to outline the lines when Xiao Lan suddenly knocked on the door. “Young Madam.”","“What is it?” Qiao Xi asked.","“Assistant Song called and said that the president is going to the capital for a business trip. He left in a hurry and should be on the plane now.”","Qiao Xi pursed her lips. “Why didn’t he call me?”","“Assistant Song said that the president called you but you didn’t pick up. They were anxious, so they called the villa.”","Qiao Xi turned on her cell phone and saw that there were indeed a few missed calls. However, her cell phone was on silent mode and she did not hear them.","“Did something happen that he’s in such a rush to go to the capital?” Qiao Xi asked.","“I’m not too sure either. I heard from Song Shiyu that it’s a very important business,” Xiao Lan replied.","Qiao Xi seemed to be lost in thought, but she had a bad feeling.","The plane from Li City to the capital was only two hours long. Qiao Xi had sent Gu Zheng a message, but two hours later, Gu Zheng still did not reply. She could not get through to Song Shiyu and Song Shijing either.","She turned on her computer and found Gu Zheng’s location through his phone. She realized that he was in a clubhouse in the capital. It was where the big shots of the business world gathered. Most of the businessmen in the capital went there to discuss business.","Qiao Xi heaved a sigh of relief.","At night, Qiao Xi’s phone suddenly rang. She hurriedly picked it up and heard Gu Yao’s voice. “Has Gu Zheng contacted you?”","“His scandal with Ji Tian is trending now. Many people are asking me about the situation. Didn’t you see it?” Gu Yao’s voice was filled with anger.","Qiao Xi hurriedly went online, and eye-catching headlines immediately came into view.","[Ji Tian and Gu Zheng are together. Their postures are intimate!]","[The handsome and rich president and the noble lady of the entertainment industry!]","There were a few photos below the headlines. The two of them were seen chatting in the clubhouse and getting into a car together. From the angle, the woman seemed to be holding his arm. They were indeed in intimate postures.","Right on the heels of that, countless people discussed their relationship online. They were university classmates and had been good friends for many years. They appeared at a clubhouse in the capital together and left in a car after the gathering ended.","Qiao Xi’s face was a little pale. She trusted Gu Zheng, but she would definitely feel uncomfortable now that such a thing had happened. Moreover, the woman in the photo was smiling brightly as she raised her head to look at Gu Zheng. Gu Zheng happened to lower his eyes as if their eyes were meeting. No wonder the netizens said that they were intimate.","She had heard of Ji Tian. She was a singer in the entertainment industry. She had a sweet voice and a cute appearance. She was called the nation’s younger sister. At the same time, she was also the eldest daughter of the Ji family in the capital.","Qiao Xi was silent for a moment before calling Qingfeng’s public relations department. “Remove the trending topics no matter how much it costs.”","The staff of the public relations department replied while trembling, “Young Master Gu Yao has already made a move, but the other party clearly came prepared and the trending topics reappeared soon after.”","Qiao Xi was instantly stunned. For the sake of spreading the scandal between Gu Zheng and Ji Tian, they did not hesitate to spend such a large sum of money. Was it Ji Tian’s idea, or was it someone else?","The next day, the news about Gu Zheng and Ji Tian was still on the top trending list. During this period, Gu Zheng did not call back.","The uneasiness in Qiao Xi’s heart grew stronger.","Not long after, photos were exposed online again. Not only were Gu Zheng and Ji Tian in a car, but they even entered the hotel together.","Public opinion was everywhere online. Some congratulated Ji Tian for being able to date a handsome and rich man like Gu Zheng, but at the same time, there were also people who expressed their doubts.","Wasn’t Gu Zheng already married?"]},{"number":1663,"title":"Chapter 1663 I Won’t Be Affected By A Woman","paragraphs":["1663 I Won’t Be Affected By A Woman","Even though Qiao Xi trusted Gu Zheng, she could not help but feel bitter in her heart when she saw those photos. After nearly two days of torture, Qiao Xi finally called Gu Zheng.","“Hello.” The man’s voice was extremely cold.","Qiao Xi’s throat was slightly bitter, and her emotions were extremely complicated. Her voice trembled slightly as well. “Gu... Gu Zheng.”","Gu Zheng’s voice was very calm. “Yes, what’s the matter?”","Hearing his question, Qiao Xi did not know what to say anymore. She could clearly sense that Gu Zheng’s emotions were very strange, and he seemed to be a little perfunctory.","After a long silence, she slowly asked, “Are you with Ji Tian?”","“Mhm.”","Qiao Xi’s heart could not help but ache. “Have you seen the news online?”","“No, I’m very busy.” Gu Zheng took a deep breath and lowered his voice. “Mrs. Gu, I have something very important to attend to now. I’ll handle it quickly. It won’t be convenient for me to answer your calls these few days. I’ll contact you when I’m done.”","“Gu...” Qiao Xi had just said one word when the sound of the call being hung up sounded in her ears. Her heart instantly fell to the bottom.","Gu Zheng had never been so cold to her. Even if there really was trouble, he would patiently comfort her. However, his tone was filled with perfunctoryness as if he was unwilling to speak to her.","At this moment in the capital.","Gu Zheng’s expression was cold, and his voice carried a chill. “Old Master Brook, I’ve already said what I should. I’ll take my leave first.”","“Was the person who called just now Mrs. Gu?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes instantly turned cold.","The old man in front of him was the current head of the Brook family. Ever since the previous head of the family disappeared, he had ascended to a high position and gradually became the most powerful person in the Brook family.","“Mr. Gu, you’re a smart person. How can you be hampered by love? You and Huo Yuzhou have both been bewitched by this woman. She’s just a little girl. Is there a need for you to put in so much effort?”","A trace of killing intent flashed past Old Master Brook’s eyes. “You have to know that our collaboration has to be foolproof. If that woman affects our plan, then don’t blame me for being heartless.”","Gu Zheng’s heart trembled, but his expression remained cold. He sneered. “I won’t be affected by a woman. I like her, but I definitely won’t allow her to affect my career.”","Old Master Brook’s eyes narrowed slightly. He recalled Gu Zheng’s attitude toward Qiao Xi just now. It seemed to be very perfunctory. He was probably thinking too much. That woman had already fallen out of favor.","Gu Zheng said casually, “Huo Yuzhou was influenced by Qiao Xi, which can only mean that he’s useless. Why blame a woman? Moreover, he hasn’t seen Qiao Xi for many years and doesn’t have much feelings for her anymore. There’s no need for him to ruin his future for Qiao Xi.”","Old Master Brook’s old eyes became sharp. “Mr. Gu, it looks like you do have feelings for Qiao Xi, but don’t forget that she’s from the Situ family! The Situ and Shu families are both our enemies!”","With that, Gu Zheng turned around and left. Ye Qingyuan was waiting in the car. Seeing that he was back, he heaved a sigh of relief. “You’re finally out.”","“I’m fine, Qingyuan. You have to help me keep it a secret. Don’t let Xi Xi know about the capital for the time being. I don’t want her to be involved.” Gu Zheng pinched the space between his eyebrows tiredly.","“But the divine physician is Qiao Xi’s grandfather. Aren’t you going to tell her about this?” Ye Qingyuan asked with a frown.","“The divine physician is in a dangerous situation now. Telling Xi Xi will only add to her worries. Moreover, there are too many dangers hidden in the capital. I have to eliminate some of them for her. Since the Brook family is targeting her, let’s start with them.”","Ye Qingyuan looked at Gu Zheng’s eyes which were filled with killing intent and sighed in his heart. The head of the Brook family could have provoked anyone, but he just had to attack Qiao Xi. Wasn’t this equivalent to taking Gu Zheng’s life?","“By the way, the Ji family...” When Ye Qingyuan spoke, the car had already stopped at the entrance of a private hospital. Ji Tian, who was dressed exquisitely, walked over with a smile. “Ah Zheng, Qingyuan, you’re finally here.”","Gu Zheng and Ye Qingyuan nodded at her, then the three of them entered the hospital together.","The dean brought Doctor Jiang to welcome them. “Mr. Gu, Mr. Ye, his condition is very bad now. We were busy saving him for the entire night before he finally survived.”","Gu Zheng’s heart trembled. Ji Tian, who was at the side, hurriedly said, “Grandpa Shang is a good person. He’ll be fine.”","The dean had a serious expression. “His injuries are too serious. Not only is he suffering from knife wounds, but he’s also poisoned. Fortunately, his physique is very strong, so he managed to survive. It looks like the other party wanted to kill him!”"]},{"number":1664,"title":"Chapter 1664 You Don’t Even Have The Chance To Be A Mistress","paragraphs":["1664 You Don’t Even Have The Chance To Be A Mistress","Ji Tian suddenly became nervous, and a vicious glint burst out of her eyes. She did not expect the damned old man to really come back to life. However, this was good too. She would have a chance to get close to Gu Zheng and Ye Qingyuan.","Although she looked glorious on the surface, she was actually just the illegitimate daughter of the Ji family and was not liked by others. She spent so much effort to please Gu Zheng and Ye Qingyuan just to have a place in the Ji family.","So what if she was an illegitimate daughter? As long as she got close to Gu Zheng, everyone would think highly of her!","...","Li City.","Qiao Xi had been filled with sorrow these past few days. She lost her inspiration as she looked at the wedding dress design.","Suddenly, Xiao Lan rushed in. “Young Madam, that woman from the Xia family is here!”","Xia Chunyu?","Qiao Xi sneered. “I’m not seeing her.”","Xiao Lan immediately went downstairs and replied, “Our young madam doesn’t want to see you. Leave.”","“Who do you think you are? How dare you stop me?” Xia Chunyu reached out and pushed Xiao Lan, but Xiao Lan stood in front of her.","Smack!","Xia Chunyu was used to being arrogant. She raised her hand and slapped Xiao Lan. Xiao Lan had worked in Longwan Residential for a year. The president and Young Madam had never said anything harsh to her, but she was slapped by an outsider. Her eyes instantly turned red.","“B*tch!” Xia Chunyu shouted, “If you dare to stop me again, I’ll beat you to death!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Xia Chunyu suddenly felt a sharp pain in her wrist. Before she could see who it was, she was slapped hard on the face. She could not help but scream. “Ah!”","Qiao Xi flung her hand away fiercely. Xia Chunyu’s head was heavy as she fell to the floor and shouted fiercely, “Qiao Xi! You hit me for a servant?”","“Xiao Lan, call the police!” Qiao Xi said coldly.","Xia Chunyu shouted in exasperation, “Alright! Call the police! I’m the eldest daughter of the Xia family. If you hit me, I’ll make you stay in jail forever!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were cold. “You hit Xiao Lan first. I only hit you to stop you. Moreover, Miss Xia, you’re trespassing on private property. Is it wrong for me to call the police to arrest you?”","Xia Chunyu widened her eyes. “She’s just a cheap servant. So what if I slapped her? So what if I kill her?”","“Alright, Young Madam.”","Seeing this, Xia Chunyu hurriedly rushed over and snatched Xiao Lan’s phone. She smashed it on the floor angrily and roared at Qiao Xi, “Qiao Xi! You’ve already been abandoned by Gu Zheng. What right do you have to fight me?!”","As soon as these words were spoken, the eyes of Xiao Lan and the butler turned cold. Only Qiao Xi had a calm expression.","“You’ve seen the rumors online, right? Gu Zheng and Sister Ji Tian had a meal together in the capital and even entered a hotel. With Gu Zheng’s methods, if he doesn’t want to acknowledge Sister Ji Tian’s identity, he can completely remove these rumors from the internet. However, their photos are still online. This means that he’s no longer interested in you!”","To be honest, the rumors online did make Qiao Xi feel sad, but she believed in Gu Zheng. He must have his own difficulties.","Qiao Xi’s eyes carried a trace of ridicule. “Even if Gu Zheng has really abandoned me, I’m still Mrs. Gu. Miss Ji is just a mistress. She’ll be despised by everyone. Meanwhile, you don’t even have a chance to be a mistress.”","As soon as these words were spoken, Xia Chunyu instantly exploded. “Qiao Xi! You b*tch! Gu Zheng will divorce you sooner or later!”","“Heh!” Qiao Xi sneered. “Miss Xia, you probably don’t know yet, but Gu Zheng has long transferred Longwan Residential to my name. Moreover, once we divorce, he’ll have to give me half of all his assets. Do you think he’ll give up on these for Miss Ji?","“Whether he likes Ji Tian or not, I’m the legitimate Mrs. Gu now. If I’m angered and the news goes online, the entire internet will scold them for being an adulterous pair. I can take half of his assets and live a glorious life alone. Who do you think will be the final winner?”","Xia Chunyu’s eyes were filled with shock. This b*tch could actually take half of Gu Zheng’s assets?","“Impossible! With Gu Zheng’s methods, how could he let you snatch his assets? Just wait to be an abandoned wife of a rich family!” Xia Chunyu said excitedly.","Qiao Xi chuckled. “Miss Xia, why are you so agitated? Could it be that you think that if Gu Zheng leaves me now and gets together with Ji Tian, he might leave Ji Tian in the future to be with you?”","Xia Chunyu’s expression changed drastically, then she was flustered and exasperated. “Nonsense! I’ve never thought of that! You b*tch! I’ll kill you!”","As soon as she finished speaking, she pounced toward Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi’s figure flashed nimbly, and Xia Chunyu fell heavily to the floor."]},{"number":1665,"title":"Chapter 1665 An Inexplicable Sense Of Closeness","paragraphs":["1665 An Inexplicable Sense Of Closeness","“Xia Chunyu?”","She was about to curse when a cold voice came from behind.","At this moment, Xia Jingan walked over with cold eyes and gave her a warning look. Then, he looked at Qiao Xi. “I’m sorry, Miss Qiao.”","Xia Chunyu widened her eyes. “Brother! Why are you apologizing to her? Have you forgotten Grandma’s words?”","“Shut up!” Xia Jingan’s voice was a little hoarse, and his eyes were malicious as he looked down at her. “Have you forgotten my warning?”","!!","Xia Chunyu’s face was pale. She struggled to get up from the floor before lowering her head, not daring to look at him.","Xia Jingan said gently to Qiao Xi, “It’s my fault for not managing her well. I hope you won’t take offense.”","Qiao Xi crossed her arms and had an indifferent expression. “Young Master Xia, please restrain Miss Xia and don’t let her kick up a fuss in front of me. I can forget about it this time, but I won’t be so easy to talk to next time.”","Xia Jingan hurriedly nodded. He did not know why his grandmother wanted to bring Qiao Xi home, but whether it was for public or private reasons, they should not offend Qiao Xi. However, this idiot, Xia Chunyu, always came to look for trouble with Qiao Xi. It was really a headache.","“Bring Eldest Miss back!” Xia Jingan ordered his assistant behind him.","Xia Chunyu shouted indignantly, “Brother! Why are you on her side?! She’s a b*tch—”","With a look from Xia Jingan, the assistant hurriedly covered her mouth. Xia Chunyu was then forcefully pulled into the car.","Seeing Xia Chunyu leave in a sorry state, Qiao Xi slowly said, “Young Master Xia, you’ve put in a lot of effort! But your sister won’t understand you.”","Xia Jingan said indifferently, “I don’t care what she thinks as long as you don’t blame me. I can’t just watch her ruin the Xia family’s reputation.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at him and was slightly curious in her heart. Xia Jingan and Xia Chunyu grew up together, so why was the difference between them so big?","“Miss Qiao, actually, not everyone is like Xia Chunyu.” As soon as Xia Jingan finished speaking, he looked straight at Qiao Xi.","“Why are you looking at me?” Qiao Xi asked.","Xia Jingan looked away and smiled lightly. “I just feel very close to you, Miss Qiao.”","Qiao Xi smiled as well. “Actually, I have the same feeling. If you weren’t from the Xia family, perhaps we could be good friends.”","Xia Jingan’s eyes were a little lonely. He knew that Qiao Xi hated the Xia family very much. Saying such things in front of him meant that she already had a deep prejudice against the Xia family","After a few seconds of silence, Xia Jingan suddenly said, “Miss Qiao, are you free tonight? Can I invite you to my place for a meal?”","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. “Young Master Xia, it’s not good for us to meet alone tonight, right?”","Qiao Xi instantly understood that there must be Old Madam Xia’s subordinates in the car, so it was not convenient for him to say some things here.","These words aroused Qiao Xi’s curiosity. Coupled with her good impression of Xia Jingan, she nodded. “Alright, I’ll see you tonight.”","Xia Jingan’s eyes curved. “I’ll send you the address later.”","He turned to leave. When he reached the door, he suddenly stopped in his tracks. “Miss Qiao, you’ve seen the rumors online, right? Do you need my help?”","“There’s no need. I believe in him.” After Qiao Xi finished speaking, she looked at him seriously. “Young Master Xia, I don’t understand. As Xia Zishan’s son, our relationship should be very bad. Why do you seem to be very concerned about me?”","Xia Jingan explained uneasily, “I don’t know why either. I just can’t help but want to care about you. Don’t worry, I don’t have any ill intentions toward you. In the future, the Xia family will be in my hands. It’ll definitely be different from before. I’ll investigate the humiliation Aunt Yunqiu suffered and won’t let you suffer anymore.”","Qiao Xi smiled and said, “Thank you.”","...","In the capital.","“When will he wake up?” Gu Zheng asked.","Doctor Jiang had a serious expression. “It might take a month, a year, or even...”","Gu Zheng’s eyes flashed. The divine physician could not die just like that. Xi Xi had been waiting for him!","“When the old master was unconscious, he kept shouting a name. I think he was saying ‘Xi Xi’. She must be a very important person. You can try talking to him often. He might wake up early,” Doctor Jiang suggested.","Crash!","Ji Tian suddenly knocked over the cup on the table, and everyone’s eyes landed on her.","“I’m sorry, I’m going to the bathroom.” Ji Tian left in a hurry. She had a feeling that Gu Zheng and Ye Qingyuan seemed to have already suspected her."]},{"number":1666,"title":"Chapter 1666 Scandal","paragraphs":["1666 Scandal","Ji Tian bit her lip. She had to divert Gu Zheng’s attention and find a chance to get rid of the unconscious old man.","She thought for a moment, took out her phone, and made a call.","“Miss Ji, what’s the matter?” A young man’s voice sounded.","Ji Tian went straight to the point. “Please ask the head of the Brook family if he wants Gu Zheng to return to the Brook family.”","After a while, an old man’s dignified voice came from the other end of the phone. “Miss Ji, what are your ideas?”","Ji Tian’s eyes were filled with viciousness. “Old Master, you should know very well that the reason Gu Zheng is unwilling to return to the Brook family is that he can’t let go of someone. Everyone in Li City knows how much he dotes on Qiao Xi. If Qiao Xi is by his side, it’ll be very difficult for him to return to the Brook family.”","“Miss Ji, what do you think we should do?”","Ji Tian smiled sinisterly. “If you want to have the perfect heir, you should be more heartless. Old Master, you know what to do.”","Old Master Brook smiled and hung up.","The next day.","An explosive piece of news swept the internet.","[Ji Tian and Gu Zheng went to the hospital together. The couple is suspected to be pregnant.]","Below the headline was a photo of the two of them entering the hospital. After a while, Ji Tian’s manager posted a message. [Tian Tian won’t give up on her work for the time being, but the intensity of her work will decrease. I hope everyone can understand.]","These words were ambiguous, making one’s imagination run wild. Ji Tian’s manager posted such a message, and Gu Zheng did not stop it. That meant that he had already tacitly agreed.","After a while, the netizens dug up Gu Zheng and Ji Tian’s past. Rumor had it that the two of them had once been in a relationship. However, when Ji Tian went overseas and the two of them were in a long-distance relationship, someone took advantage of the situation and ruined their relationship. In the end, they broke up.","[In that case, Ji Tian is Gu Zheng’s first love. Now that his former lover is back, he’s going to divorce Mrs. Gu!]","[Ji Tian is already pregnant. If she doesn’t get a divorce, the child she gives birth to will be an illegitimate child!]","[So the person who took advantage of the situation back then to ruin their relationship was Qiao Xi. She spent so much effort to separate them, but Gu Zheng is going to divorce her now. How laughable!]","Qiao Xi looked at the overwhelming news online, and her expression was terrifyingly gloomy. So many days had passed, but there was still no news of Gu Zheng. He let the rumors cause an uproar and did not respond.","She took a deep breath and forced herself not to let her imagination run wild. She lowered her head to look at the time. It was about time to look for Xia Jingan. She put on a warm jacket and drove out.","At this moment, on the other side of the bridge, a man said in a low voice, “A car is here. It must be her!”","“That’s right! There’s only Longwan Residential nearby. Gu Zheng isn’t at home, and there’s only the butler and servants in the villa. Even if this woman goes missing, they won’t discover it in a short period of time.”","“But didn’t Miss He say that she wants to kill her?”","The man laughed out loud. “The head of the Brook family gave us a higher price to bring her to the capital. Of course, we’ll follow the orders of those who give a higher price.”","Soon, Qiao Xi realized that there was a car behind her. Longwan Residential was Gu Zheng’s territory, so ordinary people would not come here. Moreover, it was nighttime. When she reacted, the car behind her suddenly accelerated and crashed into her.","Qiao Xi stepped on the accelerator, her heart thumping violently. Below this road was a bottomless cliff. Once she was knocked down, it was practically impossible for her to survive.","The car chased after her and slammed into Qiao Xi’s car. As the road was slippery on a rainy day, the car swayed violently in the middle of the road.","Qiao Xi knew that someone wanted to kill her. If she continued to hide in the car, she would only die if the car was destroyed.","She opened the car door. When the car slid to the edge, she quickly jumped out of the car. With the cover of the night, she climbed over the guardrail and grabbed a rock on the side with both hands. She tested the height and jumped into the grass to offset the huge impact.","The two of them would soon realize that there was no one in the car. She had to leave as soon as possible before the other party noticed. Unfortunately, she had sprained her ankle and her back was scratched, so her movements slowed down. However, she did not dare to stop and could only endure the pain as she walked.","“F*ck! That woman ran away! She jumped down from here. She won’t fall to her death from such a high height, right?”","“Call someone over now. We’ll guard the place from above. As long as she dares to come up, we’ll tie her up. If she doesn’t come up, the rain will be heavy and the water will rise. Only death will await her!”"]},{"number":1667,"title":"Chapter 1667 Sacrifice Yourself To Help Us","paragraphs":["1667 Sacrifice Yourself To Help Us","Qiao Xi vaguely heard the conversation between the two of them and heaved a sigh of relief. If they did not come down, she could at least hide for a while longer. However, she was also clearly aware that the rain was getting heavier and she was injured. If she did not leave, even if she did not drown, she would freeze to death.","The rainwater soaked through her clothes and clung to her body. The surroundings were cold, making her feel despair.","She stood up with difficulty and walked forward in the water. She found a safe corner and tried to climb up, but as long as she raised her arm, the wound on her back would hurt so much that she felt she was about to faint.","The water current was getting faster and faster. She could only try her best to go up to higher ground. She took out her phone from her bag with trembling hands. Although the screen was broken, it was still usable. She wiped the rainwater off her face and called Gu Zheng.","However, he was in the capital! He could not save her, but she still subconsciously called him.","She wanted to hang up, but she had a trace of hope in her heart. Right at this moment, a cold and white light shone over. Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled as she hurriedly used the weeds to cover her body and block the weak light from her cell phone.","With the help of the night and the rain, she could hide perfectly, but the faint movement still attracted the other party’s attention.","Just as Qiao Xi’s heart was beating violently, the call connected.","Qiao Xi took a deep breath and said in a hoarse voice, “Gu Zheng...”","The voice she was looking forward to did not sound out. Instead, it was a female voice. “Why are you looking for Ah Zheng? He’s taking a shower. It’s not convenient for him to answer the call now. Call him tomorrow.”","The sudden female voice made the already weak Qiao Xi’s mind heavy. She even thought that she was hallucinating. She said with a trembling voice, “Ji Tian?”","It was already so late, yet Gu Zheng was actually with Ji Tian?","Ji Tian chuckled, her tone filled with pride. “That’s right, I’m Ji Tian. Ah Zheng has been very busy recently and doesn’t have time to answer your calls.”","Qiao Xi suppressed the bitterness in her heart and pretended to be calm as she asked, “He asked you to answer the phone?”","“That’s right! You should know as well that without Ah Zheng’s permission, no one can touch his phone. He doesn’t want to face you, so he asked me to answer it.”","Qiao Xi’s plea for help was instantly stuck in her throat. She was being chased, and her life was in danger, but Gu Zheng actually asked Ji Tian to answer the phone?","The scandal between him and Ji Tian had caused an uproar on the internet. It was fine that he did not comfort her at all, but now that she was in danger, he was with Ji Tian. He even got that woman to answer the phone and show off in front of her, the legitimate Mrs. Gu.","How laughable!","“Qiao Xi.” Ji Tian’s voice suddenly became vicious. “Ah Zheng doesn’t like you anymore. He’ll marry me! He’s been in the capital for so many days but hasn’t called you once. The rumors on the internet have been spreading for so many days, but he doesn’t care. This means that he has already tacitly agreed to our relationship.","“The entire internet is mocking you now. You spent so much effort to marry into a rich family, but you’re still abandoned in the end. Instead of living such a humiliating life, you might as well die!”","She was still wondering who wanted to harm her. After hearing Ji Tian’s words, she understood.","“It’s not just me. There are too many people who want to kill you. It’s impossible for Ah Zheng to save you. I advise you to die quickly and give up your position. Don’t make things difficult for Ah Zheng either. How good would it be to sacrifice yourself to help us?!”","In Ji Tian’s opinion, Qiao Xi would definitely die today. Even if she could escape from He Wenxian, she could not escape from the head of the Brook family. Hence, she was not afraid that Qiao Xi would come back alive to tell Gu Zheng this.","Qiao Xi held her cell phone tightly. “Ji Tian, get Gu Zheng to answer the phone!”","“That’s impossible! Ah Zheng and I are going to sleep soon. If you want to die, die quickly. Don’t interrupt our time together!”","With that, Ji Tian quickly hung up.","Qiao Xi’s body became colder and colder. Sorrow and anger rushed to her head, causing her to almost faint.","She had been married to Gu Zheng for so long and had always trusted him, but now...","Qiao Xi shook her head and let her consciousness remain clear. No matter if Gu Zheng abandoned her or not, she could not give up on herself. She had to survive!","She took out her phone and called the police, but the next second—","“She’s here!”","A stick hit her hand, and the intense pain made her subconsciously let go of her cell phone.","Thump!","Her cell phone fell into the water.","“You still dare to call the police?! I’ll beat you to death!”","“Tie her up!”","A few men ran over. Qiao Xi did not have the strength to resist and could only say weakly, “How much did they give you? I’ll double it!”"]},{"number":1668,"title":"Chapter 1668 Telepathy","paragraphs":["1668 Telepathy","The man sneered. “Why should I believe you? We’ve already captured you. As long as we send you over, we’ll be able to get a generous reward!”","“Mr. Gu can’t save you. I advise you to be sensible and leave with us. Otherwise...”","Before he could finish speaking, the man felt an intense pain in his thigh. Qiao Xi had taken out a sharp dagger from somewhere and stabbed it fiercely into the man’s leg.","While the few of them were stunned, Qiao Xi leaped into the river and tried her best to swim to the other side.","“Hurry up and chase after her!”","Qiao Xi used all her strength to swim forward. She did not know if there was an end in front of her. She only knew that she could not fall into their hands no matter what.","“Catch her!”","“Why don’t we just kill her according to Miss He’s wishes?!”","“But that gentleman wants him alive!”","“If we let her escape, we won’t be able to get any money from either side!”","At this moment, Qiao Xi no longer had the ability to think. She could only rely on her instincts to swim. However, she was already injured, so how could she escape from a few strong men?","Sensing that they were getting closer and closer, Qiao Xi gradually lost her strength—","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","Suddenly, she heard a few gunshots. The surrounding men’s bodies stiffened as they wailed in pain. Qiao Xi could smell the smell of blood spreading in the water. They had all been shot!","Everyone was dealt with. Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes to look at the shore. A tall man was standing there, and his appearance could not be seen clearly. Then, a few black figures were about to jump down from the shore, but the man stopped them. He jumped into the water and swam to her side.","Qiao Xi’s mind gradually became heavy as she closed her eyes. She felt the man hug her waist and swim toward the shore. Soon, she lost consciousness.","...","In the capital.","After Ji Tian hung up, her heart thumped violently. She hurriedly deleted the call records.","At this moment, the door was pushed open and a group of people walked in. Ji Tian was so scared that she quickly threw away the cell phone. The screen instantly shattered. Her face was pale, and she looked flustered.","Everyone walked in one after another and saw the phone on the floor. Ji Tian hurriedly walked forward and said nervously, “I’m sorry, Ah Zheng. I didn’t mean to break your phone. I’ll compensate you.”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and looked at his phone with a cold gaze.","Gu Zheng looked up at Ji Tian. Her eyes were red, and she suddenly coughed violently. Her face was pale, and her legs went weak. She subconsciously grabbed Gu Zheng’s hand and fell onto him.","“Miss Ji has fainted. Put her on the bed first.” The nurse hurriedly supported her.","Although Ji Tian was unconscious, one of her hands was tightly grabbing Gu Zheng’s sleeve. The doctor did not dare to pull her forcefully and could only look at Gu Zheng awkwardly. “Mr. Gu, can you help? Miss Ji must have fainted because she was too tired these past few days. She should wake up soon.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was cold as he pried Ji Tian’s hand away.","“Mr. Gu, this...”","Gu Zheng ignored the doctor and turned to leave the ward.","He held the broken phone as the uneasiness in his heart grew stronger. An inexplicable pain swept through his body.","Xi Xi...","He shook his head, and his vision gradually blurred. Song Shijing quickly supported him. Doctor Jiang had just finished diagnosing Ji Tian. Seeing that Gu Zheng was a little weak, he checked his pulse. His expression changed drastically. “The poison is acting up!”","Song Shijing was also surprised. “Ever since Young Madam detoxified the president’s poison, it’s been a long time since the poison acted up. Why did it suddenly flare up?”","Doctor Jiang hurriedly said, “Quickly bring him to my ward. We can’t let anyone know that his poison has acted up. Tell the public that his old injuries have relapsed and he needs to recuperate.”","Song Shijing nodded quickly. Many eyes were on the president now. If he fell into a coma, it would give those people a chance.","Before Song Shijing could come back to his senses, he received a call from Uncle Sheng. “Assistant Song, Young Madam is missing!”","At this moment, Xia Jingan was sitting in the living room and looking at the time. It was already 40 minutes past the agreed time, but Qiao Xi was still not here. He suddenly felt a little uneasy and hurriedly called Qiao Xi.","It was raining heavily outside, so it was normal for her to be late. However, he could not get through to her phone!","Since they had agreed to meet today, how could he not be able to contact her?","Xia Jingan’s heart suddenly trembled, and his body spasmed uncontrollably. He seemed to have telepathy and felt that something must have happened to Qiao Xi!"]},{"number":1669,"title":"Chapter 1669 Can’t Leave When You’re In My Territory","paragraphs":["1669 Can’t Leave When You’re In My Territory","Xia Jingan quickly stood up and walked out with an umbrella.","The assistant hurriedly asked, “Young Master, where are you going? Aren’t you going to wait for Miss Qiao?”","Xia Jingan’s footsteps were hurried, and his voice was a little flustered. “She might be in trouble. Send people to look for her immediately.”","The assistant was instantly stunned and hurriedly got into the car with Xia Jingan.","Xia Jingan kept calling Qiao Xi’s number, but he could not get through. His eyes gradually became malicious.","Didn’t Gu Zheng say that he would protect her? She couldn’t even be contacted now, so why was there no news from Gu Zheng?","At this moment, in Longwan Residential, Uncle Sheng also realized that something was wrong. He hurriedly instructed, “Xiao Lan, stay at home and call Young Madam every ten minutes. I’ll bring people out to look for her!”","Xiao Lan hurriedly nodded. Not long after, a shadow guard from the villa sent back a message. “Uncle Sheng, we found something in the river...”","“Tell me!”","“Six bodies were found. They look like assassins, but there’s no sign of Young Madam yet.”","Uncle Sheng’s face darkened. “I’ll go take a look. Xiao Lan, contact me if there’s any news.”","“Alright, Uncle Sheng. Be careful.” Xiao Lan’s heart thumped. She prayed that Young Madam would be safe.","Uncle Sheng was flustered in the car. He knew that this matter could not be spread, so he could only call Song Shijing first and deploy all the shadow guards to look for Young Madam. If the Gu family could not find her, then it would be even more impossible for others to find her.","He walked down the mountain path and saw the six corpses that the shadow guards had fished out lying on the ground.","“Uncle Sheng, these six people were all killed with one shot. To be able to kill them in such a dark environment means that this person’s marksmanship is very good.”","Uncle Sheng’s eyes turned cold. The shadow guards of Longwan Residential had all undergone strict training. The person who could make them praise them was definitely not an ordinary person. Six well-trained assassins died instantly. It seemed that that person had taken Young Madam away.","He thought for a long time before slowly saying, “Continue to send people to search. We can’t miss any clues!”","Soon, Xia Jingan rushed to the location with his men and realized that Qiao Xi was chased after by a group of people. He immediately suspected the Xia family.","Old Madam Xia clearly did not like Qiao Xi, yet she still wanted Qiao Xi to return to the Xia family. Did she send someone to kill Qiao Xi in a fit of anger after being rejected?","Looking at the blood on the floor, Xia Jingan felt a dull pain in his chest. He gritted his teeth and growled, “Look for her! Send someone to look for her immediately!”","Xia Jingan’s heart was filled with guilt. If he had not invited Qiao Xi to be a guest tonight, such a thing would not have happened.","The next day.","Qiao Xi slowly woke up and was stunned for a moment when she saw the unfamiliar environment. Only then did she realize that she was no longer in Longwan Residential. She raised her eyes and sized up her surroundings. The room was not big, and the furniture was a little old. Fortunately, it was still relatively clean.","Her head was still a little heavy, and the memories in her mind were a little chaotic. However, she quickly recalled what happened last night. She remembered that the person who saved her was a tall man. Moreover, that person was very good at shooting. In the end, he even jumped into the water to save her.","The wound on Qiao Xi’s back had already been bandaged, but when she moved her arm slightly, she felt a sharp pain. Her entire body was sore and soft as if she had experienced a calamity. At this moment, not to mention escaping, even getting off the bed was a little strenuous for her.","“You’re injured. Behave yourself.”","A male voice sounded from outside the door, and Qiao Xi’s face turned pale.","The man’s footsteps were steady as he walked over. Soon, his cold and handsome face appeared in front of Qiao Xi.","Huo Yuzhou? It was actually him?","Qiao Xi clenched her fists, her eyes filled with vigilance. “You saved me?”","Ever since she parted with Huo Yuzhou on bad terms, Qiao Xi thought that they would never meet again. She did not expect to see him again so soon in such a manner.","Huo Yuzhou looked down at her and smirked. “I saved you. If I hadn’t arrived in time, you would’ve died a long time ago.”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes. “Call my fourth brother and get him to pick me up.”","Huo Yuzhou’s body stiffened, and the corners of his lips curled into a mocking smile. “Xi Xi, do you think you can leave when you’re in my territory? Are you very disappointed that Gu Zheng didn’t save you? Is that why you want me to call Xue Liang instead of Gu Zheng?”","Qiao Xi pursed her lips. “What exactly do you want?”","At this moment, she finally realized that her situation was critical when she was in danger last night. Why did Huo Yuzhou appear there? Did he know in advance that she would be chased after?","“Don’t worry, I won’t hurt you. I really care about you, so I took the risk to save you.”"]},{"number":1670,"title":"Chapter 1670 A Chance To Compete Fairly","paragraphs":["1670 A Chance To Compete Fairly","Qiao Xi avoided his burning gaze and felt slightly bitter in her heart.","Yes! No matter how unbearable Huo Yuzhou was in the past, Huo Yuzhou had risked everything to save her when she was in danger. On the contrary, there was no news of Gu Zheng.","She lowered her eyes to hide her loneliness.","Huo Yuzhou sensed the change in her emotions and snorted. “Do you like Gu Zheng so much? Do you still think that he’s better than me even though he’s abandoned you?”","The corners of his lips curled up as he said in a low and hoarse voice, “I heard that Ji Tian suddenly fainted last night and Gu Zheng was accompanying her in front of the hospital bed. He’s very considerate.”","With that, he took out his phone and clicked on a photo. Ji Tian was lying on the hospital bed with a pale face. She was pulling Gu Zheng’s sleeve tightly. Gu Zheng and the doctor were standing at the side, their eyes lowered. One could not tell their emotions.","The timestamp was displayed in the lower right corner of the photo. It happened to be when she was in danger last night.","“Xi Xi, look carefully. He doesn’t love you at all. He abandoned you and went to the capital to accompany Ji Tian. There are rumors all over the internet, but he’s unwilling to step forward and explain things. He’s clearly tacitly agreeing to his relationship with Ji Tian!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes coldly. “This is between us. It has nothing to do with you!”","“Xi Xi, I don’t want to force you to like me, but you have to stay by my side.” Huo Yuzhou stared at her with a burning gaze. His eyes seemed to contain love but also unwillingness.","Qiao Xi knew that she did not have the ability to escape, so she could only cover her face with the blanket and not look at Huo Yuzhou anymore.","“Rest well. I won’t disturb you anymore,” Huo Yuzhou said softly.","“Huo Yuzhou.” Qiao Xi’s tone was tainted with a trace of ridicule. “Or should I call you the young master of the Brook family? Can you explain why you came so timely last night?”","“I really can’t hide anything from you.” Huo Yuzhou smiled. “Unfortunately, you can’t escape. Not to mention Xue Liang, even Gu Zheng will find it difficult to find you.”","Qiao Xi had a puzzled expression. With Gu Zheng’s power, as long as she was still in Li City, she would not be able to escape the eyes of those shadow guards unless...","At this moment, the room suddenly shook. Only then did Qiao Xi realize that she was on a ship!","“Xi Xi, Gu Zheng has already betrayed you. I’ll bring you out of Li City to live overseas. I’ll love you well.” Huo Yuzhou’s eyes burst with madness.","Back then, he made a mistake and disappointed Xi Xi. However, now that Gu Zheng had also betrayed her, he would have a chance to compete fairly with Gu Zheng.","“Xi Xi, your injuries are serious. It’s better if you don’t think of escaping. I’ll get servants to guard the door. If you want anything, give them your instructions.” Huo Yuzhou turned around and left the room.","Qiao Xi ignored him, her heart filled with depression.","She could feel that this ship was moving. If it had been moving since last night, it should have already left Li City. It would indeed be very difficult for Gu Zheng to find her.","Another two days passed. During this period of time, Qiao Xi had been lying on the bed to recuperate. The five servants surrounded her every day and simply treated her as a princess.","Huo Yuzhou had given her a phone without a SIM card so that she could use it to pass the time. However, she was still very bored.","Her brothers must be looking for her crazily after finding out that she had disappeared.","She went missing while looking for Xia Jingan. Xia Jingan should already know that she was being chased after. He must be very anxious too. Gu Zheng should also know about it. How would he react?","A trace of bitterness surged in Qiao Xi’s heart, then she shook her head. Gu Zheng would absolutely not abandon her. She had been with Gu Zheng for more than ten years. Not only were they husband and wife, but they were also family and partners. He loved her so much and wished for nothing more than to give his life to her. How could he suddenly have a change of heart?","Even if he really did not love her one day, Gu Zheng would not ignore her. He had not come to look for her yet, so there must be a reason why he could not come.","When she thought of the photo Huo Yuzhou had shown her, Qiao Xi could not help but feel sad. She wiped her cheeks and suddenly realized that she was crying. Her pillow was even drenched in tears.","She took a deep breath to calm herself down and carefully moved her arms and legs. Huo Yuzhou was not bad to her and had given her the best medicine. The wounds on her body had already healed, but her leg was still in a cast, and she could not get out of bed. She could only close her eyes and think about how to contact the outside world to escape from Huo Yuzhou’s cage.","At this moment, Xia Jingan, who had not slept for two days, had bloodshot eyes. He looked tired and asked Uncle Sheng angrily, “Qiao Xi has gone missing. Where’s Gu Zheng?”"]},{"number":1671,"title":"Chapter 1671 Discovered Important Clues","paragraphs":["1671 Discovered Important Clues","Uncle Sheng did not know what important things the president was dealing with. Song Shijing already knew that Young Madam was missing, but the president had not come back yet. He had not even called.","They all knew how much the president doted on Young Madam. However, Young Madam was missing and the president had not done anything. It was even stranger that Song Shijing and Song Shiyu had not called.","Not only was Xia Jingan angry, but Uncle Sheng and Xiao Lan were also anxious.","After Xue Liang found out about the news, he brought people to search everywhere, but there were no clues.","Shen Yu had just finished filming and had stayed up for a day and a night. When he heard that something had happened to Qiao Xi, he returned to Li City without caring about anything else. After getting out of the car, his expression was terrifyingly gloomy.","“Where’s Gu Zheng?”","The surroundings were silent. He was the last person to arrive at the location where the incident took place. Along the way, he had been scolding himself for not caring enough about Qiao Xi. However, after arriving, Shen Yu realized that Gu Zheng was not in Li City!","Shen Yu had not gotten any sleep to begin with. When he found out that Qiao Xi was missing, his usually gentle face was filled with anger. He glared fiercely at Uncle Sheng with his cold eyes. “Where’s Gu Zheng?”","After being questioned by countless angry men, Uncle Sheng looked helpless. “I’m not sure either. The president must have something important...”","“His wife’s whereabouts are unknown. What’s more important than Qiao Xi?”","Shen Yu gritted his teeth and said, “If he doesn’t like Little Six anymore, he should get a divorce. We’ll leave with Little Six. She’s so young and beautiful. She can definitely find a better man than him!”","Uncle Sheng panicked when he heard that. “Mr. Shen, don’t be agitated. You know how much our president cares about Young Madam. If he hadn’t encountered trouble, why would he...”","“Brother!” At this moment, Luo Qing walked in. His eyes were even colder, and his entire body exuded a chill. The moment he appeared, the surrounding temperature seemed to have dropped.","Before he could speak, Xue Liang’s surprised voice came from below. “Look, isn’t this Little Six’s phone?!”","Xue Liang pulled the rope and climbed up from below. His body was covered in mud, and he held a broken phone tightly in his hand.","The rain was very heavy last night. The cell phone fell into the water and flowed downstream. It was stuck in the gap between the rocks. Xue Liang and Qin An had almost rummaged through the place before discovering the cell phone.","“It’s her cell phone. Gu Zheng custom-made it...”","At the mention of Gu Zheng’s name, Shen Yu could not help but frown. A trace of coldness flashed past his eyes.","He knew that Gu Zheng had a reason to go to the capital, but at this moment, Qiao Xi was missing. He should rush back no matter what. Was he so indifferent that he did not take this case seriously?","“The cell phone was smashed, and it’s been soaking in water for a day and a night. It’s already damaged. I’ll repair it first and see if there are any clues.” Xue Liang held the cell phone and got into the car.","After Xue Liang finished speaking, he snorted. “What was Xia Jingan planning? He must’ve invited Little Six out so late at night with ill intentions...”","Before he could finish speaking, Xia Jingan’s voice came from not far away. “I’m her biological cousin. What kind of ill intentions could I have, Young Master Xue?”","Xue Liang smirked. “What nonsense are you talking about? You’re just her cousin.”","Xia Jingan did not argue with him and continued to ask, “What other clues are there on Qiao Xi’s phone?”","Hearing this, Xue Liang’s expression darkened even more. He clenched his fists and gritted his teeth. “Little Six called Gu Zheng before she went missing. The two of them spoke for one minute and 36 seconds.”","He roared angrily, “When Little Six was in danger, she called Gu Zheng. That man picked up but didn’t come to save her. It’s been a day and a night, but he hasn’t returned!”","The few men’s expressions did not look too good. After a long silence, Luo Qing slowly said, “I found some clues. Those six people were all members of the same assassin organization. They had committed countless murders and deserved to die. Most importantly, they were assassins specially nurtured by a family in Y Nation.","“It’s the Brook family.”","Everyone’s pupils constricted abruptly as they continued to search for Qiao Xi’s traces, but they still found nothing.","...","Another day later, Gu Zheng woke up from his sleep. This time, the poison acted up extremely fiercely. Not only did he instantly fall into a coma, but when he woke up, he realized that he had lost his eyesight.","In the past, his vision would deteriorate whenever the poison acted up, but now, his vision was dark and he could not see anything.","Seeing him like this, Song Shijing was extremely anxious. Without the president’s permission, they did not dare to return to Li City as they were afraid that they would arouse the Brook family’s suspicion."]},{"number":1672,"title":"Chapter 1672 Heart Felt Like It Was Burning","paragraphs":["1672 Heart Felt Like It Was Burning","At this moment, Gu Zheng’s eyes were empty, but his expression was very calm.","“President, the poison has already spread to your eyes. We can only suppress it with medicine for the time being, but...”","However, everyone knew that using medications to suppress the symptoms was only temporary. One day, the medicine would lose its effect and the poison would completely erupt. At that time, it was hard to predict if he would completely lose his eyesight or lose his life.","If the president really lost his eyesight...","Gu Zheng’s eyes were still gray. His thin lips parted slightly. “Is she okay?”","Doctor Jiang did not realize who he was asking about, but Song Shijing choked and could not say anything.","Gu Zheng knew Song Shijing very well. The silence at this moment was enough to explain everything. He sounded a little flustered. “Song Shijing, what’s wrong with her?”","He looked up at Song Shijing. Although he could not see anything, he still felt a chill. “I’m asking you a question! Did something happen?”","From that night onward, Gu Zheng had been uneasy. Even though he had woken up from his coma, the feeling was still extremely strong.","Just then, Song Shijing’s phone rang. It was Uncle Sheng. He picked it up immediately. Hearing the other party’s words, his face darkened.","Song Shijing and Song Shiyu looked at each other. If they did not tell the president the truth, the president would definitely not let them off when he found out. However, they were sure that as long as they told the president, the president would return to the capital immediately, regardless of whether it would arouse the suspicion of the Brook family.","After hesitating for a moment, Song Shijing took a deep breath. “Young Madam... She’s missing.”","The moment that was said, the ward instantly fell silent. Gu Zheng clenched his fists tightly and felt his heart twitch as if he was going to faint the next second. He gritted his teeth and asked again, “Did you say that Xi Xi is missing?”","“Y-Yes.”","Hearing an affirmative answer, Gu Zheng felt his mind buzz. Everything around him became blurry. The pain in his heart made his entire body go numb. He took a long time to accept this fact.","Cold sweat broke out on Song Shiyu’s forehead as he said slowly, “Young Madam and Mr. Xia Jingan had an appointment. When she drove out alone at night, she was chased after by a group of people. She fell into the river and disappeared.”","Gu Zheng’s heart felt as if it was being dismembered by a sharp knife. The pain caused him to be unable to help but groan as the smell of blood surged out of his throat. He recalled that the scandal between him and Ji Tian had spread throughout the city these past few days. He had deliberately neglected Qiao Xi because he wanted to survive this period of time. He wanted to look for Qiao Xi to explain and beg for her forgiveness after this.","However, before he could return to Li City, Qiao Xi went missing. When she was being chased after, he was far away in the capital. Would Xi Xi forgive him despite not knowing his difficulties?","After a long silence, the usually calm man asked in a trembling voice, “When did this happen?”","“The night before yesterday. After you fainted, I received a call from Uncle Sheng. They’ve already sent everyone to look for Young Madam, but there are no clues.”","Gu Zheng covered his eyes with his hand as warm liquid gushed out. The darkness in front of him made him feel terrified, and his heart felt as if it was burning.","“Xi Xi...”","He said her name and took a deep breath. “Return to Li City immediately!”","When Gu Zheng left the ward with everyone, he happened to see many doctors running toward Ji Tian’s ward.","“Tian Tian! Don’t scare me!” The woman who was shouting in the hospital was Ji Tian’s mother. At this moment, Ji Tian was holding her chest and leaning weakly against her.","Ji Tian’s mother, Liu Meiyu, rushed over and grabbed Gu Zheng’s hand. She cried, “Mr. Gu! Tian Tian’s condition isn’t too good. You should stay and accompany her!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was cold as he shook off Liu Meiyu’s hand.","The next second, Song Shijing stood in front of her. “If you’re sick, please look for a doctor. It’s useless to look for our president.”","“But the internet is saying that Mr. Gu and our Tian Tian are a couple. Now that she’s sick, you can’t just abandon her!” Liu Meiyu wailed loudly, and everyone around her looked over.","Everyone had heard the rumors online and thought that Ji Tian was Gu Zheng’s woman. Now that Ji Tian was sick, wasn’t Gu Zheng too heartless to abandon her?","“Mom!” Just as Liu Meiyu was about to pester her, Ji Tian said weakly, “Don’t stop Ah Zheng. He’s already very good to me. If it’s not for something important, he wouldn’t abandon me.”"]},{"number":1673,"title":"Chapter 1673 Her Call For Help","paragraphs":["1673 Her Call For Help","Suddenly, Ji Tian coughed violently, and her face turned even paler. The doctor could not help but persuade Gu Zheng. “Mr. Gu, the patient’s condition isn’t too good now. Can you...”","Ji Tian lowered her head and revealed a proud smile. As long as she pretended to be pitiful, someone would persuade Gu Zheng to stay and accompany her. By then, Qiao Xi’s body should have already been dismembered!","“Ah Zheng...” Ji Tian closed her eyes and called out weakly.","Liu Meiyu stood in front of Gu Zheng again and said with a sad expression, “Mr. Gu, I’m begging you. Just stay and accompany Tian Tian!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Gu Zheng said coldly, “Move! I want to return to Li City!”","“Tian Tian is your woman. How can you abandon her?”","Song Shiyu exploded. “Madam Liu, please don’t spout nonsense. Our president is already married, and he’s not familiar with Miss Ji Tian.","“Our president has long announced to the public that he’s married. He and Young Madam are very close. What identity are you using to make the president stay?”","After he finished speaking, the corridor fell silent.","It turned out that Ji Tian was a mistress! Moreover, Gu Zheng did not seem to like her at all. The rumors were actually fake!","“President, the car is ready. We can leave now.”","Gu Zheng nodded and walked forward.","Liu Meiyu was unwilling to give up and shouted, “Mr. Gu, our Tian Tian is sincere to you! You can get a divorce even if you’re married!”","Gu Zheng’s eyes suddenly turned cold, and he exuded cold killing intent. Song Shiyu, who was at the side, could not help but curse, “I’ve never seen such a shameless pair of mother and daughter. If you don’t get lost, I’ll tell Master Ji about this and get him to pick you up personally!”","Hearing Song Shiyu’s threat, Liu Meiyu trembled in fear and took a few steps back.","Just then, Gu Zheng’s phone suddenly rang.","Hearing this ringtone, Ji Tian subconsciously trembled as fear spread from the bottom of her heart.","When Song Shijing answered the call, a man’s angry roar came from the other end. “Gu Zheng, where are you?”","“The capital,” Song Shijing replied truthfully.","Xia Jingan did not expect Gu Zheng to really pick up the call. He could not suppress his anger. “Everyone has arrived in Li City except for you. You’re still in the capital. Do you care about Qiao Xi or not?”","Song Shijing asked in confusion, “Sir, you are?”","Xia Jingan took a deep breath. His good upbringing did not allow him to scold others. “Gu Zheng, it doesn’t matter if you’ve forgotten me, but how can you be indifferent to Xi Xi? You didn’t come back to save her the moment she vanished, so it’s meaningless for you to come back now!”","Gu Zheng, on the other hand, caught the key message. He hurriedly took the phone and asked, “What did you mean when you said I didn’t come back to save her?”","“Why are you pretending?! Didn’t you answer her call for help? She must have been very afraid at that time and hoped that you could save her, but what about you? You didn’t care about her after you received the call, which caused her to go missing!”","Gu Zheng’s eyes suddenly turned cold, and his breathing quickened. “I never received a call.”","Xia Jingan sneered. “Three days ago, on the night she was chased after by a group of people, she called you. You spoke for one minute and 36 seconds. There are records of it on her phone. Do you still dare to say that you didn’t receive the call?”","Gu Zheng’s ears buzzed. Three days ago, he left his phone in the ward. When he came back, it was smashed by Ji Tian.","Smack!","Song Shiyu reacted instantly and rushed over to slap Ji Tian hard.","Everyone exclaimed, then they saw Gu Zheng walking over like a demon from hell. “You answered the call?”","Ji Tian held her red and swollen cheek, and her legs went weak as she knelt on the floor. Fear swept through her body like a tide. “No, it wasn’t me, Ah Zheng...”","Gu Zheng slowly bent down and grabbed her neck, tightening his grip. His low and hoarse voice sounded. “I advise you to tell the truth. Otherwise, when I find the call records, I’ll kill you.”","With that, Gu Zheng shook her off fiercely. Ji Tian coughed violently and retreated in horror. She shook her head crazily. “I... I did answer the call, but I... accidentally pressed it. I forgot about it after that.”","She knew that Gu Zheng would find out about that call. She was the only one in the ward at that time. There was no point in her denying it. Moreover, she felt that Gu Zheng would really kill her.","Gu Zheng glanced at her coldly. “Miss Ji, you best get prepared. I won’t let this matter rest. I don’t think the Ji family will offend me because of an illegitimate daughter. I don’t think I need to do anything before the head of the Ji family personally cleans up this mess.”","The faces of Liu Meiyu and Ji Tian were pale. Ji Tian was an illegitimate daughter and was not valued by the Ji family. If she offended Gu Zheng, she would be completely expelled from the Ji family!"]},{"number":1674,"title":"Chapter 1674 Exhausting His Lifespan","paragraphs":["1674 Exhausting His Lifespan","Four hours later, Gu Zheng finally arrived at Longwan Residential.","Xue Liang watched as he walked in. Anger surged to his head as he punched him hard. “Gu Zheng! You still dare to come back?!”","This punch landed heavily on Gu Zheng’s chest, and Gu Zheng could not help but grunt. It was not that Xue Liang’s fist was heavy, but he was indeed injured. Moreover, it was a gunshot wound. He left Li City and went to the capital because he did not want Qiao Xi to worry.","Qiao Xi was very sensitive to the smell of blood. If he had returned home on the day he was injured, he would definitely have been discovered by Qiao Xi. Coincidentally, the divine physician was injured in the capital, so he went straight to the capital.","Cold sweat broke out on Gu Zheng’s forehead after being punched, making Xue Liang a little surprised.","“Gu Zheng! Have you forgotten what you promised us? You said you’ll protect her, but she went missing and you’re the last to come back!","“Moreover, the group of people chasing after Little Six was most likely sent by the Brook family. Those people are after you. When she was being chased, you were accompanying Ji Tian in the hospital and even let news of it be posted online. You’re really shameless!”","Gu Zheng stood tall and gritted his teeth, but he did not say anything and let Xue Liang insult him.","Song Shijing could not stand it anymore. “Mr. Xue, our president...”","“Shut up!” Xue Liang roared to stop him, then looked coldly at Gu Zheng. “Let me tell you, after Little Six comes back this time, we’ll bring her away and let her decide if she wants to—”","“I know who took her away.” Gu Zheng suddenly interrupted Xue Liang.","Xue Liang instantly grabbed Gu Zheng’s arm and roared, “Tell me! Who took Little Six away?”","Gu Zheng’s voice was hoarse. “Huo Yuzhou.”","Xue Liang was dumbfounded. Gu Zheng had just returned to Li City, yet he was already sure that Huo Yuzhou had taken Little Six away? But if Huo Yuzhou had saved Little Six, why didn’t he call him? What exactly did he want?","At this moment, Xue Liang’s heart was a mess. He shook his head and chased away those distracting thoughts. The most important thing now was to find Little Six.","Xue Liang left in a hurry. Song Shiyu quickly helped Gu Zheng sit down. “Did your wound open?”","“I’m fine.”","Gu Zheng endured the pain and gritted his teeth. “I didn’t receive any news of the Brook family chasing after Xi Xi, but that person was able to arrive when Xi Xi was in danger. Only Huo Yuzhou could do that.”","With that, Gu Zheng suddenly bent down and frowned in pain.","Pfft!!!","He spat out a mouthful of blood, scaring Song Shijing so much that he turned pale. “President!”","“Doctor Jiang gave you the medicine to suppress the poison. You can see for the time being, but the medicine is too harsh. If this goes on, the poison will spread even faster!","As Song Shijing spoke, he felt bitter.","What right did Xue Liang have to say that the president did not care about Young Madam? There was no one in the world who cared about Young Madam more than the president. For Young Madam’s sake, he risked everything to return to Li City and used medicine to forcefully suppress the poison in his body. He was exhausting his lifespan, afraid that he would miss out on any clues.","At this moment, Gu Zheng knew very well in his heart that Huo Yuzhou liked Qiao Xi. There was admiration and possessiveness hidden in his eyes. Huo Yuzhou disobeyed the old master’s order and brought Qiao Xi away. This was enough to show how crazy this man was. Hence, he had to find Xi Xi as soon as possible.","Gu Zheng wiped the blood from the corner of his lips with his finger and ordered coldly, “Immediately send someone to search for Huo Yuzhou. Remember, you can’t let the Brook family discover you.”","“Uncle Sheng and Mr. Xia have already searched the entire Li City but haven’t found any traces of Young Madam. Where can Huo Yuzhou bring Young Madam?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were slightly cold. After a long silence, he slowly said, “They must’ve set sail.”","Song Shijing was stunned for a moment before realizing that Li City was the president’s territory. He had spies everywhere, so Huo Yuzhou would not hide Young Madam in Li City. If she left from any of the roads in Li City that led to other provinces, she would definitely be noticed. However, she would not attract attention if she went out to sea.","However, the sea was so vast. How would they know where Huo Yuzhou would go?","...","At this moment, Qiao Xi opened her eyes again and looked at the time on her phone. She had already been trapped here for four days. During this period of time, Huo Yuzhou had not made things difficult for her. The servants were even more silent, afraid that she would get information out of them.","Huo Yuzhou had long warned those people that if anyone revealed any news to her, they would be thrown into the sea. The servants were so scared that they avoided her like she was a snake and did not dare to say a word."]},{"number":1675,"title":"Chapter 1675 We’ve Long Been Strangers","paragraphs":["1675 We’ve Long Been Strangers","“Xi Xi, don’t waste your effort. They won’t be able to find you.” Huo Yuzhou’s gentle voice sounded.","Qiao Xi’s voice was cold. “Huo Yuzhou, what exactly are you planning on doing?”","Huo Yuzhou sat opposite her and smiled devilishly. “What if I say that I love you? That I want to keep you by my side?”","“Like hell I’ll believe you!” Qiao Xi glared at him. “If you really love me, you wouldn’t have betrayed me back then and even set fire to Grandpa’s library. You destroyed our relationship with your own hands. You’ve always been someone who’ll be unscrupulous for the sake of achieving your goals. Why are you kidnapping me this time?”","Huo Yuzhou’s eyes suddenly turned cold, and his heart felt like it was being dismembered. It turned out that in her eyes, he was such a person.","After a long silence, he suddenly sneered. “I might be terrible, but at least I could save you when you were in danger. But what about your husband? He was with another woman. You shouldn’t have married such a man.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched as she looked at him with a mocking expression. “Even if I didn’t marry him, I would absolutely not marry you. We’ve long been strangers.”","Huo Yuzhou suddenly choked as a suffocating feeling swept through his body. He stood up angrily and left.","Qiao Xi turned over and heaved a sigh of relief when she heard the door close. Not to mention escaping, she could not even leave this bedroom now. How was she going to send news to Gu Zheng and Fourth Brother?","After Huo Yuzhou left the room, his assistant walked forward. “Sir, Miss Guan called.”","Hearing that Guan Hui had called, Huo Yuzhou frowned.","“Miss Guan said that she’s not feeling well and wants you to go back and accompany her...” The assistant became less and less confident as he spoke. Every once in a while, Miss Guan would use such a reason to ask Mr. Huo to visit her. Mr. Huo would get very impatient every time, but he would still visit her if he had time.","The assistant had been with Huo Yuzhou for so many years and knew that he liked Miss Qiao a lot. However, because Miss Guan had once saved him, he had no choice but to do something against his conscience. He even set a fire and completely cut off his relationship with Miss Qiao.","However, was it really worth it to lose the person he loved for Guan Hui?","As an outsider, he could tell that Mr. Huo did not like Guan Hui and even hated her.","Huo Yuzhou made a call and asked impatiently, “What’s wrong now?”","Guan Hui’s sobbing voice sounded. “Yuzhou, I’m dizzy. Can you come...”","“No, I’m not a doctor. It’s useless even if I go back.”","“Yuzhou, do you hate me?” Guan Hui said aggrievedly, “I was the one who saved you back then...”","Huo Yuzhou frowned. “Guan Hui, haven’t I given you enough all these years? I probably returned the favor a long time ago. I advise you not to be too greedy!”","Guan Hui bit her lip aggrievedly. She had not seen Huo Yuzhou for many days. He was not in the villa in Li City or in Y Nation. Where could he have gone?","Guan Hui thought for a few seconds and suddenly said, “Yuzhou, I heard that Xi Xi has gone missing. Gu Zheng and the Xia family are all looking for her!”","“Does this have anything to do with you?” Huo Yuzhou replied coldly. “I didn’t even hear about it, so who did you hear it from?”","“I...” Guan Hui was instantly speechless.","Huo Yuzhou sneered. “You’re recuperating at home every day, but you’re more well-informed than me. Gu Zheng and Xia Jingan have always been careful. So how do you know about this?”","Guan Hui instantly panicked. She had found out that the Brook family was chasing after Qiao Xi, so she suspected that this matter was related to Huo Yuzhou, which was why she specially called to test him. Unexpectedly, she was questioned by him.","After knowing that Qiao Xi had disappeared for a few days, Guan Hui cursed Qiao Xi in her heart. It would be best if she died. As long as she died, no one would know that the person who saved Huo Yuzhou back then was Qiao Xi. She could use this life-saving grace to make Huo Yuzhou stay by her side for the rest of his life.","After the two of them hung up, Guan Hui immediately replied to the head of the Brook family, “Yuzhou said he doesn’t know.”","The head of the Brook family’s expression darkened. He did not want to suspect Huo Yuzhou, but Huo Yuzhou had not been in Li City these past few days, making him find it a little strange.","...","Li City.","“President, there’s still no news of Young Madam.” Song Shijing had been looking for her for many days and was physically and mentally exhausted.","At this moment, Gu Zheng was standing on a pier in Li City. He looked at the vast sea with red eyes that carried a trace of determination.","“Why do you think Huo Yuzhou took Young Madam away? If he wants something, why hasn’t he done anything for so many days?” Song Shijing looked puzzled.","Before Gu Zheng could answer, Song Shiyu rushed over. “President, we just received an email. It contains a photo of Young Madam!”"]},{"number":1676,"title":"Chapter 1676 She’s Also Thorny Like Rose","paragraphs":["1676 She’s Also Thorny Like Rose","Gu Zheng’s entire body trembled. The person in the photo was indeed Qiao Xi. She was sitting by the bed and reading. Her hair covered her forehead, and she looked like she had been living a peaceful life.","He knew that this was an email from Huo Yuzhou. Huo Yuzhou was baiting him and forcing him to make a choice. Did he want Qiao Xi or the Brook family’s power?","“Immediately send someone to confirm the location,” Gu Zheng ordered with his eyes closed. At this moment, the poison in his body had already begun to spread. Coupled with the fact that he had not been sleeping well for the past few days, he was in unbearable pain.","However, he could not fall. He had not found Qiao Xi yet!","The next day.","Song Shijing had exciting news. They had found Huo Yuzhou.","Gu Zheng immediately ordered, “Let’s go!”","On the other hand, Huo Yuzhou learned that Gu Zheng had gone out to sea and raised an eyebrow. “I didn’t expect him to discover us so quickly.”","“I find it a little strange too. How did Mr. Gu find us so quickly and confirm that we’re on this cruise ship?”","Huo Yuzhou’s eyebrows suddenly twitched. “How has Xi Xi been recently?”","“Miss Qiao is in a good state. Other than eating and sleeping, she reads books to pass the time.”","It could not be Qiao Xi. She could not send any news at sea. Moreover, she had not even left her room recently.","Originally, Huo Yuzhou thought that Gu Zheng would only be able to find him half a month later. Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng had only returned to Li City for three days and was already rushing toward them.","“Don’t let Xi Xi know about this.” Huo Yuzhou paused for a moment and instructed, “Get the doctor to check Xi Xi’s body.”","At this moment, Qiao Xi was trying her best to contact the outside world. The number of places she could go to was limited, and every time she went out, there would be a servant accompanying her. It was very difficult to send news.","At this moment, a young doctor knocked on the door and walked in. Qiao Xi raised her eyes and glanced over. It was an unfamiliar face.","“Put the medicine down and leave.”","“Mr. Huo asked me to check your body. If there’s nothing wrong, I’ll get the nurse to help you apply the medicine.”","Qiao Xi did not refuse his suggestion, so the doctor sat opposite her and placed his hand on her wrist to take her pulse. “Miss Qiao, you haven’t been sleeping well recently. You’re injured, so you have to rest well. Set your worries aside.”","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “The ship is too shaky, so I can’t sleep well.”","The doctor nodded thoughtfully. “It’s indeed not suitable to recuperate on a ship. Miss Qiao, you should rest on shore. Otherwise, there might be aftereffects.”","The two of them casually chatted for a while before the doctor left. Qiao Xi looked at the doctor’s back and sighed in her heart. She did not know if Huo Yuzhou would dock for her. She could not send a message and could only use this method to delay Huo Yuzhou until Gu Zheng came to save her.","“Miss Qiao’s injuries aren’t serious, but it’s been bumpy on the sea these past few days. Coupled with the humid air, it’s not an ideal environment for her injuries to recover.”","Qiao Xi stood at the door and heard the conversation between the doctor and Huo Yuzhou. Although she had never seen that doctor, when the doctor took her pulse just now, she realized that the doctor’s finger technique was special and guessed that this person should be from the Medical Association.","If he was from the Medical Association, it meant that Third Brother had already found Huo Yuzhou. As long as the cruise ship docked, Third Brother would be able to rush over.","Ten minutes later, Huo Yuzhou ordered them to stop by the shore. However, they were still a distance away from the shore. It would take at least five hours for them to reach the shore.","Qiao Xi was bored and could only read medical books to pass the time.","Huo Yuzhou pushed the door open and walked in. The first thing he saw was Qiao Xi leaning against the bed with her head lowered, reading a book. She was wearing a white long-sleeved nightdress, and her dark hair was casually draped over her shoulders. Her long eyelashes left shadows on her eyelids. When she saw him enter, she pursed her beautiful lips as if she was a little dissatisfied.","Without a doubt, Qiao Xi was very beautiful. She was stunning like a delicate and beautiful rose. Unfortunately, she was as thorny as a rose too.","“Get out!” Qiao Xi said angrily.","Huo Yuzhou’s eyes turned cold, but he slowly approached her and looked down at her. “Xi Xi, forget about Gu Zheng. Come back to Y Nation with me. As long as you agree, I’ll handle everything and protect you well. I won’t let you be hurt at all.”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Mr. Huo, you saved me to discuss terms with Gu Zheng, right? You took me away because you think you’re not Gu Zheng’s match, so you can only use me to restrain Gu Zheng. Since you’ve already made your plans, why pretend to be affectionate in front of me?”","Huo Yuzhou’s eyes were red as if he was extremely hurt. After calming down for a long time, he gritted his teeth and said, “In your eyes, I’m an unscrupulous and sinister person, while Gu Zheng is an honest powerhouse?”"]},{"number":1677,"title":"Chapter 1677 I’m Here To Bring Xi Xi Home","paragraphs":["1677 I’m Here To Bring Xi Xi Home","Qiao Xi replied without raising her head, “Mr. Huo, you’re quite self-aware. You stole the book in my hand from Grandpa’s library. At the very least, Gu Zheng wouldn’t do such a thing.”","These words struck a nerve with Huo Yuzhou. A trace of heat surged out of his eyes, and his anger almost burned Qiao Xi to ashes.","He grabbed Qiao Xi’s wrist and pressed her onto the bed, locking her tightly.","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with shock. The man in front of her emitted a chill, and the emotions in his eyes surged. She knew that it was a sign of danger.","“Let go of me! Huo Yuzhou!” Qiao Xi turned her face away and ordered coldly.","Huo Yuzhou panted heavily as he looked at Qiao Xi’s snow-white skin that was exposed to the air because of her struggle. His gaze burned even more, and his voice became hoarse. “Since you said I’m a sinister person, I’ll let you see just that!”","With that, Huo Yuzhou bent down and kissed her cheek.","The man’s scorching breath sprayed on Qiao Xi’s neck, causing her entire body to tremble. At this moment, Qiao Xi could no longer calm down and struggled violently. “Huo Yuzhou! Are you crazy? If you dare to force me, I’ll kill you myself!”","Huo Yuzhou stopped in his tracks and stood up slightly. He stared at her with a burning gaze. After calming down for a moment, he let go of Qiao Xi and turned to leave the room.","Qiao Xi’s words heavily smashed into his heart, so he lost control. However, he knew very well that if he forced Qiao Xi, the consequences would be very serious. He did not want the only woman he loved in his life to hate him, so he fled and did not even dare to look at Qiao Xi again.","Night fell.","The cruise ship was docked at the shore. This city was not big, and there was no one at the pier. There was only their ship nearby.","After that, Huo Yuzhou never entered Qiao Xi’s room again. She could finally sleep peacefully.","At ten at night.","Huo Yuzhou became a little anxious. “Gu Zheng isn’t here yet?”","“Sir, should we send someone to take a look? There are very few boats around here. We’ll be able to spot them as long as they approach us.”","Huo Yuzhou shook his head. “There’s no need. Since Gu Zheng has already gone out to sea, he’ll definitely come.”","The assistant suddenly could not help but ask, “But if Mr. Gu is coming, doesn’t that mean Miss Qiao will leave?”","Sir was letting Miss Qiao leave just like that? How could he be willing?","At the mention of Qiao Xi, Huo Yuzhou’s expression was extremely complicated. He smiled bitterly. “She doesn’t love me. Forcefully keeping her by my side will only make her hate me more and more.”","Huo Yuzhou stood up abruptly. “How many people did he bring?”","“His boat is docked nearby. He got on our boat by himself.”","“By himself?” Huo Yuzhou could not help but be a little surprised. In the current situation, Gu Zheng should know very well how dangerous it was to appear here alone.","Was he too stupid, or was he too confident that he could escape unscathed?","“Let’s go! We’ll meet him!” Huo Yuzhou looked at the room not far away. “Let Qiao Xi go with me.”","Not long after, the assistant brought Qiao Xi out of the room. She was dressed neatly with a calm expression and slightly pursed lips. She had guessed that Gu Zheng was here. No matter what, she had to leave with Gu Zheng.","She had not left the cabin for the past few days. Now that she had just walked out, a bone-piercing cold wind assaulted her, making her tremble.","She looked up and saw a tall man standing on the deck. He was wearing a black windbreaker that almost blended into the night. When he heard footsteps, he slowly looked up.","It had only been a few days since they last met, but Qiao Xi felt as if a lifetime had passed. Gu Zheng was still elegant and noble. Even though he looked a little tired, it could not hide his kingly aura.","As if they shared telepathy, the instant Gu Zheng looked up, his gaze passed through the crowd and met Qiao Xi’s gaze.","At this moment, Huo Yuzhou had already walked in front of him. Gu Zheng said indifferently, “I’m here to bring Xi Xi home.”","The cold wind at the pier at night was biting cold, and the surrounding was filled with the salty smell of seawater. However, Gu Zheng’s words warmly struck Qiao Xi’s heart, causing her eyes to well up with tears.","Huo Yuzhou blocked his gaze and said coldly, “Gu Zheng, you should know why I’m looking for you.”","Gu Zheng said indifferently, “The Brook family.”","“That’s right.” A trace of viciousness flashed past Huo Yuzhou’s eyes. “I’ve been scheming in the Brook family for so many years. I don’t want your appearance to affect my status.”","“Mr. Huo, you’re overthinking things. I’m not interested in the Brook family.”"]},{"number":1678,"title":"Chapter 1678 We’re Surrounded","paragraphs":["1678 We’re Surrounded","Huo Yuzhou was a little surprised. That was the powerful Brook family. It was not easy for him to sit in the position of heir. The head of the Brook family thought highly of Gu Zheng and even cleared the obstacles for him. How could Gu Zheng not be interested?","Gu Zheng could tell that he was shocked, and a trace of coldness burst out of his eyes. “You should know that the people who chased after Xi Xi were sent by the Brook family. Do you think it’s possible for me to work with the people who hurt Xi Xi?”","Huo Yuzhou narrowed his eyes and stared fixedly at Gu Zheng. He was willing to give up the monstrous power of the Brook family just because of Qiao Xi?","After a long silence, Huo Yuzhou suddenly smiled. “No wonder Xi Xi likes you. You’re indeed more qualified to be with her than me.”","Right on the heels of that, the assistant walked up to Gu Zheng with a document. “Mr. Gu, sign this document. From now on, you’ll have nothing to do with the Brook family.”","Gu Zheng took the pen without hesitation and signed his name on it. Then, he looked up. “Where’s Xi Xi?”","Ten minutes ago.","The young doctor walked to Qiao Xi’s side. “Miss Qiao, your body isn’t suitable for the cold wind. You should go to the cabin and wait.”","Qiao Xi glanced at the people on the deck. Their negotiation seemed to be going very smoothly. Coupled with the fact that she was indeed very cold, she agreed to return to the cabin and wait.","After they entered the cabin, the doctor suddenly laughed. “Miss Qiao, I’m afraid you won’t be able to leave today!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the servants and bodyguards beside her fell to the floor. Qiao Xi took a few steps back, tensed her body, and looked at the doctor warily. “What’s wrong with them?”","The doctor smiled sinisterly. “They’re just unconscious. Don’t worry. I know you’re immune to poison and it’s useless to drug you, but if you run away, I’ll kill them to vent my anger. You can’t bear to see so many innocent lives die because of you, right?!”","Qiao Xi’s gaze was cold. “You’re not one of Huo Yuzhou’s men?”","“I didn’t say I was one of his.”","“The patriarch of the Brook family, then?” Qiao Xi probed.","“You’re right!” The doctor’s voice was cold. “You seduced the heirs chosen by the head of the family and ruined his plan. He’s already being lenient by not killing you. As long as you obediently follow me to see the head of the family, I won’t kill you. However, if you’re disobedient, I’ll kill you directly!”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Kill me? That depends on whether you have the ability. Moreover, their lives can’t threaten me. They’re unrelated to me, so I can’t give up my chance to escape for them.”","“You can choose not to care about them, but you probably don’t know this yet, right? Gu Zheng’s poison has acted up!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes instantly widened, and her voice trembled. “What did you say?”","“The head of the family has always thought highly of Gu Zheng, the heir, but he’s not the only choice. Now that he has given up the chance to inherit the Brooke family for you, there’s no need to keep him. The poison in Gu Zheng’s body has already acted up, and he shouldn’t be able to see anymore. However, in order to save you, he chose to take a powerful medicine to suppress the poison. As a result, the backlash he’s suffering from is also huge. Before long, he’ll become blind and might even lose his life.","“If it weren’t for you, Gu Zheng would have led the Brook family to the peak. You ruined all of this!” The doctor’s voice gradually became crazy. “Qiao Xi! You can’t cure the poison in Gu Zheng’s body; only the head of the family can!","“As long as you leave with me now, Gu Zheng will have to work for the Brook family, and he’ll be able to live. He loves you so much. Can you bear to see him die?”","Qiao Xi’s heart instantly turned cold. She did not expect that Gu Zheng would forcefully suppress the poison in order to save her.","Her heart seemed to have been cut open, and she felt a dull pain. This man clearly loved her to the bone, but she still suspected him!","“This is bad! We’re surrounded!”","“Gu Zheng!”","The shouts from outside caused Qiao Xi’s entire body to tremble. The doctor smiled proudly. “They’re here.”","Qiao Xi guessed that the head of the Brook family wanted to bring her away probably because of her blood. Once she fell into the tiger’s den, it would be difficult for her to escape.","When Huo Yuzhou and Gu Zheng realized that the situation was not right, four boats had already surrounded them. The people on the boats were all armed with guns."]},{"number":1679,"title":"Chapter 1679 Her Heart Found A Safe Haven","paragraphs":["1679 Her Heart Found A Safe Haven","At this moment, Huo Yuzhou realized that all his bodyguards were gone. He turned around and saw that everyone had fallen unconscious.","Gu Zheng subconsciously shouted, “Xi Xi!”","Then, everyone saw the doctor holding Qiao Xi hostage as he walked out of the cabin. “The two of you don’t have to be nervous. The head of the family just wants to invite Miss Qiao as a guest. He won’t hurt her. We only want Miss Qiao. After we leave, we’ll give you the antidote.”","Song Shijing realized that something was wrong and came to the ship from the other side. There was a trace of panic in his eyes. “President, there are many people on the other side, and they’re all armed. Mr. Huo’s people are all unconscious. We...”","Huo Yuzhou’s expression darkened. He actually had the patriarch’s men by his side. He brought Qiao Xi to the sea to avoid the Brook family’s spies. Unexpectedly...","This doctor was not on the ship in the beginning. He was sent by Guan Hui. Only then did Huo Yuzhou realize that Guan Hui had informed the head of the family and colluded with him to scheme against him!","“Miss Qiao, let’s go.” The doctor looked up at her. “You can ignore others, but you should think about Mr. Gu! If you insist on resisting, the head of the family won’t mind killing them all!”","The moment that was said, everyone’s expressions turned cold.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at the four boats. If they really fought, Gu Zheng would have no chance of winning. How could she watch Gu Zheng die?","The head of the Brook family was vicious. He would not allow Gu Zheng to ruin his plan just because he admired him. For now, she could only leave first and find a chance to escape in the future.","Qiao Xi turned around and walked toward the ship. The doctor smiled proudly and reached out to help her.","The next second, the doctor was kicked away. Gu Zheng’s figure rushed in front of Qiao Xi like a cheetah, and the wind made a violent sound.","The man’s cold breath surged over as he hugged her tightly. His light brown eyes were filled with complicated emotions. His low voice sounded in her ear. “I’ll bring you away.”","At that instant, Qiao Xi seemed to see the light emitted from his body. The pain from so many days instantly dissipated. She knew that this man loved her very much, even more than his life.","Hot tears trickled down her face. His rough fingers brushed past her smooth and fair cheeks as he gently wiped her tears. Her heart, which had been calm for many days, thumped violently. His cold aura surrounded her, and at this moment, her heart found a safe haven.","“Don’t cry, I won’t let them take you away.”","Gu Zheng’s voice was hoarse, and his eyes were cold but filled with heartache.","The doctor almost fell and was instantly infuriated. “Gu Zheng! Don’t think that you can disobey the old master just because he admires you! If you dare to stop me from taking Qiao Xi away, then I can only kill you!”","Qiao Xi’s body trembled as she hugged Gu Zheng tightly.","“Don’t be afraid.” Gu Zheng shielded her behind him. “I came here today to take you away. I have to do it even if it takes my last breath. I won’t go back on my word.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the people on the ship raised their guns one after another. Dozens of guns were aimed at them. With a single order, the couple would die on the spot.","Huo Yuzhou looked at the scene in front of him with a dark expression.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng. His hair fell and danced with the sea breeze, but his eyes were extremely firm.","Before Qiao Xi could say anything, Huo Yuzhou boarded one of the ships. As the heir of the Brook family, his power was second only to the head of the family. No one dared to stop him when they saw him board the ship.","Gu Zheng pulled Qiao Xi into his arms and gently stroked her back. His voice was low and hoarse. “Don’t be afraid, Xi Xi. I’ll bring you away.”","“Gu Zheng!”","At this moment, a voice came from the ship. A young man walked out, and his voice was filled with threat. “What right do you have to take her away? Are you willing to throw your life away for a woman?”","Gu Zheng’s and Huo Yuzhou’s expressions darkened when they saw this man. However, the man ordered indifferently, “Gu Zheng, as the head of the family, I order you to let go immediately. Otherwise, bear the consequences!”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled. He was the patriarch of the Brook family?","Although she had never seen the head of the Brook family, she knew that he was definitely an old man in his 60s or 70s. The young man in front of her looked to be only 30 years old, so he should be the new head of the family."]},{"number":1680,"title":"Chapter 1680 Willing To Give Her Life","paragraphs":["1680 Willing To Give Her Life","Originally, the heir the old master thought highly of was Huo Yuzhou. After that, it was Gu Zheng. However, the old master actually chose another stranger and he rose to power in just a few days. It seemed that this man’s strength could not be underestimated.","“Gu Zheng, are you sure you want to be my enemy for this woman?” the man asked coldly.","“If you want to take Xi Xi away, you’re my enemy.” Gu Zheng protected Qiao Xi in his arms, his voice filled with determination.","A man in a black windbreaker walked toward them. He was wearing a mask and hat, revealing only his eyes. His appearance could not be seen clearly. He was like a demon who had walked out of hell as he slowly raised his gun at Qiao Xi.","Bang!","A gunshot pierced through the air and hit the sky above Qiao Xi. The shell fell from the sky and hit the deck.","“Since you’re unwilling to leave, I can only kill you!”","As soon as these words were spoken, everyone aimed their guns at Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi frowned. Her family mainly wanted to capture her for her blood, but this man really wanted to kill her. Moreover, she kept having the feeling that this man was a little familiar.","After a few seconds of silence, she said helplessly, “I’ll go with you.”","“No!” Gu Zheng roared and held her hand tightly.","The man smiled in satisfaction. “Come over yourself and I’ll let them go. Otherwise, Gu Zheng, Xue Liang, Qin An, and everyone here will die here!”","Qiao Xi looked at the black muzzles, and her eyes were slightly teary. If she refused, bullets would take their lives. In front of weapons, they were indeed a little weak.","The man looked at her conflicted expression and was extremely proud, but the next second, he could not smile anymore.","Huo Yuzhou had raised his gun and pressed it against the man’s head. His voice was cold. “If you kill them, I’ll kill you too. Let’s die together.”","His move completely changed the situation. Brook’s people instantly panicked. They did not dare to raise their guns at Huo Yuzhou and could only watch this scene in horror.","“Huo Yuzhou, are you going against me for this woman?”","“Let them go! I’ll go back with you!” Huo Yuzhou gritted his teeth.","The man suddenly laughed, then quickly said, “Kill her!”","As soon as these words were spoken, one of them suddenly shot at Qiao Xi.","Bang!","Qiao Xi was pushed away by Gu Zheng. The bullet brushed past his arm, and blood gushed out. Due to the strong inertia, Qiao Xi fell into the sea.","Huo Yuzhou pressed the gun in his hand against the man’s head. “I’m warning you, tell them to stop immediately. Otherwise, I’ll really kill you!”","The man stared fixedly at the surface of the sea. Gu Zheng was actually willing to take a bullet for Qiao Xi and even jump into the sea without caring about his injuries. If he gave the order to shoot again, they would not be able to escape.","A man like Gu Zheng actually disregarded his life for a woman. It was the same for Huo Yuzhou. He really did not understand what charm Qiao Xi and Xia Yunqiu had to make those men willingly give up their lives for them.","The man knew that Huo Yuzhou was really determined to kill him. If he gave the order to shoot, Huo Yuzhou would kill him with one shot. There was a high chance that those people would not attack Huo Yuzhou. After all, he controlled a third of the Brook family’s power. If they killed him, the family would be in chaos and everyone would be affected.","He was silent for a long time before waving his hand lightly. Those people returned to the cabin and sailed away on three of the boats.","Huo Yuzhou smirked. “Thank you, Patriarch.”","“I’ve thought of many possibilities and was prepared to fight Gu Zheng. I didn’t expect to be defeated by you.” The man sneered.","“You saved her once, but you can’t save her life. I’ll kill her sooner or later!” The man’s eyes were filled with maliciousness and killing intent.","Huo Yuzhou noticed something and asked tentatively, “Do you have a grudge against Qiao Xi?”","Although the man did not answer, Huo Yuzhou was already sure that his hatred for Qiao Xi could not be hidden.","After Qiao Xi fell into the sea, the stinging seawater caused her entire body to stiffen. Coupled with the fact that her injuries had yet to recover, her consciousness gradually became blurry, and her body sank uncontrollably.","In a daze, a figure swam toward her. His strong arms wrapped around her waist as he hugged her and swam up.","Qiao Xi opened her eyes. In the cold seawater, the man’s eyes were still so bright and deep. At this moment, Gu Zheng seemed to be a god who had descended to earth, his entire body emitting light.","Her consciousness gradually blurred. At the last moment, his slightly cold lips landed on hers, and his hot breath dissipated every trace of coldness in her body."]},{"number":1681,"title":"Chapter 1681 Didn’t Have Time To Say A Word Of Gratitude","paragraphs":["1681 Didn’t Have Time To Say A Word Of Gratitude","Gu Zheng hugged Qiao Xi tightly, his expression cold. “Song Shijing, drive to the hospital!”","At this moment, he only had eyes for Qiao Xi in his arms. Ignoring the gunshot wound on his body, he carried her and quickly rushed into the car. Song Shijing quickly drove to the nearest hospital.","After seeing Qiao Xi leave safely, Huo Yuzhou put down his gun and muttered, “Once you leave the sea, you won’t be Gu Zheng’s match. He won’t give you a chance to hurt Xi Xi.”","The man knew that it was meaningless to continue chasing after her. He snorted. “Let’s go!”","Huo Yuzhou got off the ship and looked at Xue Liang. The two of them looked at each other but neither said a word.","The two of them became strangers long ago, but if it were not for Huo Yuzhou today, it would’ve been very difficult for them to leave alive. Xue Liang did not know what to say.","“Young Master Xue, let’s go!” Song Shiyu drove in front of him. Xue Liang immediately turned around and left. He did not even have the time to thank the man.","At this moment, in the hospital.","Gu Zheng was drenched, and his hair was still dripping. However, he did not look disheveled at all. Instead, he looked attractive.","Qin An had long called the hospital. The dean had also arranged for doctors to wait in the ward. Qiao Xi’s injuries were not serious, but those who were familiar with her knew that she was very afraid of water, which was why she fainted.","After the doctor diagnosed Qiao Xi and confirmed that she was fine, he saw the blood dripping on the floor and instantly exclaimed, “Mr. Gu, your wound needs to be bandaged quickly!”","Gu Zheng was wearing a black windbreaker. His body was drenched, so the blood stains weren’t visible. However, at this moment, his blood and seawater mixed together and dripped onto the floor along the corner of his shirt. It was a shocking sight.","Gu Zheng had a calm expression as he continued to stare at Qiao Xi, who was lying on the hospital bed. His lips were pale and trembling slightly. His brows were tightly furrowed as if he was suppressing the pain.","Song Shijing said quickly, “President, the doctor said that Young Madam’s injury isn’t serious. You should treat your wound first. Otherwise, Young Madam will be sad to see you like this when she wakes up.”","“Alright.” Gu Zheng stood up and went to the ward next door. He sat down tiredly and took off his jacket, revealing the wound on his arm. The bullet had grazed his arm, leaving a deep wound. After being in seawater, the flesh around the wound began to turn white. This kind of pain was not something ordinary people could withstand, but he remained silent and expressionless.","The doctor hurriedly cleaned his wound. He sincerely admired this man.","While getting his wound treated, Gu Zheng closed his eyes and panted slightly. His face gradually turned pale, and cold sweat dripped down his forehead. The doctor’s hands trembled.","After applying the ointment, the doctor heaved a sigh of relief. “Mr. Gu, your wound is very deep. You need to apply the ointment every five hours. You can’t let it come in contact with water, lest your wound becomes inflamed.”","With that, Gu Zheng nodded, put on a clean jacket, and quickly walked toward the ward opposite. His anxious appearance made Song Shijing and Qin An sigh.","Previously, there were rumors online. Because of them, Qin An wanted to settle the score with Gu Zheng, but now that he saw him, he knew that he would absolutely not betray Qiao Xi.","Fortunately, he found her after going through a few hardships.","Gu Zheng could not imagine what would happen if he were to lose Qiao Xi. Just thinking about that scene made his heart ache like it was being pricked by needles.","Suddenly, the scene in front of him became blurry, and waves of sharp pain caused him to be unable to help but close his eyes. He lay exhaustedly beside Qiao Xi and gently pulled her into his arms before sleeping peacefully.","The next morning, Gu Zheng was woken up by a knock on the door. Song Shijing walked in and said in a low voice, “President, there’s news.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes suddenly turned cold. He quickly stood up and left the ward, closing the door gently. Song Shijing said, “When Huo Yuzhou took Young Madam away, the old patriarch of the Brook family abdicated. That young man became the new patriarch of the family, and the old patriarch is already under house arrest.”","“Who exactly is he?” Gu Zheng asked coldly.","He had been in contact with the old patriarch of the family for a period of time. Huo Yuzhou had also stayed with the Brook family for so many years, but they had never met such a person. This person had become the new patriarch of the family in just a few days. It was enough to show that he was resourceful.","Song Shijing also sensed that the man was dangerous and said in a low voice, “I haven’t found out his identity, but I can confirm that his surname is Meng.”"]},{"number":1682,"title":"Chapter 1682 Longwan Residential Hasn’t Seen Blood For A Long Time","paragraphs":["1682 Longwan Residential Hasn’t Seen Blood For A Long Time","Gu Zheng frowned. He had never heard of a large family with the surname Meng. After a long silence, Gu Zheng suddenly recalled that Qiao Xi had said that she had seen a doctor called Meng Fan in the Medical Association. Not only did he know the secret of her blood, but he also seemed to be filled with hostility toward her.","This did not seem to be a coincidence. Could that person be Meng Fan?","“Investigate this man’s relationship with Xia Yunqiu.”","“Madam Xia?” Song Shijing was surprised, then nodded.","The new patriarch of the family looked to be at most 30 years old. What could he have to do with Madam Xia? When Madam Xia passed away, he was still a child!","Song Shijing suddenly thought of something and reported, “President, apart from the Brook family, there were also people sent by He Wenxian to kill Young Madam that night. Uncle Sheng has already sent someone to lock He Wenxian up in Longwan Residential. What should we do with her?”","Gu Zheng knew very well in his heart that the old patriarch of the Brook family did not want to kill Qiao Xi, but He Wenxian did. He would absolutely not let this go.","“He Weinian spent a lot of effort to send He Wenxian overseas, but she insisted on courting death. Let’s fulfill her wish!” Gu Zheng’s eyes burst with strong killing intent. “Let Uncle Sheng handle it.”","“Roger that!” Song Shijing’s heart trembled. Ever since the president and Young Madam got married, Longwan Residential had not seen blood for a long time.","An entire day later, Qiao Xi still did not wake up. Her injuries were not serious, so it was probably because she had been too nervous recently that she fell into a deep sleep.","After Gu Zheng woke up, he had been by her side, applying medicine for her and massaging her. He even chatted with her like a silly boy in love.","Just then, Song Shijing knocked on the door. “President, Young Master Xia is here.”","Xia Jingan?","They were in a small city that was not developed. It seemed that Xia Jingan had some tricks up his sleeve to be able to find this place so quickly.","After a while, Xia Jingan entered and asked with a cold face, “Why aren’t you bringing Xi Xi back to Li City?”","Gu Zheng’s voice was indifferent. “This is my business. I have no reason to explain myself to you.”","“What’s going on between you and that female singer? Why did so many people come to look for Xi Xi recently? What are your plans for the Brook family?” Xia Jingan could not suppress the anger in his heart when he thought of Qiao Xi’s sad appearance.","“The Brook family attacked Xi Xi because of you. You know very well that you can’t let Xi Xi be in danger anymore!”","Gu Zheng’s body trembled, and his voice was low and hoarse. “I know.”","He lowered his eyes to look at Qiao Xi, whose face was pale. His eyes were filled with pity and love. “From now on, I’m enemies with the Brook family. It’s true that I didn’t protect Xi Xi well. When Xi Xi wakes up, I’ll beg her for forgiveness. Young Master Xia, you don’t have to be a busybody.”","“You’re just her cousin.” At this moment, a voice came from outside the door. Ye Qingyuan entered, looking travel-worn. There was a trace of coldness on his body.","“Young Master Xia, you also know about the grudge between the Xia family and Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi definitely doesn’t want to have any more dealings with the Xia family. Before you criticize Gu Zheng, you should first think about whether you’re qualified to do so.”","“Qingyuan,” Gu Zheng greeted with a smile.","Ye Qingyuan looked at him with a complicated expression. “You... Are you crazy? Do you want to die?”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes. He knew that Ye Qingyuan was blaming him for being too rash. He was clearly injured by a gunshot, yet he still jumped into the sea to save her. “If she’s not by my side, there’s no point in me living.”","When Ye Qingyuan heard this, the anger in his heart turned into helplessness. “Fortunately, you’re both safe and sound.”","With that, Ye Qingyuan looked at Xia Jingan with a gloomy expression. “You’re from the Xia family. It’s best if you don’t interact with Xi Xi in the future. She doesn’t lack a cousin like you.”","When Ye Qingyuan heard that Old Madam Xia wanted to bring Qiao Xi back to the capital, he knew that she definitely had ill intentions. If Qiao Xi really went to the capital, she would be a lamb waiting to be slaughtered.","Did Xia Jingan not know what an outsider like him knew? If he really cared about Qiao Xi, he should keep a distance.","Xia Jingan was instantly speechless. He knew that the Xia family had let Xia Yunqiu and Qiao Xi down, but he did not have any ill intentions. He just wanted to care about Qiao Xi.","Previously, he had already suspected his identity. When he found out that Qiao Xi was being chased after and went missing, he seemed to have some sort of telepathic connection. If they were not biological siblings, how could there be such a phenomenon?","He looked at the person on the bed with burning eyes. After not seeing her for a few days, she had lost a lot of weight. Her petite face was as pale as paper, and her breathing was shallow like a kitten. He could not bear to leave.","Ye Qingyuan said impatiently, “Young Master Xia, please leave!”","“Mhm... Don’t be noisy...”","Suddenly, a faint voice sounded. It sounded a little lazy and confused."]},{"number":1683,"title":"Chapter 1683 The Grudges Of The Previous Generation","paragraphs":["1683 The Grudges Of The Previous Generation","The ward instantly fell silent. The three men stopped breathing and looked at the woman on the bed. She narrowed her eyes and said coquettishly, “Don’t disturb my sleep!”","Qiao Xi slowly woke up. She had been asleep for too long that she was now unaccustomed to the dazzling sunlight. Gu Zheng immediately stood up and quickly closed the curtains. He turned around, then went to the bed to hold her hand. “Xi Xi!”","Ye Qingyuan was stunned for a few seconds before pulling Xia Jingan along. “Ah Zheng, we’ll go out first. Take good care of Xi Xi.”","Xi Xi had just woken up. The couple would definitely express their feelings for each other. The two of them should be sensible and go out, but Xia Jingan stood rooted to the ground.","Just as Ye Qingyuan was about to forcefully pull him out, Qiao Xi suddenly said, “I want to talk to Mr. Xia alone.”","Gu Zheng looked at her meaningfully. Seeing that her eyes were calm, he nodded. “Alright, you guys talk. I’ll wait for you outside.”","After the two men left, Qiao Xi went straight to the point and asked, “What exactly did you want to say that day?”","Xia Jingan took a deep breath and said helplessly, “I think you need to know about the grudges of the previous generation. Back then, my mother, Xia Zishan, fell in love with a man. This person happens to be Aunt Yunqiu’s fiance and the heir of the Situ family.","“Originally, the Xia family wanted to form a marriage alliance with the Situ family. Old Madam Xia was prepared to give this marriage to my mother, but after Aunt Yunqiu returned, Mr. Situ fell in love with her at first sight and wanted to marry her. My mother hated her and spent a lot of effort chasing Aunt Yunqiu away. When Mr. Situ found out, he fell out with the Xia family and took Aunt Yunqiu away. He completely cut off all contact with the Xia family.","“Ever since then, Xia Zishan became even crazier. She... She found out that a noble in Y Nation liked Aunt Yunqiu, but at that time, Aunt was already engaged to Mr. Situ. She relied on the fact that she was a little similar to Aunt Yunqiu and pretended to be Aunt to have sex with that noble. She even gave birth to a son.","“She went to Y Nation under Aunt Yunqiu’s name. That noble knew that she was not Aunt Yunqiu, but he still deceived himself and thought that the woman who gave birth to his child was Xia Yunqiu.","“After that, she returned to Li City. That man chased after her and said in public that he and Aunt Yunqiu had a child together. Old Madam Xia handed Aunt Yunqiu to that man and asked him to bring Aunt Yunqiu to Y Nation. This way, the Situ family’s engagement could only belong to Xia Zishan.”","Xia Jingan paused for a moment, and his tone carried a trace of mockery when he said, “But Mr. Situ’s heart was filled with Aunt Yunqiu. Even though Xia Zishan looked a little similar to her, he didn’t have any feelings for her at all. Everything Xia Zishan did was in vain. She ruined Xia Yunqiu’s reputation but also her own.","“Two years later, Aunt Yunqiu escaped from Y Nation, and Mr. Situ’s whereabouts were unknown. At that time, Xia Zishan adopted a child called Xia Chunyu, who was about your age.","“Xia Zishan looked for Mr. Situ everywhere, but there was no trace of him. She missed him so much that she committed suicide by jumping into the river.”","After the last word was said, the ward fell silent.","Qiao Xi was unable to understand why a woman would be unscrupulous for love and even force herself to have children with a man she did not love.","“That noble is Kang Ru. Xia Zishan’s son is Kang Jichuan!”","As soon as these words were spoken, Qiao Xi gasped. All the mysteries seemed to have been solved. In order to ruin her mother’s engagement, Xia Zishan set up a big plan. Yin Lianyi took the opportunity to chase her mother out of the Xia family and got Kang Ru to bring her to Y Nation.","She had long guessed that her mother would not like a selfish man like Kang Ru, much less bear him a child. It turned out that all of this was Xia Zishan’s scheme.","Xia Jingan suddenly laughed. “I’m about the same age as Kang Jichuan, but I’m not Kang Ru’s child.”","Qiao Xi had a shocked expression. Xia Zishan was the same age as Kang Jichuan, so how could she have given birth to two children with different fathers at the same time? Either Xia Jingan was not Xia Zishan’s child, or the Xia family had hidden Xia Jingan’s age.","Qiao Xi wanted to ask something else, but she felt that her throat was a little itchy. She could not help but cough a few times. The next second, the door was pushed open and Gu Zheng walked over with a glass of warm water in his hand. “Xi Xi, drink some water first.”","Qiao Xi took the glass and took two sips. When she met Gu Zheng’s eyes, they were red and dark. He even emitted a strong smell of medicine.","She instantly recalled the scene before she fainted. Gu Zheng was clearly injured by a gunshot.","At this moment, Ye Qingyuan said with an unhappy expression, “Mr. Xia, Xi Xi has just woken up and is still very weak. She’ll be fine soon. Come with me.”"]},{"number":1684,"title":"Chapter 1684 His Love Would Never Change","paragraphs":["1684 His Love Would Never Change","Xia Jingan could tell that Qiao Xi was indeed very weak, so he left with Ye Qingyuan.","At this moment, only Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng were left in the ward. The surroundings instantly fell silent.","Qiao Xi looked at the man in front of her. The two of them had experienced a near-death encounter together. When she saw him standing in front of her safe and sound, it was as if she had obtained the entire world.","Seeing that she was in a daze, Gu Zheng asked with concern, “Are you feeling unwell? I’ll go look for the doctor...”","Qiao Xi grabbed his hand and let him move closer. She gently stroked his eyes. His deep and amorous eyes were so bright and lively that she could not see any problems with them. However, she knew that his vision had already begun to blur.","In order to save her, Gu Zheng used medicine to suppress the poison, but forcefully suppressing it would cause a backlash. The consequences would be very serious the next time the poison acted up.","Qiao Xi had the urge to cry. She could not describe her feelings. She had blamed Gu Zheng when she was in danger, but at this moment, her heart ached.","When he jumped into the sea to save her without hesitation, she no longer blamed Gu Zheng. Though he might face many difficulties, the only thing that would never change was his love for her.","“Did your poison spread?”","Gu Zheng’s heart trembled as he pursed his lips tightly. His large palm stroked her smooth cheek as he muttered softly, “I’m fine. Don’t worry.”","Qiao Xi bit her lip.","Gu Zheng pulled her into his arms and sighed. “Xi Xi, I have to save you and bring you home. I can’t become blind. I’ve already recovered, so don’t be sad.”","Qiao Xi’s tears welled up in her eyes as she said with a sobbing tone, “You went to the capital because the patriarch of the Brook family wanted to attack me. Because of you, they delayed their attack by a week. I just didn’t expect He Wenxian to also send people to kill me.”","Gu Zheng had already done a very good job and could not be blamed for not rushing back to Li City in time.","“Right, what do you plan to do with Ji Tian?” Qiao Xi suddenly asked sourly.","Gu Zheng was stunned for a moment before he laughed.","She pinched his ear and grunted angrily. “How dare you laugh at a time like this?!”","“Xi Xi, you’re jealous. It looks like you’ve forgiven me.”","Initially, Gu Zheng was worried that she would be angry and unwilling to forgive him. Now, it seemed that she was not angry. This surprised him.","She rolled her eyes. “You didn’t do anything wrong. It’s obvious that the woman was deliberately hyping things up. She even hung up on me. You can’t let her off!”","She was not angry with Gu Zheng, but Ji Tian had made her so sad. She could not let this go.","Gu Zheng nodded, and a trace of coldness flashed past his eyes. Ji Tian had already paid the price for her actions.","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled as she nodded.","“The divine physician is seriously injured and unconscious. He’s in a private hospital in the capital now.” As soon as Gu Zheng finished speaking, Qiao Xi’s expression instantly changed.","“What? Grandpa is unconscious?” Qiao Xi felt as if she had fallen into an ice cellar, and her entire body turned cold.","He was seriously injured and unconscious! What exactly had he encountered?","“I contacted Ji Tian because of the divine physician. She saved your grandfather and contacted Ye Qingyuan. However, I suspect that your grandfather’s injury is related to her, so I haven’t chased her away. I want to find out more.” Gu Zheng stroked her head gently.","“Can he wake up?” Qiao Xi held his hand tightly, her eyes filled with anticipation.","“Yes,” Gu Zheng replied without hesitation. He could not bear to see her hurt, so he had to save the divine physician no matter what.","Hot tears trickled down her face and dripped onto Gu Zheng’s palm, burning him until his entire body trembled. He pulled Qiao Xi into his arms and gently patted her back. “He’ll definitely wake up. He still has to attend our wedding!”","At nine in the evening.","Qiao Xi leaned against the bed and looked at the photos sent from the capital. Qin An pushed the door open and entered. “Xi Xi, are you feeling better? I want to tell you something.”","“What’s wrong?” Qiao Xi put down her phone.","Qin An sat by her bed and said with a serious expression, “I checked Grandpa’s notes and realized that the spread of the poison is difficult to suppress. Even if Grandpa wakes up, he might not be able to save Gu Zheng. Back then, Miss Lu Qingyun died at the age of 37. If Gu Zheng still doesn’t have a way to detoxify the poison by the time he’s 37, it’s useless even if a god appears.","“During the spread of the poison, the patient will be in a lot of pain. They’ll lose their eyesight bit by bit over time and lose all mobility. Gu Zheng’s poison isn’t that serious, but if the poison is allowed to spread, he’ll become a cripple sooner or later. He won’t be able to see anything and can only sit in a wheelchair. He won’t even be able to protect himself, much less you.”"]},{"number":1685,"title":"Chapter 1685 Fighting Poison With Poison","paragraphs":["1685 Fighting Poison With Poison","Qiao Xi’s heart ached, and her breathing trembled. “The doctor on the ship said that the old patriarch of the Brook family has a way to detoxify the poison. What exactly is it?”","“Fight poison with poison.” Qin An frowned. “By giving him another poison, the two poisons will counter each other and slow down the spread of the poison. This method is risky, but as long as he survives it, he can at least keep his life for another ten years. He won’t lose his eyesight and mobility.”","Qiao Xi said anxiously, “Can’t he use my blood? I can—”","“He has already taken the poison.” Qin An interrupted Qiao Xi. This was Gu Zheng’s choice. He would rather choose a risky path than let Qiao Xi be hurt.","Qiao Xi was instantly stunned. It was as if someone had cut her heart, and her entire body went numb.","“Gu Zheng wants to protect you. He can’t become blind, much less crippled. He had no choice but to choose this method.”","After Qin An finished speaking, tears fell from the corners of Qiao Xi’s eyes. She choked and said, “Since you’ve already done it, why are you telling me?”","“If I hadn’t told you in advance, you would definitely have given Gu Zheng a blood transfusion. However, you’ve already done it once. No one can guarantee what the consequences will be if you go through it again. Gu Zheng won’t let you take that risk, and I won’t see you hurt yourself to save him.","“We reached a consensus, and this method was the best we could think of.”","Qin An could not help but feel bitter. When he saw Gu Zheng take the bullet for Xi Xi and jump into the sea to save her without hesitation, he knew that Xi Xi had married the right person.","Looking at Qiao Xi’s dejected appearance, Qin An smiled and comforted her. “Don’t cry. Gu Zheng doesn’t want you to be sad either. The most important thing for you now is to recuperate.”","“Where is he?”","“He’s in the ward next door. He’s unconscious.”","Qiao Xi pursed her lips, and Qin An did not say anything else. He stood up and left. As soon as he left, he saw her rush toward Gu Zheng’s ward.","At this moment, Gu Zheng’s clothes were already drenched in sweat. He was wrapped in a thick blanket, but he still felt bone-piercingly cold. It was as if he was in an ice cellar. It was like every inch of his body was covered in cuts, and it was so painful that he could not help but tremble.","Qin An said that the process of fighting poison with poison would be very painful. Gu Zheng was always beaten up and injured when he was young. He was no longer afraid of pain, but he never expected it to hurt this badly. It was so painful that he wished he were dead!","Suddenly, a pair of warm hands landed on his forehead, and he felt a warm breath on his face. Gu Zheng used all his strength to open his eyes and shouted weakly, “Xi Xi.”","His voice was extremely hoarse as he was enduring the intense pain. His voice trembled as he looked at her gently with a smile. “I’m sorry I made the decision myself. Don’t be angry with me.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes burned as she bit her lip, not making a sound.","“I can’t become a cripple. I said that I would protect you for the rest of my life, and I won’t go back on my word.” His voice was hoarse like never before. “Even if it’s for you, I’ll try my best to survive.”","Qiao Xi’s tears trickled down. Looking at the man’s painful expression, she pounced into his arms and sobbed.","“Gu Zheng! What right do you have to hide it from me? You secretly ran to the capital and made a decision with Qin An. Do you still think of me as your wife? Why didn’t you tell me?”","Qiao Xi wiped her tears on his chest and said hatefully, “If you dare to make a decision behind my back again, I’ll ignore you!”","He endured the pain and reached out to touch her smooth and fair cheek.","After the bone-chilling pain, he realized that his vision had recovered and was back to normal. Even without turning on the lights, he could still see Qiao Xi’s appearance clearly. This meant he could also protect Qiao Xi at night now.","Back then, his mother probably chose this method to suppress the poison because she could not bear to part with him. She did not want to spend the rest of her life in darkness.","It was the same for Gu Zheng. Perhaps he only had ten years to accompany Qiao Xi, but at the very least, he could accompany her like a normal person for the next ten years. He could travel with her, cook for her, and protect her from harm.","He had to pave a way out for Qiao Xi in these ten years and let her live the rest of her life in peace.","After returning to the ward, Qiao Xi saw a pop-up on her phone: [Shocking! Female Singer Ji Tian Has Been Banned!]","The general content of the news article was that Ji Tian clearly knew that Gu Zheng had a wife, but she still tried her best to pester him and deliberately exposed those photos. Gu Zheng was dissatisfied with her actions, so he canceled the contract between Gu Corporation and her. At the same time, she was suspected of being involved in a murder case and was arrested by the police. The Ji family also announced to the public that they would cut ties with her. Overnight, Ji Tian went from a popular singer to a prisoner.","It had to be said that Gu Zheng’s actions were really straightforward!"]},{"number":1686,"title":"Chapter 1686 Bring Her Back For The Xia Family’s Reputation","paragraphs":["1686 Bring Her Back For The Xia Family’s Reputation","A week later, Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng were discharged from the hospital and returned to Longwan Residential.","Uncle Sheng and Xiao Lan tidied up Longwan Residential and even made many delicious dishes to celebrate their safe return.","When everyone in Li City heard that Mrs. Gu was back, they all used the excuse of visiting to please Gu Zheng. However, they were all rejected by Uncle Sheng. There was only one person whom Uncle Sheng could not make the decision on.","“Young Madam, Old Madam Xia called to say that she wants to visit you.”","“Yin Lianyi?”","“Yes, she personally called and even sent someone to deliver the invitation. She’s the old madam of the Xia family, after all, so I didn’t refuse immediately. I just said that it would depend on your body’s recovery.”","Actually, Uncle Sheng did not want Young Madam to go. After all, even a fool could tell that Old Madam Xia had ill intentions.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi smiled. “Old Madam Xia invited me so sincerely. Of course, I have to see her!”","Uncle Sheng was a little surprised, but he still called back according to her wishes.","The next day, Old Madam Xia came to visit. Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng were also waiting at home, but this time, not only was Old Madam Xia here, but Xia Chunyu also came.","Xia Chunyu helped Yin Lianyi into the villa. Xia Chunyu seemed to have changed into a different person. When she saw Qiao Xi, she even called out obediently, “Sister Xi Xi.”","Yin Lianyi chuckled and said, “Xi Xi, Chunyu has already told me everything. She was too wilful and made you angry, so I came to visit today to get Chunyu to apologize to you.”","Xia Chunyu handed her a box. “Sister Xi Xi, this is my apology gift. It was my fault before. Can you forgive me?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. Was this person really Xia Chunyu? She actually apologized so submissively?","It seemed that Yin Lianyi had said something that made the arrogant Xia Chunyu lower her voice in front of her. There must be a great benefit to it. That was why she hid her resentment and came to apologize.","Qiao Xi took the gift and said indifferently, “You’re being so sincere, so, of course, I’ll forgive you!”","The smile on Xia Chunyu’s face was a little stiff, but Yin Lianyi, who was at the side, was very natural. She did not like Qiao Xi, but she had to coax Qiao Xi to come back to the Xia family. It was not only for her blood but also for the Xia family’s reputation.","She had promised Chunyu that even if Qiao Xi returned to the Xia family, it would be absolutely impossible for her to surpass Chunyu’s status. When Qiao Xi arrived in the capital and their territory, they could slowly deal with Qiao Xi.","Yin Lianyi sat down and slowly said, “Xi Xi, you’re Yunqiu’s daughter, so you’re a child of the Xia family. You should return to the capital and show your face so that everyone knows your identity.”","Qiao Xi chuckled, and her eyes carried a trace of ridicule.","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with doubt. “That’s really strange! You found me last year. This matter should have spread to the capital a long time ago. Why did you come looking for me now?”","“...” Old Madam Xia was instantly speechless.","Qiao Xi put on a lonely expression. “The Yin family has long announced my identity to the public. As my real grandmother, you only came to look for me at this time? Actually, you don’t want me to return to the Xia family, right? It’s just that my identity has spread. So for the sake of the Xia family’s reputation, you can only bring me back.”","“Qiao Xi!” Yin Lianyi’s expression was gloomy.","“I know you don’t like Mom, so you don’t like me. Moreover, if I return to the Xia family, Miss Xia, the adopted daughter, will be in an awkward situation, so I shouldn’t go back.”","“Shut up!” Yin Lianyi glared at her.","Qiao Xi was shocked, and her eyes turned red from grievance. The servants beside her all felt their hearts ache.","Seeing the people around her sigh, Yin Lianyi calmed down and said gently, “Xi Xi, you’ve misunderstood. I’ve long wanted to bring you home, but the Xia family was in chaos at that time, so it wasn’t safe to bring you home. That’s why...”","“The Xia family was in chaos? Why didn’t I hear about it? On the contrary, it was the Qiao family that was in chaos!” Qiao Xi sighed lightly. “My stepmother and the illegitimate daughter wanted to chase me out of the Qiao family, so I was struggling to survive under their hands. Old Madam Xia, did you think that it was safe for me to stay with the Qiao family?”","Everyone in Li City knew how much Mrs. Gu had suffered in the Qiao family’s residence back then. Qiao Rou stole her fiance, and Xu Mei schemed to frame her. It was only after she married Mr. Gu that Mrs. Gu completely broke away from that family.","Now, Old Madam Xia was saying that it was safer for Mrs. Gu to stay with the Qiao family as the Xia family was in chaos back then?","Would anyone believe her?","Xia Chunyu, the adopted daughter, was living so comfortably with the Xia family. She even became a popular socialite in the capital. The adopted daughter was living so comfortably, but Qiao Xi was living in fear!"]},{"number":1687,"title":"Chapter 1687 Becoming The Noble Daughter Of The Xia Family","paragraphs":["1687 Becoming The Noble Daughter Of The Xia Family","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression, while Old Madam Xia’s expression was extremely ugly. “Xi Xi, I personally came to bring you home, but this is your attitude? Didn’t your mother teach you how to respect your elders?”","Qiao Xi’s face turned cold. “My mother passed away a long time ago. Indeed, no one educated me. I wasn’t a child raised by you, so it’s normal that you don’t like me. There’s no need for you to bring me home.”","Yin Lianyi was instantly infuriated and glared at her fiercely. Xia Chunyu, who was at the side, hurriedly said, “Sister Xi Xi, Grandma is your elder. How can you speak to Grandma like this?”","Xia Chunyu walked in front of Qiao Xi and held her hand. “As a junior, you have to know how to respect your elders. Quickly apologize to Grandma.”","Before Qiao Xi could speak, Gu Zheng suddenly chuckled. “Old Madam Xia, Xi Xi can go back with you, but she has to go back as the eldest daughter of the Xia family. The entire Xia family has to respect her. If she suffers in the Xia family, I’m afraid the Xia family will lose their dignity.”","Xia Chunyu’s and Old Madam Xia’s expressions instantly changed.","Old Madam Xia gritted her teeth and suppressed the anger in her heart. “Alright, I’ll announce Xi Xi’s identity. Don’t worry about this. After Xi Xi returns to the Xia family, she’ll be the legitimate eldest daughter. I’ll strictly restrain Chunyu and won’t let her find trouble with Xi Xi again.”","Gu Zheng smiled and nodded. “I hope you’ll remember what you said, Old Madam Xia. Other than that, I also hope you can hold a banquet for Xi Xi and invite the wealthy families in the capital to attend.”","Yin Lianyi’s expression flickered. She gritted her teeth and said, “Alright! From now on, Xi Xi is the noblest daughter of the Xia family. Everyone has to respect her.”","Xia Chunyu’s body went soft. Old Madam Xia’s words seemed to have slapped her hard. Qiao Xi was the noblest daughter of the Xia family, so what about her? She had been the daughter of the Xia family for more than 20 years. All the socialites in the capital tried to curry favor with her. If Qiao Xi returned to the Xia family, she would be replaced. Those socialites would definitely laugh at her!","Qiao Xi! Xia Yunqiu! They were both b*tches!","After the matter was settled, Old Madam Xia left. As soon as she left the villa, Xia Chunyu cried, “Grandma, you don’t dote on me anymore! And Gu Zheng hates me too. I can’t compare to Qiao Xi in anything!”","Yin Lianyi patiently comforted her, saying, “Chunyu, I had no choice. For the sake of the Xia family’s reputation, I could only agree to his request for the time being.”","Back then, Xia Yunqiu was extremely talented and left a deep impression on everyone in the capital. Qiao Xi was her daughter, so the Xia family had to take her seriously. Otherwise, they would definitely be gossiped about. Most importantly, the blood in Qiao Xi’s body was very useful.","“Chunyu, you must calm down. Don’t forget that the capital is our territory. When she goes to the capital, you can do whatever you want to her. I did promise her that I would hold a banquet, but it’ll be your birthday soon after we return to the capital. At that time, your birthday banquet will be held on the same day as the acknowledgment banquet. Everyone will come to congratulate you on your birthday, so naturally, no one will go to her banquet.”","Hearing this, Xia Chunyu instantly laughed. “Grandma, you’re really awesome! Then can you invite Gu Zheng to my birthday party?”","Yin Lianyi looked at Xia Chunyu and sighed helplessly. “Chunyu, Gu Zheng isn’t suitable for you. It’s better not to force him.”","Back then, Zishan and Yunqiu fell in love with the same man, which was why so many things happened. In the end, both daughters died unnaturally. Hence, Yin Lianyi had a feeling that if Chunyu insisted on pursuing Gu Zheng, it would definitely not end well.","“Grandma, I really like Gu Zheng. Back then, when Mom liked Young Master Situ, didn’t you help her? Help me now!” Xia Chunyu’s eyes were filled with pleading, then she cried. “I’m just unconvinced. Back then, the person who was engaged to Young Master Situ was Xia Yunqiu. Now, the person who’s married to Gu Zheng is Qiao Xi. Why can the mother and daughter easily snatch away my and Mom’s lovers?”","Yin Lianyi could not help but fall into her memories. This scene was indeed familiar. Back then, Zishan had also knelt in front of her and cried. Why did Xia Yunqiu snatch her lover while she had to come to the capital?","On the other hand, the news of Qiao Xi’s decision to go to the capital had spread to the Yin family. The Yin family immediately decided to send their entire family to the capital, while Gu Zheng handed all the company’s matters to Gu Yao to manage so that he could accompany Qiao Xi to the capital.","The world of Li City had long belonged to Gu Zheng. Everyone was eyeing Gu Corporation covetously, wanting to take a share of the loot while Gu Zheng was not around. However, they had underestimated Gu Yao. He was indeed an ignorant and incompetent good-for-nothing in the past, but that was all an act. Now, he was more than able to take charge."]},{"number":1688,"title":"Chapter 1688 The Brook Family’s Territory","paragraphs":["1688 The Brook Family’s Territory","A few days later.","Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng flew to the capital. The first thing they did after getting off the plane was to visit the divine physician, Shang Xiao.","Along the way, Qiao Xi’s heart thumped. The moment she entered the ward, her heart tightened. Although the wounds on Shang Xiao’s body had been treated, she could still tell how serious they were. His body was filled with instruments, and he wore an oxygen mask, looking as if he could die at any time.","“Grandpa!” Qiao Xi choked as tears fell uncontrollably.","She approached the bed, but her fingers froze in midair. She did not dare to touch him.","Gu Zheng pulled her into his arms and gently wiped her tears. He comforted her softly, saying, “Don’t cry. He’ll definitely wake up.”","Qiao Xi pounced into Gu Zheng’s arms and sobbed uncontrollably. She realized that there were many wounds on her grandfather’s body. If the other party wanted to kill him, they could have killed him with a single strike. Why torture him unless the other party hoped to know something from him?","The two of them stayed in the ward for an hour before returning to their residence in the capital. Although the villa was not as luxurious as Longwan Residential, it was still spacious and clean.","Yin Lianyi did not expect Qiao Xi to arrive so quickly and immediately called. “Xi Xi, you’ve already arrived in the capital. Why didn’t you return to the Xia family’s residence?”","Gu Zheng replied casually, “Of course, we can stay at the Xia family’s residence, but I need to emphasize that Xi Xi is the only daughter of the Xia family, so she has to stay in the best room in the Xia family. I heard from Young Master Xia that the bedroom Miss Xia is staying in is very luxurious. The renovation cost hundreds of thousands. Xi Xi can just stay there.”","Qiao Xi sat at the side and smiled slyly when she heard the silence on Yin Lianyi’s side.","After a few seconds of silence, Yin Lianyi said unhappily, “That won’t do. Chunyu has been staying in that room for more than ten years. It’s not appropriate to chase her away as soon as Xi Xi comes back!”","“Xi Xi is the biological daughter of the Xia family. Could it be that she’s inferior to an adopted daughter? If you think so, then I won’t let Xi Xi go back.” The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled into a gentle smile, but his voice was extremely cold.","Yin Lianyi’s expression instantly turned ashen. It was not easy for her to coax Qiao Xi back. They were already in the capital. If she did not let Qiao Xi come back because of a room, she would definitely be criticized.","She hesitated for a long time before gritting her teeth. “Let’s do as Mr. Gu says.”","“Thank you, Old Madam Xia. Please send someone to tidy up the room. When everything is ready, I’ll let Qiao Xi stay in the Xia family in peace,” Gu Zheng said indifferently.","Yin Lianyi was furious and hung up angrily","Qiao Xi decided to go to the Xia family, so she instructed Uncle Sheng to send some unimportant things over first and get the servants to carry all her things into her room in the Xia family’s residence.","In the afternoon, the Xia family sent a car to pick Qiao Xi up.","Gu Zheng watched the car gradually drive away with a gloomy expression. “Is the Xia family so poor? Did they send such a car to bring their eldest miss home?”","Song Shiyu snorted. “They’re deliberately trying to take her down a notch. The Xia family is no good!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Song Shijing suddenly walked over and said in a low voice, “President, the new patriarch of the Brook family wants to meet you.”","When Gu Zheng saw that insignia, he instantly burst out with biting cold killing intent. This person wanted to kill Xi Xi, yet he still dared to meet him now?","After a moment of silence, Gu Zheng smirked. “Prepare the car. Let’s go meet him!”","“President...”","It was obvious that the new patriarch had ill intentions. If the president went to the Brook family’s territory, would he still come back safe and sound?","“If I don’t meet him, how will I know who he is? Huo Yuzhou has been scheming in the Brook family for seven years without getting the position of patriarch, but this person suddenly became the new patriarch. His methods are more brilliant and vicious than Huo Yuzhou’s. I have to see him.”","Gu Zheng sneered and got into the car.","After Song Shijing sent him to the agreed spot, he was stopped outside the door. He suddenly felt uneasy.","This building was the Brook family’s territory. If the president entered alone, it would be very difficult for him to come out alive if there was a conflict. However, the president was tall and leisurely as if he was walking in his own backyard. He was not intimidated by this scene at all.","Gu Zheng followed a young man upstairs to the innermost room. The man then pushed the door open. “Mr. Gu, the patriarch is waiting for you inside. Please.”","Gu Zheng walked in casually and sat lazily on the sofa. He was not nervous at all as if this was his own home."]},{"number":1689,"title":"Chapter 1689 I’ll Back You Up","paragraphs":["1689 I’ll Back You Up","The two men sat opposite each other. Neither of them spoke first. They just looked at each other quietly. When their eyes met, a trace of coldness surged.","After a long silence, the new patriarch suddenly smiled with a trace of coldness in his eyes. “As expected of you, Gu Zheng. You dare to come to my territory alone.”","Gu Zheng looked up and saw that the man was wearing a mask and hat. He sneered. “Since you called me over, why are you still in disguise?”","The next second, the new patriarch took off his hat and mask, revealing his true appearance.","Gu Zheng’s pupils constricted, and his thin lips parted slightly. “It’s indeed you, Meng Fan!”","This person was the doctor Xi Xi met in the Medical Association, Meng Fan. Gu Zheng had secretly investigated this man but found nothing. At that time, he knew that his background was not ordinary. No wonder he knew that Qiao Xi was in Huo Yuzhou’s hands. He had long planted a doctor by Huo Yuzhou’s side.","Meng Fan said casually, “To tell you the truth, I have a grudge against Xia Yunqiu. If you insist on helping Qiao Xi, we can only be enemies.”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow and sneered. He had many enemies, so it made no difference to have one more.","After leaving the building, Meng Fan’s assistant walked in. “Patriarch, are you letting Gu Zheng leave just like that? Why not...”","Why not kill him? As long as the patriarch wanted to attack, he could completely get rid of this powerful enemy!","“I guessed that he wouldn’t agree, but I still wanted to ask. It’s fine if he’s unwilling. Besides, if I don’t kill him now, I can return Eldest Miss Lu’s kindness back then.”","Meng Fan’s eyes suddenly turned cold. “I really don’t understand why a kind person like Eldest Miss Lu would be friends with someone like Xia Yunqiu.”","On the other hand, after Gu Zheng got into the car, he asked Song Shijing, “Do you still remember that I asked you to investigate a person called Meng Fan a few months ago?”","“Yes!”","“He’s the new patriarch of the Brook family!”","Song Shijing was dumbfounded. Who was Meng Fan? How did he go from a doctor to the patriarch of the Brook family?","In the Xia family’s villa.","Qiao Xi got out of the car and walked into the Xia family’s residence alone. The servants pretended not to see her.","She had snatched Xia Chunyu’s room. Xia Chunyu must be very angry, so she would want to establish her status in the household and lord over her. She wanted to let Qiao Xi know that she was just the daughter of the Xia family in name.","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. As soon as she entered, she heard a sharp voice. “These are all such lousy things! Throw them all out!”","The person who spoke was Xia Chunyu’s servant, Aunt Liu. She had a very high status in the Xia family. Qiao Xi watched helplessly as the things she had gotten Uncle Sheng to send over earlier were thrown out. Her eyes turned cold.","Qiao Xi said with a smile, “These are mine. As a servant, who allowed you to throw away your master’s things?”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Does that mean Xia Chunyu is unwilling to give up the room?”","As soon as he finished speaking, the servant’s slightly nervous voice came from outside. “Young Master, you’re back! Didn’t you say that you had something urgent to attend to in the company and that you won’t be coming back today?”","Xia Jingan ignored her and quickly walked in. He saw Qiao Xi sitting on the sofa with luggage beside her.","He walked over and said in a gentle tone, “Xi Xi, you just arrived in the capital today. Why haven’t you returned to your room to rest?”","Qiao Xi said aggrievedly, “The room on the first floor hasn’t been tidied up yet. I’ll wait in the living room for a while.”","Xia Jingan’s expression darkened. “Who told you to stay on the first floor? Your room is clearly on the second floor!”","“Aunt Liu said so.” Qiao Xi pointed at the person beside her. “She said that I’m not worthy of staying in such a good room, so she wants me to stay on the first floor with the servants.”","Xia Jingan’s expression was terrifyingly gloomy as he looked coldly at Aunt Liu. “I want Xi Xi to stay on the second floor. Do you dare to go against my wishes?”","Aunt Liu was so scared that her entire body trembled. She could not say a word.","Xia Jingan leaned closer and said softly, “Xi Xi, if you encounter any difficulties in the Xia family in the future, you can look for me. I’ll support you.”","He then instructed coldly, “Immediately send Eldest Miss’ luggage to the room on the second floor!”","Aunt Liu lowered her head and retorted, “Young Master, that room is occupied by Miss Chunyu. She has been staying there for so many years. It’s not appropriate for Miss Qiao to snatch her room the moment she arrives, right?”","“What are you arguing about?!”","Suddenly, a dignified voice came from upstairs. Yin Lianyi and Xia Chunyu walked down together.","Xia Jingan said, “Grandma, I’ve already instructed the servants to tidy up the room on the second floor for Xi Xi, but Aunt Liu actually went against my wishes and arranged for Xi Xi to stay on the first floor.”"]},{"number":1690,"title":"Chapter 1690 You Can’t Wear The Jewelry Another Man Gave You","paragraphs":["1690 You Can’t Wear The Jewelry Another Man Gave You","Before Yin Lianyi could speak, Xia Chunyu unhappily said, “Brother, why are you always protecting Qiao Xi? She’s your younger sister, but am I not?”","Xia Jingan glanced at her with a mocking smile. It was enough to explain everything.","“That’s right, I want your room. Moreover, didn’t Old Madam Xia promise me this a long time ago?” Qiao Xi said with a smile, not hiding the arrogance in her tone at all.","Yin Lianyi met her gaze and suppressed her surging anger. “Chunyu, that room... Let Xi Xi have it.”","The moment that was said, the surroundings instantly fell silent. Xia Chunyu’s expression froze, and her voice trembled. “What?”","Yin Lianyi said seriously, “I agreed to let Xi Xi stay in that room. Pack your things and move them to the guest room.”","Xia Chunyu was angered to the point her face turned red. She did not expect her grandmother to actually let Qiao Xi snatch her room.","However, no matter how arrogant she was, she did not dare to disobey Yin Lianyi. She could only move her belongings to the guest room angrily. The things that were thrown out were all moved back to the room on the second floor by Aunt Liu.","Qiao Xi watched with amusement as they moved around, then she turned to look at Xia Chunyu, who was fiercely glaring at her.","Aunt Liu walked in front of her and gritted her teeth. “Miss Qiao, the room is ready.”","“Call me Eldest Miss in the future,” Qiao Xi ordered arrogantly.","Aunt Liu’s expression darkened, but she could only say stiffly, “Yes, Eldest Miss!”","When Xia Chunyu heard this, she could not stop her tears from flowing. She ran upstairs angrily.","Seeing her leave, Qiao Xi lost interest and nodded slightly at Yin Lianyi. “I’ll go rest first. Please fulfill the banquet you promised me as soon as possible. I don’t have much patience.”","Yin Lianyi was instantly infuriated. “Qiao Xi! You dare threaten me?”","Qiao Xi grunted lightly, stood up, and elegantly went upstairs.","Yin Lianyi was so angry that her entire body was trembling. She smashed a glass angrily.","Three days later, the Xia family booked First Class Residential in the capital to hold a birthday party for Xia Chunyu. At the same time, Qiao Xi was holding a banquet at Hua Xia Hotel, which was right opposite First Class Residential.","By six in the evening, Xia Chunyu’s banquet was brimming with guests, but Hua Xia Hotel was still cold and empty.","Xia Chunyu was extremely proud. Qiao Xi insisted on holding a banquet on this day. She was clearly courting humiliation!","Xia Chunyu’s eyes turned red as she pretended to be tolerant. “Don’t say that about my sister. She just returned to the Xia family. I should give in to her.”","The socialites had disdainful expressions. Qiao Xi had just returned to the Xia family, yet she was already giving Xia Chunyu attitude. How unelegant!","Moreover, everyone knew very well that in Old Madam Xia’s eyes, Xia Chunyu was the most favored one. As for Qiao Xi, she was just the daughter of the Xia family in name.","At this moment, in Hua Xia Hotel.","There were not many guests who came. Those who did were all seniors in the art world. There was still an hour before the banquet. Qiao Xi was not anxious and was still choosing jewelry in the lounge.","The jewelry on the table was all sent over by Xia Jingan. As a jewelry designer, she knew that they were expensive, but she accepted them without hesitation.","At this moment, someone pushed the door open and walked in. Before Qiao Xi could turn around, she felt a cold sensation on her neck. The man’s warm fingers brushed past her collarbone and stopped at the back of her neck.","“Xia Jingan has already prepared jewelry for me.” Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng.","“It’s not as good as mine,” Gu Zheng said indifferently.","Qiao Xi could tell that Xia Jingan had spent a lot of effort choosing the jewelry. However, when she raised her eyes to look at the mirror, she was truly stunned for a moment. The diamond necklace on her neck was elegant and simple, and it flickered with a dazzling light. It was indeed the most outstanding necklace in the selection.","“But I promised Xia Jingan that I would wear the jewelry he gave me.” Qiao Xi liked her brother very much. Ever since she met Xia Jingan, he had taken good care of her. In the past few days in the Xia family, it was Xia Jingan who had been protecting her. He had indeed not let her suffer at all.","Gu Zheng sneered. “No, you can’t wear jewelry given by other men.”","Qiao Xi said, “He’s my brother.”","“Not even your brother.” Gu Zheng was very domineering.","Qiao Xi had a helpless expression and obediently wore the necklace Gu Zheng gave her. However, she chose a bracelet and earrings from the jewelry Xia Jingan gave her."]},{"number":1691,"title":"Chapter 1691 The Two Ladies Are Like Fire And Water","paragraphs":["1691 The Two Ladies Are Like Fire And Water","At the entrance of Hua Xia Hotel.","Xia Jingan drove Li Xing’er over and asked casually, “Miss Li, you and Gu Yao are inseparable. Why isn’t he here today?”","“Gu Yao is busy managing the company! He really doesn’t have the time to attend.”","“I heard that Gu Yao is very talented in music?”","When Li Xing’er heard this, she instantly became proud. “That’s right! You heard about it too, right?! Gu Yao was raised as a good-for-nothing since he was young. He was ignorant and incompetent and never learned any musical instruments at all. However, he could play the piano perfectly the first time he touched it. After learning for a few months, he reached the standard of being able to play in a concert hall!”","At the mention of Gu Yao, Li Xing’er spoke confidently. Xia Jingan’s lips curled into a smile as he muttered, “I see.”","There were indeed not many people in the banquet hall. After entering, Xia Jingan saw Qiao Xi at a glance, but he was slightly unhappy. “Why aren’t you wearing any of the necklaces I gave you?”","Qiao Xi smiled awkwardly and subconsciously glanced at Gu Zheng. Xia Jingan instantly understood. “Mr. Gu, I’m her brother.”","Was Gu Zheng actually jealous?","Qiao Xi hurriedly changed the topic. “If you don’t go to Xia Chunyu’s banquet, they’ll definitely be unhappy. Will you get into trouble?”","“It’s okay.” Xia Jingan chuckled. “Now that I’m in charge of Xia Corporation, no matter how angry Grandma is, she won’t do anything to me.”","On the other hand, in First Class Residential.","In the gorgeously decorated banquet hall, Xia Chunyu was wearing a pink princess dress and a diamond crown. She slowly came to Old Madam Xia’s side. The entire Xia family was here to celebrate her birthday.","Xia Chunyu held Old Madam Xia’s arm and said delicately, “Thank you, Grandma, for holding such a luxurious birthday party for me. I really love you! I’ll never marry in my life and just accompany you at home.”","Yin Lianyi scratched her nose and said with a loving expression, “Silly girl! Even if you marry someone, you’ll always be the little princess of our Xia family.”","Xia Chunyu looked around and suddenly asked, “Grandma, where did Brother go? We’re about to cut the cake. Why isn’t he here yet?”","Yin Lianyi glanced around and realized that Xia Jingan was not around. Today was his sister’s birthday. How could he not appear?","Xia Chunyu’s eyes turned red as she said aggrievedly, “Grandma, did Brother go to Sister’s banquet? He must still blame me regarding the matter of the room, so he’s unwilling to come to my birthday party.”","Yin Lianyi instantly came back to her senses, and her voice was a little hoarse. “What... How can Jingan go there?! He...”","Xia Chunyu’s voice was filled with tears. “Grandma, no matter how busy Brother is with work, he has always celebrated my birthday with me. Why doesn’t Brother care about me after Sister came back?”","Everyone in the banquet hall also began to discuss. These two daughters were holding a banquet at the same time. Qiao Xi had just returned to the Xia family, yet she was already like fire and water with Xia Chunyu. She would definitely turn the Xia family upside down in the future.","At this moment, someone exclaimed, “Old Madam, Miss, outside...”","“Young Master Ji Huaizhi’s car is parked outside!”","The surroundings instantly fell silent.","Ji Huaizhi! He was the heir of the Ji family! The Ji family had already confirmed that he was the next patriarch. His status in the capital had even surpassed Xia Jingan’s. He actually came to attend Xia Chunyu’s birthday party?","Yin Lianyi could not help but feel proud. Ji Huaizhi was here, which meant that the Ji family had acknowledged that Chunyu was the eldest daughter of the Xia family. If Ji Huaizhi liked Chunyu, the two families might even be able to form a marriage alliance. This was a great thing!","“Quick! Chunyu, quickly go welcome Young Master Ji!”","Xia Chunyu was also extremely proud and pursed her lips shyly. “Why is Young Master Ji here?! I’m not ready to see him!”","“Silly child, go quickly. Don’t be rude.”","The socialites watched Xia Chunyu lift her gown and run out, their faces filled with envy. Ignoring Ji Huaizhi’s noble status, just his face, which was comparable to a celebrity’s, was enough to move their hearts. If they could marry such a man, they would have no regrets for the rest of their lives.","Everyone followed Xia Chunyu to the door, but they did not see Ji Huaizhi. Yin Lianyi hurriedly asked, “Where’s Young Master Ji?”","The attendant at the door replied with a smile, “Young Master Ji said that he has something important to attend to and left after leaving the gift.”"]},{"number":1692,"title":"Chapter 1692 Wanted To Personally Give Her The Gift","paragraphs":["1692 Wanted To Personally Give Her The Gift","Yin Lianyi nodded. Ji Huaizhi was the heir of the Ji family, after all. It was already good enough that he came by to drop off a gift. It was fine even if he did not attend the banquet.","“Chunyu, prepare a gift. We’ll pay a visit to Young Master Ji one day to thank him.”","“I understand, Grandma.”","Xia Chunyu was extremely excited. She picked up the birthday gift from Ji Huaizhi and was about to open it.","“Look, isn’t that Young Master Ji’s car?! Why is it back?” someone suddenly asked.","Everyone hurriedly looked over. It was indeed Young Master Ji’s high-profile luxury car driving over.","“That’s not right! The car isn’t coming to First Class Residential. It’s going to the other side...”","Before they could finish talking, Ji Huaizhi’s car stopped in front of Hua Xia Hotel. A handsome and charming young man got out of the car and entered it.","“Young Master Ji is... going to Miss Qiao’s banquet!”","Yin Lianyi’s face instantly turned livid as she subconsciously retorted, “Impossible! Xi Xi has just arrived in the capital. How could she know the young master of the Ji family?”","Seeing that Yin Lianyi was angry, everyone tried to console her. “Young Master Ji must have another reason for going to Hua Xia Hotel. It’s not like Miss Qiao is the only one holding a banquet in Hua Xia Hotel.”","As soon as they finished speaking, an attendant rushed over. “Old Madam Xia, Miss Xia, this is a gift from Mr. Yang Wei to Miss Xia.”","Yang Wei was the heir of the Yang family, and his status was extremely noble. Yin Lianyi’s expression softened a little. “Where’s Mr. Yang? Invite him over for a meal.”","The attendant wanted to say something but hesitated. He finally braced himself and said, “Mr. Yang went... to the other side.”","Ji Huaizhi and Yang Wei had both gone to Hua Xia Hotel. Could it be for Qiao Xi?","At this moment, someone had already started to contact the staff of Hua Xia Hotel. Could it be that apart from Qiao Xi, there were some other noble families holding banquets there? Why were the two heirs from the top four major families there?","Before everyone could come back to their senses, they saw the Huo family’s car parking in front of them. Huo Yuzhou looked up at everyone and was not in a rush to get out of the car. Instead, he turned to his assistant and asked, “Do you think she won’t want to see me?”","“It can’t be. You saved her. I believe Miss Qiao has stopped blaming you.”","Huo Yuzhou smiled bitterly and shook his head. Qiao Xi had not invited him to this banquet, so she naturally did not welcome him. He came over without permission because he hoped to personally hand the gift to her.","At the thought of this, Huo Yuzhou opened the door, got out of the car, and walked toward the door.","Yin Lianyi was full of smiles. “Mr. Huo.”","Everyone thought that Huo Yuzhou was here to deliver a gift, but Huo Yuzhou walked over and asked gently, “Old Madam, aren’t you going to invite me in?”","Yin Lianyi was very surprised. She immediately led the way and brought Huo Yuzhou into the banquet hall. He had a gentle smile on his face as he looked around, but he soon asked in confusion, “Old Madam Xia, where is she? I want to give her the gift myself.”","Yin Lianyi’s expression suddenly stiffened. Who should he give the gift to? Wasn’t Chunyu standing in front of him?","She hesitated for a moment and pushed Xia Chunyu forward. “Chunyu, quickly greet Mr. Huo.”","Although Huo Yuzhou was not as famous as Ji Huaizhi in the capital’s circle, he was doing well overseas. Xia Chunyu smiled shyly at him. “Hello, Mr. Huo.”","Huo Yuzhou’s expression was calm, and he did not respond immediately.","Only then did everyone realize that something was wrong. Huo Yuzhou sneered. “Isn’t today the banquet for the daughter of the Xia family, Qiao Xi? Why is Old Madam Xia holding a banquet for the family’s adopted daughter here? It’s not very noble of the Xia family to be so biased toward their adopted daughter.”","The moment that was said, the banquet hall fell silent.","Xia Chunyu was so embarrassed that her face turned red. The person Huo Yuzhou was looking for was Qiao Xi?","At this moment, Yin Lianyi finally reacted, and her expression instantly darkened. “Mr. Huo, Xi Xi’s banquet is being held in the opposite hotel. You went the wrong way. Why are you mocking Chunyu?”","Huo Yuzhou frowned before smirking. “I heard that Old Madam Xia specially went to Li City to bring Qiao Xi back and was holding a banquet in First Class Residential. I naturally thought that you were holding a banquet for Xi Xi. I didn’t expect it to be for the family’s adopted daughter’s birthday. In that case, I’ll take my leave.”","Everyone looked at each other and thought that Huo Yuzhou’s words made sense. Old Madam Xia had acknowledged Qiao Xi, so it was only normal to think that she was holding this banquet for her. It was no wonder that Mr. Huo went to the wrong place.","After Huo Yuzhou left, the banquet hall was deathly silent. No one dared to make a sound, afraid that they would anger Old Madam Xia.","Yin Lianyi suppressed her anger and said, “The banquet is about to start. Please take a seat.”"]},{"number":1693,"title":"Chapter 1693 Live And Die With The Situ Family","paragraphs":["1693 Live And Die With The Situ Family","Seeing this scene, everyone had their own thoughts. Since Miss Qiao could invite Huo Yuzhou to the banquet, wouldn’t they offend Huo Yuzhou if they didn’t go? However, if they went, they would offend Old Madam Xia. If they had known earlier, they would have found an excuse not to come.","During the second half of the banquet, everyone was in an uncomfortable situation. However, it was very lively in Hua Xia Hotel which was opposite First Class Residential. Ji Huaizhi’s arrival surprised everyone present, but Qiao Xi’s expression showed that she was already expecting it.","Before the commotion caused by Ji Huaizhi subsided, someone came to inform them that Yang Wei was here. Yang Wei was the heir of the Yang family. Two of the four major families had already come, so only the Huo family was left.","A moment later, Huo Yuzhou also came, making everyone present exclaim.","On the other hand, Xia Jingan walked in front of Qiao Xi and asked softly, “They’re all here. Why hasn’t the banquet started?”","Qiao Xi said with a smile, “The Situ family isn’t here yet!”","“Actually, I’ve long guessed that I have relations with the Situ family. Everyone in the capital knows that I came this time. The Situ family must have long received the news. Since I’m already here, there’s no reason for them not to appear.”","Xia Jingan sighed softly. This sister of his could not be underestimated!","The Situ family had declined, but they were still a noble family in the capital. Although their power was inferior to the four major families, no one dared to provoke them. Qiao Xi was curious about what the Situ family had that the four major families were afraid of.","Halfway through the banquet, a low-profile and luxurious car stopped at the entrance of Hua Xia Hotel. That person only put down the gift before leaving.","Qiao Xi opened the gift box and saw a rose brooch inside. Although the other party did not reveal their identity, Qiao Xi could guess that they must be from the Situ family.","Gu Zheng stood beside her and pulled her into his arms before kissing her forehead.","Qiao Xi looked at the rose brooch in a daze and put it on her chest.","“Think it through. Wearing it means that you’re a member of the Situ family and want to live and die with the Situ family.” Gu Zheng’s voice was low as he muttered softly in her ear.","Qiao Xi nodded without the slightest hesitation. “I want to know everything about my mother. I want to know the secret from back then. Since I’ve decided to come to the capital, it’s absolutely impossible for me to stay out of trouble. We can’t forget about the Situ family’s murder case just like that.”","“Alright,” Gu Zheng replied softly, his voice filled with strength. “Since the Situ family has already expressed their attitude, the heads of the Ji, Yang, and Huo families will definitely arrive in a while. At that time, you’ll definitely be famous in the capital. But don’t be afraid. I’ll accompany you.”","Qiao Xi opened her arms and hugged his waist. She pressed her ear against his chest and listened to his strong heartbeat as well as clear breathing. She felt extremely at ease.","Half an hour later, a few luxury cars drove into the parking lot of Hua Xia Hotel without any obstruction.","...","At this moment, in the banquet hall of First Class Residential.","At this moment, a waiter pushed the cake up. The lights shone on Xia Chunyu, and the diamond crown on her head dazzled brightly. Xia Chunyu smiled. “Grandma, let’s cut the cake!”","Yin Lianyi nodded with a smile. “Chunyu, happy birthday to you. You’ll always be...”","Before she could finish, someone suddenly exclaimed. Yin Lianyi looked unhappy when she was suddenly interrupted, so that person hurriedly shut up.","However, the next second, someone suddenly stood up again. “No way!”","Yin Lianyi’s expression darkened. Before she could speak again, a few of them stood up. “Old Madam Xia, Miss Xia, I’m sorry. I suddenly have something to attend to, so I have to leave now.”","With that, the person hurriedly left the banquet hall. Right on the heels of that, the few people who stood up all found an excuse to leave.","Xia Chunyu’s face was pale as she squeezed out a smile. “Let’s continue cutting the cake.”","As soon as she finished speaking, a few more people stood up. “I’m sorry, Old Madam Xia. I have something urgent to attend to at the company. I’ll take my leave first.”","After that, half of the guests left. Yin Lianyi’s face alternated between red and green.","At this moment, someone said indignantly, “Miss Xia, they left in a hurry before the cake was even cut. Aren’t they disrespecting Miss Xia by acting like this?”","“That’s right! If they offend the Xia family, they’ll suffer!”","As soon as they finished speaking, they suddenly received a message on their phones. They looked down, and their expressions instantly changed. “Check your phones! No wonder they ran so quickly just now!”","The banquet hall instantly became chaotic. Someone shouted, “Let’s hurry up and go to Hua Xia Hotel to take a look! The patriarchs of the three major families are all there!”"]},{"number":1694,"title":"Chapter 1694 Don’t Smile At Other Men In The Future","paragraphs":["1694 Don’t Smile At Other Men In The Future","When everyone heard this, they stood up one after another and looked at Yin Lianyi and Xia Chunyu with conflicted expressions. In the end, they braced themselves and left. Not long after, only a few people were left in the huge banquet hall.","Xia Chunyu was angered to the point her eyes turned red and her voice became sharp. “Grandma, they’ve all gone to Qiao Xi’s banquet. My birthday banquet is ruined!”","Yin Lianyi clenched her fists and trembled. Qiao Xi must have done it on purpose!","The guests went to Hua Xia Hotel one after another, and the banquet hall was filled with people. Qiao Xi had long expected this scene, and her expression was very calm.","After this banquet ended, Qiao Xi would become famous in the capital. After the people from the four great families left, the guests who rushed over from First Class Residential hurriedly swarmed over with the intention of apologizing to Qiao Xi.","However, Qiao Xi was protected in Gu Zheng’s arms. She did not even look at them and directly entered the underground parking lot.","Xia Jingan followed Qiao Xi to the parking lot and asked in a slightly sad tone, “You’re not going back to the Xia family’s residence?”","“If I go back now, they’ll definitely look for trouble with me. Why should I invite trouble to myself?”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, Xia Jingan did not force her. He reminded her again, “I believe there’ll be many rumors about you in the capital soon. If you have any difficulties, feel free to look for me.”","Qiao Xi smiled and nodded. “Alright.”","Seeing Xia Jingan leave, Qiao Xi closed the car door, and the vehicle slowly drove out of the parking lot.","Gu Zheng held Qiao Xi’s hand and put a ring on her slender and fair finger. This ring was not considered luxurious, but the style was exquisite and special.","“Mrs. Gu, you’re already married, but you’re unwilling to wear a ring. You must think that the rings at home are too exaggerated, so you don’t want to wear them. That’s why I specially custom-made this one.” Gu Zheng looked at her affectionately.","Qiao Xi was indeed not used to wearing rings, but the diamond on this ring was not exaggerated. Even so, it was dazzling like a star.","Gu Zheng had not spoken much the entire day. Now, he was putting a ring on her. He must have been unhappy when he saw the heirs in the capital surrounding her and giving her gifts.","“Xi Xi, you didn’t even look at me much tonight. You smiled more at other men.” Gu Zheng slowly approached her. The bitter words that came out of his mouth were like an electric current that swept through Qiao Xi’s heart.","His long fingers brushed past her hair and cheek before finally landing on her beautiful lips. Then, he bent down and kissed her lips hard. There was a trace of madness in his breath.","She subconsciously retreated, but she was pressed down by him. His strong and strong arms firmly restrained her, and he kissed her even harder, making it difficult for Qiao Xi to breathe. Her entire body was sore and soft.","“Oh... Don’t...” Qiao Xi’s charming voice sounded like a kitten’s.","“You can’t smile at other men in the future, much less neglect me.” Gu Zheng ended the long kiss and pecked the corner of her mouth. His voice was hoarse and exuded a trace of charm. The air gradually heated up.","The next day, the entire capital was talking about the Xia family.","As the daughter of the Xia family, Qiao Xi had the support of Gu Zheng, the three big families, and Xia Jingan. However, in order to attend the Xia family’s adopted daughter’s birthday banquet, Old Madam Xia did not attend the biological daughter’s banquet. This matter quickly spread online, and the Xia family’s share price fell by two percentage points overnight.","In Xia Corporation’s building, the higher-ups looked worried.","“Young Master, what should we do?! We lost so much money overnight. If this goes on, the Xia family will be doomed!”","Xia Jingan sneered. “Since Old Madam Xia chose to side with Xia Chunyu, we should have expected this outcome. It’s normal for the shares to fall.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Yin Lianyi and Xia Chunyu pushed the door open and walked in.","“Get out!” Yin Lianyi ordered with a cold face. Many higher-ups left, leaving the three of them in the room.","After the door of the meeting room was closed, Yin Lianyi slowly said, “Jingan, what did you just say? Are you blaming me?","“Although Chunyu was adopted, she has lived with the Xia family for so many years. However, Qiao Xi chose to hold a banquet on the same day as Chunyu. Isn’t that blatant disrespect toward Chunyu?”","Yin Lianyi’s gaze was vicious. She had indeed underestimated Qiao Xi. She did not expect her to be able to invite so many big shots to the banquet. She originally brought Qiao Xi home for the sake of the Xia family’s reputation, but after Qiao Xi’s commotion, the Xia family’s reputation was not as good as before."]},{"number":1695,"title":"Chapter 1695 The Secret The Three Great Families Are Afraid Of","paragraphs":["1695 The Secret The Three Great Families Are Afraid Of","Xia Jingan saw the viciousness in her eyes and sneered. “Grandma, you keep blaming Xi Xi, but don’t forget who the real daughter of the Xia family is. Xia Chunyu was adopted. She holds luxurious birthday banquets every year, which is such a waste. Xi Xi is only holding this one banquet in her life, but you didn’t even attend. Aren’t you showing blatant disrespect toward Xi Xi?”","Yin Lianyi was instantly speechless. “I...”","Xia Jingan said coldly, “Grandma, you’ve already paid the price. You should know the consequences if you dare to go against Xi Xi again, right?”","Yin Lianyi suddenly became nervous. “What can she do to me? She’s my granddaughter. If she dares to attack me, she’ll be unfilial!”","“She doesn’t have to do it herself. The other three big families will appear to deal with the Xia family. As Aunt Yunqiu’s daughter, why is Xi Xi able to make the three big families afraid upon her return to the capital? Don’t you want to know the reason?”","“What does this have to do with Xia Yunqiu? Didn’t Xia Yunqiu die back then because of the three big families—”","Yin Lianyi’s voice stopped abruptly, and Xia Jingan sneered. “That’s right. The three big families chased after Aunt Yunqiu because she had something on her. However, in the eyes of outsiders, Aunt Yunqiu left the capital because the Xia family chased her away and even helped Xia Zishan snatch her lover. The Xia family even wanted to kill her.","“Everyone thinks that Xia Yunqiu was killed by the Xia family, and no one thinks that it’s the fault of the three big families. Now, they want to support Qiao Xi. They’re afraid that Xi Xi will publicize that secret, so they’re on Xi Xi’s side.”","Xia Jingan’s words clearly told Yin Lianyi that going against Qiao Xi meant death!","“Old Madam!” At this moment, the assistant rushed in. “The three major families have jointly released a statement. They said that for the sake of the Xia family’s adopted daughter, you neglected the real daughter of the Xia family. They want to seek an explanation for Miss Yunqiu’s daughter. Xia Corporation is really in trouble this time!”","Yin Lianyi’s body trembled as she suddenly looked at Xia Jingan.","Although the Xia family was also one of the four major families, if the three major families joined forces, the Xia family would definitely not be their match. Back then, the four of them joined forces and divided the Situ family’s assets amongst themselves. Could it be that it was the Xia family’s turn now?","Yin Lianyi broke out in a cold sweat and hurriedly grabbed Xia Jingan’s arm. “Jingan! You’re the heir of Xia Corporation. You can’t ignore this matter! You must have a way to help Xia Corporation survive this crisis!”","Xia Jingan sneered. “Grandma, I advise you to bring Xia Chunyu to apologize to Xi Xi immediately. Only when Xi Xi forgives you can the three major families let you off. Otherwise, they’ll attack Xia Corporation sooner or later and divide our assets.”","Yin Lianyi knew very well in her heart that the four great families had been peaceful all these years because they were holding onto the same secret. That way, they could restrain each other. However, now that Qiao Xi had appeared and broken the balance, the three families could devour the Xia family at any time. Now, only Qiao Xi could save the Xia family","Xia Jingan said casually, “That’s all I have to say. Everything else will depend on your choice.”","With that, Xia Jingan turned around and left.","Anger surged in Yin Lianyi’s heart as she smashed everything on the table. She was the old madam of the Xia family and the person with the highest status. Xia Jingan actually spoke to her like this?","He wanted her and Chunyu to apologize to Qiao Xi? Dream on! She would not apologize. She would see what they could do!","Qiao Xi was indeed the same as Xia Yunqiu. They were both jinxes. As soon as the mother and daughter arrived in the capital, they caused a ruckus and implicated Xia Corporation’s shares.","“I’m not going! I want to see what benefits she can get from destroying the Xia family!” Old Madam Yin roared angrily.","...","At this moment, Qiao Xi was flipping through a notebook in the room when Gu Zheng walked in. “What are you looking at?”","“Mom’s belongings.” Qiao Xi put down her notebook and sighed helplessly. “I’ve looked through all her belongings. I just want to find out what the three great families are afraid of, but I didn’t find anything.","“Ah Zheng, do you think that secret really exists?”","The moment that was said, Gu Zheng’s eyes flickered.","Qiao Xi muttered, “Back then, the Situ family was brought down and their assets were divided up by the four great families. When Mom was facing a threat, could it be that she deliberately created a secret just to protect me?”","Gu Zheng said slowly, “The four major families thought that she left with a secret, so they sent people to chase after her. However, now that you’ve returned to the capital, they don’t dare to attack you anymore. If they anger you, they might pay a painful price.”"]},{"number":1696,"title":"Chapter 1696 Creating A New Xia Corporation","paragraphs":["1696 Creating A New Xia Corporation","“Actually, it doesn’t matter if this secret exists or not. As long as the three families think that it exists, they won’t dare to act rashly.”","Hearing Gu Zheng’s words, Qiao Xi was enlightened. Actually, this was her mother’s way of protecting her. Because those people had ulterior motives, they did not dare to hurt her.","She packed the belongings and placed them in the box. “If Mom really wanted me to know that secret, she would’ve left me a clue. I haven’t found it, so it’s possible that Mom lied to them.”","She should not be worried about this. The people who should be worried were the four major families.","At this moment, Gu Corporation released an announcement accusing Xia Corporation of plagiarism. In the statement, it was pointed out that Xia Corporation’s ‘Illusory Night Clothing’ had plagiarized the clothes Gu Corporation released two years ago.","Gu Corporation released the design draft and the photos from back then. The style and fabric of the two clothes were almost the same. Even the embroidery on the collar was exactly the same.","Under normal circumstances, a plagiarism dispute like this could be discussed in private. As long as Xia Corporation was willing to compensate and stop producing the clothes, the matter would be resolved. However, Gu Corporation posted a statement online to protect their rights.","In the fashion industry, plagiarism was common, but this was the first time everyone had seen a party plagiarize Gu Corporation. They all reposted the news. Some of them knew that Gu Zheng was declaring war on Xia Corporation because Mrs. Gu had suffered at the hands of the Xia family.","Soon, Xia Corporation received a lawyer’s letter from Gu Corporation. The other party did not accept the compensation and wanted to blow things up. If a company’s reputation was ruined, it would be very difficult to continue operating.","The higher-ups gathered in the meeting room with worried expressions. “Jingan! Our Xia Corporation has always valued our reputation. With the Xia family being one of the four major families in the capital, there hasn’t been a plagiarism scandal for decades. Could it be that Gu...”","“This is Gu Zheng’s warning to Xia Corporation.” Xia Jingan looked helpless. “I’ve already advised Old Madam Xia, but she’s unwilling to apologize. I can’t do anything about it.”","Everyone knew that Old Madam Xia had abandoned her daughter, Xia Yunqiu, years ago. Now, for the sake of the family’s adopted daughter, she had offended Qiao Xi. As Xia Yunqiu’s daughter, how could Qiao Xi swallow this anger? She did not have any feelings for the Xia family. If she was really angered, she had the ability to destroy the Xia family.","“Jingan! You can’t ignore this matter! Xia Corporation is also a result of your hard work. You have to think of a way!”","“That’s right! I heard that you have a good relationship with Miss Qiao. If you visit her and beg her, she might let us off.”","Xia Jingan sneered. “Xia Corporation is Grandma’s and Xia Chunyu’s business. It has nothing to do with me. I’m the heir on the surface, but I don’t have any shares.”","The moment that was said, everyone could not help but feel disappointed for Xia Jingan. He had been working hard for Xia Corporation for so many years. Everyone thought that he was the heir, but Old Madam Xia was actually biased toward Xia Chunyu. She gave the family’s adopted daughter so many shares but was unwilling to give any to Xia Jingan.","Everyone knew that Old Madam Xia wanted to leave Xia Corporation to Xia Chunyu in the future. She was just temporarily letting Xia Jingan carry the title of heir. In the end, he was just someone who worked for Xia Chunyu.","They originally wanted to persuade Xia Jingan, but after hearing his words, no one could say anything.","That was right! He did not have any shares, so why should he risk his life for Xia Corporation?","Seeing that everyone was silent, Xia Jingan felt that the time was right. He slowly said, “Everyone, I have no obligation to solve Xia Chunyu’s problems for her. Everything I’ve done for the Xia family all these years is enough to repay them for raising me.”","Xia Jingan smiled at that person. “Speaking of which, may I ask if you’re willing to follow me? I want to create a brand new Xia Corporation!”","Everyone was instantly stunned and looked at him with burning eyes.","A brand new Xia Corporation?","They had been in Xia Corporation for so many years and had seen Old Madam Xia almost destroy Xia Corporation for Xia Zishan. Now, for Xia Chunyu, Xia Corporation’s reputation was damaged and the share prices had fallen. They were already extremely disappointed in Old Madam Xia.","Everyone was silent. They had been with Xia Jingan for so many years and knew that although he was young, he was very capable. If they followed him, they would definitely be able to create a more glorious Xia Corporation.","“Alright! We’ll follow you!”","Xia Jingan was not surprised at all. He only curled his lips slightly. “Then let’s wait.”","At this moment in the Xia family’s villa...","Yin Lianyi had a worried expression. “It’s just a small matter. Do you really want me to apologize to her?”","“Old Madam, Young Master is back.”","The next second, Xia Jingan walked in and was about to go upstairs."]},{"number":1697,"title":"Chapter 1697 The Xia Family Will Be Destroyed In Your Hands Sooner Or Later","paragraphs":["1697 The Xia Family Will Be Destroyed In Your Hands Sooner Or Later","“Jingan!” Yin Lianyi shouted. “What’s going on at Xia Corporation? Is Qiao Xi still unwilling to appear?”","Xia Jingan pretended to be surprised. “Grandma, you still care about Xia Corporation? Didn’t you and Xia Chunyu already give up on the company?”","“Why are you being so sarcastic? What’s so good about Qiao Xi? You’d rather see Xia Corporation fall into danger than plead with Qiao Xi. Why are you still mocking Chunyu and me?” Yin Lianyi was furious.","Xia Jingan’s face was filled with mockery. He glanced indifferently at Xia Chunyu, then went upstairs.","Yin Lianyi revealed a vicious expression and shouted indignantly, “Why should I apologize? If Xia Corporation really falls into a crisis, it’ll be Qiao Xi’s responsibility. Everyone should settle the score with her!”","The corners of Xia Chunyu’s mouth curled into a proud smile. His grandmother would definitely hate Qiao Xi more and more. She would blame Qiao Xi for all the humiliation and the company’s losses before finally chasing Qiao Xi out of the house!","Just as Xia Chunyu was feeling proud of herself, Aunt Liu’s voice came from outside. “Old Madam! The branch family... The Xia branch family is here!”","Yin Lianyi suddenly stood up. The Xia branch family usually did not come to the house. They only appeared at family gatherings. Could it be that they suddenly came because of the matter with the company?","“Invite them in and get Jingan to come downstairs.”","As soon as she finished speaking, the door of the villa slammed open. Before Yin Lianyi could react, an angry voice came from the door. “Sister-in-law! Why aren’t you bringing Chunyu over to apologize when things have already come to this point?”","This person was the clueless old master of the Xia branch family and Yin Lianyi’s husband’s biological younger brother, Xia Zhao. Ever since Yin Lianyi took over the Xia family, Xia Zhao had been very respectful to her and had never spoken to her in such a questioning tone.","When Xia Chunyu heard this, tears instantly fell. She threw herself into Yin Lianyi’s arms in fear.","Yin Lianyi said unhappily, “Second Brother, what are you trying to do by bringing people here? Are you interrogating Chunyu and me?”","Xia Zhao thought of the miserable state of his shop and naturally did not have a good expression. “You don’t know the current situation of Xia Corporation. If this goes on, the company will close down. As long as you apologize, Miss Qiao will let us off.”","“Impossible!” Yin Lianyi refused angrily.","“For the sake of your ego, you’d rather Xia Corporation go bankrupt?” Xia Zhao was extremely angry and glared fiercely at Xia Chunyu. Then, he rushed over and grabbed Xia Chunyu’s arm. “Xia Chunyu! Let’s go! Follow me to apologize!”","Xia Chunyu was shocked as tears trickled down her face. She grabbed Yin Lianyi’s sleeve tightly and refused to let go. She wailed loudly, “Grandma! Save me! Save me!”","Yin Lianyi was burning with anger as she berated, “Let go! Who do you think you are? How dare you attack Chunyu?”","Xia Zhao roared. “Do you know that the restaurants under Xia Corporation are about to close down?”","“So what if they do? We’re a big family. We don’t have to care about those restaurants. You want me and Chunyu to apologize? Dream on! Get lost!” Yin Lianyi pointed at the door and shouted.","At this moment, someone received a call, and their voice was filled with panic. “What? The supermarkets have closed down too? The three big families want to exterminate us!","“Gu Corporation cut off all collaborations with us? It’s all over!”","After the person hung up, he looked at Xia Chunyu angrily. “You jinx. It’s all because of you that the supermarkets under Xia Corporation were seized. Are you happy?”","Xia Chunyu looked panicked and hid behind Yin Lianyi in fear.","“How can you blame Chunyu? It’s all Qiao Xi’s fault! Why aren’t you looking for her?!” Yin Lianyi retorted loudly.","Xia Chunyu cried out, “Grandma, why won’t Sister Xi Xi let me off? I didn’t do anything wrong!”","“That’s right! What did Chunyu do wrong? Instead of looking for Qiao Xi, you’re blaming Chunyu. Isn’t this too much?” Yin Lianyi roared.","“I don’t care who’s right or wrong. I only know that Xia Corporation’s shares are about to fall to the limit,” Xia Zhao said with a cold face.","“Grandma.” At this moment, Xia Jingan came down from upstairs. His thin lips parted slightly, and he said, “It’s not just the shares. The Xia family has already been eliminated by the development area project jointly organized by the four major families. It means that the three billion yuan that Xia Corporation invested in the project previously can’t be returned for the time being. The restaurants, supermarkets, and entertainment venues under Xia Corporation will all be closed. We’ll suffer heavy losses, and the company won’t be able to operate normally.”","Yin Lianyi’s face gradually turned pale. When she took the documents from Xia Jingan, her entire body went soft and she almost fell to the floor. Just because they did not apologize, Qiao Xi wanted to destroy the Xia family?"]},{"number":1698,"title":"Chapter 1698 A Rose Invitation","paragraphs":["1698 A Rose Invitation","“The Xia family has already lost more than ten billion yuan for an adopted daughter. You’re really muddle-headed!”","Everyone’s angry voices sounded one after another. Yin Lianyi felt her ears buzz.","She did not expect the consequences to be so serious. Everything she did was for Xia Corporation. How did it end up like this?","Qiao Xi had the Xia family’s blood flowing in her veins, but she did not grow up in the Xia family. She was unreliable. Chunyu was the eldest daughter of the Xia family. She could lead the Xia family to glory, so why was everyone criticizing her now?","“At this point, I won’t force you to apologize.” Xia Jingan suddenly said in a calm voice, “I announce that I’ll withdraw from Xia Corporation from today onward. Grandma, you like Chunyu the most, so let her be the heir.”","With that, Xia Jingan took out a document and handed it to Xia Chunyu. “Sign it. Xia Corporation is yours.”","This action stunned everyone while Xia Chunyu was overjoyed. She even suspected that she was dreaming. Xia Jingan was really giving Xia Corporation to her?","She had always fantasized about sitting in Xia Jingan’s seat. Unfortunately, the higher-ups of the company were unconvinced. Now that Xia Jingan had personally handed Xia Corporation to her, even if those higher-ups were unconvinced, they could only endure it.","As long as she managed the company, she could be on equal footing with the heirs of the other three big families and become the top socialite in the capital.","“Jingan, don’t be rash!”","“You can’t do this!”","Xia Zhao hurriedly went forward to stop them. Xia Corporation could not survive without Xia Jingan. As he was from the branch family of the Xia family, once the Xia family fell, he would also be affected and lose everything.","“Xia Chunyu!” Xia Zhao shouted at the top of his voice. “Apologize! Jingan can’t leave Xia Corporation! Absolutely not!”","Xia Chunyu looked unconvinced, and her eyes were filled with viciousness. She snatched the contract and signed it under everyone’s shocked gazes. “I’m the daughter of the Xia family. I have the right to inherit Xia Corporation. It’s good that Xia Jingan took the initiative to withdraw. It’s only right for me to manage the company. Who do you think you are to force me to apologize?”","Everyone looked at her in disdain. Was she worthy of being compared to Xia Jingan?","Xia Zhao glanced at the transfer document and took a deep breath. “Alright! In that case, I’ll leave Xia Corporation too!”","With the first person taking the lead, everyone announced that they wanted to withdraw. Yin Lianyi’s expression instantly darkened. “Alright! I hope you won’t regret it. Now get lost!”","Then, more than ten companies under the Xia family announced that they would leave Xia Corporation and follow Xia Jingan to establish Jingan Corporation. Now, Xia Corporation was only an empty shell.","...","Qiao Xi was not shocked in the slightest when she heard that Xia Corporation had been split into two. With Xia Jingan’s ability, it was completely possible. Old Madam Xia and Xia Chunyu had already received their punishment. Without their former power, they were no longer a threat to her.","At this moment, Uncle Sheng walked in and handed her an invitation. “Young Madam, someone just sent this over. They said they want to invite you to be a guest.”","Qiao Xi took it. There was no signature on the invitation, only an address. A vivid rose was drawn in the lower right corner.","Following the address on the invitation, the chauffeur sent her to an antique courtyard in the suburbs. The attendant at the door saw her and respectfully invited her in.","She followed the attendant all the way to the main residence. As soon as she entered, she smelled a strong medicinal fragrance. The first person she saw was a man in a wheelchair. He looked to be in his 30s, but his hair was white, and his face was pale. He looked like he did not have long to live. Sitting beside him was Old Master Situ, whom Qiao Xi had seen before.","“Xi Xi, you’re here. Quickly take a seat.” Old Master Situ smiled, while the young man nodded at her.","“Old Master.” Qiao Xi bowed to the two of them to show her respect, then sat on the chair opposite.","Old Master Situ pointed at the man beside him and said softly, “Xi Xi, let me introduce you. This is my son, Situ Mingye.”","Qiao Xi widened her eyes. How could his son be so young?","Old Master Situ could tell that she was surprised and explained, “I believe you know that the Situ family suffered a heavy blow a few years ago. Mingye was poisoned by a strange poison because of this. The symptoms of this poison are that his face won’t age, but he’ll be disabled and he’ll have to suffer for the rest of his life. In reality, Ming Ye is already in his 60s, but he still looks to be in his 30s.","“Actually, Mingye is your biological grandfather, and his child, Situ Yu, is your biological father. It’s just that he’s been missing for many years, and there’s been no news of him.”","Before Qiao Xi came, she had already expected that Old Master Situ would lay his cards on the table with her. However, she never expected that the sickly man in front of her was actually her grandfather!"]},{"number":1699,"title":"Chapter 1699 Final Decision","paragraphs":["1699 Final Decision","Situ Mingye looked at the table and picked up a photo with trembling fingers. In the photo, a young man and a woman were standing together. It was the noble young master of the Situ family, Situ Yu, and the talented woman, Xia Yunqiu, who stunned the entire capital.","They were the most compatible couple in the capital. Later on, one of them passed away, while the other’s whereabouts were still unknown.","Situ Mingye handed the photo to Qiao Xi and said in an old and hoarse voice, “Xi... Xi Xi, keep this photo as a memento.”","Qiao Xi took it with both hands and looked at the smiling young man and woman in it. Her eyes could not help but turn red.","“All these years, we’ve sent people everywhere to look for Yu’er, but there are no clues. I think he must have found out about Yunqiu’s death, so...” Old Master Situ’s voice was a little strained.","No one was willing to believe that Situ Yu was dead, but after so many years, there was no news at all. It was enough to explain everything.","“Then do you know how my mother died?” Qiao Xi asked in a hoarse voice.","Old Master Situ sighed and said, “According to what I know, your mother was chased by the three major families and died in Li City. However, there was actually something else going on. Perhaps the four major families did something, or it’s also possible that the Qiao family attacked her. In the end, only she knows the truth. If she didn’t leave any clues for you in the things she left behind, it means that she didn’t want you to bear all of this.","“Rumor has it that your mother knew a secret involving the four great families, so she was chased after by them. However, with my understanding of Yunqiu, regardless of whether she knew a secret or not, she wouldn’t have told you.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with shock. She seemed to understand her mother’s intentions. If she told her, it would mean that she would have to bear more things.","Old Master Situ picked up a document on the table and handed it to Qiao Xi. “Go back and take a look at it. You’ve already grown up and can make your own decisions. No matter what your plans are in the end, the Situ family will support you.”","Qiao Xi brought the document back to the villa in a daze. As soon as she entered, she saw Gu Zheng sitting on the sofa and looking at her with a burning gaze.","The moment she saw Gu Zheng, Qiao Xi’s eyes instantly turned red as she flew into Gu Zheng’s embrace like a butterfly.","Gu Zheng opened his arms and hugged her, gently caressing her back. “What’s wrong?”","Qiao Xi repeated what had happened in the Situ family with a sobbing tone. Then, she took out the document Old Master Situ had given her and slowly opened it in front of Gu Zheng. The first thing that came into view was a few large words, ‘Paternity Test Report’. It confirmed that Qiao Xi and Xia Jingan were siblings.","No wonder... She kept feeling an affinity with Xia Jingan. It turned out that they were biological siblings. Xia Jingan must have guessed it a long time ago, but he never confirmed it. It was because regardless of whether they were related by blood, Xia Jingan would still treat her sincerely.","“There’s something else behind it,” Gu Zheng reminded her.","Qiao Xi took out a photo from the back. It was of a man in his 30s. He looked gentle, elegant, and handsome.","“Don’t you think this man looks very familiar?” Qiao Xi asked thoughtfully.","“He looks like Gu Yao,” Gu Zheng said indifferently.","The two of them looked at each other and confirmed one thing. Old Master Situ would not have given her the photo for no reason. He was telling them that Gu Yao was Yue Tangqing’s child. This could explain why Gu Yao was born with superb piano talent.","“Back then, when the capital was in chaos, the Situ family relied on their hundred years of foundation to protect their last bit of bloodline. However, the Yue family was almost wiped out. Gu Yao might be the only descendant of the Yue family, but if we tell him the truth, he’ll have to bear invisible shackles for the rest of his life, so...” Gu Zheng’s voice was low with a trace of helplessness.","“Let’s not tell him! It might be a good thing for him to not be able to find his biological parents. After all, he still has us and his girlfriend. He’ll be very happy in the future.” Qiao Xi sighed lightly.","“Girlfriend?” Gu Zheng was a little surprised.","Qiao Xi smiled. “Yes! Don’t you know that Gu Yao and Li Xing’er are together? As Gu Yao’s brother, why aren’t you paying attention to him at all?!”","Gu Zheng laughed. “I only pay attention to you. I don’t have time to think about him!”","“By the way, there’s something else I want to tell you. It’s about Meng Fan.” Gu Zheng’s expression instantly turned serious. “I’m guessing that Meng Fan’s father is the young master of the Yan family in the capital. Back then, when your mother was chased by the three big families, Mr. Yan sacrificed himself to save her. However, he was seriously injured from that incident and passed away. After that, the Yan family suffered the revenge of the three big families, resulting in Mr. Yan’s wife and children leaving the capital to earn a living. This can also explain why Meng Fan hates your mother so much.”","Qiao Xi had complicated feelings. She could understand Meng Fan’s hatred for her. In order to save another woman, his father abandoned the mother and son. After leaving the capital, his life must have been very painful, so it triggered such monstrous hatred."]},{"number":1700,"title":"Chapter 1700 Island Wedding","paragraphs":["1700 Island Wedding","“Ah Zheng, my mother’s death anniversary is in a month. Let’s return to Li City. I don’t like the capital,” Qiao Xi said softly as she leaned into Gu Zheng’s embrace.","“Alright.” Gu Zheng’s Adam’s apple bobbed as he hugged her tightly.","At this moment, Gu Zheng’s phone suddenly rang. When he picked it up, his eyes widened. “Alright, we’ll be right there.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at him. “What’s wrong?”","Gu Zheng took a deep breath, his deep eyes filled with smiles. “I have good news for you. The divine physician has woken up.”","Qiao Xi’s breathing stopped, and her heart trembled. She suddenly stood up and pulled Gu Zheng out.","The two of them got into the car and sped all the way to the hospital. When Qiao Xi saw the weak old man in the ward, her eyes could not help but turn red. “Grandpa!”","“Xi Xi,” Shang Xiao shouted hoarsely.","Qiao Xi could not stop her tears from flowing. This was the first time Gu Zheng had seen her lose control.","The first thing Shang Xiao did after waking up was to tell Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi what he had seen and heard in the laboratory during this period of time. He also got them to organize everything on a piece of paper and hand it to Cheng Juan as evidence to defeat He Weinian.","A month later, Shang Xiao’s injuries had basically recovered. Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng returned to Li City to pay respects to Xia Yunqiu.","Qiao Xi stood in front of Xia Yunqiu’s tombstone, her slender fingers caressing her photo. Tears welled up in her eyes. She turned slightly to look at the man beside her. “Ah Zheng, let’s get married. I want a unique wedding.”","“I’ve already arranged it.” Gu Zheng looked at her with a smile. His deep light brown eyes seemed to be filled with stars.","Qiao Xi leaned into his embrace and closed her eyes. She quietly felt the wind around her and muttered, “In novels, they say that parents love their children a lot, so their plans are far-reaching. Only today did I understand my mother’s good intentions. She doesn’t want me to live in hatred forever, so she deliberately hid what happened back then.","“She wrote in her notebook that I should cherish my lover and not be blinded by hatred. Those were the words she left for me. Now that I’ve found my lover, shouldn’t I let go of my hatred?”","The surroundings were silent. Qiao Xi could clearly feel Gu Zheng’s heart beating faster and faster.","“Moreover, we have someone more important than us now.” Qiao Xi suddenly raised her eyes that had curved into crescents, and her face was filled with happiness.","Gu Zheng was first a little confused, then shocked, and finally, ecstatic. His voice trembled slightly. “Xi Xi, you... You mean...”","His hand tentatively touched her stomach, and the scorching temperature of his palm made Qiao Xi’s entire body tremble. She nodded shyly. “It’s been more than a month. I don’t want to wear a wedding dress once my belly gets big, so we have to hold the wedding quickly.”","Gu Zheng nodded hurriedly, and a childlike smile appeared on his cold face. “Alright! I’ll get Song Shijing to prepare the invitations. We’ll have the wedding on the island.”","Gu Zheng lowered his head and kissed her lips. “Yes, it’s an island that only belongs to you. I’ve already sent someone to build a castle there. We’ll stay on the island in the future, alright?”","Qiao Xi suddenly recalled that Gu Zheng had spent 9.3 billion to buy an island for her as a birthday gift. It turned out that after buying it, Gu Zheng had already been preparing for their future lives.","“Alright! But if you go to the island with me, what will happen to Gu Corporation?” Qiao Xi asked.","Gu Zheng smiled playfully. “Don’t we have Gu Yao? He can already hold his own now. Letting him manage the Gu family and Gu Corporation at the same time is also a form of training.”","At this moment, Gu Yao, who was as busy as a dog, sneezed and roared angrily. “Damn it! Gu Zheng is busy going out on dates and has left the company to me. I have to date too! How inhumane!”","...","Half a month later, Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng held their wedding on the island. Others would choose to hold their wedding during the day when it was bright, but Qiao Xi liked dark nights. The fragrance of flowers and the aroma of delicacies blended together in the open-air wedding, and light shone on every corner.","Qiao Xi was wearing a pure white wedding dress and holding a white rose in her hand. A ray of light scattered from the top of her head and landed on her body like a thin veil. She was like an angel who had descended to the mortal world. She was so pure and dazzling that it made others not dare to breathe as they were afraid of disturbing her.","The man beside her was tall, with a well-defined face. His eyes were deep and affectionate as he looked gently at the most beautiful bride in the world.","“Please kiss your bride!”","Gu Zheng lifted the veil and bent down to plant a kiss on her beautiful lips. At this moment, he felt that all the pain and humiliation he had suffered previously were worth it. Being able to meet Qiao Xi was the greatest blessing in his life.","Qiao Xi’s cheeks were slightly red. She finally understood her mother’s words in the notebook. She was only by her lover’s side for five years before passing away while still in her most beautiful years, but she had no complaints.","Perhaps if she could not find the antidote, Gu Zheng would only have ten years left to live. However, with these ten years of companionship, Qiao Xi would be able to live a happy life. She did not want to worry unnecessarily. She only wanted to enjoy the present and cherish every second she was with him so that she would not have any regrets."]}]);
